{"id": "16759", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16759", "title": "Aero Zambia (Sosiyete y'ubwikorezi n'abantu)", "text": "Aero Zambia yari sosiyete y'indege ikorera muri Zambiya. Aero Zambia yasimbuye Zambia Airways yari yarahombye kandi yemererwa kuba umunyamuryango wuzuye wa IATA (Ishyirahamwe mpuzamahanga ryo gutwara abantu n'ibintu mu kirere) ku itariki 11 Mata 1996. Sosiyete y'indege yakoresheje abakozi 300 yakoreraga mu byerekezo birimo i Lusaka yerekeza i Johannesburg, Ndola, Nairobi, Harare na Dar es Salaam. Batangaga serivisi zikubiye mu byiciro bitanukanye birimo icyiciro cy'ubucuruzi n'icyiciro cy'ubukungu. Aero Zambia yakoreshaga indege ebyiri zo mu bwoko bwa Boeing 737-200s, 9J-AFU na 9J-AFW yo ikaba yari verisiyo ikomatanyije. \nAmateka.\nIyi sosiyete y'indege yashinzwe mu mwaka wa 1996. Ku itariki ya 19 Mutarama 2000, Guverinoma ya Zambiya yarayihagaritse kubera impungenge z'umutekano. Impamvu nyamukuru nuko haraho byari bihuriye na politike hagati ya David Tokoph n'abayobozi ba guverinoma ya Zambiya. \nAmato.\nAmato ya Aero Zambiya yari agizwe n'indege zikurikira:"}
{"id": "16760", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16760", "title": "Ubucukuzi bw'amabuye y'agaciro mu Rwanda", "text": "Ubucukuzi bw'amabuye y'agaciro mu Rwanda bugizwe N'amabuye y'agaciro nka tin, tantalum, na tungsten. Muri mwaka wa 2020, u Rwanda rwinjije amadolari ya Amerika miliyoni 733 avuye mu bicukuzi bw'amabuye y'agaciro yoherezwa mu mahanga, byatumye ubucukuzi bw'amabuye y'agaciro ari bwo bukomera mukwinjiza amafaranga menshi mu bucuruzi nyuma y'ubukerarugendo.\nMu mwaka wa 2019, iki gihugu cyari icya 7 ku isi hose mu bihugu bitanga tungsten kandi kikaba icya 12 ku isi hose mu bihugu bitanga tin. \n* Cassiterite (kasegereti) yari afite umusaruro mwinshi n\u2019ibyoherezwa mu mahanga byari toni zigera ku 3,874 zifite agaciro ka miliyoni 42,2 by'amadolari ya Amerika mu mwaka wa 2010 (habayeho ukamanuka kwa toni 4,269 mu mwaka wa 2009);\n* Yakurikiwe na coltan ifite toni 749 mu mwaka wa 2010 ifite agaciro ka miliyoni 18,48 z'amadolari ya Amerika (toni 949 mu mwaka wa 2009), na wolfram (ubutare bwa tungsten) hamwe na toni 843 mu mwaka wa 2010 zifite agaciro ka miliyoni 7,1 z'amadolari ya Amerika, zikamanuka kuri toni 874 mu mwaka wa 2009.\n* U Rwanda rutunganya hafi 9% ya tantalum ku isi, ikoreshwa mu gukora ibikoresho bya elegitoroniki, hamwe na 4% bya tungsten ku isi. \nAmabuye y'agaciro acukurwa.\nMu kwezi ku Kwakira mu mwaka wa 2012, Minisiteri y\u2019Umutungo Kamere w\u2019u Rwanda yahagaritse ibikorwa by\u2019ubucukuzi bw\u2019amabuye y'agaciro mu ntara y\u2019iburengerazuba bw\u2019igihugu hashingiwe ko babangamiye uruzi rwa Sebeya. Iki cyemezo cyakemuwe nabi bitewe n\u2019amasosiyete y'ubucukuzi bw\u2019amabuye y'agaciro yatakaje umusaruro ndetse no gutakaza akazi ibihumbi n\u2019ibihumbi ku bakozi bakora mu birombe. "}
{"id": "16761", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16761", "title": "Minisiteri y'Imari n'Igenamigambi ry'Ubukungu mu Rwanda", "text": "Minisiteri y'Imari n'Igenamigambi ry'Ubukungu (\"Ministry of Finance and Economic Planning\", MINECOFIN) ni minisiteri ya Leta y'u Rwanda. Ishinzwe imari ya Leta n'igenamigambi ry'ubukungu bw'igihugu.\nIcyicaro cyayo kiri mu Akarere ka Nyarugenge, mu mujyi wa Kigali. Kuva muri Kamena 2024, Minisitiri w'Imari n'Igenamigambi ry'Ubukungu ni Yusuf Murangwa.\nInshingano.\nIcyerekezo cya MINECOFIN ni u Rwanda rutarangwamo ubukene. Inshingano yayo ni ukuzamura ubukungu burambye, amahirwe mu bukungu, n'imibereho myiza y'Abanyarwanda bose.\nIntego za MINECOFIN zirimo izi:\nMINECOFIN itegura ingengo y'imari ya Leta. Ku wa 11 Kamena 2026, Yusuf Murangwa yagejeje ku Nteko Ishinga Amategeko ingengo y'imari ya 2026/27. Iyo ngengo y'imari ingana na miliyari 7 796,3 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda.\nIbigo bikorana na MINECOFIN birimo Banki Nkuru y'u Rwanda n'Ikigo gishinzwe Imisoro n'Amahoro mu Rwanda.\nAbaminisitiri.\nKu wa 12 Kamena 2024, Yusuf Murangwa yasimbuye Uzziel Ndagijimana. Mbere yaho, Murangwa yayoboraga Ikigo cy'Igihugu cy'Ibarurishamibare.\nAbaminisitiri b'Imari bakurikiranye ni aba:"}
{"id": "16762", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16762", "title": "Kongere y\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019abakozi muri Afurika", "text": "Kongere y\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019abakozi muri Afurika (ATUC) yari ikigo cy\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019abakozi muri Rhodesia (nyuma Zimbabwe). Kongere y\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019abakozi muri Afurika yari ihagarariye abakozi b'Abirabura, kandi yarwanyaga gahunda y'ubutegetsi bw'abazungu bake muri Rhodesia. \nATUC yashinzwe mu mwaka wa 1962 nka Kongere y\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019abakozi bo muri Afurika y\u2019Amajyepfo ya Rodeziya (SRATUC), itandukanyirizo rya Kongere y\u2019abakozi bo mu majyepfo ya Rodeziya (SRTUC). Ubumwe bushya bwari buyobowe na Josiah Maluleke wahoze ari umunyamabanga mukuru wa SRTUC. SRATUC yakiriye ishyirahamwe rya kera nyuma y'umwaka wo mu 1963, hamwe n\u2019umuryango uhuriweho wafashe izina rya Kongere y\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019abakozi muri Afurika. Nyuma yo gutandukana mu mitwe y\u2019Abanyafurika baharanira inyungu z\u2019abenegihugu mu mwaka wa 1963, byatumye Umuryango w\u2019Afurika Yunze ubumwe wa Zimbabwe (ZANU) utandukana n\u2019umuryango w\u2019abaturage ba zimbabwe (ZAPU), Kongere y\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019abakozi muri Afurika (ATUC) ihuzwa na Umuryango w\u2019Afurika Yunze ubumwe wa Zimbabwe (ZANU). ATUC yari ifitanye isano n\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019abakozi muri Afurika. \nBivugwa ko ATUC yarifite amahuriro icyenda yarashamikiyeho hagati yo mu myaka ya 1960, hamwe n\u2019abanyamuryango bose hamwe 29,198 (36 ku ijana by\u2019abanyamuryango b\u2019amashyirahamwe y\u2019abakozi mu gihugu). Ihuriro rinini cyane ryunze ubumwe ni ihuriro ry\u2019abakozi ba gari ya moshi muri Afurika (RAWU), ryari rifite abanyamuryango bagera ku 16,000.\nMu mwaka wa1981, ATUC yinjiye muri Kongere y'amashyirahamwe y'abakozi muri Zimbabwe. \n\u00a0Twe nk'urugaga rw'abakozi twiteguye rwose gushyira imbaraga zacu mu ntambara yo guharanira inyungu z'abenegihugu - hanyuma ya byose, twese turashaka gukuraho guverinoma iriho ubu, ariko turashaka kubikora nk'abakozi, hamwe n'umuryango wacu. Erega nyuma y'ubwigenge ishyaka rizaba guverinoma kandi rizahangayikishwa cyane na guverinoma iyo ari yo yose yo kongera umusaruro kugira ngo igihugu kiteze imbere. Ibi birashobora kubaho bitwaye umushahara w'abakozi n'imibereho rusange. Noneho turashaka ko umuryango wacu urengera imyanya yacu n'uburenganzira bwacu; niba twe, noneho turi ukuboko kwishyaka twe nkabakozi tuzaba tutagira kirengera. \nJosiah Maluleke, \"Uruhare rwa politiki rw'amashyirahamwe y'abakozi muri Rhodesia\""}
{"id": "16763", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16763", "title": "Carnivore (resitora)", "text": "Carnivore ni resitora ifunguye iherereye mu mujyi wa Langata mu murwa mukuru wa Nairobi, mu gihugu cya Kenya. Umwihariko wa resitora Carnivore ni inyama, kandi bahita bagaragaza uburyo bwose ushobora kurya inyama ziteguwe mu buryo butandukanye. Batanga inyama zitandukanye kandi bazwi cyane kubera umwihariko wabo werekeranye n'inyama z'ishyamba kugeza igihe Kenya yashyizeho itegeko ribuza kugurisha inyama zikomokamu ishyamba mu mwaka wa 2004. Ariko haracyari ahantu nyaburanga hasurwa na bamukerarugendo. \nAmateka.\nMu mwaka wa 1999, resitora yari ifite imyanya yicaramo abantu 350 naho yari ifite abakozi bakora muri resitora bangana nka 330 bashoboraga kuba bakorera abantu barenga 1000 ku munsi. Parike, yari igizwe n'inyamanswa zirimo gasumbashyamba, isha, otirishe, n'ingona, wazamuwe kuri Hopcraft Ranch, hafi hanze ya Nairobi. Kuva kugurisha inyama z'ishyamba byaba ibintu bibujijwe muri Kenya mu mwaka wa 2004, resitora itanga inyama zo mu rugo nk'inka, inyama z'ingurube, intama, n'inkoko, hamwe n'inyoni zororerwa hamwe n'inyama z'ingona. Inyama zometse ku nkota ya Maasai, zitekwa ku makara, hanyuma zigashyirwa ku masahani. Ifite uburyo bwo kurya ibikomoka ku bimera. Yashyizwe ku mwanya wa 47 ku rutonde rwateguwe n\"'ikinyamakuru\" kivuga ibyerekeranye n'amaResitora, aho cyatangazaga urutonde rwa resitora 50 nziza ku isi\" mu mwaka wa 2003. \nSimba Saloon.\nHano hari akabyiniro k'ijoro kitwa \"Simba Saloon\" nijoro gafite ubushobozi bwo kwakira abantu bangana na 2500, hamwe n'ibikoresho byo kwifashishwa bakoresha murandasi, ikibuga cyo gukiniramo, n'utubari dutandatu. Restaurant ikora ibitaramo birimo abahanzi baho. Abahanzi mpuzamahanga nka Shaggy, Tevin Campbell, TOK, na Sean Paul nabo bakoreyeyo ibitaramo.\u00a0muri iyo salo mu mwaka wa 2004 hapfiriye abantu 3. Resitora izwi cyane ku muteguro w'ijoro rifite insanganyamatsiko zirimo injyana ishaje, injyana ya roke n'amajoro y'ubugingo ibi bikaba bishimisha abanyakenya benshi.\nItsinda rya Tamarind.\nCarnivore ifitwe byemewe n'amategeko na Martin Dunford wo mu itsinda rya Tamarind. Yafunguwe mu mwaka wa 1980 ifungurwa na Dunford, umugore we, hamwe n'itsinda ry'abafatanyabikorwa. Dunford yafunguye resitora Carnivore, abikurije ku gitekerezo cya Rod\u00edzio cyerekeranye n'amazu ya churrascaria yo muri Berezile. Itsinda rya Tamarind rikoresha resitora y\u2019inyanja ya Tamarind i Mombasa na Nairobi. Hariho kandi resitora isa na Carnivore, ifitwe n'abantu bamwe, mu nkengero za Johannesburg, muri Afrika yepfo, ndetse na i Cairo, muri Egiputa. "}
{"id": "16764", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16764", "title": "Ihuriro ry\u2019ibiribwa n\u2019ubuhinzi n\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019abakozi", "text": "Ihuriro ry\u2019ibiribwa n\u2019ubuhinzi n\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019abakozi (AFADWU) ni ihuriro ry\u2019abakozi rihagarariye abakozi batunganya ibiribwa muri Afurika yepfo.\nIhuriro ryashinzwe mu mwaka wa 2016 nyuma yo kwirukana ingabo z\u2019abayobozi b\u2019abakozi, ibisonga by\u2019amaduka n\u2019abayobozi n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019ibiribwa n\u2019abakozi (FAWU). FAWU kandi yanze kuva muri Kongere y\u2019amashyirahamwe y\u2019abakozi bo muri Afurika yepfo (COSATU). \nAFADWU ni ishyirahamwe ry'abakozi rifite intego nyamukuru yo guhuza umubano hagati y abakozi n\u2019abakoresha, harimo n\u2019amashyirahamwe y'abakoresha. Ku ya 17 Mata 2018, AFADWU yiyandikishije mu Ishami rishinzwe umurimo n'abakozi mu buryo bwemewe n'amategeko agenga imibanire y'abakozi No 66 yo mu 1995 nk'uko ryavuguruwe.\nMu mwaka wa 2018, AFADWU yemerewe kuba ishami rya COSATU. \nUbuyobozi.\n2020 (Abakozi bo muri iki gihe).\nAbanyamabanga b'Intara.\nUburasirazuba bwa Cape: Victor Mbaza | Leta y'Ubuntu: Thulani Klass | Gauteng: Lucas Mbambo | KwaZulu-Natal: Mtokhona Ngcobo | Limpopo: Jan Maifala | Mpumalanga: Elias Mgwenya | Uburengerazuba bwa Cape: Michael Helu \nUbukangurambaga.\nGura ubukangurambaga bwaho\nAFADWU, Umuryango wa FairPlay, Ishema ryo muri Afurika y'epfo n\u2019andi mashyirahamwe y\u2019abakozi batangije ubukangurambaga bugamije guteza imbere ikoreshwa ry\u2019inkoko. "}
{"id": "16765", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16765", "title": "Ubukerarugendo muri Gambiya", "text": "Inganda z\u2019ubukerarugendo uyu munsi muri Gambiya zatangiye igihe ibirori by\u2019abakerarugendo 300 bo muri Suwede bahageraga mu mwaka wa 1965. Urwo rugendo rw'ubupayiniya rwateguwe numu Suwede witwa Bertil Harding afatanije n'abashinzwe ingendo Vingresor. Byagaragaye nk'ahantu heza ho guhungira amezi akaze ya Scandinaviya aho Abanyaburayi batishimiraga gusa izuba, umucanga n\u2019inyanja ahubwo bakanezerwa no kumenyera umunsi mukuru ny'afurika. Yatanze kandi ikiruhuko gishya kugirango umubare w\u2019abanyaburayi batembera wiyongere.\nUmubare w\u2019abashyitsi wariyongereye uva kuri ba mukerarugendo 300 mu mwaka wa 1965 ugera ku 25,000 mu mwaka wa 1976. Umubare wa ba mukerarugendo wakomeje kwiyongera cyane mu myaka yashize, kandi kubera ko guverinoma ishishikajwe no gutandukanya ubukungu, yemeje ko ubukerarugendo ari isoko ry\u2019amafaranga yinjira mu mahanga. Nubwo, kwiyongera kwamamare nkahantu nyaburanga, iterambere ryibikorwa remezo ryatinze.\nAhantu hazwi mu gukurura bamukera rugendo.\nBanjul.\nBanjul, umurwa mukuru wa Gambiya, ni agace gakunzwe na ba mukerarugendo. Abatuye uyu mujyi ni 34,828 gusa, hamwe n'agace k\u2019akarere ka Banjul kanini, karimo Umujyi wa Banjul n\u2019inama Njyanama y\u2019Umujyi wa Kanifing, utuwe n\u2019abaturage 357,238 (Ibarura mu mwaka wa 2003). Iherereye ku kirwa cya St Mary (Ikirwa cya Banjul) aho uruzi rwa Gambiya rwinjira mu nyanja ya Atalantika. Ikirwa cyahujwe n\u2019umugabane wa gari ya moshi zitwara abagenzi n\u2019imodoka mu majyaruguru n\u2019ibiraro mu majyepfo. Banjul iherereye kuri 13 \u00b0 28' mu majyaruguru, 16 \u00b0 36' mu burengerazuba (13.4667, -16.60). \nJufureh.\nJufureh, Juffureh, cyangwa Juffure ni umujyi wo muri Gambiya ukunzwe na ba mukerarugendo, ureshya nka kilometero 30 imbere ku nkombe y'amajyaruguru y'Uruzi rwa Gambiya mu gice cya Banki y'Amajyaruguru. Bivugwa ko ariho hashyizweho igitabo cyitwa Imizi: Saga y'umuryango w'abanyamerika. Ni inzu ndangamurage kandi iri hafi y'ikirwa cya James. Umuryango uvuga ko ukomoka kuri Kunta Kinte uracyaba hano. \nIkidendezi cy'ingona cya Kachikally.\nIkidendezi cy'ingona cya Kachikally giherereye hagati ya Bakau nko mu bilometero 10 (kilometero 16) uvuye mu murwa mukuru Banjul. Nimwe mubidendezi bitatu byingona byera bikoreshwa nkibibanza by'imihango y'uburumbuke. Abandi ni Folonko muri Kombo y'Amajyepfo na Berending ku nkombe y'amajyaruguru.\nJanjanbureh.\nJanjanbureh cyangwa Jangjangbureh ni umujyi washinzwe mu mwaka wa 1732, ku kirwa cya Janjanbureh mu ruzi rwa Gambiya mu burasirazuba bwa Gambiya. Yahoze yitwa Georgetown kandi yari iya kabiri mu gihugu. Ubu ni umurwa mukuru w'igice cyo hagati cy'Uruzi rwagati kandi uzwi cyane nk'urugo rwa gereza nkuru ya Gambiya. Uruziga rw'amabuye rwa Wassu rungana nka kilometero 22 mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bwa Lamin Koto, ku nkombe y'amajyaruguru hakurya ya Janjanbureh. Ni kamwe mu turere dukunzwe cyane muri Gambiya. "}
{"id": "16766", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16766", "title": "Ubukerarugendo muri Cote d'Ivoire", "text": "Inganda z\u2019ubukerarugendo za Cote d'Ivoire zateye imbere cyane kuva mu ntangiriro ya za 70. Igihugu cyari gifite ibitanda 11,374 mu byumba bya hoteri 7,786 ku igipimo cya 70% mu mwaka wa 1997. Mu mwaka wa 1998, hari ba mukerarugendo bagera ku 301,039, barimo abarenga 73,000 baturutse mu (Ubudage), Ubufaransa n'Ubwongereza. Inyanja, imidugudu y'ubukerarugendo, hamwe n\u2019amafoto ya safari binyuze mu kubungabunga inyamaswa ni bimwe mu bikurura abantu.\nIcyangobwa cy'inzira kirakenewe ku ngendo zijya muri Cote d'Ivoire. Viza ntisabwa kubamara iminsi itarenze 91,\u00a0 nanone icyemezo cyo gukingira irwara yo mu bwoko bw'ibicurani yitwa Yellow fever gisabwa abashitsi bose babanyamahanga basura kino gihugu. Mu mwaka wa 2002, Minisiteri y\u2019ububanyi n\u2019amahanga ya Amerika yagereranije igiciro cyo kuguma muri Abidjan ku madolari 160 y'amanyamerika ku munsi, ugereranije na Yamoussoukro ku madolari 98 y'amanyamerika."}
{"id": "16767", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16767", "title": "COGEBANQUE", "text": "Compagnie G\u00e9n\u00e9rale de Banque (Cogebanque), rimwe na rimwe bita Cogebank, ni banki y\u2019ubucuruzi yo mu Rwanda. Iyi banki ni imwe mu mabanki y\u2019ubucuruzi ari muri Repubulika y\u2019u Rwanda, abiherewe uruhushya na Banki nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda, ariyo mugenzuzi w\u2019amabanki mu gihugu. \nIncamake.\nKugeza mu Kuboza 2014, umutungo wose wa banki wari ufite agaciro karenga miliyoni 192.2 z'amadorali y'amerika (miliyari 134 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda), imigabane y\u2019abanyamigabane ifite agaciro ka miliyoni 19.65 z'amadorali y'amerika (miliyari 13.7 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda)\nAmateka.\nCogebanque yashinzwe muri Nyakanga 1999 n'abashoramari bo mu Rwanda bagera kuri mirongo ine na babiri. Muri icyo gihe, isosiyete y\u2019ubwishingizi Compagnie G\u00e9n\u00e9rale d'Assurance et de Reassurance, yari umunyamigabane munini, ufite hafi 34%. Mu ntangiriro, banki yibanze ku mishinga mito n'iciriritse (SMEs), ubuhinzi n'inganda za serivisi. Muri 2008, abashoramari batatu bashya bari mpuzamahanga bishyuye miliyoni 6 z'amadorali y'amerika kuri 40% bagira imigabanye Ownership muri banki. Abashoramari bashya barimo: (a) ShoreCap International (SCI) ya Chicago, Illinois, Amerika; (b) Isosiyete y'ishoramari yo mu Bubiligi mu bihugu biri mu nzira y'amajyambere (BIO) na (c) AfricaInvest, ni sosiyete ishora imari ikorera muri Tuniziya. Ubu bucuruzi bwatangiye muri 2008, bwarangiye mu ntangiriro ya za 2010. Abashoramari bo mu Rwanda bambere bagumana imigabane 60% muri banki ivuguruye. \nUmuyoboro w'ishami.\nKuva muri Werurwe 2015, Cogebanque yakomeje amashami ahantu hakurikira: "}
{"id": "16768", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16768", "title": "I&amp;M Banki Rwanda", "text": "I&amp;M Bank Rwanda Plc., ni banki y\u2019ubucuruzi mu Rwanda yemerewe na Banki nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda. ikaba ari banki ya kabiri nini mu Rwanda. \nAho biherereye.\nIcyicaro gikuru cya banki giherereye kuri KN 03 Avenue 9, mu karere k\u2019ubucuruzi hagati ka Kigali, mu murwa mukuru w\u2019u Rwanda. icyicaro gikuru cya banki kiri: 01 \u00b0 56'55.0 \"S, 30 \u00b0 03'41.0\" E (Ubunini: -1.948611; Uburebure: 30.061389). \nIncamake.\nBanki ya kabiri nini mu bucuruzi bunini mu Rwanda, inyuma ya Banki ya Kigali, ikora ibigo binini, imishinga mito n'iciriritse, n'abantu ku giti cyabo. Kugeza mu Kuboza 2020, umutungo wose wa banki wari ufite agaciro ka miliyari 417.2 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda (hafi miliyoni 424.46 z'amadolari y'Amerika), hamwe n\u2019abanyamigabane bangana na miliyari 54.48 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda (hafi 55.42 z' amadolari y'Amerika). \nAmateka.\nIyi banki yafunguwe muri 1963 ku izina y'Igifaransa rya Banque Commerciale du Rwanda BCR cyangwa Banki y'Ubucuruzi y'u Rwanda. Mu ntangiriro, yari ifitwe na guverinoma y'u Rwanda. Muri 2004, yeguriwe abikorera. Kugeza muri Mata 2010, Actis Capital yari ifite 80 ku ijana yari aya guverinoma y'u Rwanda ikaba ifite 20 ku ijana by'ikigo cy'imari gisigaye. Actis Capital ni sosiyete yigenga ishoramari, ifite icyicaro i Londere mu Bwongereza, izobereye mu ishoramari mu bihugu biri mu nzira y'amajyambere. Kuva muri Mata 2010, ishoramari ry\u2019ikigo ryari hafi miliyari 5 z'amadolari y'Amerika. \nMuri Nyakanga 2012, Actis Capital yavuye muri BCR igurisha imigabane yayo mu ihuriro rigizwe na Banki ya I&amp;amp;M yo muri Kenya, PROPARCO yo mu Bufaransa, hamwe n\u2019ishoramari ry\u2019Abadage. Guverinoma y'u Rwanda yagumanye imigabane muri banki. Muri Kanama 2013, banki yasubiye muri Banki ya I&amp;M (u Rwanda) kugira ngo igaragaze imigabane iriho ubu. \nMuri Nzeri 2015, I&amp;M banki Rwanda yashyizeho Umuyobozi uyobora - Robin Bairstow. \nMuri Werurwe 2017, I&amp;M Bank Rwanda yatangiye gucuruza ku Isoko ry\u2019imigabane mu Rwanda binyuze mu Itangizwa rya mbere. \nItsinda rya Banki ya I&amp;M.\nBanki ya I&amp;M (u Rwanda) ni umunyamuryango w'itsinda rya I&amp;amp;M Bank ry'amasosiyete. Iri tsinda n\u2019isosiyete itanga serivisi z\u2019imari muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, ifite umutungo urenga miliyari 3.14 z'amadolari y'Amerika (KSh324.3) guhera muri Nzeri 2019. Iri tsinda rifite ibikorwa muri Kenya, Morise, u Rwanda, na Tanzaniya. \nNyirubwite.\nKugeza muri Nyakanga 2021, imigabane ya banki yari ifite ibigo byashyizwe ku mbonerahamwe ikurikira\nUmuyoboro w'ishami.\nBanki ya I&amp;M Rwanda ikomeza amashami akurikira, guhera muri Werurwe 2020: "}
{"id": "16769", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16769", "title": "Banki y'Urwego", "text": "Banki ya Urwego ni banki ifite Imari iciriritse ishingiye kuri Kristo mu Rwanda. Yahawe uruhushya na Banki nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda, Isanzwe igenzura amabanki y'igihugu. iyi banki iherereye mu karere ka Rwamaganahirya gato y'ishami rya banki nkuru y'u Rwanda rikorera i Rwamagana. Iyi baki kandi ifasha abaturage mu kwiteza imbere bagurizwa amafaranga.\nAmateka.\nBanki yashinzwe muri 1997 na World Relief yashizwe n'Urwego Community Banking, banki yinjiye mu muyoboro mpuzamahanga wa HOPE muri 2005. Muri 2007, banki yahujwe na Opportunity International Bank yu Rwanda hanyuma ihinduka Banki ya Urwego Opportunity Bank.\nByemejwe na Banki nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda, Opportunity International yagurishije 50% bya Urwego kuri HOPE International muri 2017, bituma HOPE iba umunyamigabane 99% muri banki, hamwe n\u2019ubutabazi ku isi bukomeje gutunga 1%. \nIncamake.\nBanki y'Urwego ni banki yemewe, ishingiye ku kwizera kwa gikirisitu. Dushingiye ku izina ryayo (Urwego ni ijambo rya Kinyarwanda risobanurwa ngo \u201curwego\u201d), ubutumwa bw'Urwego bugira buti: \u201cGutanga urwego rw'amahirwe ku baturage batishoboye bo mu Rwanda nk'uko dutangaza kandi tukabaho Ubutumwa bwiza bwa Yesu Kristo.\u201d \nUrwego irashaka kugera ku Banyarwanda bakora mu bukungu ariko badakwiye ibigo by'amabanki byemewe. Itanga serivisi zuzuye zimari, harimo inguzanyo na gahunda yo kuzigama, hamwe namahugurwa yo kugabanya ingaruka zibicuruzwa byimari no guha imbaraga abakiriya kugirango batsinde mu bucuruzi, imicungire yurugo, nu buzima.\nMu mateka yarwo, Banki y'Urwego yatanze inguzanyo ingana na miliyoni 290 z'amadolari. \nNyirubwite.\nNk\u2019urubuga rwa banki, ibigo bikurikira bikurikira ni abanyamigabane. \nUmuyoboro w'ishami.\nKugeza muri Nyakanga 2019, Banki ya Urwego yari ifite amashami 15 yuzuye, arindwi muri yo, harimo icyicaro gikuru cya banki, aherereye mu mujyi wa Kigali, umurwa mukuru w'u Rwanda. Byongeye kandi, Urwego yari ifite ATM 15 mu gihugu hose."}
{"id": "16772", "revid": "16886", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16772", "title": "Access Bank Rwanda", "text": "Access Bank Rwanda ni banki y'ubucuruzi mu Rwanda. Ni mwe muri banki z'ubucuruzi zemewe na Banki nkuru y'u Rwanda, umuyobozi wa banki y'igihugu. \nIncamake.\nBanki ni ikigo cyimari giciriritse mu Rwanda. Nk\u2019uko urubuga rwayo rubitangaza, ni banki ya kane mu bunini mu bucuruzi mu gihugu, ishingiye ku mutungo. Guhera mu Kuboza 2011, banki yari ifite miliyoni 83.4 z'amadolari y'Amerika (miliyoni 55.8 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda), abanyamigabane bangana na miliyoni 9.72 z'amadolari y'Amerika (miliyoni 6.65 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda).\nAmateka.\nAccess Bank (Rwanda) PLC ni banki yubucuruzi ikorera mu Rwanda. Banki yatangijwe ku mugaragaro muri Mutarama 2009 nyuma yo kuzuza ibisabwa byose.\nYahoze ari BANCOR SA Rwanda kandi yashinzwe mu 1995 n'abashoramari b'abanyamahanga, banki yavuguruwe mu 2001 nyuma yo kwigarurira abashoramari bigenga bo mu Rwanda ndetse no muri Afurika y'Epfo. Amaze gutangira ibikorwa muri Kigali, Banki imaze kwagura ibikorwa byayo yongerera umuyoboro wa Nyabugogo, Rubavu na Rusizi.\nAccess Bank Plc, imwe muri banki nini muri Nijeriya, yaguze BANCOR SA kumugaragaro nyuma yo kubona imigabane 75%.\nInjira Itsinda rya Banki.\nAccess Bank Rwanda ni umunyamuryango wa Access Bank Group, ikigo cya gatandatu gitanga serivisi z\u2019imari muri Nijeriya, gishingiye ku mutungo. Andi masosiyete y'abanyamuryango b'itsinda arimo:\nNyirubwite.\nUbubiko bwa banki bufitwe n\u2019ibigo bikurikira n\u2019abikorera ku giti cyabo: \nShikira Banki Rwanda - Umuyoboro w'ishami.\nKuva muri Mata 2022, banki ikora amashami ahantu hakurikira: "}
{"id": "16773", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16773", "title": "KCB Bank Rwanda", "text": "Banki ya KCB u Rwanda yari banki y'ubucuruzi mu Rwanda n\u2019ishami rya KCB Group yo muri Kenya. Yari imwe muri banki zemewe na Banki nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda, mu bugenzuzi blw\u2019amabanki mu gihugu. \nKugeza muri Kamena 2015, KCB y'u Rwanda rwatanze serivisi ziciriritse zitanga serivisi z\u2019imari, aho umutungo wose ugera kuri miliyoni 190.2 z'amadolari y'Amerika (RWF: miliyari 140 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda) hamwe n\u2019imigabane y\u2019abanyamigabane ingana na miliyoni 16.3 z'amadolari y'Amerika (miliyari 12 amafaranga y'u Rwanda). \nAmateka.\nUkuboza 2008, u Rwanda RC rwatangiye serivisi z\u2019amabanki i Kigali, nyuma y\u2019uruhush\nya rwatanzwe na Banki nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda. Kuva icyo gihe, banki yafunguye amashami cumi n'ane (14) mu gihugu. KCB u Rwanda ni ishami rya 100% ry'itsinda rya KCB.\nNyuma yo kubona BPR n'itsinda rya KCB, U Rwanda rwahujwe na \"Banque Populaire du Rwanda\" rushinga Banki ya BPR Rwanda Plc, bituma iba banki ya kabiri mu gihugu. \nUmuyoboro w'ishami.\nKuva mu Gushyingo 2015 kuvugurura, KCB u Rwanda rufite amashami cumi n'ane (14) mu gihugu hose. Mu bibanza banki ikoreramo amashami harimo ibi bikurikira."}
{"id": "16774", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16774", "title": "Zigama CSS", "text": "Banki y'inguzanyo no kuzigama Zigama (ZCSB), ni banki iciriritse mu Rwanda. Banki ni kimwe mu bigo by'imari byemewe na Banki nkuru y'u Rwanda, umuyobozi wa banki y'igihugu. \nAmateka.\nZCSB yashinzwe muri 1997 yitwa Zigama Credit &amp; Savings Society (ZCSS), nanone yitwa Zigama CSS, ifite inshingano nyamukuru yo gukorera imibereho myiza y\u2019imiryango y\u2019abasirikare b\u2019u Rwanda. Mu mwaka wa 2011, ikigo cyabonye uruhushya rw\u2019amabanki y\u2019ubucuruzi kandi rusubira ku izina ryarwo. Kuva yashingwa, banki ya koperative yemeye kuba umunyamuryango wa Polisi y\u2019u Rwanda n\u2019Urwego rushinzwe amagereza. \nIncamake.\nBanki ni banki ya koperative yemewe, ikorera abanyamuryango bayo mu Rwanda. As of December 2012, igiteranyo cy'umutungo wose w'ikigo cyari hejuru ya miliyoni 143 z'amadolari y'Amerika (miliyari 90 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda). \nNyirubwite.\nKuva mu Kuboza 2011, imigabane irambuye mu bubiko bwa Zigama Credit na Banki yo kuzigama ntabwo izwi ku mugaragaro. Banki ifite ubwinshi kandi ikayoborwa n\u2019abagize ingabo z\u2019u Rwanda.\nUmuyoboro w'ishami.\nKuva mu Kuboza 2011, ZCSB ikomeza amashami ahantu hakurikira: "}
{"id": "16776", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16776", "title": "Banki ya Unguka", "text": "Unguka Bank Plc (UB), bakunze kwita Banki ya Unguka, ni banki ifite Imari iciriritse mu Rwanda. Ni imwe muri banki zemewe na Banki nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda, umugenzuzi w\u2019amabanki mu gihugu. \nIncamake.\nKugeza muri Kamena 2012, UBL yari itanga serivisi ntoya y\u2019imari ariko ikura, ifite agaciro k\u2019umutungo hamwe n\u2019imigabane y\u2019abanyamigabane ntabwo byari bizwi muri iki gihe. Icyo gihe, banki yari ifite abanyamigabane 556 n'amashami 14.\nAmateka.\nIkigo cyashinzwe mu 2005, nka Unguka Microfinance Limited, n\u2019abashoramari 215 bafite imari shingiro y\u2019amadolari ya Amerika agera 538.400 (RWF agera miliyoni 321.1). Muri 2008, ibikorwa bya banki byakozwe mu buryo bwikora. Mu mwaka wa 2012, ikigo cyahindutse banki iciriritse, nyuma yo gutanga uruhushya rwa banki iciriritse na banki y'igihugu y'u Rwanda. Banki yahinduwe nka Unguka Bank Limited. \nNyirubwite.\nUmugabane wa Banki ya Uguka ufite abikorera ku giti cyabo n\u2019abashoramari ku giti cyabo. Muri iki gihe, imigabane irambuye muri banki ntabwo izwi ku mugaragaro. 35% by'imigabane ni iy'icyaro Impulse Fund II. "}
{"id": "16778", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16778", "title": "Banki y'Afurika Rwanda Limited", "text": "Banki y'Afurika Rwanda Limited cyangwa BOA Rwanda, yahoze yitwa Agaseke Bank, ni banki yubucuruzi mu Rwanda. Banki ni imwe muri banki zemewe muri Repubulika y'u Rwanda. Banki niterambere ritanga serivise yimari mu Rwanda. Kugeza mu Kuboza 2012, umutungo wacyo wose wari ufite agaciro ka miliyoni 14.6 z'amadolari y'Amerika (miliyari 9.2 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda). \nAmateka.\nBOA Rwanda yashinzwe mu Gushyingo 2003 nka Centre Financier aux Rwiyemezamirimo Agaseke (CFE SA Agaseke) hagamijwe gutanga serivisi z\u2019imari ku bucuruzi buciriritse n'ibiciriritse. Ku ya 14 Ukuboza 2010, abanyamigabane bafashe icyemezo cyo guhindura CFE SA Agaseke muri banki iciriritse maze bafata izina rya Agaseke Bank. Banki yahawe uruhushya rwa banki na Banki nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda, umugenzuzi w\u2019amabanki mu gihugu, mu 2011, itangira serivisi z\u2019amabanki y\u2019ubucuruzi muri uwo mwaka. \nKu ya 15 Ukwakira 2015, Itsinda rya Banki ya Afurika ryatangaje ko riguze imigabane 90% muri Banki ya Agaseke. Ibi byatumye Agaske Bank ihindura izina yitwa Banki ya Afrika Rwanda Limited ihinduka banki yubucuruzi. \nOwnership.\nUmugabane wa banki ufite abikorera ku giti cyabo n'abashoramari ku giti cyabo. As of December 2015, imigabane muri banki nkuko bigaragara mu mbonerahamwe ikurikira: \nAmashami.\nKuva muri Kanama 2017, banki yakomeje amashami akurikira. \n(1) Main Branch, Ground Floor, Chic Complex Nyarugege, Kigali (2) Ishami rya Kayonza (3) Ishami rya Gizozi, Inzu ya Umukindo, Kigali (4) Ishami rya Muhanga (5) Ishami rya Rusizi (6) Ishami rya Rubavu (7) Ishami rya Musanze (8) Ishami rya Huye (8) 9) Ishami rya Nyabugogo (10) Ishami rya Remera (10) Ishami rya Gikondo (11) Ishami rya Kamironko (12) Ishami rya Nyarugege, Inzu ya KIC, Kigali (12) Soras Outlet, Umuhanda wa Kakuyu, Kigali na (13) Ishami rya Kabuga."}
{"id": "16779", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16779", "title": "Ubukerarugendo muri Lesotho", "text": "Ubukerarugendo muri Lesotho ni inganda zirigukura mu gihugu.\nMu mwaka wa 2013, ingendo n'ubukerarugendo byatanze hafi 5.5% by'umusaruro mbumbe w'igihugu (GDP) muri Lesotho, biteganijwe ko uyu mubare uziyongera kugera kuri 6.1% by'umusaruro mbumbe w'igihugu (GDP) mu mwaka wa 2024. Aka gace kubukerarugendo kahaye akazi abakozi 25,000 mu mwaka wa 2013, 4.6% by'imirimo yose y'igihugu. \nAbatuye Afurika y'Epfo, bakikije Lesotho, barenga 90 ku ijana by'abasura iki gihugu. Ingendo nyinshi nugusura inshuti n'imiryango.\nIbikorwa bitandukanye byo hanze bikorwa mu buryo bwo kwidagadura buzwi cyane kubakerarugendo mu gihugu. Imisozi ikurura ba mukerarugendo mu kuzamuka imisozi bayitemberaho, gukora ingendo zakure no gusiganwa ku binyabiziga byabugenewe, ndetse no gukoresha inzira enye zifite ibiziga bine. Ikibuga cyo gukoreraho ayo masiganwa cyitwa Afriski gikora mu mezi y'itumba.\nAhantu hakunda gukoreshwa cyane mukwinjira muri Lesotho harimo ikibuga cy'indege mpuzamahanga cya Moshoeshoe hamwe n\u2019umupaka wambukiranya imipaka ya Maseru na Maputsoe. \nUbukerarugendo mu gihugu bugenzurwa na Minisiteri y'Ubukerarugendo, Ibidukikije n'umuco, ikorera mu murwa mukuru wa Maseru."}
{"id": "16780", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16780", "title": "Ubukerarugendo muri Liberiya", "text": "Ubukerarugendo ni bumwe mubintu bigize agace gato k'ubukungu bw'igihugu cya Liberiya. Mu bihe byatambutse, ba mukerarugendo benshi basuye Liberiya, abenshi baturutse muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika. Mu bukungu bwa Liberiya, harimo n\u2019inganda z\u2019ubukerarugendo, zangijwe cyane n\u2019intambara y\u2019abenegihugu muri iki gihugu, kandi yatangiye gufata ingamba zo gutangiza ishyirahamwe ry\u2019ubukerarugendo muri iki gihugu. Amacumbi arahari kuri ba mukerarugendo, kimwe n'ibikorwa remezo byo gutwara abantu muri Liberiya. Ikintu cyiza cyane kiri hejuru ni Robertsport. "}
{"id": "16781", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16781", "title": "Anna Phosa", "text": "Anna Phosa ni umworozi w'ingurube watsinze muri Afurika umwe mu batanga ingurube nini muri Afrika yepfo. Yatangiye ubucuruzi bw'ingurube mu 2004 kandi yakoresheje amadorari 100 gusa yo kuzigama. Nubwo yatangiriye ku ngurube enye, isosiyete ye yagiye mu bihugu byinshi byo ku mugabane wa Afurika, bituma aba umwe muri ba rwiyemezamirimo bakomeye ku mugabane wa Afurika.Ni umwe mu bahinzi borozi b'ingurube b'abirabura mu gihugu. Yatangiye Dreamland Piggery &amp; Abbatoir mu gace ka Vaal, Amajyepfo ya Johannesburg mu 2004."}
{"id": "16782", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16782", "title": "Sibongile Sambo", "text": "Sibongile Sambo (yavutse 1974 i Bushbuckridge) ni umuyobozi w'indege zo muri Afurika y'Epfo. Yashinze SRS Aviation. Sambo yashyizwe ku rutonde rwa \"Abakobwa 20 b'ingufu muri Afurika 2013\"\nUbuzima.\nYarangije muri kaminuza ya Zululand.\nSambo ntabwo yashoboye kuba umukozi windege hamwe na South African Airways. Mu 2004, yatsindiye amasezerano ya guverinoma y'Afurika y'Epfo.Yashinze SRS Aviation, itanga serivisi zo gukodesha indege na kajugujugu, amasezerano y\u2019imizigo yo mu kirere, kohereza ba mukerarugendo, umutekano w\u2019ikirere rusange, kwimura abaganga n\u2019izindi serivisi za aero. SRS Aviation n\u2019isosiyete ya mbere y\u2019abirabura y\u2019abirabura ifite indege muri Afurika yepfo.\nMuri Gashyantare 2020, Sambo yatanze ubuhamya imbere ya komisiyo ishinzwe iperereza ya Zondo ku ifatwa rya leta i Parktown, Johannesburg, mu rwego rwo gukora iperereza ku micungire y\u2019indege za Afurika yepfo."}
{"id": "16783", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16783", "title": "Salwa Idrissi Akhannouch", "text": "Salwa Idrissi Akhannouch ni umucuruzi na rwiyemezamirimo. Niwe washinze akaba na perezida wa none wa Aksal Holding, isosiyete yo muri Maroc izobereye mu gucuruza, kwisiga, ibicuruzwa byiza ndetse n\u2019amasoko. Kugeza ubu, afite izina rya Madamu wa Perezida wa Maroc (de facto gusa, kubera ko Maroc imaze kugira Umwamikazi Consort). Muri 2017, OZY yiswe \"Umutegarugori ukomeye muri Maroc w\u2019ibicuruzwa byiza\" na OZY."}
{"id": "16784", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16784", "title": "Jason Njoku", "text": "Jason Chukwuma Njoku (yavutse taliki 11 Ukuboza umwaka 1980) ni umucuruzi wo mugihugu cy\u2019Ubwongereza. Niwe washinze kandi akaba n'umuyobozi mukuru wa iROKOtv, serivisi isaba amashusho kuri firime zo muri Nigeriya.\nYiyita rwiyemezamirimo udasanzwe, iROKOtv yari Njoku ya 11 agerageza gutangiza umushinga. Yaje afite igitekerezo cyo gutangiza urubuga rushya rwo gukwirakwiza firime Nollywood mugihe yabanaga murugo na mama we, afite imyaka 30, nyuma yimishinga myinshi yananiranye igendayanga. \nUbuzima bwambere n'imyigire.\nJason yavukiye kandi akurira i Deptford, mu majyepfo y\u2019iburasirazuba bwa Londere, nyina amurera na bashiki be batatu na murumuna we wenyine, mu gihe yakoraga akazi k'amasaha yose muri serivisi y\u2019ubuzima. Yigiye amashuri i Londire, nyuma yimukira mu mudugudu wo muri Nijeriya kuva afite imyaka 12 kugeza 15. Amaze gusubira mu Bwongereza, yize kaminuza kugira ngo arangize Amashuri yisumbuye, mbere yo kubona umwanya muri kaminuza ya Manchester aho yize ibijyanye 'ibinyabutabire. Yarangije amashuriye mu mwaka 2005 afite 2: 1 atangiza \"Ikinyamakuru Brash Magazine\", igitabo yashize hanze cy\u2019abanyeshuri cyatangiye mumyaka itatu mbere yuko gifunga mu mwaka 2008. \nUmwuga.\niROKO.\nNyuma y\u2019imishinga myinshi yananiranye hagati yu mwaka wa 2005 nuwa 2010, birimo umuyoboro wa blog, ubucuruzi bw'imyenda hamwe n\u2019isosiyete ikora imbuga za interineti, Njoku yasubiye mu rugo mu nzu ya nyina i Deptford. Aho niho yaje gutekereza igitekerezo cyo gutangiza ubucuruzi bwo gukwirakwiza Nollywood kuri interineti, \"Uburengerazuba bwari bufite Hulu na Netflix Afurika ntacyo yari ifite\", Njoku. Amaze kwiga ibijyanye n'inganda kure, yerekeje i Lagosi, abikesheje ubufasha bw'amafaranga y'inshuti ye magara Bastian Gotter, mugenzi we barangirije hamwe muri kaminuza ya Manchester, maze atangira kugura impushya zo kuri interineti za firime za Nollywood. Yakoraga mu nzu y'ibyumba bibiri biri mu mujyi wa Festac, i Lagosi, maze agirana amasezerano na YouTube mu Budage kugira ngo abe umufatanyabikorwa wa sosiyete ya Nollywood. \u00a0\nMu mwaka wa 2010, Njoku na mugenzi we Bastian Gotter bashyize ahagaragara NollywoodLove, kumuyoboro wa YouTube, watangiye kunguka mu mezi abiri bamaze batangiye. Muri uwo mwaka, bashima inyandiko yanditswe na Sarah Lacy wakoraga icyo gihe muri Tech Crunch, NollywoodLove yashimishijwe n\u2019ikigega cy\u2019ishoramari cyo muri Amerika cyitwa Tiger Global ku kuba cyarashishikajwe no kwagura ibikorwa byabo ku masoko agiye atandukanye akomeye. \nUrukurikirane Ishoramari rya amadolari miliyoni 3 yahawe ingwate muri Tiger Global mu mwaka wa 2010 maze iyo siyete itangira kwerekana amashusho yonyine, kuri iROKOtv, kuri taliki ya 1 Ukuboza umwaka wa 2011. Urubuga rwahuje abareba baturutse mu bihugu 178 kwisi. Njoku na Gotter kuva bakomeza gukusanya andi miliyoni 22 z'amadolari ziva muri VC mpuzamahanga, harimo n\u2019ishoramari AB Kinnevik na RISE Capital kandi bakoresheje ishoramari mu kubaka kataloge nini ya firime 5.000, ibirori byo gutangiza ibiro i Lagosi, New York, na Londire no gushora imari mu kuzamura ibikoresho no guteza imbere iby'ikoranabuhanga. Iroko yagiye gutera izindi nkunga ishoramari ingana na miliyoni 40 z'amadolari \nMu mwaka wa 2015, Njoku yahisemo kwerekeza ibitekerezo kuri sosiyete kuri porogaramu igendanwa ya Android igendanwa, aho kuba inzira yo guhangana n\u2019ibikorwa remezo bigari akamaro Afurika mu iterambere.\nMuri Nyakanga mu mwaka 2012, yavuzwe na \"Forbes Africa\" nk'umwe mu 'Baherwe icumi b'Abanyafurika bakurikirana'. Ku ya 29 Kanama 2013, Njoku yahawe igihembo nka CNBC All Africa Business Awards Umuyobozi w\u2019umwaka muri Afurika y\u2019iburengerazuba. \u00a0 Yamenyekanye kandi nk'umwe mu bantu 1000 ba mbere mu guhanga ubucuruzi. \nIbindi wamenya.\nMuri Kanama mu mwaka wa 2013, hamwe n'abafatanyabikorwa be mu bucuruzi Bastian Gotter na Mary Remmy Njoku, Njoku yatangije amadorari miriyoni 2 yimodoka ishora imari kuri Lagosi itangizwa na enterineti yitwa Spark. Isosiyete yabanje gushora imari mu bigo 11, birimo isosiyete ikwirakwiza ibinyobwa byitwa Drinks.ng, ikigo cy\u2019imitungo itimukanwa n\u2019umutungo ku rubuga rwa interineti cyitwa ToLet.com.ng, hamwe n\u2019ahantu ho kubika ibyumba bya hoteri, byitwa Hotels.ng, byakomeje. gukusanya miliyoni 1.2 byamadolari mu ishoramari rya VC riva muri EchoVC Pan-Africa Fund na Omidyar Network. Muri 2015, Jason Njoku mu rubuga rwa blog yatangaje ko barekuye abantu bane batangiye bafatwa nk'ubucuruzi bwatsinzwe:.com.ng (iduka ryerekana imideli kumurongo) hamwe nabakristu.ng, urubuga rwo gukundana kumurongo kubakristo.\nUbuzima bwite.\nKu taliki ya 18 Kanama mu mwaka 2012. Njoku yashakanye numugore w'umukinnyi wa filime zinyura kuri Nollywood akaba na producer Mary Remmy Njoku mu mujyi wa Festac, i Lagosi. Bakiriye umuhungu babyaye wabo wa mbere, Jason Obinna Njoku, ku taliki ya 30 Nyakanga mu mwaka wa 2013, umwana wa kabiri, Nwakaego Annabel Njoku, yavutse ku taliki ya 24 Kanama mu mwaka wa 2015 n'umwana wa gatatu, Nnenna Amber Njoku yavutse ku taliki ya 4 Kanama mu mwaka 2017. "}
{"id": "16785", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16785", "title": "AB Bank Rwanda", "text": "AB Bank Rwanda (ABR), ni banki ifite imari iciriritse mu Rwanda. Ni banki imwe muri banki zemewe muri Repubulika y'u Rwanda. \nIncamake.\nABR ni banki iciriritse yo mu Rwanda, ifitwe n\u2019ibigo mpuzamahanga, yashinzwe mu 2013. Ifitanye isano, kandi ni ishami rya Access Holding, ishoramari rito ry\u2019ubucuruzi n\u2019imishinga iciriritse ikorera mu Budage, ifite amashami muri Azaribayijan, Madagasikari, Tanzaniya, Nijeriya, Liberiya, Tajikistan, Zambiya n'u Rwanda. \nAmateka.\nBanki yahawe uruhushya rwa banki na Banki nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda, akaba ari umugenzuzi w\u2019amabanki mu gihugu, muri 2013 itangira serivisi z\u2019amabanki y\u2019ubucuruzi muri uwo mwaka. Muri Kamena 2014, AB Banki y'u Rwanda yagumanye konti zo kubitsa zirenga 4000 hamwe na konti zirenga 1.300. Igitabo cy'inguzanyo cyarenze RWF: miliyari 1 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda (miliyoni 1.5 z'amadolari y'Amerika). \nNyirubwite (Ownership).\nUmugabane wa banki ufite abikorera ku giti cyabo. As of December 2013, imigabane muri banki nkuko bigaragara mu mbonerahamwe ikurikira: \nUmuyoboro w'ishami.\nKugeza muri Werurwe 2019, banki ifite amashami atandatu hamwe n\u2019ibicuruzwa bitandatu by\u2019inguzanyo mu gihugu hose."}
{"id": "16786", "revid": "13539", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16786", "title": "Banki y'Amakoperative mu Rwanda", "text": "Banki y'amakoperative y'u Rwanda ni banki y\u2019ubucuruzi ikorera mu Rwanda. Biteganijwe ko yagura imari mu gihugu, binyuze muri Umurenge Saccos no kongera serivisi z\u2019imari mu cyaro. \nIncamake.\nMuri Nyakanga 2014, abagera kuri 2500 mu b\u2019ikigo cy\u2019amakoperative y\u2019u Rwanda (RCA) bahuye na Paul Kagame, perezida w\u2019u Rwanda mu birori byiswe Guhura na Perezida. Muri ibyo birori byabereye i Kigali, umurwa mukuru w\u2019igihugu, perezida yategetse minisitiri w\u2019ubucuruzi n\u2019inganda gushinga banki y\u2019amakoperative, mu gihe gito gishoboka. \nUkurikije amabwiriza ya Banki nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda, igishoro ntarengwa gisabwa ni miliyari 5 z'amadorari (miliyoni 6 z'amafaranga yu Rwanda). Rwanda ivuga ko mu Rwanda hari amakoperative agera ku 8000 (amakoperative y'abaturage). Amakoperative yiteguye gutanga 60% bikenewe mu gutangiza igishoro. \nNanone, mu gihugu habarirwa amakoperative 480 yo kuzigama no kuguriza, (Umurenge SACCO) mu gihugu. Aba Saccos baraburanishwa kugirango batange 40% asigaye yo gushora imari. Na none, Saccos igomba guhuzwa na sisitemu rusange ya mudasobwa, kugirango ibe amashami ya banki yatanzwe. Iyo banki itangiye gukora muri 2018, nkuko byari byitezwe, igipimo cyayo cyo gutanga inguzanyo giteganijwe kuba munsi ya banki z'ubucuruzi. \nNyirubwite.\nMugihe amakuru arambuye arimo gutegurwa, ba nyirayo bazashyiramo (a) Sacco Umurenge (b) andi makoperative y'u Rwanda (c) n'izindi nzego zu Rwanda. Guverinoma y'u Rwanda isaba ko abanyamigabane bose muri banki baba abanyarwanda. \nAmashami.\nBiteganijwe ko bimwe mu biro bya Sacco 480 biri mu gihugu bizahinduka amashami ya banki yatanzwe, nyuma yo kurangiza mudasobwa no guhuza ibikorwa byabo. "}
{"id": "16787", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16787", "title": "Banki Crane Rwanda", "text": "Banki Crane Rwanda yari banki y'ubucuruzi ikorera mu Rwanda, yemewe na Banki nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda, nk\u2019umuyobozi ushinzwe amabanki y\u2019igihugu. Muri Kamena 2017, Banki y\u2019ubucuruzi y'afurika yashyize umukono ku masezerano yo kugura umutungo muri Banki ya Crane y\u2019u Rwanda, mu gihe hagitegerejwe ko byemezwa n\u2019amabwiriza. \nBanki yatangiye gukora ku wa mbere 30 Kamena 2014, imaze kubona uruhushya rwa banki rutagira umupaka muri NBR, umwaka umwe mbere. Ikigereranyo cy\u2019agaciro k\u2019umutungo w\u2019ikigo mu Kuboza 2014 cyari hafi miliyoni 13.7 z\u2019amadolari y\u2019Amerika, aho abanyamigabane bangana na miliyoni 8.6 US z'amadolari y'amerika. Igipimo cy\u2019ivunjisha ryemewe ku ya 31 Ukuboza 2014 cyari USh 2.778 = n'idolari rimwe 1.00.\nOwnership.\nBanki Crane yu Rwanda yari ishami rya 100% rya Banki yu Crane, yari banki ya 3 nini y\u2019ubucuruzi muri Uganda, banki nini y\u2019ubucuruzi gakondo mu gihugu, ifite umutungo wa miliyoni 620 z\u2019amadolari y\u2019Amerika mu Kuboza 2014.\nMuri Gicurasi 2017, ikigo cy\u2019imari iciriritse CBA Rwanda, cyatangaje ku mugaragaro umugambi wo kugura Crane Bank Rwanda, banki y\u2019ubucuruzi, isosiyete y\u2019ababyeyi muri Uganda yari yagurishijwe kandi abaguzi b\u2019ababyeyi ntibifuzaga kugumana ishami ry\u2019u Rwanda. Ku ya 15 Kamena 2017 Itsinda rya CBA ryasinyanye amasezerano yo kugurisha no kugura na Banki ya DFCU, ba nyiri Crane Banki yu Rwanda. Kugura byasabye kwemererwa n'amategeko mu Rwanda, Kenya na Uganda. \nSale and acquisition.\nMuri Gashyantare 2018, nyuma yo kwemezwa na Banki nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda, Banki Nkuru ya Kenya na Banki ya Uganda, Itsinda rya CBA ryigaruriye u Rwanda rwa Crane. Umutungo hamwe ninshingano byabonye, \u200b\u200bharimo amashami atatu akorera muri Kigali, biteganijwe ko bizahuzwa nibikorwa bisanzwe by\u2019imari iciriritse ya CBA Rwanda.\nItsinda Ruparelia.\nCrane Bank u Rwanda yari umunyamuryango wa Groupe Ruparelia, ihuriro rikorera muri Uganda, ryarimo banki, amasosiyete y\u2019ubwishingizi, ibiro by\u2019ivunjisha, amashuri, amaradiyo, kaminuza, amahoteri na resitora. Mu Kwakira 2016, Banki ya Uganda yafashe ubuyobozi bwa Crane Bank n\u2019ibigo biyishamikiyeho, kubera igishoro gike. Muri Mutarama 2017, Banki ya DFCU yaguze umutungo n'imyenda bya Crane Bank. Crane Bank Rwanda yagurishijwe muri Banki yubucuruzi ya Afrika Group muri Gashyantare 2018. \nAmashami.\nkuva muri Nyakanga 2015, CBR ikomeza amashami akurikira."}
{"id": "16788", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16788", "title": "Banki y'Iterambere rya Afurika y'Iburasirazuba", "text": "Banki y'Iterambere ry'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba (EADB) ni ikigo cy'imari cy'iterambere kigamije guteza imbere iterambere mu bihugu bigize Umuryango w'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba. \nIncamake.\nEADB ifite uruhare runini mu nguzanyo, kujyinama, n'abafatanyabikorwa mu iterambere. Banki itanga ibicuruzwa na serivisi bitandukanye bijyanye n'iterambere ry'akarere. Banki ifite uburambe, gutera inkunga imari, abakozi, n'ubumenyi bukenewe mu karere. nku mu Ukuboza 2017 Umutungo wose w\u2019ikigo wari ufite agaciro ka miliyoni 390.411 z'amadolari y'amerika, hamwe n\u2019abanyamigabane bangana na miliyoni 261.36 z'amadolari y'amerika.\nAmateka.\nEADB yashinzwe muri 1967 hashingiwe ku masezerano y\u2019ubufatanye bwa Afurika y\u2019iburasirazuba icyo gihe hagati ya Kenya, Tanzaniya, na Uganda. Nyuma y\u2019isenyuka ry\u2019umuryango wa mbere w\u2019Afurika y\u2019iburasirazuba (EAC) mu 1977, banki yongeye gushingwa hashingiwe ku masezerano yayo bwite mu 1980. Mu mwaka wa 2008, nyuma y\u2019uko u Burundi n\u2019u Rwanda byinjira muri EAC nshya, u Rwanda rwasabye kandi rwinjira muri EADB. Mu gitabo gishya, hasuzumwe uruhare rwa manda na manda bya banki kandi ibikorwa byayo byaragutse. Mu rwego rwo kwagura ibikorwa byayo, banki itanga serivisi zitandukanye z\u2019imari mu bihugu bigize uyu muryango. Intego nyamukuru yaryo ni ugushimangira iterambere ryimibereho nubukungu no kwishyira hamwe kwakarere. \nNyirubwite.\nIfite Uburenganzira bwa EADB guhera mu Kuboza 2013 burambuye mu mbonerahamwe ikurikira. \nKugeza mu Kuboza 2013, imigabane y\u2019abanyamigabane ya banki igera kuri miliyoni 166.03 z'amadolari y'amerika. Muri Mutarama 2013, Banki Nyafurika itsura amajyambere yinjije miliyoni 24 z'amadolari ya Amerika muri EADB mu buryo bushya, bituma imigabane yayo igera kuri 15 ku ijana.\nIbihembo.\nMu Gushyingo 2014, Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019ibigo by\u2019imari by\u2019iterambere ry\u2019Afurika ryashyize ku mwanya wa EADB, \"ikigo cy\u2019imari cy\u2019iterambere ry\u2019imikorere myiza muri Afurika\" mu mwaka wa kabiri wikurikiranya, hamwe na AA. Banki yashyizwe ku mwanya mwiza mu bigo 33 byatanze isuzuma. \nImiterere ya banki.\nImiterere ya EADB igizwe n'ibi bikurikira;\nIbisobanuro birambuye kumiterere ya EADB bigaragazwa kurubuga rwa banki. \nUmuyoboro w'ishami.\nIcyicaro gikuru cya banki giherereye mu murwa mukuru wa Uganda, Kampala. Kuva muri Kamena 2014, EADB yari ifite andi mashami atatu, rimwe rimwe mu murwa mukuru wa Afurika y'Iburasirazuba wa Nairobi, Kigali, na Dar-es-Salaam. Ishami rizashingwa i Bujumbura akimara kwinjira mu banki. "}
{"id": "16789", "revid": "13539", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16789", "title": "Banki NCBA Rwanda", "text": "Banki NCBA yu Rwanda, yahoze ari Banki y\u2019ubucuruzi ya Afurika (mu Rwanda), ni banki y\u2019ubucuruzi iri mu Rwanda. Banki NCBA Rwanda ni imwe mu mashami ya banki ya Kenya yo gutangiza ibikorwa mu Rwanda. Iyi banki ni ishami rya NCBA Group Plc ku isi, akaba ari itsinda rya serivisi z\u2019imari rifite icyicaro i Nairobi, muri Kenya, rifite amashami muri Kenya, u Rwanda, Tanzaniya, Uganda na Kote divuwari. \nIncamake.\nKugeza ku ya 30 Nzeri 2019, umutungo wose wa banki wari ufite agaciro ka miliyari 30.23 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda (miliyoni 32.44 z'amadolari y'amerika), hamwe n\u2019abanyamigabane bangana na miliyari 7.015 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda (miliyoni 7.53 z'amadolari y'amerika). \nAmateka.\nMu Gushyingo 2015, Itsinda rya CBA, ikigo kinini cya Kenya gitanga serivisi z\u2019imari y\u2019abikorera ku giti cyabo cyatangaje ku mugaragaro ko bifuza kwinjira ku isoko ry\u2019u Rwanda. Itsinda ryasabye uruhushya rwa banki kubuyobozi bwu Rwanda. \nUkuboza 2016, Banki nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda yahaye CBA u Rwanda uruhushya rw\u2019imari iciriritse. Muri Gicurasi 2017, ikigo cy\u2019imari iciriritse CBA Rwanda, cyatangaje ku mugaragaro umugambi wo kugura Crane Bank Rwanda, banki y\u2019ubucuruzi, isosiyete y\u2019ababyeyi muri Uganda yari yagurishijwe kandi abaguzi b\u2019ababyeyi ntibifuzaga kugumana ishami ry\u2019u Rwanda. Ku ya 15 Kamena 2017 Itsinda rya CBA ryasinyanye amasezerano yo kugurisha no kugura na Banki ya DFCU, ba nyiri Crane Bank u Rwanda. Kugura byasabye kwemererwa n'amategeko mu Rwanda, Kenya na Uganda. \nImiterere ya banki yubucuruzi.\nKu wa mbere, 21 Gashyantare 2018, EastAfrican yatangaje ko ibyemezo bya ngombwa byo kugura Crane Bank u Rwanda byakiriwe na Banki ya Uganda, Banki Nkuru ya Kenya na Banki nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda. Biteganijwe ko umutungo n\u2019umwenda byabonye, harimo amashami abiri akorera muri Kigali, biteganijwe ko bizahuzwa n\u2019ibikorwa by\u2019imari iciriritse biriho mu Rwanda. Ku ya 19 Werurwe 2018, amashami yavuguruwe ya Crane Bank Rwanda, yafunguwe nka CBA Bank Rwanda, banki y\u2019ubucuruzi. \nGuhuriza hamwe.\nMuri Nzeri 2019, Banki y\u2019Ubucuruzi ya Afurika Itsinda, isosiyete nkuru ya Banki y\u2019ubucuruzi ya Afurika (u Rwanda), yemerewe na banki nkuru ya Kenya na Minisiteri y\u2019imari ya Kenya, kugira ngo ihuze n\u2019itsinda rya banki NIC, guhera 1 Ukwakira 2019. Biteganijwe ko iyi banki izongera kuranga Banki y'u Rwanda ya NCBA, byemejwe na Banki nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda. Ku ya 13 Mutarama 2020, Banki nkuru y\u2019igihugu ya NCBA yahawe uruhushya rushya rw\u2019amabanki y\u2019ubucuruzi na Banki nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda. "}
{"id": "16790", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16790", "title": "Banki y'Ubucuruzi ya Afurika", "text": "Banki y'Ubucuruzi ya Afurika (CBA) itanga serivisi izi mari ifite icyicaro i Nairobi, muri Kenya, ifiteubukungu bunini mu muryango w'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba. CBA yahawe uruhushya na Banki Nkuru ya Kenya, ni umuyobozi ushinzwe amabanki y'igihugu. \nKugeza mu Kuboza 2015, banki yari imwe mu mabanki manini y\u2019ubucuruzi muri Kenya afite umutungo ungana na miliyari 2.166 z\u2019amadolari y\u2019Amerika, hamwe n\u2019abanyamigabane bangana na miliyoni 217.83 z\u2019amadolari y\u2019Amerika. Niyo banki nini y\u2019ubucuruzi yari ifite abikorera ku giti cyabo muri Kenya.\nAmateka.\nIyi banki yashinzwe muri 1962 i Dar es Salaam, muri Tanzaniya. Bidatinze, amashami yafunguwe i Nairobi &amp; Mombasa, Kenya no muri Kampala, Uganda. Igihe Tanzaniya yashyiragaho ubwenegihugu amabanki yigenga muri 1967, banki yimuye icyicaro cyayo i Nairobi. Nyuma y\u2019impinduka za politiki muri Uganda muri 1971, banki yagurishije umutungo wayo muri kiriya gihugu. \nKu ikubitiro, CBA yari ifitwe n\u2019ihuriro ry\u2019ibigo by\u2019imari bizwi ku izina rya \"Soci\u00e9t\u00e9 Financi\u00e8re pour les Pays d'Outre-Mer\" (SFOM), ifite icyicaro mu Busuwisi. Abanyamuryango bambere bagize ihuriro barimo Banque Nationale de Paris, Banki Bruxelles Lambert, Commerzbank, na Banki ya Amerika. Mu 1980, Banki ya Amerika yaguze imigabane 84%, igura neza abandi bafatanyabikorwa bose ba SFOM. 16% by'imigabane muri CBA yagumye mu maboko y'abashoramari bo muri Kenya. Mu myaka ya za 1980 Banki ya Amerika yavuye muri banki, ishyira imigabane 100% muri CBA mu maboko y'abanyakenya. \nUkuboza 2018, Banki y\u2019Ubucuruzi ya Afurika Itsinda (CBA Group) yatangaje ko igiye guhuzwa na NIC Group ishyiraho banki ya gatatu ikomeye muri Kenya. Ubucuruzi bwemejwe n\u2019abagenzuzi n\u2019abanyamigabane bo muri Kenya muri Mata 2019. Ku ya 27 Nzeri 2019, Banki Nkuru ya Kenya yemeye guhuza, guhera ku ya 1 Ukwakira 2019. Binyuze mu guhuza, itsinda ryahujwe, Itsinda rya NCBA, ryagombaga guhuriza hamwe ubucuruzi bwabo bwa banki. Ibi byatumye ihererekanyabucuruzi mu kigo kimwe cyiswe NCBA Bank Kenya Limited. \nNyirubwite.\nBanki y\u2019ubucuruzi ya Afurika ifite umutungo uri munsi yimigabane. Umuryango wa Kenyatta ugenzura 24,91 ku ijana bya CBA ukoresheje imodoka ishora imari yitwa Enke Investments Limited. Imbonerahamwe ikurikira irerekana imigabane mu isosiyete, guhera mu Kuboza 2017. \nItsinda rya Banki yubucuruzi ya Afrika.\nBanki yubucuruzi ya Afrika (Kenya) ni umunyamuryango witsinda ryamasosiyete ya CBA. Muri byo harimo:\nImiyoborere.\nUmuyobozi w'inama y'ubutegetsi ni Desterio Oyatsi, umwe mu bayobozi batari abayobozi. Isaac Awoundo akora nk'umuyobozi ucunga Imari. \nAbandi bayobozi barimo:"}
{"id": "16791", "revid": "13539", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16791", "title": "Banki ya GT Rwanda", "text": "Banki y'ingwate yu Rwanda) plc, bakunze kwita GTBank Rwanda, ni imwe muri banki z'ubucuruzi zemewe muri Repubulika y'u Rwanda. Yabaye muri banki y\u2019ingwate kuva muri 2013.\nKugeza mu Kuboza 2020, Banki y\u2019ingwate (Rwanda) plc yari ifite umutungo w\u2019amadolari miliyoni 131.309 (miliyari 132.571 z'amafarnga y'u Rwanda).\nAmateka.\nIntangiriro ya banki mu Rwanda irashobora guhera muri 1983, igihe banki ya BACAR yashingwa. Yabaye imwe mu mabanki ya mbere y\u2019ubucuruzi yigenga mu gihugu. Igihe kimwe mbere ya 2004, BACAR yigaruriwe na Banki nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda, banki nkuru y\u2019igihugu, kubera ibibazo by\u2019ubuyobozi. Mu 2004, Fina Bank, icyo gihe, banki yubucuruzi yo muri Kenya, yaguze BACAR. Muri 2008, Banki Fina yafunguye ibikorwa bya banki no muri Uganda, ishinga itsinda rya Banki Fina.\nMuri 2013, Banki y\u2019ingwate (Kenya) ltd yaguze imigabane 70% mu itsinda rya Fina Bank Group kugirango yishyure amafaranga miliyoni 100 z'amadolari. Muri Mutarama 2014, banki yahinduye uburyo bwo kwerekana imiterere mishya nyir'ubwite. \nUmuyoboro w'ishami.\nKugeza mu Kuboza 2022, GTBank yu Rwanda rwakomeje amashami ahantu hakurikira: "}
{"id": "16792", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16792", "title": "Banki ishinzwe imiturire mu Rwanda", "text": "Banki ishinzwe imiturire mu Rwanda yari banki y\u2019ubucuruzi mu Rwanda. Izina ryayo mu gifaransa ni Banque de l'Habitat du Rwanda SA (BHR). Iyi banki yari imwe mu ma banki y\u2019ubucuruzi yemewe na Banki nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda, akaba ari umugenzuzi w\u2019amabanki mu gihugu. \nAmateka.\nBanki yafunguwe muri 1975, nk'ikigo gishinzwe imari y'amazu kimwe n'umushinga utimukanwa. HBR yariyandikishije nk'isosiyete idafite inshingano. Ku ya 2 Nyakanga 2004, Banki nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda, Banki Nkuru y\u2019igihugu, yahaye HBR uruhushya rw\u2019agateganyo rwo gukora nka Banki y\u2019imiturire. Uru ruhushya rwashingiraga ku kigo cyazamuye imari shingiro kugeza kuri miliyoni 2.65 z'amadolari ya Amerika, kugira ngo gikurikize amategeko agenga amabanki muri iki gihe mu Rwanda.\nKu ya 25 Gashyantare 2005, abanyamigabane ba Banque de l'Habiatat du Rwanda (BHR), bakoze inama rusange idasanzwe kandi bahitamo kongera imari shingiro yabo ku gipimo gito gisabwa, guhindura izina ryabo muri Banki yi miturire y\u2019u Rwanda no guhindura izina ryabo ubutumwa buva mu kigo cy\u2019inguzanyo, uteza imbere imitungo itimukanwa kuri Banki yubucuruzi kabuhariwe mu bijyanye n\u2019imari yimiturire. \nNyirubwite.\nKugeza muri Mata 2010, imigabane ya banki yari ifite ibigo bikurikira: \nUmuyoboro w'ishami.\nKuva muri Mata 2010, banki yakomeje icyicaro cyayo kuri Avenue de la Justice, mu mujyi wa Kigali, umurwa mukuru w'u Rwanda. Nta yandi mashami yari azwiho kubaho muri kiriya gihe. \nGufata no guseswa.\nMuri Mata 2011, Banki ishinzwe iterambere ry\u2019u Rwanda, izwi ku bimenyetso by\u2019igifaransa BRD, yabonye inyungu 100% igenzura inyungu muri Banki y\u2019imiturire y\u2019u Rwanda. BRD iri mubikorwa byo kwinjiza umutungo, imyenda n'abakozi ba HBR. Nyuma yo kongera gutunganya, BRD izatangira ibikorwa byo gucuruza amabanki. Byongeye kandi, izatangira kwandikisha ibicuruzwa by\u2019inguzanyo byaturutse ku yandi m'abanki y\u2019ubucuruzi mu gihugu, mu rwego rwo kongera umutungo w\u2019amazu mu Rwanda. Mugihe cyo gufata, umutungo wa HBR wose wari ufite agaciro ka miliyoni 23.7 z'amadolari (miliyari 14 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda). "}
{"id": "16793", "revid": "13539", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16793", "title": "Banki ishinzwe iterambere mu Rwanda", "text": "Banki y\u2019iterambere y\u2019u Rwanda, bakunze kwita (BRD), ni banki y\u2019iterambere mu Rwanda. Ni imwe muri banki zemewe na Banki nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda, ariyo mugenzuzi w\u2019amabanki mu gihugu. \nIncamake.\nBanki yatangiye ibikorwa byayo muri 1967, nkumuntu utanga serivisi zigihe kirekire zitanga serivise yimari, inkunga ikaba igamije imishinga yiterambere ryigihugu. Muri Mata 2011, umutungo wose wa banki wagereranije hafi miliyoni 122 z'amadolari (miliyari 72 z'amanyarwanda), hamwe n\u2019abanyamigabane bangana na miliyoni 42.3 z'amadolari (miliyari 25 z'amanyarwanda) \nIbice byo gutabara.\nIbice bafasha birimo ibi bikurikira: \nImishinga idasanzwe.\nBanki ishinzwe iterambere yu Rwanda itanga ibicuruzwa byiza kubakiriya bayo. Aba ni:\nImishinga idasanzwe iminshinga idasanzwe:\nInguzanyo\nIbicuruzwa byiyongera\nAmateka.\nBanki ishinzwe iterambere mu Rwanda (BRD), ni Isosiyete ya Leta igarukira ku migabane, ifite imari shingiro y'amafaranga 57.808.931.000, yanditswe ku Mukozi wa Gerefiye Mukuru, kode ya sosiyete n \u00b0 100003547.\nBanki yashinzwe ku ya 5 Kanama 1967; icyakora, icyemezo cyacyo cyo gushinga cyatanzwe ku ya 7/7/2011 mu gihe uruhushya rwa banki n\u00b0003 rwatanzwe na Banki nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda ku ya 11 Kanama 2009.\nMu myaka irenga mirongo ine, BRD niyo yonyine itanga imari yigihe kirekire kandi yorohereje cyane kugaragara kwimishinga itandukanye itanga umusaruro mubikorera.\n2000-2009: Icyiciro cyo gukura no guhanga udushya\nIki cyiciro gikomoka ku bikenewe ko Banki igira uruhare mu kongera kwimurwa no kwinjiza amafaranga mu cyaro, mu kongera ibicuruzwa byoherezwa mu mahanga birwanya imbogamizi z\u2019ubukungu bw\u2019u Rwanda byashyizweho n\u2019ibikenewe by\u2019iterambere ryihuse kandi rirambye mu kurwanya ubukene. Mu byukuri abarenga 90% by'abaturage baba mu cyaro cyane ku buhinzi.\nMu rwego rwo kuzamura inshingano za Banki y\u2019iterambere, muri 2005 Guverinoma yu Rwanda yategetse BRD inshingano yo kuba Umunyemari w\u2019iterambere ry\u2019u Rwanda. Kuva icyo gihe BRD yagiye yihindura kugira ngo ibashe kugira uruhare runini mu iterambere ry\u2019u Rwanda. BRD muri 2005-2009 Gahunda yibikorwa isobanura ubutumwa bwa BRD n'icyerekezo cyo kuba banki yunguka cyane muri serivisi yo kugabanya ubukene.\nIcyiciro cya nyuma ya Jenoside: Nyuma ya jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu 1994, habaye ibisubizo by\u2019ibiza byakurikiyeho kandi banki ikomeje kwikorera umutwaro urenga 50 % by\u2019inshingano zayo zigizwe n\u2019inguzanyo zitishyurwa zatewe na jenoside yo muri 1994.\nUmubare w'inguzanyo ingana na miliyari 6.8 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda, ibikorwa 115; Miliyari 6.7 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda mu mirongo 112 y'inguzanyo; Miliyoni 156.4 y'imigabane yi migabane mu mishinga 3 itanga umusaruro. Inguzanyo zashowe cyane mu kuvugurura imishinga igera kuri miliyari 13.4 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda, bituma habaho akazi k'abantu 8.923 ndetse n'inyongera ku bukungu bwa miliyari 8 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda.\nIntambara yamugaye mu cyaro no kuvugurura ibikorwa nyuma yo muri 1994 yibanda mu murwa mukuru cyane mu mashuri yisumbuye na kaminuza. Iki gihe cyari icyiciro cyo kuvugurura no guhuza.\n1988-1994: Icyiciro cyo gukura\nMuri iki gihe, Banki yatanze inguzanyo zose hamwe: Rwf4. Miliyari 6 mu mirongo 873 y'inguzanyo; Miliyoni 84,5 z'imigabane mu migabane 7 itanga umusaruro. Yinjije igishoro kingana na miliyari 15.7 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda hamwe no guhanga imirimo ku bantu 9.094 n'agaciro kongerewe mu bukungu bw'amafaranga 8, miliyari 5.\nIbyingenzi byibanze ku nguzanyo ni inganda z\u2019ubuhinzi cyane urwego rw\u2019icyayi n\u2019inganda, rushobozwa n\u2019umutungo muto uhendutse uhabwa imishinga mito n'iciriritse mu buhinzi; abanyabukorikori n'imishinga iciriritse\n1968-1987: Gushinga icyiciro\nMu myaka ya 1968 kugeza 1970, Banki yashinzwe kandi nta mushinga watewe inkunga.\nMu myaka ine yakurikiyeho, Banki yanditse inguzanyo zikomeye ku binyabiziga (pick-up) no gusya. Inkunga y\u2019imodoka yaguye mu gihugu hose kandi igaragaza intambwe ikomeye iganisha ku kuzamura ibicuruzwa mu gihugu.\nGuhera muri 1974, banki yatangiye gutera inkunga ibikorwa bitandukanye byubukungu.\nUmubare w'inguzanyo ingana na miliyari 6,6 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda kuva yongerewe kugera ku bikorwa 501, miliyoni 317 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda yashora mu migabane ingana n'amasosiyete 23, na miliyari 6.3 z'inguzanyo ku baguriza 478. Ibi bivuze ingaruka zishoramari zingana na miliyari 12.6 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda hifashishijwe uburyo bwo kubona akazi ku bantu 8.400 hamwe n\u2019agaciro kiyongereyeho miliyari 25.2.\nBanki yateye inkunga hafi 80% y\u2019inguzanyo ziciriritse n\u2019igihe kirekire mu gihugu mu bikorwa bitanga umusaruro.\nKugura.\nWERURWE - 2011: Guhuza BAS na BDF\nKuva muri Werurwe 2011, Serivisi Ngishwanama za BRD (BAS Ltd) na BRD Development Fund (BDF Ltd) zahujwe no gushinga sosiyete nshya yitwa BDF Ltd. Ibigo byombi byahoze ari BRD byari bifite amashami yose ashinzwe gutanga serivisi n\u2019ibicuruzwa biteza imbere imishinga mito n'iciriritse mu Rwanda. Isosiyete nshya yagumye ifasha BRD kandi inonosora ubutumwa bwabanje.\nIhuriro ryemejwe n\u2019inama y\u2019ubuyobozi ya BRD yateranye ku ya 17 Werurwe 2011 hagamijwe kunoza imikorere y\u2019ibikorwa, ireme, serivisi n\u2019ibicuruzwa bizatangwa n\u2019ikigo gishya, BDF Ltd.\n26-MATA-2011: gusaba BHR\nKu ya 26 Mata 2011, BRD yaguze ku mugaragaro Banque de l'Habitat du Rwanda (BHR) mu muhango wakiriwe na Nyakubahwa Minisitiri w\u2019imari n\u2019igenamigambi, Bwana John RWANGOMBWA. Icyari kigamijwe muri uku kugura kwari ukugera ku iterambere rirambye hifashishijwe BRD banki ikomeye kandi ihagaze neza itanga inguzanyo z'igihe kirekire, inguzanyo z\u2019amazu, kongera inguzanyo ndetse n\u2019izindi serivisi z\u2019imari zigamije kunoza uburyo bwo kubona imari mu Rwanda.\nIfatwa rya BHR ryahaye BRD ishingiro ry'umutungo urenga Miliyari 72 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda (Miliyari 58 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda na miliyari 14 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda muri BHR).\nInkunga.\nBanki ifite amashami abiri, ifite 100%, aribyo:\nNyirubwite.\nImigabane ya banki ifitwe n\u2019ibigo byigenga n\u2019ibigo bikurikira: \nAmashami.\nBanki ikomeza ahantu hamwe ku cyicaro cyabo: \nImiyoborere.\nKuva muri Gashyantare 2023 [kuvugurura], ibikurikira bigize Inama y'Ubuyobozi ya banki.\nAbakurikira ni abagize itsinda rya Komite Nyobozi muri Banki ishinzwe iterambere ry\u2019u Rwanda, guhera mu Gushyingo 2019."}
{"id": "16794", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16794", "title": "Ni Nyagasambu rirarema", "text": "Ni Nyagasambu rirarema Ni mvugo yamamaye mu Rwanda, ndetse ihimbwamo n\u2019indirimbo, ngo yakomotse ku bakozi ba MININTER, ubwo bajyaga gukora umuganda wo gutera ibiti i Nyagasambu, bataha bakahahahira ibiribwa bitandukanye ku giciro giciriritse, nyuma bajya mu masoko ya Kigali bagasanga ibyaho bihenze, bati \u201cN\u2019Inyagasambu rirarema.\u201dikindi wamenya n'uko nyagasambu iherereye mukarere ka rwamgana.\nIcyo wamenya.\nNyagasambu Ni ahantu mu Rwanda hamenyekanye kubera umugani ngo 'N'i Nyagasambu rirarema', ubu ni Mu Akagari ka Nyagasambu, Umurenge wa Fumbwe mu Karere ka Rwamagana, Intara y'iburasirazuba. Abaturage bo muri aka gace bavuga ko abari abakozi ba Minisiteri icyo gihe yitwaga (MININTER) \u2018Minisiteri y\u2019Ubutegetsi bw\u2019Igihugu n\u2019Amajyambere ya Komini\u2019, mu myaka ya za 1975 bajyaga mu muganda wo gutera ibiti bya Pinusi i Nyagasambu mu cyahoze ari Komini Bicumbi baturutse i Kigali. Mu minsi isanzwe itari iyo kujya ku muganda, birumvikana ko aba bakozi bajyaga guhahira mu masoko asanzwe yo muri Kigali, bakabwirwa ibiciro bihanitse ugereranyije n\u2019iby\u2019i Nyagasambu maze nabo bagasubiza ko n\u2019i Nyagasambu rirema. Ni uko kuva icyo gihe kugeza ubu imvugo iba kimomo, iyo umuntu akwimye ikintu runaka cyangwa se iyo aguhenze, uramusubiza uti \u201cN\u2019inyagasambu rirarema.\u201d"}
{"id": "16795", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16795", "title": "Isoko rya Biryogo", "text": "Isoko rya Biryogo Ucyumva Biryogo wumva agace karangwamo ubuzima buhendutse kubahatemberera iri soko ryubazwe Muri 1999 Ryubakwa Mu Kagali ka Biryogo Mu Murenge wa Nyarugenge Mu Karere Ka Nyarugenge, ryacururizwaga ibiguzi bitadukanda harimo ibiribwa,bamashuka,couvre-rit,rideau,tapis,imisego.essui main inkweto ndetse N'inkweto.\nNkomoko y'Izina Biryogo.\nInkomoko y\u2019izina rya Biryogo, atubwira ko amateka avuga ko ryazanywe n\u2019abazungu baje kuhatura bwa mbere, bakajya baza kuhashakira ibyo kurya dore ko ngo hari n\u2019abatetsi b\u2019abahanga. Ati \u201cBarazaga babazanya ahantu bakura ibiryo, hanyuma bakavuga mu rurimi rw\u2019Icyongereza ngo (Biryo Go.) berekana aho wakura ibiryo kuko ntakinyarwanda bari bazi bagahitamo kuvanga indimi, nuko izina rihita rifata gutyo\u201d \nIcyo wamenya.\nUmuntu uvuye mu bice by\u2019icyaro bitandukanye akerekeza mu mujyi wa Kigali, iyo awuvuyemo atageze i Nyamirambo usanga bamukiniraho ko nta mujyi yagezemo. Ikindi kandi uvuze ko uzi i Kigali ariko utazi i Nyamirambo abantu bashobora kuguseka kuko bamwe ntibabura no kuhita umurwa mukuru wa Kigali."}
{"id": "16796", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16796", "title": "Kwa Rubangura", "text": "Ni mu mujyi wa Kigali mu karere ka Nyarugenge, umurenge wa Nyarugenge. Hamenyekanye kuri iryo zina Kwa Rubangura kubera igorofa rya Rubangura Vedatse rihubatse.\nRubangura Vedaste yari umwe mu bashoramari bakomeye mu gihugu yatabarutse tariki 06/05/2007 akaba yari umubyeyi w\u2019abana 11."}
{"id": "16797", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16797", "title": "Umupaka wa Cyanika", "text": "Umupaka wa Cyanika Uyu Mupaka uherereye Mu Akarere ka Burera uyu mupaka ukoreshwa na Abanyarwanda n\u2019Abanya-Uganda baturiye umupaka wa Cyanika mu buhahirane bw'ibihugu byombi."}
