{"id": "16835", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16835", "title": "Umuhanda wa Kagitumba - Kayonza - Rusumo", "text": "Umuhanda wa Kagitumba - Kayonza - Rusumo ni umuhanda uri mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba bw'u Rwanda, uhuza ibigo by'ubucuruzi byo mu mijyi ya Kagitumba, ku mupaka na Uganda na Kayonza, icyicaro cy'akarere ka Kayonza mu Rwanda na Rusumo, ku mupaka wa Tanzaniya. Umuhanda uhuza Koridoro y'ubucuruzi y'Amajyaruguru muri Uganda na Koridoro y'ubucuruzi yo hagati muri Tanzaniya. \nAho biherereye.\nUmuhanda utangirira i Kagitumba k'umupaka mpuzamahanga na Uganda. Irakurikira icyerekezo rusange cyerekeza mu majyepfo, ikanyura Kayonza, ikarangirira i Rusumo, k'umupaka mpuzamahanga na Tanzaniya, intera yi kilometero 208. Umujyi wa Kayonza ni hafi yo hagati mu muhanda, uherereye kuri kilometero 123 mu majyepfo ya Kagitumba na kilometero 85 amajyaruguru ya Rusumo. \nIncamake.\nMbere yo muri 2018 iyi koridoro yo gutwara abantu, yari mu Rwanda rwose, yagaragayeho amabuye mu byiciro bitandukanye byo gusenyuka. Hifashishijwe amafaranga yatanzwe na guverinoma yu Rwanda, hamwe n\u2019inguzanyo n\u2019impano zatanzwe n\u2019abafatanyabikorwa mu iterambere, umuhanda wagutse kandi utezwa imbere kugeza ku cyiciro cya kabiri cya bitumen, hamwe n\u2019ibitugu, imiyoboro y\u2019amazi n\u2019amazi. \nKuwongera.\nMuri 2018, kuzamura umuhanda ujya mucyiciro cya kabiri cya bitumen, hamwe na ruhurura, ibitugu n'inzira zitwara amazi. Umwaka wo muri 2018 urangiye, abagera kuri 75 ku ijana by'imirimo yarangiye, biteganijwe ko barangiza mu gihembwe cya kane cya 2019. Muri kiriya gihe, ibiciro byiterambere byavuzwe nka miliyoni 187.210.000 z'amapawundi (hafi miliyoni 212.000.000 z'amadolari y'amerika). \nInkunga.\nKwagura umuhanda no gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe inyungu zatewe inkunga n\u2019inzego zikurikira (a) Guverinoma y\u2019u Rwanda (b) Banki Nyafurika itsura amajyambere (c) Ikigega cy\u2019ibikorwa Remezo cy\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Uburayi na (d) Ikigo cy\u2019ubufatanye mpuzamahanga cy\u2019Ubuyapani. "}
{"id": "16836", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16836", "title": "Kenya - Uganda - U Rwanda Ibikomoka kuri peteroli", "text": "Umuyoboro w\u2019ibikomoka kuri peteroli wa Kenya - Uganda - u Rwanda ni umuyoboro utwara ibikomoka kuri peteroli bitunganijwe kuva mu mujyi wa Mombasa ku cyambu cya Kenya kugera ku murwa mukuru w\u2019iki gihugu wa Nairobi ugakomeza kugera mu mujyi wa Eldoret ku kibaya cya Rift. Hariho gahunda yo kwagura umuyoboro mu murwa mukuru wa Uganda, wa Kampala, ukomereza ku murwa mukuru w'u Rwanda, Kigali. \nAho biherereye.\nUyu muyoboro ukomoka ku cyambu cya Mombasa cyo mu nyanja y'Abahinde ugenda ugana i Nairobi, ukomeza kuri Eldoret. Icyo gice cy'umuyoboro kirahari guhera muri Gicurasi 2014.\nHasabwe ko umuyoboro wagera i Kigali, mu Rwanda, unyuze i Kampala, muri Uganda. Inzira y'umuyoboro, nkuko byasabwe, ireshya na kilometero 1,800. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nKwagura umuyoboro bizahuza ahari Eldoret muri Kenya na Kampala muri Uganda, unyuze muri Malaba. Uyu muyoboro uzagera i Kigali mu Rwanda kandi birashoboka ko uzagera i Bujumbura, mu Burundi. Buri gihugu kizaba gifite inshingano zo guteza imbere ibikorwa remezo mu mbibi zacyo; icyakora, hazatoranywa \"umujyanama w'ubucuruzi\" kugirango habeho kugenzura ubuziranenge. \nUbwubatsi.\nUbushakashatsi bushoboka bwo kwagura umuyoboro wari Eldoret kugera Kampala bwahawe ikigo mpuzamahanga muri 1997. Ubushakashatsi bwarangiye muri 1998, raporo itangwa umwaka ukurikira. Ubushakashatsi bwatewe inkunga na Banki y\u2019ishoramari y\u2019i Burayi. Raporo yerekanye ko kubaka umuyoboro bishoboka. Inyigo ishoboka yo kwagura Kampala kugeza Kigali yahawe Umuryango w\u2019Afurika y'Iburasirazuba muri Nzeri 2011, iterwa inkunga ingana na miliyoni 600,000 z'amadolari y'amerika na Banki Nyafurika itsura amajyambere. Guverinoma za Kenya, Uganda, n'u Rwanda zemeye ibyavuye mu bushakashatsi bwombi.\nAmasezerano yo kubaka yatangijwe bwa mbere, muri 2007, Tamoil, isosiyete ifitwe na guverinoma ya Libiya. Ayo masezerano yateshejwe agaciro mu 2012 nyuma yuko sosiyete yananiwe gushyira mu bikorwa umushinga. Muri Mata 2014, ibigo cumi na bine byatanze amasoko yo kubaka umuyoboro uva muri Kenya ujya mu Rwanda. Biteganijwe ko imirimo yo kubaka izatangira muri 2014, hamwe n\u2019amezi 32 yo kubaka. Komisiyo iteganijwe mu 2016. \nAmafaranga yo kubaka.\nAmafaranga yose yo kubaka igice cya Eldoret Kampala Kigali yuwo muyoboro agera kuri miliyari 5 z\u2019amadolari y\u2019Amerika. Mu Gushyingo 2014, Ishami mpuzamahanga ry\u2019imari, ishami rya Banki y\u2019isi, ryiyemeje gutanga miliyoni 600 z\u2019amadolari y\u2019Amerika mu iyubakwa ryi gice cya Eldoret Kampala. "}
{"id": "16837", "revid": "9488", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16837", "title": "Ingufu za Gaz methani", "text": "Ibikorwa by'Ingufu za Gaze methani ni uruganda ruteganijwe gukuramo gaz metani no gutunganya Gaz mu Rwanda. \nAho biherereye.\nUru ruganda ruherereye mu mazi y\u2019ikiyaga cya Kivu, mu karere ka mazi yu Rwanda, hafi y\u2019umujyi wa Gisenyi,mu bilometero 165, ku muhanda ujya mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bwa Kigali, umurwa mukuru wu Rwanda. \nIncamake.\nIkiyaga cya Kivu kirimo gaze metani nyinshi na gaze karuboni, iyo ibyimbye hejuru, ikora ibicu byuburozi byica. Nyamara, iyo imyuka ikuweho ikanabikwa mu icupa, ikora amavuta yingenzi yo guteka asimbuza inkwi namakara, bityo bikabungabunga ibidukikije. Imishinga yabanjirije iyerekeje gaze kubyara amashanyarazi. \nMuri Mutarama 2019, Inama y'Abaminisitiri y\u2019u Rwanda yemereye akanama gashinzwe iterambere ry\u2019u Rwanda kugirana amasezerano na Gasmeth Energy Limited, gukuramo gaze metani yo gukoresha mu nganda no mu nganda nk'amavuta yo guteka. Ku ya 5 Gashyantare 2019, hasinywe amasezerano, hagati y\u2019ikigo gishinzwe iterambere ry\u2019u Rwanda (RDB), mu Rwanda Mines, peteroli na gaze (RMB) na Gasmeth Energy Limited (GEL), biyemeza GEL kubaka ikigo ku kiyaga cya Kivu cyo kuvoma, gutunganya no guhagarika gaze metani ku isoko ryimbere mu gihugu no kohereza ibicuruzwa hanze. Uyu niwo mushinga wambere wingenzi mukarere ka Afrika yibiyaga bigari byo gukuramo gaze metani yo guteka, kurwego rw'inganda. \nIngufu za Gasmeth.\nBa nyir'iterambere umushinga ni Gasmeth Energy Limited, isosiyete yanditswe ku Rwanda, abanyamigabane bayo bakaba bigaragara mu mbonerahamwe ikurikira. \nKubaka no gutera inkunga.\nGasmeth yiyemeje kwandika gushora miliyoni 400 z'amadolari y'Amerika mu kubaka uruganda rwa gaze metani. Biteganijwe ko ibikorwa by\u2019ubucuruzi by\u2019uruganda rushya bizatangira muri Gashyantare 2021. "}
{"id": "16838", "revid": "13539", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16838", "title": "Ikibuga cy'indege cya Butare", "text": "Ikibuga cy'indege cya Butare ni ikibuga cy'indege giherereye i Butare, mu Rwanda.\nAho biherereye.\nIkibuga cy'indege cya Butare, giherereye mu mujyi wa Butare, mu Karere ka Huye, Intara y'Amajyepfo. Aho giherereye nko muri kilometero 80, mu majyepfo ashyira uburengerazuba bw'ikibuga cy'indege mpuzamahanga cya Kigali, ikibuga kinini cy'abasivili mu gihugu. Imiterere y'ubumenyi bw'isi yikibuga cy'indege ni: 2 \u00b0 35 '42.00 \"S, 29 \u00b0 44' 24.00\" E (Ubunini: -2.59500; Uburebure: 29.74000).\nIncamake.\nIkibuga cy'indege cya Butare ni ikibuga gito cya gisivili gikorera mu mujyi wa Butare. Ni kimwe mubibuga by'indege umunani (8) biyoborwa n'ubuyobozi bw'indege za gisivili. Ikibuga cy'indege cya Butare giherereye muri metero 1,768 hejuru y'inyanja. Ikibuga cy\u2019indege gifite inzira imwe ya kaburimbo, ipima metero 860 mu burebure. "}
{"id": "16840", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16840", "title": "African Alliance Investment Bank", "text": "African Alliance Investment Bank (AAIB) ni \"ikigo cya banki gishinzwe ishoramari\" gikorera ku mugabane w'Afurika.\nAho giherereye.\nIcyicaro gikuru cy\u2019iryo tsinda giherereye mu gace kitwa Melrose, mu mujyi wa Johannesburg, muri Afurika yepfo, ugereranyije kiri nko muri, mu majyaruguru y'umujyi rwagati. Igipimo ndangamerekezo kigaragaza icyicaro gikuru aho giherereye ni: 26 \u00b0 07'47.0 \"S, 28 \u00b0 04'12.0\" E (Ubunini: -26.129737; Uburebure: 28.070007). \nAmasoko.\nKuva muri Werurwe 2016, AAIB ikorera mu mashami atandukanye aho ifite amasoko mu bihugu bikurikira:\nIbikorwa.\nMuri buri soko iyi banki ikoreramo, haba hari ishami ryanditswe ryo muri icyo gihugu rikaba riba riyobowe n'umuyobozi mukuru utari umuyobozi nshingwabikorwa, komite nyobozi, komite ishinzwe ibyago, komite y'ubugenzuzi, umugenzuzi w'imbere mu kigo, komite ishinzwe imishahara, komite ishinzwe amasezerano na komite ngishwanama tekinike. \nIkigo gikora ibikorwa bitandukanye harimo ibi bikurikira: \nIhuza ryo hanze.\n&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Coordinates/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;26\u00b007\u203247\u2033S 28\u00b004\u203212\u2033E\ufeff / \ufeff26.12972\u00b0S 28.07000\u00b0E\ufeff / -26.12972; 28.07000"}
{"id": "16841", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16841", "title": "Gati Meddy", "text": "Gati Meddy ni umunyarwanda akaba ari rwiyemezamirimo watangije ubucuruzi ariko bw\u2019ibikorwa ahanini byo muri Amerika noneho akabigemura mu Rwanda, abicishije mu isosiyete yashinze ikorera kuri murandasi. \nNi Muntu ki.\nGati Meddy Ni umusore ukiri muto ufite imigambi mu kuzamura ubucuruzi bukorerwa kuri murandasi, mugufasha abakiri bato ndetse bashaka kwinjira mu bucuruzi bukoresheje ikoranabuhanga. Gati Meddy yize ibijyanye n\u2019amashanyarazi.\nMu bucuruzi.\nMeddy Yatangiye ubu bucuruzi muri 2012 ahereye ku iduka rizwi ku Isi rya eBay na Amazon,yabanje gucuruza amadarubindi arinda izuba n\u2019amasaha, avaho kurirwo rwego ahita atangiza iduka ryakoreraga ku rubuga rwe bwite yashinze rwitwa www.gatishop.com muri 2015.\nGati Shop yatangiriye ku Mugabane wa Amerika, ositraliya, u Burayi na Aziya nyuma yo muri 2017 afata umwanzuro wo gutangiza nanone Mall for Africa, isosiyete igemura ibicuruzwa biva muri Amerika abyohereza ababikeneye mu Rwanda. Gati ubu afite amaduka 180 yo muri Amerika ndetse Bwongereza bakora. "}
{"id": "16842", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16842", "title": "Mall for Africa", "text": "Mall for Africa ikompanyi cyangwa sosiyete igemura cyangwa izana ibicuruzwa biva muri Amerika hamwe n'Ubwongereza abyoherereza abakiriya mu Rwanda.\nUko Yatangiye.\nMall for Arica Ubusanzwe yatangijwe na Gati Meddy uyu yize ibijyanye n\u2019amashanyarazi muri KIST nyuma yagiye muri Amerika aho utuye, ubu aba muri Leta ya California ahamaze imyaka igera kuri irindwi. Mu Rwanda yahuguwe mu bijyanye n\u2019amashanyarazi ndetse n\u2019ubucuruzi bwo kuri murandasi [e-commerce]. Natangiye gucuruza kuri murandasi muri 2012 atangirira kuri eBay aho yacuruzaga amataratara n\u2019amasaha muri 2013 atangirira gucuruza kuri Amazon ibintu bitandukanye, nyuma muri 2015 atangiza urubuga rwa www.gatishop.com uru rucururiza ku mugabane wa Amerika, ositaraliya, u Burayi na Aziya. Muri 2017 nibwo yatangije urubuga Mallforafrica.com mu Rwanda.\nMu Rwanda.\nMall for Arica ubu afite amaduka agera ku 180 yo muri Amerika n\u2019u Bwongereza bafitanye amasezerano yo kugemura ibicuruzwa byabo nibindi babyohereza mu Rwanda. Ayo maduka yose ushobora kuyasanga ku rubuga rwacu rwa murandasi www.mallforafrica.com.\nAho Bakorera.\nMall for Arica yafunguye ibirobikuru mu Mujyi wa Kigali kuri Centenary House, aha afite abakozi babiri bakora bahoraho. kandi batanze akazi ku bantu bamamaza, ndetse bahaye akazi amaradiyo na bagemura ibintu byabo.\u201dIbicuruzwa bigemurwa biza mu Rwanda akabisakaza mu bihugu birimo Nigeriya, Kenya, Gana, na Dubayi."}
{"id": "16843", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16843", "title": "Ikibuga cy'indege cya Gisenyi", "text": "Ikibuga cy'indege cya Gisenyi ni ikibuga cy'indege cyo mu Rwanda. Ifite ikibuga cy'indege cya IATA GYI (tutitiranya ikibuga cy'indege cya Texas y'Amajyaruguru hamwe na FAA iranga GYI).\nAho biherereye.\nIkibuga cy'indege cya Gisenyi, giherereye mu Ntara y'Uburengerazuba bw'u Rwanda, mu Karere ka Rubavu, mu mujyi wa Gisenyi, ku mupaka mpuzamahanga na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Aha hantu hareshya na kilometero 94, mu kirere, mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bw'ikibuga cy'indege mpuzamahanga cya Kigali, kuri ubu, cyikaba aricyo kibuga kinini cy'abasivili mu gihugu. Imiterere y'ubumenyi bw'isi bwiki kibuga ni: 1 \u00b0 40 '48.00 \"S, 29 \u00b0 15' 30.00\" E (Ubunini: -1.680000; Uburebure: 29.258334).\nIncamake.\nIkibuga cy'indege cya Gisenyi ni ikibuga cy'indege giciriritse gikorera mu mujyi wa Gisenyi n'umujyi bituranye wa Goma, hakurya y'umupaka wa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Imijyi yombi ituranye nayo ikoresha i Kibuga cy'indege cya Goma, cyegereye cyane umupaka w'u Rwanda neza neza n'ikibuga cy'indege mpuzamahanga cya Tijuana n'ikibuga cy'indege cya Brown Field gitandukanijwe na Amerika - Umupaka wa Mexico. Ikibuga cy'indege cya Gisenyi ni kimwe mu bibuga by'indege bya gisivili umunani (8) biyobowe n'ikigo gishinzwe indege za gisivili mu Rwanda. Ikibuga cy'indege cya Gisenyi giherereye ku butumburuke bwa metero 1,549 hejuru y'inyanja. Ikibuga cy\u2019indege gifite umuhanda umwe wa asfalt upima metero 1,010 mu burebure na metero 23 mu bugari. \nSosiyete z'ubwikorezi bw'abantu n'ibintu z'indege hamwe nibyerekezo by'ingendo.\nRwandAir, itwara igihugu, yakoraga serivisi eshatu buri cyumweru hagati y'ikibuga cy\u2019indege cya Gisenyi n\u2019ikibuga cy\u2019indege mpuzamahanga cya Kigali. Icyakora, guhera muri Kamena mu mwaka wa 2013 ntibongeye gukora. "}
{"id": "16844", "revid": "11596", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16844", "title": "Ikibuga cy'indege cya Nemba", "text": "Ikibuga cy'indege cya Nemba ni ikibuga cy'indege cyo mu Rwanda.\nAho biherereye.\nIkibuga cy'indege cya Nemba giherereye mu Ntara y'Uburasirazuba bw'u Rwanda, mu Karere ka Bugesera, mu mujyi wa Nemba, ku mupaka mpuzamahanga na Repubulika y'Uburundi. Aha hantu hareshya na kilometero 50, mu kirere, mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba bw'ikibuga cy'indege mpuzamahanga cya Kigali, kuri ubu, ikikibuga nicyo kinini cy'abasivili mu gihugu. \nImiterere y'ubumenyi bw'isi bw'ikibuga cy'indege ni 2 \u00b0 19 '48.00 \"S, 30 \u00b0 12' 0.00\" E (Ubunini: -2.33000; Uburebure: 30.20000). Ikibuga cy'indege cya Nemba giherereye ku butumburuke bwa metero 1,495 hejuru y'inyanja. Iki kibuga cy\u2019indege gifite umuhanda umwe udasakaye ufite metero 1,100 mu burebure. \nIncamake.\nIkibuga cy'indege cya Nemba ni ikibuga gito giciriritse gikorera mu mujyi wa Nemba kikanafasha abaturage bahaturiye. Nikimwe mu bibuga by'indege umunani bya gisivili bigengwa n'ubuyobozi bw'ikigo cy'indege za gisivili."}
{"id": "16845", "revid": "13539", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16845", "title": "Ikibuga cy'indege cya Ruhengeri", "text": "Ikibuga cy'indege cya Ruhengeri ni ikibuga cy'indege giherereye muri Ruhengeri, mu Rwanda.\nAho biherereye.\nIkibuga cy'indege cya Ruhengeri giherereye mu Ntara y'Amajyaruguru y'u Rwanda, mu Karere ka Musanze, mu mujyi wa Ruhengeri. Aha hantu hareshya na kilometero 227, mu kirere, mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bw'ikibuga cy'indege mpuzamahanga cya Kigali, kuri ubu, iki kibuga nicyo kinini cy'abasivili mu gihugu. Imiterere y'ubumenyi bw'isi bwiki kibuga ni: 1 \u00b0 30 '0.00 \"S, 29 \u00b0 38' 1.00\" E (Ubunini: -1.50000; Uburebure: 29.63361).\nIncamake.\nIkibuga cy'indege cya Ruhengeri ni ikibuga cy'indege kiringaniye gifasha umujyi wa Ruhengeri ndetse n'abaturage bahaturiye. Ni kimwe mu bibuga by'indege umunani bya gisivili bigengwa n'ubuyobozi bw'ikigo cy'indege za gisivili. Ikibuga cy'indege cya Ruhengeri giherereye ku butumburuke bwa metero 1,860 hejuru y'inyanja. Iki kibuga cy'indege gifite inzira imwe ya asfalt ipima metero 1,480 mu burebure. "}
