{"id": "16851", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16851", "title": "ADEBIMPE ONI", "text": "Adebimpe Oni ni we washinze D'Rose recycling, sosiyete irwanya abangiza ibidukikije izamura imyanda ikomeye nk'amapine ashaje, amacupa, plasitike mu bikoresho bitunganyirizwa mu nzu, ibiro, ibibuga by'imikino, sitidiyo.\nIsosiyete ya Adebimpe Oni irashaka gukemura ikibazo cyatewe na toni za plastiki n'amapine birangirira mu nyanja buri mwaka bitera umwanda w'amazi kandi bigatuma ubuzima bw'inyanja bubaho."}
{"id": "16852", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16852", "title": "Folorunso Alakija", "text": "Folorunsho Alakija (yavutse ku taliki ya 15 Nyakanga mu mwaka 1951) ni umuherwe wo muri Nigeriya umucuruzi akaba n'umugiraneza. Yisanga mu myambarire y'imideri, amavuta, imitungo itimukanwa n\u2019inganda zicapa. Ni Umuyobozi uyobora Itsinda rya Rose wo mu itsinda rya Sharon rigizwe na Rose ya Sharon Prints &amp; Promotions Limited, Digital Reality Prints Limited hamwe na visi-perezida mukuru wa Famfa Oil Limited. \nAlakija afite kandi imigabane myinshi muri sosiyete ishinzwe iterambere ry'umutungo wa DaySpring. Folorunsho Alakija yashyizwe ku rutonde na \"Forbes\" nk'umugore ukize cyane muri Nijeriya ufite umutungo wa miliyari imwe y'amadolari mu mwaka 2020. Kugeza mu mwaka 2015, Alakija yashyizwe ku rutonde rw\u2019umugore wa kabiri ukomeye muri Afurika nyuma ya Ngozi Okonjo-Iweala n\u2019umugore wa 87 ukomeye ku isi na \"Forbes\". \nUbuzima bwambere n'ubuzima bw'imyigire.\nAlakija yavutse ku taliki ya 15 Nyakanga mu mwaka 1951 mu muryango wo mu rwego rwo hejuru ; ise yari Chief LA Ogbara wa Ikorodu, muri Leta ya Lagosi. Se yashakanye n'abagore 8 babyarana abana 52 naho nyina wa Folorunso niwe mugore wambere. Alakija yize amashuri y'incuke muri Ladies of Apostles, Lagosi kuva mu mwaka wa 1955 kugeza mu mwaka wa 1958. Ku myaka yiwe irindwi(7), Alakija yagiye mu Bwongereza gukomeza amashuri abanza mu ishuri rya Dinorben ry\u2019abakobwa muri Hall ya Hafodunos i Llangernyw, muri Wales hagati yu mwaka wa 1959 nu mwaka wa 1963. Arangiza amashuri abanza mu mwaka wa 1963, Alakija yagiye kwiga amashuriye yisumbuye y\u2019abayisilamu i Sagamu, muri Leta ya Ogun, muri Nijeriya. Nyuma yaho arinabwo yaje gusubira mu Bwongereza kwiga amasomo yiwe y\u2019ubunyamabanga muri kaminuza nkuru ya Pitman, Londoni. \nUmwuga.\nAlakija yatangiye umwuga we w\u2019imyaka 12 mu mwaka 1974 ari umunyamabanga nshingwabikorwa muri Sijuade Enterprises, Lagos, muri Nijeriya nyuma gato yo kurangiza amasomo y\u2019ubunyamabanga muri kaminuza nkuru ya Pitman London. Yimukiye mu cyahoze ari Banki nkuru y\u2019igihugu ya Chicago, nyuma yaje kuba FinBank ubu yaguzwe na FCMB (Banki ya mbere y\u2019Urwibutso rwa City) nk'umunyamabanga nshingwabikorwa w'umuyobozi mukuru. Yabaye Umuyobozi mushya w\u2019ishami rishinzwe ibibazo bya Banki mpuzamahanga y\u2019abacuruzi bo muri Nijeriya (yahoze ari Banki nkuru y\u2019igihugu ya Chicago), nyuma aza kuba umufasha w\u2019ibiro mu ishami ry\u2019imari.\u00a0\nAlakija yahise yiga ibijyanye no kwerekana imideli muri Koleji y'Abanyamerika i Londire no mu Ishuri Rikuru ry'imyambarire. Yatangije ikirango cyerekana imideli kizwi ku izina rya Supreme Stitches, nyuma yaje kwitwa The Rose Of Sharon House of Fashion mu 1996. Yabaye perezida n\u2019umucungamutungo ubuzima bwe bwose bwishyirahamwe ryabashinzwe kwerekana imideli muri Nijeriya (FADAN). \nMuri Gicurasi mu mwaka 1993, Alakija yasabye itangwa ry'uruhushya rwo gushakisha peteroli (OPL). Uruhushya rwo gushakisha peteroli kuri hegitari 617.000 - ubu rwitwa OPL 216 - rwahawe isosiyete ya Alakija, Famfa Limited. Ihuriro rifite mu majyepfo y\u2019iburasirazuba bwa Lagos na nkombe za Nijeriya mu murima wa Agbami wo muri Delta yo hagati ya Nigeriya. Muri Nzeri mu mwaka 1996, Alakija yagiranye amasezerano n\u2019umushinga uhuriweho na Star Deep Water Petroleum Limited (ishami rya Texaco rifite imigabane yose) yohereza imigabane 40% muri Star Deep. \nNyuma yo gukugomera peteroli, guverinoma ya Nigeriya yasabye imigabane 40%, ikurikirwa n\u2019inyongera 10%. Guverinoma yavuze ko niba Alakija n'umuryango wemerewe gukomeza umuryango wabo, bahagararaga binjiza miliyoni 10 ku munsi. Alakija yavuguruje iki kirego aratsinda. \nUburyo yaje Kumenyekana.\nKugeza mu mwaka 2014, Alakija yashyizwe ku rutonde rw\u2019umugore wa 96 ukomeye ku isi na \"Forbes\". Muri Gicurasi 2015, abagore babiri bo muri Nijeriya, Minisitiri w\u2019imari Ngozi okonjo-Iweala na Alakija bashyizwe ku rutonde rw\u2019abagore 100 bakomeye ku isi nk'uko \"Forbes\" ibitangaza. Yari ku mwanya wa 86 kuri urwo rutonde. \nAlakija ni umwe muri 20 mu mwaka wa 2020 Urutonde rwabaherwe bo muri Afurika rwahagaritswe muri 2021, mu mwaka wa 1941 Umuherwe wo mu mwaka 2019 Yahagaritswe muri 2020 naho # 80 Abagore bafite ingufu 2016 bahagarikwa muri 2017. \nKu taliki ya 17 Nyakanga mu mwaka 2021, kaminuza ya Benson Idahosa iniveresite, yomu mujyi wa Benin yamuhaye impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga y'icyubahiro mu buyobozi bw'ubucuruzi. Ibi byari mu rwego rwo gushimira uruhare rwe mu bucuruzi.\nIbikorwa by'ubugiraneza.\nAlakija yashinze Rose of Sharon Foundation ifasha abapfakazi nimpfubyi binyuze muri bourse ninkunga zubucuruzi. Alakija yatanze ikigo cyo gushaka ubumenyi muri Yaba College of Technology (Yabatech), ikigo cyisumbuye giherereye i Lagos. \nUbuzima bwite.\nAlakija yashakanye n'umunyamategeko Modupe Alakija wo mu muryango wa Adeyemo Alakija, mu Gushyingo mu mwaka 1976. Batuye i Lagos, muri Nijeriya, hamwe n'abahungu babo bane n'abuzukuru babo. &lt;ref&gt;\u00a0 Bella Naija. 29 Kanama 2014. Muri Kamena mu mwaka 2017, umuhungu wa Folorunso, Folarin Alakija, yashakanye n'umunyamideli wo muri Irani Nazanin Jafarian Ghaissarifar mu bukwe bwa miliyoni 6.4 z'amadolari mu ngoro ya Blenheim mu Bwongereza."}
{"id": "16853", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16853", "title": "LORNA RUTTO", "text": "Lorna Rutto ni Rwiyemezairimo w' umunyakenya mubijyanye no kwita ku ibidukikije, kandi ni we washinze ikigo cya EcoPost, ikigo cy\u2019imibereho yashinzwe hagamijwe gushaka ubundi buryo bwo gucunga imyanda ku kibazo kinini cy\u2019imyanda ya Kenya. Mu 2009 yashinze isosiyete ye, ikusanya imyanda ya pulasitike kandi ikora ibicuruzwa bifatika, biramba cyane, kandi byangiza ibidukikije byangiza ibidukikije, bikoreshwa cyane muri Kenya. Mu mwaka wa 2011, Lorna yahawe igihembo n\u2019icyubahiro cya Cartier Women Initiative Awards nk'igihembo cyabo muri Afurika yo munsi y'Ubutayu bwa Sahara."}
{"id": "16854", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16854", "title": "Saran Kaba Jones", "text": "Saran Kaba Jones (wavutse ku ya 21 Kamena 1982) ni umuvugizi wunganira amazi meza na rwiyemezamirimo ukomoka muri Liberiya.Niwe washinze FACE Africa, umuryango uharanira gushimangira ibikorwa remezo na serivisi z\u2019amazi, isuku n\u2019isuku (WASH) mu baturage bo mu cyaro muri Afurika yo munsi y\u2019ubutayu bwa Sahara.Ari mu komite y' Ihuriro ry\u2019Ubukungu ku Isi (mu icyongereza: World Economic Forum Young Global Leader) akaba n' Umuyobozi w\u2019Ikinyamakuru IGIHE 2016 (Mu icyongereza:TIME Magazine Next Generation Leader)"}
{"id": "16855", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16855", "title": "Dambisa Moyo", "text": "Dambisa Moyo (yavutse ku ya 2 Gashyantare 1969) ni impuguke mu by'ubukungu akaba n'umwanditsi wa Zambiya, uzwiho gusesengura ubukungu bw\u2019isi. N'umuntu udasanzwe ufite amateka ashimishije kandi yumwuga. Dambisa afite impamyabumenyi ya PhD mu by'ubukungu muri kaminuza ya Oxford kandi afite impamyabumenyi ya Masters yakuye muri kaminuza ya Harvard. Byongeye kandi, umuvugizi wacu Dambisa Mayo yagiye mu bihugu birenga 70 kandi akora muri Goldman Sachs, Banki y'Isi, ndetse no mu bukungu buzwi ku rwego mpuzamahanga, umwanditsi, n'umuvugizi."}
{"id": "16856", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16856", "title": "Ory Okolloh", "text": "Ory Okolloh ni umunyakenya uharanira inyungu, umunyamategeko, na. Ni umuyobozi ushinzwe ishoramari muri. Yahoze ari Umuyobozi wa Politiki muri Afurika hamwe na Google. Muri 2007, Okolloh yafatanije na \nUbuzima.\nYabonye impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu bumenyi bwa politiki yakuye muri kaminuza ya arangiza mu ishuri ry'amategeko rya mu 2005"}
{"id": "16857", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16857", "title": "Isis Nyong\u2019o Madison", "text": "Isis Nyong\u2019o Madison ni rwiyemezamirimo w\u2019itangazamakuru n\u2019umunyakenya-Amerika. Kugeza ubu umuyobozi mu kigo ngishwanama ngishwanama Asphalt &amp; Ink, mbere yakoranye na InMobi, Google na MTV Africa. Umujyanama Mukuru mu itsinda rya. ni nawe washinze Mum's Village, urubuga rwa interineti ruhindura uburambe bwa nyina-umwana muri Kenya."}
{"id": "16858", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16858", "title": "Juliet Ehimuan", "text": "Juliet Ehimuan n'umuyobozi wubucuruzi wa Nigeriya, umuyobozi ushinzwe ikoranabuhanga, na rwiyemezamirimo. Ubu ni Umuyobozi muri Google West Africa,\nEhimuan amaze imyaka isaga makumyabiri akora mu ikoranabuhanga kandi ni umuvugizi wa rubanda, umujyanama, umwanditsi akaba n'umuvugizi w\u2019abagore mu ikoranabuhanga no kwihangira imirimo. Niwe washinze Beyond Limits Africa akaba n'umwanditsi wa 'Iminsi 30 y'indashyikirwa'."}
{"id": "16859", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16859", "title": "Allan Gray (isosiyete icunga ishoramari)", "text": "Allan Gray ni sosiyete ikora ibikorwa byo gukurikirana ishoramari ikaba ikomoka muri Afurika yepfo. Iyi sosiyete ifite kandi ibiro biherereye mu bihugu bitandukanye nka Botswana, Namibiya na Eswatini, kandi ikomeza gushimangira umubano wa hafi n\u2019amasosiyete ya \"Orbis Investment Management\" na Allan Gray yo muri Ositaraliya. Abakiriya bayo barimo ibigo bikora ishoramari, abashoramari ku giti cyabo, amasosiyete y'ubwishingizi, ibigo bitanga umutungo ukabyazwa umusaruro mu buryo bw'ikizere, fondasiyo n'ibigo by'amahanga.\nAmateka.\nUmujyanama mu ishoramari Allan Gray yashinzwe mu kwezi kwa Ukwakira mu mwaka wa 1973 ishingwa na Allan WB Gray. Ikigo cyabashije kubona umukiriya wacyo wa mbere mu mwaka wa 1974. Mu mwaka wa 1989, Gray yashyizeho Orbis Investment Management, ikaba ari sosiyete mpuzamahanga ishinzwe ishoramari. \nIkigo cyashinzwe kandi gihindura izina cyitwa Allan Gray Limited mu mwaka wa 1992. Mu mwaka wa 1996, iki kigo cyafunguye ibiro mu mujyi wa Windhoek, mu gihugu cya Namibiya. Mu mwaka wa 1998, ikigo cyatangiye gutanga ibicuruzwa byerekeranye no kuranguza ibikorwa by'ishoramari. Ibindi biro byashinzwe mu mujyi wa Gaborone, mu gihugu cya Botswana mu mwaka wa 2004. \nIbikorwa.\nAllan Gray ikora ishoramari mu bihugu bigize umugabane w'Afurika kandi ikaba ikoresha abakozi barenga 1.000. Icyicaro gikuru cyayo giherereye i Cape Town, mu Karere ka Silo V&amp;A Waterfront. Silo One, icyicaro gikuru, niyo yambere muri Afrika yepfo yahawe amanota yo mu cyiciro cy'inyenyeri esheshatu mu kurengera ibidukikije, yagihawe n'ikigo gishinzwe inyubako zirengera ibidukikije cyo muri Afrika y'epfo. \nGutanga ishoramari.\nAbashoramari bacuruza bashobora gushora imari mu mahitamo atandukanye atangwa na Allan Gray aho abashoramari bahitamo ibice byizerwa binyuze mu bicuruzwa bitandukanye byishoramari. Umuyobozi ushinzwe ishoramari muri iki gihe atanga ishoramari ryibanze, ishoramari ridasoreshwa, ishoramari ryo hanze, amafaranga yizabukuru, amafaranga yo mu kigega cyo kubungabunga, amafaranga yo kubaho hamwe n'impano.\nAbashoramari b'ibigo bashobora guhitamo gushora imari mu cyiciro cy'ishoramari ryo kwizerana aho batanga imitungo bakayibabyariza inyungu, ubuzima bwahujwe n'ubuzima butandukanye hamwe n'inshingano zitandukanye, bitewe n'ubwoko bw'ikigo n'ubunini bw'ishoramari ryabo.\nAllan Gray igira uburyo itanga kandi ibisubizo cyangwa uburyo bwo kuzigama mu matsinda kubakoresha binyuze mu kigega cy\u2019izabukuru cya Allan Gray Umbrella hamwe n\u2019umwaka wa pansiyo ya Allan Gray.\nIshoramari.\nImbaraga z\u2019ishoramari rya Allan Gray rigenewe kugira uruhare muri sosiyete izerekeza kuri Fondasiyo ya Allan Gray Orbis na E Squared, aho iba ifite intego yo kwigisha ba rwiyemezamirimo ndetse no kubaha inkunga. Fondasiyo iterwa inkunga n\u2019impano ngarukamwaka ihoraho ya 5% y\u2019inyungu ya Allan Gray Proprietary Limited itanga mbere y\u2019imisoro hamwe na miliyoni 150\u00a0z'amadorali yatanzwe na Allan WB Gray. E Squared ifite 20% by\u00edmigabane muri Allan Gray Limited. \nNyirubwite.\nInyungu igenzurwa muri Allan Gray ifitwe ubuziraherezo na Allan &amp; Gill Gray Foundation. Abandi banyamigabane barimo abakozi bahoze bayikoramo ndetse n'abagikoramo kuri ubu ndetse na E Squared. Fondasiyo ya Allan &amp; Gill Gray yashyizweho kugirango ibeho ubuziraherezo kugira ngo inyungu zigabanywa byumwihariko zigenerwa gusa abagiraneza no guteza imbere ubucuruzi, gukomeza no kwigenga mu bucuruzi bwa Allan Gray. "}
{"id": "16860", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16860", "title": "Kanyana Shalon", "text": "Kanyana Shalon ni umunyarwandakazi akaba muri ba Rwiyemezamirimo bashinze uruganda rwitwa Ishyo Food Ltd, rutunganya Konfiture ndetse akaba anitegura gukora za Yawurute. Ndetse akora ibiryo bya Yummy mu Rwanda, bikozwe mubiribwa byiza byu Rwanda. \nIbyo yize.\nSharon afite impamyabumenyi iyicyiciro cya kabili cya kaminuza mu buhinzi hamwe n' impamyabumenyi ihanitse yi cyiciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza mu bushakashatsi bwiterambere. Shalon afite ubumenyi, Ishyaka mugucukumbura ibyo guteka."}
{"id": "16861", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16861", "title": "Chancellor House (sosiyete)", "text": "Chancellor House ni isosiyete iherereye muri Afurika yepfo ikora ishoramari mu bisata bitandukanye harimo ubucukuzi bw'amabuye y'agaciro, ubwubatsi, ingufu n\u2019ikoranabuhanga mu itumanaho. Yiswe Chancellor House, bashingiye ku nyubako ikigo cy\u2019amategeko cya Nelson Mandela na Oliver Tambo cyari giherereye.\nNyuma yo kuba cyarashyizwe ahagaragara nk\u2019umuterankunga w'imena w'shyaka ryitwa Kongere y\u2019igihugu nyafurika (ANC) yaje kwemerwa nk'ikigo cy\u2019ishoramari mu gihugu kubera iryo shyaka. Birazwi cyane kubera impaka zijyanye no guhabwa igihembo cyo kungura ubukungu bw'abirabura bw'unguka hamwe n'amasezerano ya parastatal.\nAmateka.\nKuba iyi sosiyete yaramenyekanye bwa mbere mu mwaka wa 2006. Ikinyamakuru \"Mail &amp; Guardian\" kivuga ko iyi sosiyete yashinzwe mu mwaka wa 2003 kubushake bwa Mendi Msimang, akaba ariwe wahoze ari umubitsi mukuru wa ANC, icyo gihe yari agamije gukusanya inkunga y'ishyaka. \nMbere y'amakuru yatangajwe n'ikinyamakuru iyi sosiyete ntago yari izwi; Kgalema Motlanthe, icyo gihe wari umunyamabanga mukuru w\u2019ishyaka, ngo yabanje kubimenya ubwo yavuganaga n\u2019ikinyamakuru kugira ngo agire icyo abivugaho. \nMuri Nzeri mu mwaka wa 2021, iyi sosiyete ubwayo yemeye ko yabaye icyambu cyo gutera inkunga ishyaka rya ANC. \nKu ya 10 Ugushyingo mu mwaka wa 2021, Mamatho Netsianda na Zwelibanzi Nzama, umuyobozi mukuru nshingwabikorwa, bagize uruhare mu mushinga wo guteza imbere politiki y'ibikorwa by'imitungo itimukanwa guhera mu mwaka wa 2008. Isambu iri hejuru ya sitasiyo ya Sandton yari yarahinduwe n'Umujyi wa Johannesburg, ariko ntabwo bigeze bakira ubyishyu bwabyo. \nAmasezerano ya Eskom.\nMu Gushyingo mu mwaka wa 2007, ikigo gisakaza amashanyarazi ya parastatal cyitwa Eskom cyahawe imashini esheshatu zitunganya amashanyarazi zifite agaciro ka miliyari 20 yamarandi ifaranga rikoreshwa mu gihugu cya Afurika y'epfo, mu ihuriro harimo na Hitachi Power Africa. Mugihe cyo gutanga ibihembo iyo sosiyete yari ifite imigabane ingana nka 25% yose ikaba yari ifitwe na Chancellor House. \nMuri Gashyantare mu mwaka wa 2008, ishyaka rya ANC ryavuze ko rizashyiraho abajyanama hagamijwe gusohoka mu mucyo kubera ibibazo by'imiyoborere. Muri Werurwe mu mwaka wa 2008, ibiro by\u2019Umurinzi rusange byavuze ko iperereza kuri ubwo bucuruzi ririmo gukorwa. \nNyuma y\u2019ibirego bikubiye mu itegeko rigenga ruswa mu mahanga ryashyizweho na komisiyo ishinzwe umutekano no kugurizanya, Hitachi yemeye kwishyurwa miliyoni 19 z\u2019amadolari muri Nzeri mu mwaka wa 2015. Iyi myumvire mibi yo kutabazwa inshingano bashinzwe, gukorera mu mucyo no gucunga umutungo bifitanye isano na ishyaka rya ANC yanashamikiyeho kunengwa na Ishyaka riharanira demokarasi, ishyaka ritavuga rumwe n\u2019ubutegetsi. "}
{"id": "16862", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16862", "title": "Ishyo Foods Ltd", "text": "Ishyo Foods Ltd ni kampani yashinzwe na rwiyemezamirimo witwa Akanyana Shalon akaba nawe umuyobozi wayo. Shalon yatangiye ubu bucuruzi ahereye ku nkomoko yoroheje akunda guteka aho yari mugikoni akabyitekera. \nUko igitekerezo cyaje.\nIshyo Foods Ltd, Ibona u Rwanda nki igihugu gifite ubutaka byiza bukungahaye ku ntungamubiri ndetse hamwe n\u2019ikirere cyiza, hamwe no guhinga, imbuto nziza, kandi hari mashyo atandukanye atanga amata akungahaye ku ntungamubiri.\nIbyo bakora.\nIshyo Foods Ltd ifasha gukemura ikibazo cyibiribwa, aho itanga imbuto zirimbwa ndetse na yahurute zifite ubuziranenge kandi zihendutse. Kuko, imiryango imwe ni mwe yomu Rwanda itunzwe nibiribwa bihendutse, kandi usanga bitumizwa mu mahanga. Ibyo biryo byose bakabikoresha bikiri bibisi cyangwa bikiri bizima."}
{"id": "16863", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16863", "title": "Ubuhinzi n'iterambere", "text": "Ubuhinzi n'iterambere mu Rwanda.\nUbuhinzi bufite akamaro kanini mu bukungu bw\u2019u Rwanda kuko bwinjiza kimwe cya gatattu cy'umusaruro mbumbe w\u2019igihugu. uru rwego ruha akazi abarenga bibiri bya gatatu by\u2019abakozi bose mugihugu kandi iterambere rishingiye kubuhinzi ryitezweho kugira uruhare runini mu kurwanya ubukene no guca ubukene bukabije. ahubwo rukaba urwego rutanga umusaruro mwinci kandi mwiza ku isoko ry'Africa Guverinema yu Rwanda yiyemeje guhindura urwgo rw'ubuhinzi rukava kuguhinga ibitunga imiryango gusa. rukaba urwego rutanga umussruro mwinci kandi mwiza rukabasha kugemurira isoko kandi rufasha mukuzamura izindi nzego z'ubukungu mu Rwanda. Ibi bizagerwaho binyuze muri gahunda zitandukanye zishyirwa mubikorwa na Minisitteri y'ubuhinzi n'ubworozi (MINAGRI) n\u2019ibigo biyishamikiyeho, ariko ikabifashwamo n\u2019Urwego rw\u2019Abikorera, abafatanyabikorwa mu iterambere ndetse n\u2019abandi bireba bose.\nIntego n'iterambere.\nKugirango iterambere rirambye rigerweho, abahinzi n'aborozi bakwiriye kureka guhinga no korora ibitunga imiryango yabo gusa bagakorera guhaza isoko ry'Africa no hanze yayo. ibi kandi bizabasaba kubona service z'imari. mu Rwanda Imari irakenewe mubyiciro byose by'ubuhinzi nko kugura imbuto z'indobanure ndetse no mumirimo yo gutunganya no guhunika umusaruro.\nIkoranabuhanga mu buhinzi mu Rwanda.\nu Rwanda ni kimwe mubihugu by'Africa bikora uko bishoboye mu guteza imbere abahinzi naborozi muburyo bwose\nkugirango umusaruro wiyongere ndetse n'itumanaho rizamurwe mu rwego rwo guhanahana amakuru mu bahinzi ndetse nama koperative bakoreramo. mu rwego rwo guteza imbere umugore no kumushyigikira mu mirimo ye ya burimunsi leta yu Rwanda yahaye Telefone zigezweho (SMART PHONE) abagore bakora umwuga w'ubuhinzi n'ubworozi mu Turere dutandukanye harimo, Akarere Burera, Kirehe, na Nyamasheke. aba bagore bashyikirijwe izi Telefone zigezweho ni abafashamyumvire bibumbie mu ma koperative y'ubuhinzi mu Rwanda bahawe izi telefone kunkunga ya #connectRwanda"}
{"id": "16865", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16865", "title": "Uwase Peace", "text": "Peace Masozera Uwase, uzwi nka Peace Uwase, ni umucungamari w\u2019u Rwanda akaba n\u2019umuyobozi wa banki, akora nk'umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019ishami rishinzwe imari muri Banki nkuru y\u2019igihugu y\u2019u Rwanda ya BNR, kuva muri Mata 2016. \nMbere yibyo Uwase yari umufatanyabikorwa ucunga PAM Business Advisory, hagati yo muri Mutarama 2013 kugeza Mata 2016. Muri urwo ruhare, yabaye umujyanama mu by'imari n\u2019imicungire, inzobere mu bijyanye na banki, ibaruramari, ubugenzuzi, imicungire y\u2019ibyago, imiyoborere n\u2019igenamigambi. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nPeace Uwase yize muri Mount Saint Mary's College Namagunga, aho avuka, abakobwa bose bo mu mashuri yisumbuye, mu Karere ka Mukono aho bigaga, muri Uganda, yize amasomo rusange kuva hagati ya 1992 na 1998. Yize muri kaminuza ya Makerere, no muri Uganda, arangiza impamyabumenyi mu bucuruzi muri 2001. Nyuma, yabonye impamyabushobozi y'icyiciro cya gatatu mu bucuruzi yakuye muri kaminuza ya gikirisitu ya Oklahoma muri Amerika. Ni umucungamari wemewe n'ishyirahamwe ry'abacungamari bemewe bo mu Bwongereza. \nUmwuga.\nAkazi ka mbere yari nka Audit Associate muri Price Waterhouse Coopers, mu biro byabo i Kampala, muri Uganda, aho yakoreze imyaka irenga itatu. Yimukiye mu Rwanda muri Mutarama 2005, atangira akazi nk'umuyobozi w\u2019imari n\u2019imiyoborere muri \"Banki y\u2019Ubucuruzi, Iterambere n\u2019inganda ya\" BCDI, uwabanjirije Ecobanque mu Rwanda, aho yakoreye imyaka ibiri ni gice. \nEcobank imaze kubona BCDI muri Nyakanga 2007, yagumye ku mwanya mushya w'umuyobozi mukuru ushinzwe imari muri Ecobank Rwanda. Hanyuma umwaka umwe, yabaye umuyobozi mukuru ushinzwe imari muri Ecobank Gineya Bissau, ifite icyicaro i Bissau. \nYaje kuba umujyanama wigenga mu gihe cy'umwaka nigice, mbere yuko ahabwa akazi na Kivu Watt Limited, nk'umuyobozi ushinzwe imari, ahakorera umwaka urenga. Yaje gusubira mu bujyanama bwite mu gihe cy'imyaka itatu n'igice, mbere yo kwinjira muri Banki Nkuru y'u Rwanda, muri Mata 2016. \nIbindi bitekerezo.\nPeace Uwase ni umwe mu bagize inama y\u2019ubuyobozi y\u2019ikigo cy\u2019imisoro m\u2019u Rwanda. "}
{"id": "16866", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16866", "title": "Mukashyaka Epiphanie", "text": "Epiphanie Mukashyaka (wavutse muri 1959-1960) ni umucuruzi wo mu Rwanda. Niwe washinze Buf coffee nku mugore wa mbere, ukora ikawa idasanzwe mu Rwanda. \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nMukashyaka yavutse 1959 cyangwa 1960 mu Rwanda. Yize imyaka 6 arongorwa afite imyaka 17. Ari afite abana 8. \nMuri icyo gihe mu Rwanda mbere ya jenoside, abagore ntibari bemerewe kuragwa ubutaka, kandi wasangaga bidashoboka gukora ubucuruzi. Itsembabwoko ryo mu Rwanda rirangiye, abaturage bagera kuri 70% bari abagore naho abagabo bagera kuri 30%. \nItsembabwoko ryo mu Rwanda no gushiraho Bufcoffee.\nMuri 1994, ubwo Itsembabwoko ryo mu Rwanda ryabaye, bituma hapfa abantu ibihumbi magana, barimo benshi mu bagize umuryango wa Mukashyaka, nk'umugabo we ndetse n'umwe mu bana be. Ibi byatumye Mukashyaka adafite akazi kandi nta nkunga y'amafaranga. Yabanje kutabasha kuzungura isambu y'umugabo we ariko bidatinze arayigarurira. Yabonye kandi inkunga y'abapfakazi bagenzi be bo m'ubaturage, barimo Ngara Nyarusiza, waje kuba umufatanyabikorwa mu bucuruzi bwa Bufcoffee.\nNyuma ya jenoside, Mukashyaka yafashe inguzanyo ya miliyoni 54 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda maze y'ubaka ikigo cyo koza ikawa i Gikongoro cyitwa Nyarusiza, icya mbere cyari gifitwe umugore mu Rwanda,:\u200a79\u200a aho yakoresheje abahinzi guhinga ibishyimbo. Mu gihe cyo kongera kubaka ikawa ye, yahawe ubufasha na USAID na PEARL. Muri 2004 ikawa ye yaciwe neza na Kenneth Davids. maze muri 2007, afungura ikigo cya kabiri cyo koza ikawa cyitwa Remera., Muri uwo mwaka yatsindiye igihembo cya Kawa y\u2019igikombe cy\u2019u Rwanda muri 2007, n\u2019igihembo cy\u2019igikombe cy\u2019indashyikirwa cy\u2019ikawa muri 2008, 2010, 2011, 2013, na 2014. \nMuri 2016, isosiyete yari ifite abanyamigabane barenga ibihumbi 4000, kandi ikawa yoherezwa muri Amerika. \nMuri 2019, Mukashyaka yatorewe kuba rwiyemezamirimo w\u2019umugore w\u2019u Rwanda, yatsindiye miliyoni 2 z\u2019amafaranga yu Rwanda. Yabonye kandi ubufatanye muri Trademark Afurika y'Uburasirazuba. \nIcyorezo cya Covid-19.\nIgihe kimwe hagati yo muri 2016 na 2020 isosiyete yari ifite ibikoresho bine byo gukaraba. Igihe icyorezo cya COVID-19 mu Rwanda cyibasiye, ubucuruzi bwaragabanutseho cyane. Muri 2020, isosiyete yari ifite abakozi bagera ku bihumbi 12.000, igabanuka kuva mu mwaka ushize. Bamwe bagombaga kureka gukora nk'abahinzi ba kawa kubera icyorezo, bigatuma umusaruro muke, nubwo ubucuruzi bwari bugifite umutekano muke. Uburyo bwo kwishyura bwagombaga guhindurwa kumurongo kubera amategeko yimibereho. \nUbuzima bwite.\nAbana ba Mukashyaka bakorera ikigo. Umwe ni umuyobozi ucunga Bufcoffee. Mukashyaka yubatse ubusitani bw'umuganda iruhande rw'ishuri ry'incuke ry' umumvumu kugira ngo akomeze kwihaza mu biribwa mu gihe cy'icyorezo. "}
{"id": "16867", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16867", "title": "Betelehemu Tilahun Alemu", "text": "Betelehemu Tilahun Alemu (yavutse mu mwaka wa 1980) ni umucuruzi wo muri Etiyopiya, washinze akaba n'umuyobozi mukuru wa soleRebels, \"nisosiyete ikora inkweto ubucuruzi bukura bwambukiranya vuba muri Afurika\". Betelehemu yahawe icyubahiro n\u2019ishimwe kubera ubucuruzi bwe, ndetse yashizeho n\u2019ingamba yashyizeho zo guhindura imbwirwa ruhame kuri Afurika ikava mu bukene ikajya mu mwuka wo kwihangira imirimo ku mugabane w'isi, ishoramari shingiro, ndetse n\u2019ubukungu. Betelehemu yatangije \"Repubulika y\u2019uruhu\", ishushanya ibicuruzwa by\u2019uruhu birambye bikozwe mu buryo bwiza, hamwe n\u2019ubucuruzi bwa \"Garden of Kawa\" mu rwego rwo kumenyekanisha ikawa ya Etiyopiya. \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nBetelehemu yavukiye mu gace ka Zenebework ka Addis Abeba. Ababyeyi be bakoraga mu bitaro byaho hafi. Alemu yize amashuri abanza n'ayisumbuye ya Leta, hanyuma ajya gukomeza kwiga ibaruramari muri kaminuza y\u2019ubumwe, arangiza amashuri mu mwaka wa 2004. \nBethlehem ni we rwiyemezamirimo wo muba mbere w\u2019umugore wo muri Afurika waganiriye na sosiyete Clinton Global Initiative kandi yahawe igihembo cy\u2019umugore, nk\u2019umugore w\u2019umudage w\u2019indashyikirwa na African Business Awards mu mwaka wa 2011. \nImishinga y'ubucuruzi.\nMu ntangiriro zu mwaka wa 2005, Betelehemu yashinze soleRebels kugira ngo itange imirimo irambye mu ibidukikije no mu bukungu. yabonye abanyabukorikori benshi bafite ubuhanga mu gace ke gato ka Zenebework babanaga n'ubushomeri budashira, yashakaga kwerekana ubuhanga bwabo no guha akazi abo mu gace atuyemo aturukamo.\nUbucuruzi bw'inkweto zakozwe mumapine yimodoka. kuruyu munsi, iyososiyete ifite amaduka ku isi yose, harimo muri Etiyopiya, Singapore, Ubusuwisi na Tayiwani. \nBetelehemu yishimiye cyane kuba yarashoboye gukora ibirango kurwego rw'isi yose nka soleRebels no gukora ubusitani bwa Kawa.\nAmateka.\nIyososiyete yatangiriye mu mahugurwa yogupima ubutaka bwa nyirakuru wa Betelehemu muri Zenebework.\nSoleRebels yateye imbere, izagukura igera ku bakozi 300 muri Etiyopiya, izagukwirakwizwa mu bihugu mirongo itatu ku isi hose, igurisha abayobozi b'isoko ibyo kurya byuzuye, Ibisagara byo mu mijyi na Amazone. Amaduka ya francised hamwe n\u2019amasosiyete byari biteganijwe gufungura muri Otirishiya, Ubusuwisi, Tayiwani, n\u2019Ubwongereza. Betelehemu yashakaga guhanga imirimo ihembwa neza ishobora guteza imbere kubakozi bakoresheje impano yubukorikori n'umutungo kamere wa Etiyopiya. Guhitamo inkweto nk'ibicuruzwa byo gutangiza uruganda byaje nyuma. Betelehemu yatewe inkunga na seleate cyangwa barabasso, inkweto gakondo zisubirwamo z'ipine zonyine zakozwe muri Etiyopiya, kandi inkweto zahindutse inzige yahisemo kubaka uruganda. \nMuri mwaka wa 2016 iyososiyete yagurishije inkweto 125.000 kandi yari imaze guhanga imirimo 1200. \nMu mwaka 2014, Betelehemu yatangaje umushinga mushya w\u2019ubucuruzi, Repubulika y\u2019uruhu, abinyujije ku rubugarwe rwa interineti arirwo rubuga rwa soleRebels. Betelehemu yavuze ko inganda zihenze cyane z\u2019uruhu \"zakuze kugira ngo zongere zitekerezeho,\" muburyo bwokubishyira ku murongo usa n\u2019ibyo yari yararangije gukora wenyine afatanyije hamwe n\u2019inganda z\u2019inkweto. Usibye gushyigikira ibitekerezo bimwe by\u2019ibidukikije n\u2019ubukungu burambye nka soleRebels, Repubulika y\u2019uruhu ishingiye ku mahame yo guhitamo abakiriya guhitamo abakiriya guhitamo, gukora no kwakira inkunga ya 5% yikiguzi batanga cyangwa bishyura. \nMu mwaka 2017, \"Ubusitani bwa Kawa\" bwongerewe mubigo bye bimwitirirwa. Bitangirira ku bicuruzwa i Addis Abeba. \nUburyo sisitemu yari yubatse.\nBetelehemu yarashaka kurwanya inkuru gakondo zerekeye Afurika na cyane cyane Etiyopiya, \"kurwanya shibboleth ko Abanyafurika n'Abanyafurikazi batazi icyo bakora cyangwa uburyo bwo kwiteza imbere.\" Betelehemu yizeraga ko Abanyetiyopiya bagomba kugenzura inkuru zabo bwite bahereye kuburyo\"bantu n'intore bafite inyungu zo kwerekana ko Etiyopiya atari uko\" bakeneye ubufasha \"kandi bakeneye cyane cyane\" ubufasha \"batanga.\" Nkuko Betelehemu yabisobanuye mu kiganiro na \"The Umugore Ukurikira\". Intsinzi kwisi yose y'amasosiyete nka soleRebels ifashwa gukuraho izi nkuru zishaje kandi ituma Abanyetiyopiya bashiraho hagaragara k'usura yabo mpuzamahanga. "}
{"id": "16868", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16868", "title": "Rwigara Diane", "text": "Diane Shima Rwigara ni umucuruzi, akaba rwiyemezamirimo n\u2019umucungamari wabaye umukandida wigenga mu matora y\u2019umukuru w\u2019i gihugu ya Rwanda 2017. Rwigara yashinjwaga ku ya 23 Nzeri 2017, ari kumwe na nyina ndetse n'abandi baregwana bane, kuba yarateje imvururu mu bindi birego, ariko agirwa umwere hamwe na nyina ku ya 6 Ukuboza 2018. \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nDiane Rwigara yavukiye i Kigali muri 1982 avukira mu muryango w'abatutsi kandi afite barumuna be batatu. Se, ni Assinapol Rwigara, umunyenganda akaba n\u2019umunyemari ukomeye w\u2019umuryango w\u2019igihugu ukunda igihugu cya Rwanda, yaguye mu mpanuka y\u2019imodoka ku ya 4 Gashyantare 2015 i Gacuriro, muri Kigali. Umuryango wemeza ko impanuka yatewe na politiki. Polisi yavuze ko yahise yicwa ubwo imodoka y'aMercedez-Benz yari atwaye yari igonganye n'ikamyo iremereye. \nRwigara ni umucungamari watojwe. Yakunze kuvuga nabi imiyoborere y\u2019igihugu iyoborwa na Perezida Paul Kagame hamwe ndetse n\u2019akarengane n\u2019agahato. \nKu ya 3 Gicurasi 2017, Rwigara yatangaje ko yifuza kwitabira amatora ya perezida. Nyuma y'amasaha 72, amafoto ye yambaye ubusa yashyizwe ahagaragara m'uburyo bugaragara bwo kumukoza isoni no kumutera ubwoba. Yashimangiye ko afite intego yo kwiyamamaza, yiyemeza kwiyamamaza mu rwego rwo guca burundu ubukene, gushyiraho ubwishingizi bw\u2019ubuzima ku isi hose no guharanira ubwisanzure. \nKu 7 Nyakanga 2017, Komisiyo y\u2019igihugu ishinzwe amatora yabwiye ko ataziyamamaza Rwigara mu matora ku mpamvu za tekiniki, avuga ko yakoresheje imikono mpimbano mu ipiganwa rye rya perezida kandi ko yatanze imikono 572 yemewe aho kuba 600 isabwa. Rwigara yavuze ko yatanze imikono y'abamusinyiye bagera 958, hiyongeraho 120 nyuma yuko bamwe batemerewe. Abandi bakandida babiri na bo ntibemerewe, bituma Amnesty International ivuga ko ayo matora azabera mu bihe by'ubwoba no gukandamizwa. Iki cyemezo kandi cyanenzwe na Minisiteri y\u2019ububanyi n\u2019amahanga y'Amerika n\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Uburayi. Kagame yatsinze amatora yo ku ya 4 Kanama n'amajwi 98%. Rwigara yatangije umutwe w'abaharanira inyungu witwa Agakiza ka Rubanda kugira ngo uhangane n'ubutegetsi ku gitabo cy\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu, avuga ko inteko ishinga amategeko y'igihugu itarenze kashe. Umuryango uharanira agakiza ka rubanda nk'uko Rwigara abitangaza, ngo azakomeza imirimo ye yo gukangurira Abanyarwanda uburenganzira bwabo no kunenga politiki n'ibikorwa by'ishyaka riri ku butegetsi rishinzwe gukunda igihugu (FPR). \nKu ya 7 Kamena 2024, Komisiyo y\u2019igihugu ishinzwe amatora (NEC) yanze kandidatire ya Diane Rwigara mu matora y\u2019umukuru w\u2019igihugu ya 2024. \nIfatwa.\nKu ya 30 Kanama 2017, inzu ya Rwigara yagabweho igitero, abapolisi bavuga ko arimo gukorwaho iperereza ku mpimbano no kunyereza imisoro. Umuryango wa Rwigara wavuze ko yabuze, bavuga ko abantu bitwaje imbunda bitazwi bambaye imyenda ya gisivili bamufatanye imbunda mu gihe inzu yashakishwaga, ariko abapolisi bahakana ko yatawe muri yombi. \nIbinyamakuru byinshi byatangaje muri Nzeri 2017 ko Rwigara atarashobora kuboneka kandi umuryango we wakomeje kuvuga ko yabuze. Leon Orsmond, umuhanzi wo mugihugu cya Afurika y'Epfo w'amamaza udushya, wafashije Rwigara mu gikorwa cyo kwamamaza imbuga nkoranyambaga na we yabuze mu Rwanda kuva mu Gashyantare 2018. Mbere yo kubura, Orsmond ntiyigeze ahisha ko adakunda leta ya Kagame.\nMuri Kamena 2018, ikigo cy\u2019imisoro n\u2019u Rwanda cyagurishije imashini ziba mu bucuruzi bw\u2019itabi ry\u2019umuryango ku madolari agera kuri miliyoni 2 mu rwego rwo kugaruza ibyo bavugaga ko ari miliyoni 7 z\u2019ibirarane by\u2019imisoro. Cyamunara yabanje kugurisha umutungo w'ubucuruzi bwumuryango wa Rwigara, itabi ryatunganijwe, ryinjije amafaranga arenga miliyoni 500 yu Rwanda. ikigo Amnesty International yahamagariye ubucamanza bwu Rwanda kureba niba urubanza rutabaye ubundi buryo bwo gutoteza abanenga guverinoma. \nMuri Kanama 2018, habayeho #FreeDianeRwigara yakoreshwaga nabanya kenya kurubuga rwa Twitter bahamagarira Kagame kurekura Rwigara. Ibi bibaye nyuma y'iminsi mike abakoresha Twitter muri Kenya babigiriye nk\u2019umudepite wa Uganda,nyuma Robert Kyagulanyi, uzwi cyane ku izina rya Bobby Wine. \nKu ya 5 Ukwakira 2018, urukiko rwategetse ko Rwigara na nyina Adeline Rwigara barekurwa by'agateganyo; ibi bibaye nyuma y'ibyumweru bike nyuma yo gufungurwa hakiri kare abakatiwe 2140, barimo Victoire Ingabire na Kizito Mihigo. Nyuma y\u2019umwaka urenga muri gereza, Urukiko Rukuru rw\u2019u Rwanda rwarekuye Rwigara na nyina Adeline ingwate. Basabwe kutava mu murwa mukuru, Kigali, nta ruhushya, kandi urubanza rwabo ruzakomeza. \nAbasenateri benshi bo muri Amerika barimo Dick Durbin, Ann Wagner, Patrick Leahy na Barbara Lee, ndetse n'abagize komisiyo ishinzwe uburenganzira bwa muntu muri kongere ya Tom Lantos bahamagariye guverinoma y'u Rwanda kureka ibyo birego kuko ari ukurenga ku bwisanzure mu gutanga ibitekerezo. Abayobozi b'u Rwanda bashinje abanyapolitiki bo muri Amerika kwivanga mu manza zabo. \nKwemererwa.\nKu ya 6 Ukuboza 2018, inteko y'abacamanza batatu b'urukiko rukuru rw'u Rwanda yagizwe umwere Rwigara hamwe na nyina, basanga ibyo baregwa byose bidafite ishingiro. Urukiko rwasanze Rwigara yarakoresheje uburenganzira bwe bwo kuvuga mu kunegura Perezida kandi ko atateje urugomo. Nyina yagizwe umwere kubera guteza imbere amacakubiri, amacakubiri ashingiye ku moko no gukurura urugomo. Rwigara yagejeje ijambo ku bitangazamakuru biri mu cyumba cy'urukiko, agira ati: Nizeye ko ibi bivuze ko ibitotezo njye n'umuryango wanjye twahuye nabyo byarangiye kandi ko mfite umudendezo wo kuvuga icyo ntekereza. Nicyo nzakomeza kurwanira mu gihugu hose. Icyemezo cy'urukiko cyakiriwe neza na Amnesty International, yahamagariye guverinoma y'u Rwanda gukora \"hagamijwe guteza imbere ubworoherane no kwemera ibindi bitekerezo kandi binenga.\" \nUbujurire bw'Ubushinjacyaha ku rwego rw'igihugu bwatanze ubujurire bwo ku ya 27 Ukuboza. Ku ya 9 Mutarama 2019, urwego rw\u2019ubushinjacyaha rwa Kagame, rumaze guhabwa amabwiriza na minisiteri y\u2019ubutabera, rwanze ubujurire bwarwo bwo kuba abere. Rwigara yishimiye iki cyemezo, avuga ko \"azakomeza guharanira ubwisanzure mu gutanga ibitekerezo n'uburenganzira bwa muntu mu Rwanda.\" "}
{"id": "16869", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16869", "title": "Ikibuga k'indege", "text": "Ikibuga k'indege cya Bugesera.\nmu bikorwa bishimishije by'iterambere n'ubukungu u Rwanda rumaze kugeraho harimo n'iyubakwa ry'ikibuga k'indegegiherereye mu karere ka Bugesera.\nBiteganyijweko iki kibuga kizaba gifite ubuso bwa metero kare ibihumbi 130, kizajya cyakira abagenzi miliyoni 8 ku mwaka, bazarushaho kugenda biyongera bakagera kuri miliyoni 14, ndetse kikazajya kinyuraho toni ibihumbi 150 by\u2019ibicuruzwa bizajya bitwarwa n'indege zitwara imizigo.\nUbukungu n'iterambere.\nJules Ndenga, Umuyobozi Mukuru w\u2019Ikigo Aviation Travel and Logistics Holding (ATL) gikurikirana imyubakire y\u2019iki kibuga cy\u2019indege cya Bugesera, avuga ko nicyuzura bizagira uruhare rukomeye mu kuzamura ubukungu bw\u2019u Rwanda.\nAho ikibuga k'indege giherereye.\niki kibuga k'Indege giherereye mu karere ka Bugesera mu birometero 40 mu majyyepfo yy'umujyi wa Kigali\nImirimo n'ubufatanye.\nIbikorwa byo kubaka ikibuga k'indege mpuzamahanga cya Bugesera byatangijwe na Perezida wa Repubulika yu Rwanda Paul Kagame muri Kanama 2017 nyuma yuko amasezerano ajyanye no kucyubaka yari yasinywe muri nzeri 2016 hagati ya Guverinoma yu Rwanda na sosiyete yy'ubwubatsi ikomoka mugihugu cya Portugal yitwa MOTAL ENGIL ENGENHARIA e CONSTRUCAO AFRICA kugirango izubake icyo kibuga."}
{"id": "16870", "revid": "13539", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16870", "title": "Patrick E. Ngowi", "text": "Patrick Epaphra Ngowi ni rwiyemezamirimo wo muri Tanzaniya, umucuruzi, ushinzwe ibidukikije, umuyobozi w\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere ya Al Gore akaba na SDG 7 Pioneer. Patrick yashinze kandi ayobora imishinga myinshi mugihe cy'umwuga we. \nUmwuga.\nNgowi yatangiye ubucuruzi bwe bwa mbere afite imyaka 15 ubwo yatangiraga kugurisha inyemezabuguzi zo kurwego rwo hejuru kuri terefone zigendanwa mu mashuri yisumbuye. Nyuma yo guhabwa impamyabumenyi, Ngowi yakoze ingendo hagati mubihugu by'Ubushinwa naza Tanzaniya agarura amwe muriza terefone zigezweho kandi zihenze, atangira kugura terefone zidahenze ku bakorera inganda zihenze no muburyo bwo kuzigurisha ku isoko rya Tanzaniya. Yaje kwiyandikishije muri kaminuza ya Denzhou mu Bushinwa, yiga ingufu zishobora kubaho. \nPatrick Ngowi yashinze Helvetic Solar mu mwaka wa 2007 kugirango itange kandi itange ishyireho yesitara ibikoresho by'izuba mugihugu cya Tanzaniya no mugihugu cya Amerika. Iyososiyete yanahawe igihembo cya mbere cya KPMG nk'imwe mu masosiyete 100 ya mbere akomeye yo mugihugu cya Tanzaniya mu mwaka wa 2012. Kuva icyo gihe ikigo cyahindutse itsinda ryubucuruzi butandukanye,kiba mubigo ayoboye. \nKumenyekana kwe.\n\"Forbes\" yashyize Ngowi ku rutonde rw\u2019abantu bambere 30 babaherwe bari munsi ya 30 ba rwiyemezamirimo bato bato bo muri Afurika na Forbes ku rutonde rw\u2019abasore b\u2019abaherwe bo muri Afurika barebwa mu mwaka wa 2013. Yongeye gushyirwa ku rutonde mu mwaka wa 2014 rwa barwiyemezamirimo bato bato muri Afurika binyuze muri Helvetic Group. Yatowe kandi nk'umuyobozi ushinzwe ubucuruzi muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba mu mwaka wa 2014 na Forbes na CNBC. \nNgowi yagize uruhare runini mu kuvuga mu birori mpuzamahanga kuko bari mubahawe ijambo maze mu mwaka 2015 atorerwa kuba umuyobozi w\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ku isi muri Tanzaniya. Umwaka umwe, nibwo yagombaga kuyobora byatangajwe n\u2019umunyamabanga mukuru w\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye avuga ko Ngowi yari umwe mu ntego zagaragaye z\u2019iterambere mu iterambere ry\u2019iterambere ry\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye (SGDs) ku isi 10, yabaye intangarugero mu gutanga ingufu zisukuye, SDG 7. \nIbikorwa by'ubugiraneza.\nNgowi ni we washinzeho Light for Life Foundation, ikigo kidaharanira kitita kunyungu kikaba cyibanda ku gutanga amashanyarazi akomoka cyabgwa ava ku mirasire y'izuba ndetse n\u2019umuyaga muto ku rubyiruko n\u2019abagore babarizwa mu cyaro ndetse no hanze y'igihugu cya Tanzaniya. "}
{"id": "16871", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16871", "title": "Nkulikiyinka Christine", "text": "Nkulikiyinka \u00a0Christine (Yavutse ku ya 1 Gashyantare 1965) Muri 2022 yabaye umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019isosiyete igurisha n'ubucuruzi bw\u2019u Rwanda mu mahanga cyane mu guteza imbere ubufatanye bw\u2019Amajyepfo yisi. Yabari ambasaderi w'u Rwanda, wabaye umuyobozi mukuru wa gahunda y'u Rwanda. Yabaye kandi ambasaderi w'u Rwanda mu bihugu byinshi birimo Ubudage, Suwede n'Uburusiya. \nUbuzima.\nNkulikiyinka yavukiye i Kigali muri 1965. Yakuriye mu murwa mukuru w'u Rwanda kandi yiga mu mashuri yisumbuye. Kuva muri 1985 yize Ikidage nk'ururimi rw'amahanga i Mainz, hanyuma yiga ubuyobozi bw'ubucuruzi muri kaminuza ya Ludwigshafen y\u2019ubumenyi. Avuga indimi nki Igifaransa, Icyongereza, Ikidage na Kinyarwanda. \nYakoraga muri Ambasade y'u Rwanda i Berlin kuva muri 1991 kugeza 2005 aho yazamuwe kuba umujyanama wa kabiri wa ambasade. Yagarutse mu Rwanda aho yakoraga muri Minisiteri y'Ububanyi n'Amahanga y'u Rwanda i Kigali.\nKuva mu 2009 kugeza 2015 Christine Nkulikiyinka yari ambasaderi w\u2019igihugu cye i Berlin, aho yari ashinzwe Ubudage ariko nanone Polonye, Rumaniya, Liechtenstein, Repubulika ya Ceki, Slowakiya na Ukraine. Ku ya 14 Nyakanga 2011, yashyikirije Minisitiri w\u2019intebe w\u2019Uburusiya icyo gihe Dmitry Medvedev kandi kuva icyo gihe kandi yari ambasaderi w\u2019u Rwanda mu Burusiya kugeza igihe ambasade y\u2019u Rwanda i Moscou yongeye nanone gufungurwa muri Kanama 2013 maze Jeanne d'Arc Mujawamariya amusimbuye.\nMuri Nzeri 2015, Nkulikiyinka yabaye ambasaderi w'u Rwanda muri Suwede kandi akorana na Noruveje, Danimarike, Finilande na Isilande. Isilande yagize uruhare mu gushyiraho imyitozo mu Rwanda kugira ngo hashyizweho ingufu za geothermale. \nMuri 2022 yabaye umuyobozi mukuru wa gahunda y\u2019ubufatanye bw\u2019u Rwanda iterwa inkunga na guverinoma mu rwego rwo kunoza no gukoresha ubufatanye bw\u2019amajyepfo. "}
{"id": "16873", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16873", "title": "Uwineza Josephine", "text": "Josephine Uwineza uzwi nka Fina, ni rwiyemezamirimo wumunyaRwandakazi, kandi uharanira imibereho myiza. Muri 2018, yateganyaga gufungura uruganda rwa mbere rwenga inzoga mu Rwanda, ruzagaragaramo abakozi benshi bagizwe n\u2019abagore.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nJosephine yavutse muri 1964 mu muryango ufite abandi bavandimwe batanu. Muri 1974, ise yiciwe mu gihe cyo guhirika ubutegetsi bw\u2019u Rwanda mu 1973 bituma nyina wa Fina yirukanwa n Rwanda hamwe n\u2019abana be bose. Umuryango wa Uwineza wagiye mu bihugu bituranye n\u2019aho abandi bagize umuryango we bari mu buhungiro babayo ariko amaherezo bikagera muri Kanada. Nyuma Josephine yasubiye mu Rwanda muri 1998 kugira ngo atange inkunga mu gihugu nyuma ya jenoside yo mu Rwanda yatumye umubare munini w'abaturage bapfa ndetse n'igihugu cyarangiritse. \nUmwuga.\nAmaze gusubira mu Rwanda ari kumwe n'umugabo we n'u mwana, Josephine yayoboye resitora y'Abashinwa, Flamingo, mu mujyi wa Kigali. Yayiyoboye iyo resitora imyaka imyaka 13 mbere yo gufata icyemezo cyo kuyifunga muri 2015 nyuma yo gufata umwanzuro ko atanyuzwe n'ubucuruzi kandi kuko yashakaga kumarana umwanya n'umuryango we. Nyuma yo gufunga Flamingo, Josephine yabaye umunyamuryango wa gahunda y\u2019amahoro binyuze mu bucuruzi yakozwe n\u2019ikigo gishinzwe guteza imbere ubukungu bw\u2019umugore cyibasira abagore bo mu bihugu by\u2019u Rwanda na Afuganisitani batangiye ubucuruzi bwabo. Binyuze muri gahunda y\u2019amahoro binyuze no mu bucuruzi, Josephine yahuye na Nancy Coldham, umujyanama ufasha mu bijyanye n\u2019imari y\u2019a bagore mu bihugu bikennye. Josephine yagize intangiriro yigitekerezo cyo gufungura ubucuruzi bushya muri Kigali Coldham yashishikarijwe ndetse anafashwa kubitera, anafasha Josephine kubona isoko yo gufasha muri uku gutangiza. \nColdham yabonye ubufasha m'uburyo bwa Beau's All Natural Brewing Company, uruganda rukora inzoga muri Ontario, mugihugu cya Kanada. Beau yari ashishikajwe no gutanga ibikoresho n'amahugurwa kumuntu ushaka gutangiza inzoga zabo bwite, Josephine yashoboye kubyungukiramo. Itsinda ry\u2019abayobozi ba Beau basuye u Rwanda muri 2016 kugira ngo basuzume uko ibintu bimeze, amaherezo bituma bemera gufasha Josephine mu gutangira kwe. Nyuma y\u2019uruzinduko rwa Beau, Josephine n'inshuti ze nshya muri Beau batangije gahunda ya Kickstarter yo gukusanya inkunga yo kunywa inzoga, bavuga akamaro k\u2019inzoga ziri muri Rwanda ndetse na gahunda y\u2019ubucuruzi y\u2019u ruganda rukora kandi rukaba rufite abagore bose. Iyamamaza rya Kickstarter ryakusanyije miliyoni 95,000 z'amadolari ya kanada hamwe nabaterankunga barenga 1.000. \nUruganda rwenga inzoga.\nUruganda rwa Josephine, rwari ruteganijwe gufungura muri 2018, rugaragaramo abakozi bagizwe n\u2019abagore bose baturutse mu turere dukikije Kigali. Uru ruganda rwenga inzoga rwari kuzakoresha ibikoresho biva mu Rwanda. Ibyingenzi binzoga nyinshi zakorwa harimo izi bitoki n'amasaka, aribintu bizwi cyane byo gukoresha mu nzoga ny'afurika. Josephine yizera ko ishyirwa mu bikorwa ry\u2019imiti iciriritse y\u2019u Rwanda rizaba intambwe nziza ku gihugu muri rusange kuva u Rwanda rwishimira kunywa byeri kandi kuba rushobora kugira iyo mikorore ikorerwa mu karere bizaba isoko y\u2019ingufu zihuza ibihugu. "}
{"id": "16874", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16874", "title": "Turatsinze Th\u00e9og\u00e8ne", "text": "Turatsinze Th\u00e9og\u00e8ne (yavukiye mu majyaruguru y'u Rwanda muri 1970, yicishwe hagati ya 11 na 15 Ukwakira 2012 muri Mozambike) aho yari umucuruzi na rwiyemezamirimo ukomoka mu Rwanda.\nAmasomo yize.\nAmaze kwiga icyiciro cya mbere cya kaminuza mu gihugu cye, yimukiye muri Mozambike, aho yakoraga imyaka itari mike, nyuma yaho arangiza amasomo ye afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu micungire muri kaminuza Gatolika ya Ositaraliya i Sydney. Yasubiye mu Rwanda, aba umuyobozi mukuru wa Banki ishinzwe iterambere ry\u2019u Rwanda ya BRD muri 2005. Yirukanywe kuri uwo mwanya muri 2007. Yongeye kwimukira muri Mozambike, aho yabaye umuyobozi wungirije wa kaminuza Gatolika ya S\u00e3o Tom\u00e3s de Mo\u00e7ambique kugeza apfuye. \nUrupfu.\nYaburiwe irengero kuva ku ya 11 cyangwa 12 Ukwakira 2012, i Maputo. Umurambo we wabonetse ku ya 15, uboshye ndetse ureremba mu nyanja. Polisi yo muri Mozambike yabanje kwerekana uruhare rwa guverinoma y'u Rwanda mu bwicanyi, hanyuma isubiza inyuma icyo kirego. Turatsinze yatekerezaga ko yari afite amakuru y\u2019ishoramari ya politiki yerekeranye na bamwe mu bayobozi ba guverinoma y\u2019u Rwanda, yerekeranye n\u2019amafaranga ya Banki y\u2019iterambere. Iyicwa rye ritamenyekanye, ryasobanuwe nk'amateka y\u2019urupfu rw\u2019amayoberane rw\u2019abatavuga rumwe n\u2019ubutegetsi cyangwa abumva ko barwanya leta ya Paul Kagame mu Rwanda. Ikinyamakuru kizwi cya The Zimbabwean kivuga ku rupfu rwa Seth Sendashonga (umunywanyi wo mu rwego rwo hejuru wo mu rwego rwa politiki wishwe muri Kenya muri 1998), Jean-L\u00e9onard Rugambage (umunyamakuru wishwe i Kigali mu 2010), na Charles Ingabire (umunyamakuru wishwe muri Uganda muri 2011); yavuze nanone kandi kuri Kayumba Nyamwasa, wahoze mu bagize iperereza ry'u Rwanda warokotse umugambi wo kumwica muri 2010. Mu buryo nk'ubwo, Umuyoboro wa 4 w\u2019Ubwongereza wahuzaga urupfu rwa Turatsinze n\u2019a bavuzwe, ndetse nk\u2019urupfu rw\u2019umunyapolitiki Andr\u00e9 Kagwa Rwisereka wishwe muri 2010, avuga kandi ibirego by\u2019uruhare rwa guverinoma y\u2019u Rwanda. "}
{"id": "16875", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16875", "title": "Ashish Thakkar", "text": "Ashish J. Thakkar ni rwiyemezamirimo ukomoka mu Rwanda. Niwe washinze Mara Group na Mara Foundation, akaba ari nawe washinze Atlas Mara Limited. Thakkar akaba yavukiye mu Bwongereza, ariko yimukira muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba akiri ingimbi mbere yo gushinga Mara Group, ihuriro ry\u2019Abanyafurika, afite imyaka 15. Ibikorwa bya Mara Group nishoramari bikorera m'ubihugu bigera 22 by'Afurika. Ni umwanditsi w'Intare Ikanguka, Ibyabaye mu gitangaza cyu bukungu bwa Afurika.\nThakkar ni umwe mu bagize ihuriro ry\u2019ubukungu bw\u2019isi ku bayobozi bato ku isi, kandi yashyizwe ku rutonde rw\u2019ikinyamakuru Fortune ku rutonde rwa mbere imunsi 40 y\u2019imyaka 40 muri 2013. Yahawe igihembo cya Base Leadership Award mu birori bya MTV Africa Music Awards 2014. ikinyamakuru Esquire y'amwise umuntu w\u2019umwaka wo mu burasirazuba bwo hagati muri 2016. \nMuri 2015, Thakkar yagizwe Umuyobozi w\u2019Inama y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ishinzwe kwihangira imirimo ku isi naho muri 2017, agirwa umuyobozi w\u2019itsinda ngishwanama ry\u2019urubyiruko rwa Perezida muri Banki nyafurika ishinzwe iterambere;\nUbuzima bwambere nuburere.\nUmuryango wa Thakkar wimukiye muri leta ya Gujarat yo mu Buhinde muri Afurika mu 1890. Thakkar yavukiye i Leicester muri 1981. Yabayeho mu bwana bwe mu ishuri rya Rushey Mead mu itsinda rya Belvoir S. Ababyeyi be bari barimukiye mu Bwongereza mu 1972 igihe Idi Amin yashyiraga mu bikorwa kwirukana Abanyaziya muri Uganda. Thakkar n'umuryango we basubiye muri Afurika gutura mu Rwanda mbere yuko bongera guhatirwa kugenda kubera jenoside yo mu Rwanda mu 1994. Umuryango wa Thakkar wahungiye mu Burundi mbere yo gutura muri Uganda nk'impunzi. Ku myaka 15, Thakkar yaretse ishuri kugira ngo atangire ubucuruzi bwe ku nguzanyo y'amadorari 5,000. \nUmwuga.\nThakkar yashinze isosiyete ye bwite, yitwa Mara Group, muri 1996 afite imyaka 15. Yatangiye atumiza ibice bya mudasobwa birimo ahanini claviers, mouses, na desktops kuva m'urugendo rwa buri cyumweru i Dubai. Thakkar amaze kubona inguzanyo y'amadorari 5,000 yo gutangiza isosiyete ye, yafunguye ubucuruzi buciriritse bwa IT m'isoko ry\u2019ubucuruzi hakurya y'umuhanda uva mu iduka rya se i Kampala. \nMu myaka icumi yakurikiyeho, Thakkar yaguye Mara Group mu inganda, imitungo itimukanwa, ubuhinzi na serivisi za IT. Nyuma Thakkar yimuye icyicaro gikuru i Dubai, ariko akomereza ubucuruzi muri Afurika. \nMuri 2013, Thakkar yatangaje kubufatanye na Bob Diamond gutangiza Atlas Mara, isosiyete ishora imari mu bigo by\u2019a mabanki y\u2019ubucuruzi mur'afurika. Diamond wahoze ari umuyobozi mukuru wa Barclays, na Thakkar bahuriye mu nama babinyujije ku ruhande rwabo, hari Mara Foundation na Fondasiyo ya Diamond. Thakkar na Diamond bakusanyije inkunga ingana na miliyoni 325 z'amadolari y'amerika mu Kuboza 2013, mbere yo gushyira ku rutonde iyi sosiyete ku isoko ry'imigabane rya London. Igiciro cy'imigabane cyakomeje kugabanuka gahoro gahoro kandi kigera cyatakaje 95% byigiciro cya IPO. Ikimenyetso cya ticker i Londres ni ATMA. LN, m'ugihe muri Amerika, amatike yari AAMAF.\nIbindi bikorwa.\nThakkar yashinze ikigo Mara Foundation, isosiyete idaharanira inyungu itanga inama kandi igatera inkunga ba rwiyemezamirimo bakiri bato bo mu Afurika, muri 2009. Mara Mentor, yari porogaramu igendanwa ihuza ba rwiyemezamirimo bakiri bato n\u2019inzobere mu bucuruzi, yatangijwe binyuze muri Mara Foundations. \nMuri Kamena 2014, Thakkar yitabiriye ibirori bya Global Accelerator yakiriwe na Fondasiyo y\u2019umuryango w\u2019a bibumbye hamwe ibiro by\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye bishinzwe ubufatanye kugira ngo baganire ku kwihangira imirimo mu ntego za Loni. Thakkar yerekanye kandi akora mu birori bya ba rwiyemezamirimo barenga 100 n'abayobozi ba Loni barimo Michael Dell, Barbara Bush na Arianna Huffington. Muri Kanama 2014, Thakkar yitabiriye inama y\u2019Amerika n'afurika, yakiriwe ndetse na White House, ari kumwe na Bill Clinton wahoze ari Perezida w'amerika. Yagiye kandi mu ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ryita ku bagore, kandi yari umushyitsi mukuru mu nama y\u2019urubyiruko y\u2019a bagiraneza ya Emirates Foundation muri Gushyingo 2014. "}
{"id": "16876", "revid": "12340", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16876", "title": "Eisha Stephen Atieno Odhiambo", "text": "Eisha Stephen Atieno Odhiambo (1945 - 25 Gashyantare 2009 Yari Umwarimu wavukiye ahitwa i Muhoroni, akaba yaramenyekanye cyane cyane kubera umusanzu yagiye atanga mu kumvikanisha akaga/ibyago karangwa muri politiki yubumenyi na sociologie y'imbaraga. Dr Odhiambo yari kandi umwarimu w\u2019amateka muri kaminuza ya Rice muri Amerika, aho yari umuyobozi mu bijyanye no mu kwiga imico. Yize muri kaminuza ya Makerere muri gihugu cya Uganda na kaminuza ya Nairobi muri Kenya.\nOdhiambo yasezeye muri kaminuza ya Rice kubera uburwayi maze we n'umufasha we basubira mu rugo rwabo i Ndere, Siaya, muri Kenya, mbere y'urupfu rwe mu 2009 mu bitaro bya Aga Khan i Kisumu. "}
{"id": "16877", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16877", "title": "Chacha Nyaigotti-Chacha", "text": "Porofeseri Chacha Nyaigotti-Chacha (wavutse ku ya 22 Kanama 1952 mu Karere ka Kuria, Intara ya Nyanza, muri Kenya) ni umwanditsi w'amakinamico wo muri Kenya kandi wize cyane. Yabaye umunyamabanga nshingwabikorwa w\u2019inama nkuru ya kaminuza muri Afurika y\u2019iburasirazuba (2000 \u2013 2010), kandi yabaye umuyobozi wa mbere w\u2019ikigo cy\u2019inguzanyo cy\u2019amashuri makuru (Higher Education Loans Board) cyo mu gihugu cya Kenya (1995 \u2013 2000). Kuri ubu akora nk'umuyobozi wa komisiyo ishinzwe uburezi muri kaminuza ya Kenya (CUE).\nYize muri Kenyatta College, ahabwa BEd (y'Icyubahiro) (Ururimi rw'igiswahiri), nyuma yiga muri kaminuza ya Yale, ahabwa impamyabumenyi yisumbuyeho (MA) mu bijyanye n'indimi za Anthropologique n'impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga (Ph.D.) mu rurimi rw'igiswahili. Yabaye Umwarimu w'umunyeshuri n\u2019Umwarimu mu rurimi rw\u2019igiswahili n\u2019indimi muri kaminuza ya Kenyatta nyuma akaza no kwigisha muri kaminuza ya Egerton muri Kenya. Yabaye Umwarimu w\u2019ubushakashatsi mu kigo cy\u2019ubufatanye bw\u2019akarere n\u2019iterambere rya kaminuza gatolika yo muri Afurika y\u2019iburasirazuba.\nIbyiza Yagezeho.\n2004 Yahawe Umudari w'Intwari Nkuru (OGW) Umudari (Kenya).\n1994 Yahawe Umudari w'Ishimwe rya Leta (HSC) umudari (Kenya) kubera serivisi nziza."}
{"id": "16878", "revid": "12340", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16878", "title": "Maina wa Kinyatti", "text": "Maina wa Kinyatti ni umuhanga mu by'amateka ya Marxiste wo muri Kenya akaba yarahoze ari imfungwa ya politiki ku butegetsi bw'igitugu bwa Daniel arap Moi. Afatwa nk'umushakashatsi wambere ku itsinda rya Mau Mau muri Kenya, imwe mu mpamvu zambere zatumye Kinyatti atabwa muri yombi agafungwa. Amaze kurekurwa muri gereza ku ya 17 Ukwakira 1988 (nyuma yo kumara imyaka itandatu n'igice, ahanini yamaze afungiye wenyine), yahunze igihugu yerekeza muri Tanzaniya, atinya kongera gufungwa na guverinoma ya Moi. Nyuma y'ukwezi kumwe i Dar es Salaam, Kinyatti yahatiwe gusaba ubuhungiro bwa politiki muri Amerika. Kinyatti yahawe igihembo cya PEN igihembo cy' Ubwisanzure bwo kwandika mu mwaka w' 1988. "}
{"id": "16880", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16880", "title": "Ubukerarugendo muri Somaliland", "text": "Ubukerarugendo muri Somaliland bugengwa na Minisiteri y\u2019ubukerarugendo ya Somaliland.\nAmateka.\nAmateka y'ubukerarugendo muri Somaliland yahuzwaga nayo muri Somaliya, bituma habaho umuvuduko ukabije mu igabanuka ry'ubukerarugendo mu gihe cy'intambara yo muri Somaliya. Kuva ubwigenge bwa Somaliland bwatangazwa no gushyiraho guverinoma \"yemewe\" n'amategeko, umutekano wagarutse kuri bose uretse iburasirazuba bw'igihugu. Ba mukerarugendo benshi baza muri Somaliland baba baje gusura ahahoze hubatswe bimwe mu bintu bya cyera by'amateka n'ingoro z'amateka zegereye umurwa mukuru, Hargeisa, n'utundi turere nka Zeila. Ibitangaza karemano nk'ibiyaga bya Berbera cyangwa imisozi ya Cal Madow; cyangwa ubukerarugendo bwo kwidagadura mu gihugu kitabaho mu buryo bwemewe n\u2019amategeko, biracyafite tekiniki mu ntambara y\u2019abaturage mu rwego rwa Somaliya, cyangwa kuvuga ko bagiye muri Somaliya, nubwo nta kaga gakomeye kaboneka muri Somaliya.\nBenshi mu bakora ingendo muri Somaliland binjirira muri Djibouti cyangwa Etiyopiya, nko kwinjira mu nyanja cyangwa muri Somaliya ntabwo ari amahitamo meza kubera intambara y'abenegihugu ya Somaliya / Amakimbirane ya Puntland na Somaliland."}
{"id": "16881", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16881", "title": "Joel Macharia", "text": "Joel Macharia ni we washinze Abacus akaba n'Umuyobozi mukuru wa Kenya, ikigo cya Kenya cyonyine cyo mu bucuruzi bw\u2019imitungo myinshi. Abacus ituma abashoramari bo mu karere ndetse n\u2019isi yose bashora imari mu bubiko bwa Kenya, inguzanyo za leta hamwe n\u2019inguzanyo zishingiye kuri konti imwe. Isosiyete irashaka gutanga uburyo bwo kugera ku masoko akomeye ya Afurika kuri konti imwe mu myaka 3 iri imbere. Joel ni Forbes Top 30 Abatarengeje imyaka 30 na Business Daily Top 40 Abatarengeje imyaka 40.\nAmashuri.\nJoel Macharia yize muri Kaminuza ya Nairobi aho yakuye impamyabumenyi y'ikiciro cya kabiri mubijyanye n'ubucuruzi,kuva 2005 kugera 2002, Afite kandi iyi mpamyabumenyi mu mategeko yabonye 2005 muri iyi Kaminuza ya Nairobi. "}
{"id": "16882", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16882", "title": "Isaac Oboth", "text": "Isaac Nekemiah yavukiye muri Uganda, umwe mu ba rwiyemezamirimo bakiri bato bagamije gukora Afurika \"nshya\". Niwe washinze kandi akaba n'umuyobozi mukuru wa Media 256 Ltd, imwe mu masosiyete akora firime na televiziyo byihuta cyane muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba. Ku myaka 17, Isaka yahaye akazi umufotozi waho wo gufata amashusho yamashuri yisumbuye. Ufata amashusho yibwiraga ko azabona inyungu nziza akora DVD yibirori, hanyuma akajya kugurisha izo DVD kubanyeshuri bigana.\nAmateka.\nIbyumweru bibiri nyuma yo gusezerana, uwatanze amashusho yagejeje kuri Isaka 250 zanditseho DVD. Yuzuye umunezero, yahise yiruka muri laboratoire ya mudasobwa y'ishuri maze areba imwe muri DVD. Filime yari iteye ubwoba gusa! Guhindura byari bibi, umuziki wose wari wibeshye, byunvikana nkumushinga wambere uteye ubwoba. Igitangaje ariko, abo bigana barabikunze! Yagurishije umunsi umwe. Mu byukuri yagiye akora kopi nyinshi zifite amashusho yinyongera, ayita \u201cverisiyo ya deluxe\u201d ayigurisha ku giciro cyo hejuru. Ubunararibonye bwatumye Isaka agira amatsiko menshi kubyo bisaba gukora amashusho meza. Yatangiye gushakisha kumurongo no kureba amashusho yuburyo bwo kurasa no guhindura kuri YouTube. Icyatangiye nkamatsiko yoroshye byahise bihinduka. Igihe kimwe, yamaraga amasaha 16 kumunsi akina gusa na software yo gutunganya amashusho.\nNyuma y'amezi atandatu yo kureba inyigisho, Isaka yanditse Media 256, ltd. Isosiyete ikora firime na televiziyo yabaga i Kampala. Uyu munsi, Media 256 ifite abakozi 10 bigihe cyose kandi yarashe kandi itanga ibikomoka mubihugu birenga 36 byo muri Afrika. Itangazamakuru 256 ryakoze akazi ku bicuruzwa nka Coca Cola, Gahunda y\u2019iterambere ry\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye, Nestle, Ikigo cy\u2019Amerika gishinzwe iterambere mpuzamahanga, Ishuri Rikuru ry\u2019Ubuyobozi Nyafurika n\u2019Urusobe rw\u2019amakuru (CNN). By'umwihariko kuri CNN, Media 256 irasa kandi ikabyara amajwi nyafurika hamwe nisoko rya Afrika. Isosiyete yanditswe na CNN ndetse n\u2019Ubwongereza Broadcasting Corporation (BBC) kubera imbaraga zo kwandika inkuru ya Afurika.\nIsaac yakiriwe neza kubera urugendo rwe rwo kwihangira imirimo. Muri 2011, yatsindiye igihembo cya Young Achiever kubera Filime na Televiziyo. Igihembo yamuhaye na ba perezida bombi ba Uganda n'u Rwanda ndetse n'umwamikazi wa Buganda. Muri 2012, Isaac yamenyekanye nka Mugenzi wa Anzisha. Muri 2014, 2015 na 2016, yashyizwe ku rutonde rwa Forbes \u201c30 ba mbere bari munsi ya 30 ba rwiyemezamirimo bafite icyizere muri Afurika.\u201d Inzozi za Isaac nugukora byimazeyo firime na TV byerekana kandi byishimira kwihangana kwabanyafurika, ubuhanga n'ubwiza."}
{"id": "16883", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16883", "title": "Abubakar Sadick Fuseini", "text": "Abubakar ni rwiyemezamirimo w'imyaka 22 y'amavuko, ubu yiga Ikoranabuhanga mu micungire y'amasoko no gutanga amasoko muri kaminuza ya tekinike ya Kumasi muri Ghana. Afite ishyaka ryo gukemura bimwe mu bibazo bikomeye bya Afurika akoresheje ikoranabuhanga kandi yizera ko urundi rubyiruko rwashishikajwe no gutangira urugendo rwabo rwo kwihangira imirimo.\nUbucuruzi.\nAbubakar yashinze Byihuse Gutanga Intambwe muri 2019. Gutanga Byihuse-Intambwe ni sosiyete itwara abantu n'ibikoresho ikorera muri Gana. Irashaka kuba serivise yo gutanga serivisi mukarere ke. Serivise umushinga utanga zirimo ariko ntabwo zigarukira gusa kubitangwa ryibigo, kugemura kugiti cyawe, ibikorwa byo murugo, kugemura ibitaro, ibiryo nibikoreshwa, kugemura parcelle mumashuri, ibigo byicumbikira, hamwe na serivise rusange hamwe na serivise.\nUrugendo rwo Kwihangirimirimo.\nUrugendo rwo kwihangira imirimo Abubakar rwatangiye ako kanya nyuma yishuri ryisumbuye. Yatangije igitekerezo cyubucuruzi bwe Byihuse Gutanga Intambwe nyuma yo kubona ko abantu n\u2019amasosiyete barwanira kohereza no kwakira ibicuruzwa biva mu turere two hanze. Hamwe n'ubumenyi buke ku bijyanye no kwihangira imirimo, Abubakar yagombaga gushingira ku bushakashatsi buva kuri interineti ndetse n'abamukikije"}
{"id": "16884", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16884", "title": "Bassim-sw\u00e9 Hugues Bamass", "text": "Bassim-sw\u00e9 Hugues BAMASSI, rwiyemezamirimo wimyaka 21 ukomoka muri Togo, yavutse k'umubyeyi w'umushoferi wa Tagisi na nyina w'umutetsi. Yabuze se akiri muto, byamutwaye ubwana kuko yagombaga gukora nk'umucuruzi utwara ambilansi kugira ngo abone ibimutunga. Yakundaga ubuvuzi kandi abona inzozi ze zihinduka kwihangira imirimo nyuma yo kurwara mu mwaka we wa Mbere w'ishuri. \nH-Express yoherejwe ni isosiyete itwara abantu itwara amafunguro, ipaki, nibicuruzwa murugo. Kugira uruhare mu kurengera ibidukikije, ikoresha amagare mu gutanga amafunguro n'ibipaki bipima munsi ya 15kg; kuri parcelle ipima ibiro birenga 15, ikoreshwa rya moto cyangwa trikipiki. Bakoresha WhatsApp kugirango bahuze abakiriya babo muri serivisi zabo kuko igera kubantu benshi."}
{"id": "16885", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16885", "title": "Kelvin Doe", "text": "Kelvin Doe (yavutse taliki 26 Ukwakira, 1996, muri Freetown, Sierra Leone), ni injeniyeri wa Siyera Lewoni.\nUmwuga.\nKelvin Doe wavukiye mu gace gakennye ka Freetown, muri Siyera Lewone, ni umuhererezi muri batanu. Ako gace ntikabuze amashanyarazi n'amazi, kandi ntibyari byizewe ku buryo amatara yazaga rimwe gusa mu cyumweru. Afite imyaka 10 yatangiye gukusanya ibikoresho bishaje no gusiba ibyuma kugirango akore ikintu gishya muri cyo.\nYabikora abitandukanya ibikoresho bishaje kugirango arebe uko bikora, hanyuma abisubize hamwe nkibintu bishya byavuye mubitekerezo bye. Yubatse bateri na transmitter mu bice byajugunywe. Nyuma yaje kwitabira amarushanwa ya GMin's Innovate Salone igitekerezo, aho yageze kumukino wanyuma yubaka generator ivuye mubyuma. Yakoresheje icyumba cyo kuraramo nk'aho akorera aho yubatse bateri z'amatara y'amashanyarazi, na generator z'amashanyarazi igihe zitabonetse.\nYakoze imiyoboro ya radiyo maze atangiza radiyo ye ku izina rya DJ Focus. Guhishurirwa izina byaturutse ku myizerere ye ko yibanze, umuntu wese ashobora kugera kubyo aharanira. Kelvin yari afite imyaka 15 gusa igihe yubakaga radiyo, yakundaga gutangaza amakuru, umuziki n'ubutumwa bugamije amahoro n'ubumwe mu baturage be. Kevin yubatse moteri ikoresha radiyo. Yayubatsemo ibyuma bishaje, aside na soda. Nyuma yaje gukomeza guhanga no guhanga udushya. Kelvin ubu afite kandi akayobora isosiyete ye yikoranabuhanga nkumuyobozi mukuru. Isosiyete yitwa \"K-Doe Tech, Inc\" aho ategura akanagurisha ibikoresho bya elegitoroniki"}
{"id": "16886", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16886", "title": "Andrew Mupuya", "text": "Andereya yavukiye mu cyaro cya Mbale, muri Uganda, yimukiye i Kampala muri buruse ya kimwe cya kabiri kugira ngo yige ku rwego rwo hejuru. Andrew Mupuya ni we washinze uruganda rwa mbere rwa Uganda ruzwi nka paper bag company.\nNyuma byaje kuba inzitizi yo kumuha ibyo akeneye igihe yari ku ishuri ababyeyi be babaye abashomeri. Muri 2008, afite imyaka 16, Andereya yabonye amahirwe yisoko mugukora imifuka yimpapuro. Mu gihe guverinoma ya Uganda yegamiye ku kubuza gukoresha imifuka ya pulasitike ya polythene, Andereya yahisemo kwishora mu mushinga utangiza ibidukikije wo gukora impapuro.\nKubera ko nta murwa mukuru wambere, Andereya yasukuye ibidukikije akusanya amacupa ya pulasitike yakoreshejwe hanyuma ayagurisha ku ruganda rutunganya plastike. Amaze gukusanya umurwa mukuru w\u2019imbuto wa mbere ingana na 36.000 shilingi ya Uganda ($ 18), yahise atangira gukora imifuka yimpapuro ku rugero ruto akiri mu mashuri yisumbuye.\nAmateka.\nMu mwaka wa 2010, Andereya yiyandikishije mu isosiyete ye nshya, Youth Entrepreneurial Link Investments (YELI). Ubu YELI niyo sosiyete yambere yanditsweho impapuro hamwe namasosiyete akora amabahasha muri Uganda. Ubucuruzi bwe bwakuze bukoresha abantu 22, imfura muri zo ni 53. Abakiriya ba YELI barimo ibitaro byaho, amaduka acururizwamo, abagurisha umuhanda, amasoko akomeye, hamwe n\u2019amasosiyete akomeye akora ifu yo mu karere nka Maganjo abasya ingano na Akamai Foods. YELI niwe wahawe amarushanwa ya miliyoni 2.6 yo muri Uganda ($ 1.000) amarushanwa ya gahunda yubucuruzi ya ILO. Ahereye ku byo yinjije, Andereya abasha kwishyura impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bucuruzi muri kaminuza ya Makerere, kwishyura umushahara ku bakozi be, kandi atunga umuryango we i Mbale afungura aho bagurisha imifuka n'ibahasha nyina agurisha. Usibye gucunga imishinga ye ikura, Andereya yabonye umwanya wo guhugura abantu barenga 500, cyane cyane urubyiruko, uburyo bwo gukora imifuka yimpapuro hifashishijwe indi mishinga 16. Intego ye bwite ni ugukoresha abantu 60 bitarenze 2015 no gushyiraho uruganda rukora impapuro kugirango agere ku cyerekezo cya Afrika isukuye.\nAndereya ubu akoresha abantu 22 bose, kandi yagiye atandukanya umurongo we kugirango ashyiremo imifuka yimpano. Niwe wahawe igihembo cya FERD 2012 cya Rwiyemezamirimo wumwaka.\nAndereya yagaragaye nko kuri Ventures Africa, CNN kandi yamenyekanye na Tony Elemelu igihembo cya Tony Elemelu igihembo cy\u2019ubucuruzi mu 2014."}
{"id": "16887", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16887", "title": "Mogau Seshoene", "text": "Mogau Seshoene numuyobozi mukuru nuwashinze Lazy Makoti, itanga amasomo yo guteka kumafunguro gakondo yo muri Afurika y'epfo. Ni na rwiyemezamirimo w\u2019umugore wavukiye muri Afurika yepfo wakira ikiganiro cya TV cyigihugu gishingiye ku guteka muri Afrika y'epfo. Mogau Seshoene numukobwa ukiri muto wasangaga ashishikajwe nikindi kintu mbere yuko abona icyerekezo cya Lazy Makoti.\nAmavuko.\nYavukiye mu mujyi mwiza wa Turfloop Mankweng mu mujyi wa Limpopo, Afurika y'Epfo. Nubwo akomoka muri Afurika adafite ubucuruzi busa nkubwe, yiganjemo isoko ryamafunguro akora byinshi mubya Afurika. \nAmateka.\nMogau Seshoene afite isosiyete ikemura ibiryo itanga ibiryo byo guteka, ibikoresho byibiribwa nibindi bikoresho nko gutema imbaho \u200b\u200bnibindi, iterambere rya resept, hamwe no kugaburira bespoke. Umunebwe Makoti yabaye ubucuruzi bwiyemeje guteza imbere umuco n\u2019umurage nyafurika yepfo mubindi bihugu bya Afurika."}
{"id": "16888", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16888", "title": "Mariana Mahitiko", "text": "Amateka.\nMaison de Coutoure Mariana Reyel ashushanya kandi agurisha imyenda y'abagabo n'abagore muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Imyenda ikozwe cyane mubitambaro byo muri Afurika, ariko kandi ikoresha indi myenda. Imyambarire yabo itera imbaraga mumyambarire gakondo yo muri afrika hamwe nuburyo bugezweho butuma umugabo numugore wo muri Afrika ya kijyambere bumva ko ari moda kandi icyarimwe bakabona imizi n'amateka yabo mumyambarire yabo. Maison de Coutoure Mariana Reyel kugurisha imyenda haba mububiko ndetse no kumurongo bigatuma imyenda yabo iboneka muri DRC ndetse no kwisi yose. Ubucuruzi bwifuza kumenyekanisha no kwagura imideli nyafurika muri metaverse binyuze kumurongo werekana imideli. Hamwe nubucuruzi bushaka kwaguka, bategereje gushora imari mumahugurwa yo gushushanya azabafasha kuzamuka."}
{"id": "16889", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16889", "title": "Doroles Mihanjo", "text": "Dolores ni rwiyemezamirimo w'imyaka 21 ukomoka i Kibaha, muri Tanzaniya. Ashishikajwe no gukorana n'abana bava mu mibereho ikennye kugira ngo babone uburezi bufite ireme. Mu rwego rwo kubaha imbaraga z'ejo hazaza heza kandi birashoboka ko bazahinduka aba Afurika bazahindura impinduka, yashinze Maktaba.\nAmateka.\nDolores ni umunyeshuri urangije amashuri yisumbuye kandi yiyigisha porogaramu ya mudasobwa. Yashishikajwe no gutangiza umushinga we kuva amashuri yisumbuye. Dolores yahisemo guhagarika amashuri kandi afata umwaka umwe kugirango yibande ku kuzamura ubucuruzi bwe.\n80% by'abanyeshuri biga mu mashuri abanza muri Tanzaniya ntibafite uburezi bufite ireme ukurikije imibare ya SACMEQ 2010. Kubera ko Dolores yari azi icyo kintu, yashinze Maktaba kugira ngo ahindure urwego rw\u2019uburezi bwa digitale kugira ngo uburezi bufite ireme bugerweho ku giciro cyiza ku matsinda yose y\u2019abantu. Maktaba agurisha inyandiko z'uburezi nkimpapuro zashize, inoti nibitabo bikubiyemo kumurongo kubabyeyi, amashuri, n'abarimu. Ibirimo birahari kurwego rwincuke kugeza mumashuri yisumbuye. Ubu bucuruzi bwashinzwe muri Tanzaniya kandi bufite abakiriya mu turere 13 two ku mugabane w'isi, aho abaguzi benshi baturuka i Dar es Salaam, Arusha na Dodoma.\nMaktaba irimo gukemura ikibazo cyo gutandukanya uburezi bufite ireme mu banyeshuri bo mu cyaro no mu mijyi. Dolores yizera kubona uburinganire bungana kandi buringaniye nubwo uburinganire bwabo, ishuri cyangwa ubushobozi bwabo bwo kwiga. Kugeza 2026, afite intego yo kongera ijanisha ryabakobwa bafite ubumenyi bwibanze bwo gusoma no kwandika kuva 35% kugeza kuri 50% muri Tanzaniya. Afite kandi intego yo guhanga imirimo 400 ihoraho muri Tanzaniya."}
{"id": "16890", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16890", "title": "Mike Muthiga", "text": "Mike Muthiga ni umuyobozi mukuru wa Fatboy Animations numuntu wihishe inyuma ya Faiba. Mike numwe mubagabo bashakishwa cyane muri animasiyo.\nUmwuga wa Mike Muthiga watangiye igihe yari mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Alliance, ahitamo Ubuhanzi n'Ibishushanyo nk'umwe mu bo yigisha kandi abifashijwemo na mwarimu we w'ishuri yifuza cyane animasiyo.\nYabonye umwanya wo kugerageza ubuhanga bwe nka animateur muto hanyuma nyuma ayobora animateur umwaka umwe nigice hamwe na serivise izwi cyane ya Tinga Tinga.\nAmashuri.\nYahoraga afite ishyaka rya animasiyo ariko igitutu cya societe cyamuteye gukora injeniyeri. Ku ikubitiro, Mike yakurikije inzira gakondo yumwuga nyuma yo kuva mumashuri yisumbuye, arangiza icyiciro cya injeniyeri nubwo asobanura ko ishyaka rya animasiyo ryakongejwe ryashimangiwe na Alliance mugihe yahisemo ubuhanzi nubushakashatsi.\nAkazi.\nNyuma yo gukorana numuyoboro wa BBC &amp; Disney mubikorwa bizwi cyane bya TingaTinga Tales yerekana amashusho (TV Citizen TV), Mike, hamwe ninshuti ye Sen Kanyare, bashizeho Fat Boy Animations. isosiyete ikora animasiyo igamije gutanga ibikubiye mubikorwa byo kwamamaza no kwidagadura."}
{"id": "16891", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16891", "title": "Renata Silva", "text": "Renata Silva n'umugore wimyaka 20 ukunda kwihangira imirimo no kwerekana imideli. Yavukiye kandi akurira muri Angola, nyuma yimukira muri Namibiya. Kuba yararerewe mu muryango ushingiye ku bucuruzi, kwihangira imirimo byahoraga mu ntego ze, bityo amaze kubona ko akunda imyambarire, yabonye umwanya wo guhindura imyidagaduro ye yo kudoda mu bucuruzi. Muri Nyakanga 2020, yahisemo gushyira ahagaragara imyenda ye bwite aho ashushanya kandi akagurisha imyenda igezweho kandi igezweho ku rubyiruko ndetse n'abasore bakuze muri Namibiya\nAmateka.\nRS Imyenda Brand ni umurongo wimyenda itanga imyenda myiza, yimyambarire kandi ihendutse kubagabo nabagore bafite hagati yimyaka 15-25. Ikirango cyirata muburyo bwihuse nibice byakozwe. Imyambarire yihuse nigihe imyenda ikozwe mubunini busanzwe kandi igashirwaho nikirango. Iyi myenda iragurishwa kandi ikagurishwa kumurongo hanyuma igashyikirizwa abakiriya. Ibice byakorewe ibicuruzwa ni amabwiriza yakozwe kubakiriya runaka mugushushanya kwabo. Abakiriya bandika gahunda, baza mubipimo hanyuma berekane igishushanyo bifuza, hanyuma utegereze hagati yiminsi 5-7 y'akazi kugirango ubone igice cyabo. Renata yizeye ko vuba aha imyenda ya RS izaba ikirango kizwi cyane muri Namibiya.\nAmashuri.\nDr. Starr yakiriye impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya mbere cya kaminuza yakuye muri kaminuza ya Loyala i Chicago, IL n'impamyabumenyi ye y'ubuvuzi yakuye muri kaminuza ya Illionis College of Medicine. Yarangije gutura muri OB / GYN mu kigo nderabuzima cya Winnie Palmer giherereye i Orlando, muri Floride.\nRenata arangije amasomo ye muri Namibiya. Yiga mu mwaka wa kabiri w'icyiciro cya mbere cya kaminuza mu bijyanye n'ubucuruzi muri kaminuza ya Namibiya. Igihe yari afite imyaka 15, yatangiye gukora imiheto no kuyigurisha ku ishuri, guhera ku muheto atangira gukora amakaramu y\u2019ikaramu yakozwe mu ntoki n\u2019imifuka, amaherezo yinjira mu myenda akora binyuze mu bucuruzi bwe ubu, RS Clothing Brand."}
{"id": "16892", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16892", "title": "Trushar Khetia", "text": "Trushar Khetia, ni umucuruzi wo muri Kenya na rwiyemezamirimo. Niwe washinze kandi akaba n'umuyobozi mukuru wa Tria Group yamasosiyete, harimo urunigi rwamaduka manini azwi nka societe yububiko bwa societe.\nAmavu n'amavuko.\nYavutse ku ya 29 Ugushyingo 1986 i Kitale, mu Ntara ya yo muri Kenya. Uyu muryango wari ufite iduka ricuruza kuva ryinjira muri Supermarkets ya Khetia. Yize mu mashuri abanza mbere yo kwimukira mu mashuri ya Nairobi kubera O-Urwego na A-Urwego. Afite imyaka 17, mu 2004, yinjiye mu ishuri ry\u2019ubucuruzi rya, arangiza mu 2007, afite impamyabumenyi ya, inzobere mu kwamamaza.\nAkazi.\nAmaze kurangiza kaminuza, yabonye akazi mu Bwongereza, nk'umuyobozi ushinzwe iterambere ry'ubucuruzi muri (P&amp;G), ahakorera imyaka 3 kugeza mu 2010. Muri Kamena 2011, yasubiye muri Kenya akora mu bucuruzi bw'umuryango i Kitale umwaka umwe. Nyuma yo kutumvikana na bamwe mu bagize umuryango ku bijyanye n\u2019icyerekezo cy\u2019ubucuruzi, yahisemo kwimukira i Nairobi maze yirukana wenyine. Muri 2013, yatangije Tria Group, ubucuruzi buzobereye mu kwamamaza ku bitangazamakuru bitambuka nka bisi n'indege. Yatangiriye ubucuruzi muri Kenya maze mu 2014 afungura ubucuruzi nk'ubwo muri Tanzaniya."}
{"id": "16893", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16893", "title": "Ubucuruzi bw'amafi mu Rwanda", "text": "Ubworozi bw\u2019amafi mu Rwanda burazamuka burigihe cyane. Ubundi amafi yororerwaga mu biyaga no mu byuzi biri muri za kareremba, ariko ubu abantu ku giti cyabo basigaye bakora ishoramari muri ubwo bworozi iryo bigabanya ingano y\u2019amafi yatumizwaga hanze. Nko mu gihe cyo muri guma mu rugo, Kuko Abanyarwanda barya amafi yororerwa mu Rwanda gusa.\nUbworozi.\nMu Karere ka Rusizi duhafite umworozi ugeza ku musaruro wa toni zirenga 15 z\u2019amafi mu cyumweru, kandi n\u2019ubu akomeje kwagura ubwo bworozi bwe kuko afite ahantu hahagije. Muri utwo turere nka Rusizi na Rubavuo harimo aborozi b\u2019amafi kandi nanone bakaba ari n\u2019abacuruzi bayo, ikindi gishya cyajemo mu bucuruzi bw\u2019amafi, ni uko umuntu ashobora kugura amafi ari i Kigali, uyamugurishije ari nka Rusizi akayapakira mu modoka yabyo yabugenewe akayamugezeho akiri mazima.\nUbucuruzi.\nUbucuruzi bw\u2019amafi urebye buhagaze neza mu Rwanda, ariko nanone aho bugenda cyane ni mu Mujyi wa Kigali kubera ko aha hari abantu benshi n'isoko rinini ndetse nonone mu turere twundi mu Rwanda, urebye duherereye ku mupaka n\u2019igihugu nka Repubulika ya Demukarasi ya Kongo nka Rusizi na Rubavu.\nNubwo ibiciro byihagaze bityo bigenda kandi bihundagurika, ahantu hacururizwa izo fi zigurishwa zikiri nzima zoga mu mazi, ahacururizwa izindi fi nka tilapiya, zituruka mu biyaga byo mu Bugesera nka Rweru na Cyohoha, aho usanga ibiciro bya Tilapiya nibya Tomusoni ari nka bimwe, kuko ikilo cya Tilapiya bakabigurisha amafaranga 2,500Frw ni cya Tomusoni kikagura amafaranga 2,500Frw nk\u2019uko bivugwa n\u2019abacuruzi usazwe uzicuruza."}
{"id": "16894", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16894", "title": "Ikigo cy\u2019imari RIM", "text": "RIM ni kigo cy\u2019imari iciriritse cyashinzwe na Kiliziya Gatorika mu Rwanda, n'ikigo kimaze y\u2019imyaka myinshi mu rugendo rukomeje rwo gukura abantu mu bukene.\nGutangira.\nRIM ubwo yatangiraga gukora nk'ikigo cy\u2019imari iciriritse hari muri Gicurasi 2004, ubwo yabonaga uruhushya urutangwa nda Banki nkuru y\u2019igihugu, ruyemerera gukora nk\u2019ikigo cy\u2019imari muri Ukwakira muri uwo mwaka. Muri 1998 nibwo hatangiye ikigo cy\u2019ikigega ku gitekerezo cyari icya Caritas ya Arikidiyosezi ya Kigali, ubwo yari ifatanyije na za Caritas zo muzindi diyoseze. Icyo kigega rero cyahise gitangira gutanga inguzanyo z\u2019igihe gito kubantu bakene n\u2019abakoraga ubucuruzi bwo mu muhanda bitaga nkunganire, kugeza ubwo muri 2004 cyemererwa na Banki nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda nk\u2019ikigo cy\u2019imari cyemewe gukorera mu Rwanda.\nInguzanyo.\nAbatabgiranye na RIM yitwaga Nkunganire muri 1998. Icyo gihe ngo yafashaga abantu ibavana mu muhanda ikabaguriza bahera ku mafaranga ibihumbi 15,000 frw bagakora ubucuruzi buciriritse biteza imbere. Kuri ubu ngo ni abantu bafata inguzanyo ya miliyoni ebyiri muri RIM, akayakoresha mu bucuruzi. RIM urebye ikorera muri diyosezi zigera ku icyenda za Kiliziya Gatolika, no muri maparuwasi 78 yazo. Ikaba ihafite amashami 36 akoresha ikoranabuhanga rimwe rigezweho ryorohereza abakiliya gukoresha serivisi zayo aho bari hose."}
{"id": "16895", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16895", "title": "Imari iciriritse mu Rwanda", "text": "Imari iciriritse izwi nka Microfinance urebye ni icyiciro cya serivisi zimari, aho zitangwa k'ubantu cyangwa ubucuruzi buciriritse, aho badafite uburyo bwo kubona amabanki asanzwe cyangwa se serivisi zijyanye nayo hafi yabo. Microfinance ikubiyemo inguzanyo urebye ziciriritse, gutanga inguzanyo nto kubakiriya batishoboye; kuzigama no kugenzura konti ; ubwishingizi ; na sisitemu yo kwishyura, hamwe n'ibindi bikorwa. Serivise z'imari iciriritse zagenewe kugera ku bakiriya batandukanye, urebye ubusanzwe ibyiciro by'abaturage bakennye, bishoboka ko bahejejwe inyuma n'imibereho, cyangwa akarerebatuyemo kari kure ya banki, kandi hari uburyo bashaka kwiteza imbere. RIM Rwanda ni urugero rwikigo cyimari iciriritse.\nImari iciriritse cyangwa Microfinance yabanje kugira ubusobanuro: Ni ugutanga inguzanyo kuri ba rwiyemezamirimo bakennye ndetse n'ubucuruzi buciriritse urebye butabona inguzanyo. Uburyo bubiri bw'ingenzi bwo gutanga serivisi z\u2019imari kubakiriya nkabo ni: (1) zabanki ashingiye ku mibanire ya ba rwiyemezamirimo ku giti cyabo ndetse n\u2019ubucuruzi buciriritse; na (2) icyitegererezo gishingiye kumatsinda, aho ba rwiyemezamirimo benshi bahurira hamwe kugirango basabe inguzanyo n'izindi serivisi nkitsinda. Nyuma y'igihe ariko, microfinance yagaragaye nkigikorwa kinini gifite intego igira iti: \"isi aho abantu bose, cyane abakene n\u2019abasigajwe inyuma n\u2019imibereho n\u2019imiryango, bafite amahirwe menshi y\u2019ibicuruzwa na serivisi by\u2019imari bihendutse, byujuje ubuziranenge. Atari gusa inguzanyo ariko nanone kuzigama, ubwishingizi, serivisi zo kwishyura, no kohereza amafaranga. \" \nIgiciro cy'inguzanyo.\nImwe mu mbogamizi nyamukuru urebye z'Imari iciriritse ni ugutanga inguzanyo nto ku giciro cyiza. Ikigereranyo cy\u2019inyungu rusange n\u2019igipimo cy\u2019amafaranga agera kuri 37%, aho ibiciro bigera kuri 70% ku masoko amwe. Impamvu y'inyungu nyinshi ntabwo ahanini igiciro cyigishoro, Mubyukuri, amashyirahamwe yimari iciriritse yakira igishoro cyinguzanyo ari zero ziva kumurongo wa interineti iciriritse Kuva yishyuza inyungu zisanzwe hamwe n'igiciro cya 35.21%. Ahubwo, impamvu nyamukuru yikiguzi kinini cyinguzanyo ziciriritse nigiciro kinini cyigikorwa bya microfinance gakondo ugereranije nubunini bwinguzanyo. \nKugera hamwe nuburebure bwingaruka.\nHabayeho impaka zamaze igihe kinini zerekeranye n'uburemere bw'ubucuruzi hagati yo kwegera 'ubushobozi bwikigo cyimari iciriritse kigera kubantu bakennye kandi ba kure n'imari irambye ' (ubushobozi bwo kwishyura amafaranga yacyo - kandi birashoboka kandi ni giciro cyayo cyo gukorera abakiriya bashya uhereye ku mafaranga yinjira). Nubwo muri rusange hemejwe ko abakora ibikorwa by'imari iciriritse bagomba gushaka guhuza izo ntego ku rugero runaka, hariho ingamba zitandukanye, uhereye ku nyungu ntoya yerekanwe na BancoSol muri Boliviya kugeza ku cyerekezo cyinshi kidaharanira inyungu cya BRAC muri Bangaladeshi. Ibi ntabwo ari ukuri ku bigo byihariye, ahubwo nanone kuri guverinoma zifite uruhare mu guteza imbere sisitemu y\u2019imari iciriritse. BRAC yashyizwe ku mwanya wa mbere utegamiye kuri Leta ku isi muri 2015 na 2016 n'Umujyanama utegamiye kuri Leta ukorera i Geneve. \nAbagore.\nMicrofinance iha abagore ku isi serivisi z\u2019imari iciriritse cyane cyane mu cyaro cyane badafite uburyo bwo kubona amabanki gakondo ndetse n\u2019ibindi bikorwa remezo by\u2019imari. Itanga amahirwe ku bagore gutangira no kubaka ubucuruzi bwabo bakoresheje ubuhanga bwabo. \nIhohoterwa.\nMuri Nijeriya hagaragaye ibibazo by'uburiganya. Amabanki adashidikanywaho yasezeranyije abakiriya bayo inyungu zidasanzwe. Aya mabanki yarafunzwe nyuma gato yuko abakiriya babitsemo amafaranga kandi amafaranga yabo bakayabura. Abayobozi ba Nijeriya y'Ubwishingizi bw'Ubwishingizi bwo kubitsa muri Nijeriya (NDIC) baburiye abakiriya ibyo bita \"banki zitangaje\". Igikorwa kimwe cyo kubuza abantu kubitsa amafaranga kugirango bibaze amabanki ni manini ituburira imikorere yaya mabanki atangaje. "}
{"id": "16897", "revid": "13539", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16897", "title": "Banki mu Rwanda", "text": "Banki ni ikigo cyimari cyemera kubika ibivuye m'ubaturage, kandi nanone kigatanga inguzanyo isabwa mugihe kimwe. Ibikorwa byo gutanga inguzanyo birashobora gukorwa na banki cyangwa mu buryo butaziguye binyuze ku isoko ry\u2019imari n'imigabane.\nNiyo mpamvu amabanki agira uruhare runini mu ihungabana ry\u2019imari n\u2019ubukungu bw\u2019igihugu, inkiko nyinshi zifite amategeko menshi agenga amabanki. Ibihugu byinshi byashyizeho uburyo buzwi na banki ziciriritse, aho banki zifite umutungo utimukanwa uhwanye n'igice gusa cy'inshingano zabo. Usibye andi wwenda mabwiriza agamije kwemeza neza, amabanki muri rusange asabwa byibuze amafaranga asabwa ashingiye ku rwego mpuzamahanga rw\u2019imari shingiro, Amasezerano ya Basel.\nAmabanki mu buryo bugezweho yahindutse mu kinyejana cya cumi na kane mu mijyi yateye imbere ya Renaissance m'Ubutaliyani ariko mu buryo bwinshi yakoraga nk'ikomeza ry'ibitekerezo by'inguzanyo no kuguriza byari bifite inkomoko mu isi ya kera. Mu mateka ya banki, ingoma zitari nke za banki\u00a0\u2013 cyane twavuga nka Medicis, Fuggers, Welsers, Berenbergs, na Rothschilds\u00a0\u2013 bagize uruhare runini mu binyejana byinshi. Banki ya kera cyane yo gucuruza ni Banki ya Monte dei Paschi di Siena (yashinzwe muri 1472), naho banki y'abacuruzi ya kera cyane ni Banki ya Berenberg (yashinzwe muri 1590).\nAmateka.\nHagati.\nIbihe by'amabanki bishobora kuba kuva mu gihe cyo hagati na banki Renaissance yo mu Butaliyani, mu mijyi ikize yo hagati hamwe mu majyaruguru nka Florence, Lucca, Siena, Venice na Genoa. Imiryango ya Bardi na Peruzzi yiganjemo amabanki mu kinyejana cya 14nka Florence, ishinga amashami mu bindi bice byinshi by\u2019Uburayi. Giovanni di Bicci de 'Medici yashyizeho imwe mu mabanki azwi cyane yo mu Butaliyani, nka Banki ya Medici, muri 1397. Repubulika ya Genoa yashinze banki ya Leta izwi cyane yo kubitsa, Banco di San Giorgio (Banki ya Mutagatifu George), mu 1407 i Genoa, mu Butaliyani. \nBanki Ziri mu Rwanda.\nMU Rwanda hari banki nyinshi, ibigo by'imari iciriritse, ariko ibyo ibyo byose bihagarariwe na banki nkuru y'u Rwanda, ariyo ishyiraho amabwiriza n'amategeko."}
{"id": "16898", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16898", "title": "Ubucuruzi bw'indagara", "text": "Indagara zizwi nka \"Lepisma saccharinum\" ni ubwoko bw'ifi akaba ari amafi matoya, zikaba ziri mu dusimba duto hafi y'inigwahabiri tutagira amababa dukurikije gahunda ya Zygentoma (izahoze ari Thysanura). Izina ryayo rikomoka ku gakoko k'ifeza kijimye, kahujwe nuko kagaragara nk'amafi asa nuko agenda. Izina ry'o muri siyansi ni (\"L. saccharinum\") ryerekana ko iyo uyariye haba harimo feza igizwe na karubone nziza icyenewe mu mubiri w'abantu, hamwe n'isukari cyangwa se ibinyamisogwe. Mugihe izina risanzwe rya \"Indagara\" rikoreshwa hose mubuvanganzo bwisi yose kugirango ryerekane amoko atandukanye ya mafi, Umuryango Entomologiya wo muri Amerika ukaba ubuza gukoresha iryo jambo gusa kuri \"Lepisma saccharinum\". Indagara zicuruzwa ku isoko ry'urwanda zikomoka muri tanzaniya ndetse ni burundi.\nIbisobanuro.\nIfi y'indagara ni agasimba gato baroba nijoro kareshya milimetero ziri hagati ya 13--25 mu burebure. Inda yayo irangiye, ikayiha isa n'amafi. Ibishya byera, ariko uko ikura ikagira ibara ryijimye kandi ribonera cyane uko ikura. Ifite nka maboko abyiri maremare, hamwe hejuru yinda hagati ya cerci. Ifite kandi amaso abiri mato, nubwo izindi za Zygentoma zidafite amaso rwose, mu muryango wa Nicoletiidae. "}
{"id": "16899", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16899", "title": "Gina Din-Kariuki", "text": "Gina Din-Kariuki (wavutse Gina Din, ku ya 23 Ukwakira 1961) ni umucuruzi w\u2019umunyakenya w\u2019inzobere mu itumanaho n\u2019ububanyi n\u2019abaturage muri Kenya. Azwi cyane nk'uwashinze akaba n'umuyobozi mukuru wa Gina Din Corporate Communications, yatangiye nyuma yo kuva ku mirimo ye nk'umuyobozi ushinzwe itumanaho muri Barclays Bank of Kenya mu 1997."}
{"id": "16900", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16900", "title": "Nkechi Harry Ngonadi", "text": "Nkechi Harry Ngonadi numugore wibice byinshi numuyobozi winganda watsinze - rwiyemezamirimo, umuvugizi ushishikaza, umuderi, numuyobozi mukuru wa NHN Couture. Yatangiye bwa mbere kandi yitabwaho cyane mu bucuruzi bw'imyambarire n'ijambo rye - Kugarura ikinyabupfura kuri Fashion, hamwe n'ikirango cye NHN Couture.\nUbuzima bwa mbere.\nDr. Nkechi Harry Ngonadi yavutse ku ya 18 Ugushyingo 1975, akurira mu mujyi wa kera kandi mwiza wa Zaria muri Leta ya Kaduna, ari naho yabaga ubuzima bwe bwose. Yize muri kaminuza izwi cyane ya Ahmadu Bello, aho yize igenamigambi ry\u2019imijyi n\u2019akarere none, uyu munsi yashakanye n\u2019abasirikare bakuru - Rear Admiral Harry Ngonadi. Ubukwe buhiriwe nabana babiri batangaje.\nUmwitozo.\nDr. Nkechi Harry Ngonadi ni rwiyemezamirimo, umuvugizi wemewe, umujyanama w\u2019ubukwe wemewe, umuyobozi w\u2019ubwami akaba n\u2019umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019imyambarire - NHN Couture.\nNHN Couture ni ikirango kidasanzwe kandi kidasanzwe gishyigikira cyane imyambarire idakwiye mu nganda zerekana imideli. Ibitabo byinshi byayoboye byashimye Dr. Nkechi Harry Ngonadi kuba yarahinduye inkuru; iki gikorwa cyubutwari nticyabonye gusa ikirango cya NHN kizamuka hejuru ahubwo cyanakemuye itandukaniro riri hagati yimyambarire no kwizera kwa gikristo.\nMuri Werurwe 2019, Dr. Nkechi Harry-Ngonadi yarangije amasomo ajyanye no KUGARAGAZA MU RUHAME RW'IMVUGO N'UBUHANZI BUKURIKIRA MU MASHURI MPUZAMAHANGA YO GUSHYIKIRANA DUBAI. Ukuboza 2019, yahawe igihembo cyumuganga wicyubahiro wa PHILOSOPHI MU BUYOBOZI BWA STYLE NA FASHION na UNIVERSITY ESCAE-BENIN. MUTARAMA 2023, YUZUYE ABAGORE MU MASOMO YEMEZO MU BUYOBOZI MU ISHURI RYA YALE UNIVERSITY RY'UBUYOBOZI."}
{"id": "16901", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16901", "title": "Obianuju Helen Okoye", "text": "Dr. Obianuju Helen Okoye ni rwiyemezamirimo, umuganga, inzobere m'ubucuruzi muri Chicago. Ni umuyobozi mukuru akaba na perezida w\u2019ikigo mpuzamahanga ngishwanama gitanga ubufasha bw'ikoranabuhanga kubigo nderabuzima n\u2019amasosiyete yubucuruzi. \nAmashuri.\nDr. Obianuju Helen Okoye afite impamyabumenyi y'ubuvuzi (MD), MBA mu micungire y\u2019ubuzima, na master muri Epidemiology / Ubuzima rusange. Ni n'Ikigo cy'igihugu gishinzwe ubuzima (NIH) Muganga w\u2019ubuvuzi n\u2019ubushakashatsi. Afite uburambe bwubushakashatsi bwamavuriro kandi yerekanye mu nama z\u2019ubuvuzi zo muri Amerika ndetse n\u2019amahanga."}
{"id": "16902", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16902", "title": "Emelienne Nyiramana", "text": "Emelienne Nyiramana ni we washinze kandi akaba n'umujyanama wa Koperative de Couture de Kicukiro (Cocoki), koperative idoda y'abagore 29 iherereye i Kicukiro, mu Rwanda.\nNi umwe mu bafatanyabikorwa babiri b'abanyabukorikori ba Indego Afurika berekeje muri Amerika muri Kamena mu rugendo rw\u2019abanyabukorikori 2013, ubuyobozi, uburezi, ndetse na gahunda yo guhuza abaturage ku bayobozi b'abagore bakizamuka baturutse mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "16903", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16903", "title": "Kelvin Macharia Kuria", "text": "Kelvin Macharia Kuria afite imyaka 32 rwiyemezamirimo ukiri muto ufite uburambe burenze imyaka 10 nubuhanga mubucuruzi bushya bwo gucunga umutekano. Kugeza ubu, Kelvin ni we washinze SUNRISE TRACKING, akaba n'umuyobozi mukuru, isosiyete itanga ibisubizo nyabyo kandi bishya by\u2019umutekano ku binyabiziga ndetse n\u2019inyubako nka; ibicuruzwa bikurikirana imodoka, sisitemu yo gucunga lisansi / kugenzura, kugenzura CCTV, nibicuruzwa biometrike. Inshingano ye nyamukuru yibanze ku guhanga udushya, gushushanya ibicuruzwa na serivisi z'umutekano ndetse no gucunga imikorere rusange ya Sunrise Tracking. Niwe kandi washinze Sunrise Innovations Limited isosiyete ikora udushya kabuhariwe mu guhanga udushya nka TV TV ya Android, Drone, hamwe nuburyo bwose bwo gukemura software.\nKelvin ni umunyeshuri wiga mu cyiciro cya mbere cya kaminuza akurikirana impamyabumenyi y\u2019ubucuruzi yakuye muri kaminuza ya Nairobi. Ni Intiti ku Isi munsi ya (GSP-2011) mu kwihangira imirimo no kuyobora kuva muri Afurika y'Ubuyobozi bwa Afurika muri Afurika y'Epfo, kikaba aricyo kigo kizwi cyane muri Afurika gishaka guhindura Afurika mu kumenya, guteza imbere, no guhuza Abayobozi b'ejo hazaza. Mu mwaka wa 2015 yakoze inzira y\u2019ubucuruzi no kwihangira imirimo muri Dartmouth College, kimwe mu bigo bya IVY League muri Amerika nkumuyobozi w\u2019umunyafurika ukiri muto uyobowe na Mandela Washington Fellowship (YALI) gahunda y\u2019ibendera ryakozwe na Perezida wa 44 wa Leta zunze ubumwe za Amerika, Barack Obama."}
{"id": "16904", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16904", "title": "Magatte Wade", "text": "Magatte Wade ni rwiyemezamirimo udasanzwe, umuvugizi utera inkunga, n'umuyobozi w'ubucuruzi ufite icyerekezo ufite ishyaka ryo guteza impinduka nziza muri Afurika. Niwe washinze kandi akaba n'umuyobozi mukuru wa SkinIsSkin.com, \u201camavuta yo kwisiga afite ubutumwa,\u201d kandi yitangiye kugabanya ivangura rishingiye ku moko mu gihe aharanira imirimo n'iterambere mu gihugu cye cya Senegali.\nMagatte Wade yavukiye muri Senegali, yize mu Bufaransa, kandi yatangije umwuga we wo kwihangira imirimo i San Francisco. Avuga neza, kandi akora ubucuruzi muri, Wolof, Igifaransa, n'Icyongereza.\nYatangije imishinga myinshi, harimo Adina Isi Ibinyobwa na Tiossan, umurongo wohejuru wo kwita ku ruhu umurongo ushingiye ku basangwabutaka Ibisobanuro bya Senegali."}
{"id": "16905", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16905", "title": "Banki y'Isi", "text": "Banki y'isi ni kigo mpuzamahanga cy'imari gitanga inguzanyo n'inkunga kuri guverinoma z'ibihugu bikennye kandi biciriritse hagamijwe gukurikirana imishinga y'ishoramari. Banki y'isi ni izina rusange rya Banki mpuzamahanga ishinzwe iyubaka n'iterambere izwi IBRD) n'ishyirahamwe mpuzamahanga rishinzwe iterambere (izwi IDA), imiryango ibiri mu miryango itanu iri mpuzamahanga ifitwe n'itsinda rya Banki y'Isi. Yashinzwe hamwe n\u2019ikigega mpuzamahanga cy\u2019imari mu nama ya Bretton Woods yo muri 1944. Nyuma yo gutangira buhoro, inguzanyo yayo ya mbere yari iy'Ubufaransa muri 1947. Mu myaka ya za mirongo 70, yibanze ku nguzanyo ku bihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere, biva kuri ubwo butumwa mu myaka ya za mirongo 1980. Mu myaka 30 ishize, yashyizemo imiryango itegamiye kuri leta n\u2019amatsinda y\u2019ibidukikije mu nshingano z\u2019inguzanyo. Ingamba z\u2019inguzanyo ziterwa n\u2019intego z\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye urebye zigamije iterambere rirambye, ndetse n\u2019ibidukikije ndetse n\u2019imibereho myiza.\nItsinda rya Banki y'Isi.\nItsinda rya Banki y'Isi ni umuryango mugari w\u2019i miryango itanu iri mpuzamahanga, n\u2019umuryango w\u2019ababyeyi wa Banki yisi, izina rusange ryahawe imiryango ibiri ya mbere yashyizwe ku rutonde, ni IBRD na IDA:\nAmateka.\nBanki y'isi yashinzwe mu nama yo muri Bretton Woods yo muri 1944, hamwe n'ikigega mpuzamahanga cy'imari (IMF). Perezida wa Banki y'Isi asanzwe ari Umunyamerika. Banki y'isi hamwe na IMF byombi bifite icyicaro i Washington, DC, kandi bigakorana cyane.\nNubwo ibihugu byinshi byari bihagarariwe mu nama ya Bretton Woods, Amerika n\u2019Ubwongereza nibyo bikomeye byitabiriye kandi byari byiganje mu mishyikirano.:\u200a52\u201354\u200aIcyari kigamijwe gushingwa Banki y'Isi kwari ugutanga inguzanyo z'agateganyo mu bihugu bikennye bidashobora kubona inguzanyo mu bucuruzi. Banki irashobora kandi gutanga inguzanyo no gusaba ivugurura rya politiki kubahawe. \nCOVID-19 Icyorezo.\nMuri Nzeri 2020 hari cyorezo cya COVID-19, Banki y'Isi yatangaje muri gahunda ya miliyari 12 z'amadolari yo guha ibihugu byinjiza amafaranga make kandi yo hagati y'urukingo rumaze kwemezwa. Muri Kamena 2022, banki yatangaje ko miliyari 10.1 z'amadorali y'amerika, zatanzwe mu guha ibihugu 78 urukingo. "}
{"id": "16906", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16906", "title": "Farm Yard Rwanda", "text": "Farm\u00a0 Yard Rwanda LTD ni ubuhinzi bwu Rwanda bwahariwe umusaruro wibigori na chili.\nIMANIRABARUTA HONORE, ni agronome winjiye mu buhinzi bwibigori na Chili, akaba arinawe washinze FARM YARD RWANDA LTD. Mbere yo gutangira uyu mushinga, nagize igihe gito muri Horizon Sopyrwa mu 2013, aho yasanze afite ishyaka ryinshi mu buhinzi maze ahitamo kureka gukurikirana inzozi zee. yatangiye guhinga umusaruro utandukanye wubuhinzi bwimbuto mbere yuko amaherezo njya mubuhinzi bwibigori na Chili kuko namenye ko hari icyuho gikomeye kumasoko yisi yose."}
{"id": "16907", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16907", "title": "Ubusitani bwa Keyhole", "text": "Ubusitani bw'urufunguzo bufite ubuso bwa metero ebyiri z'ubugari zizengurutswe n'ubusitani bufite ishusho imeze nk'urufunguzo. kwaguka kwayo bituma abarimyi bongeramo ibisigazwa byimboga bidatetse, n'ifumbire mu duseke tw'ifumbire tuba turi hagati mu murima. Muri ubu buryo, ifumbire mvaruganda ishobora kongerwaho mu giseke mu gihe cyo guhinga kugirango itange intungamubiri kubihingwa. Igice cyo hejuru cy'ubutaka cyegeranijwe hejuru yigitebo cyo hagati kugirango ubutaka bugabanuke buhoro buhoro kuva hagati kugera kumpande. Ubusitani bwinshi bwibanze buzamuka nko muri metero imwe hejuru y'ubutaka kandi bufite inkuta zikozwe mu mabuye. Urukuta rw'amabuye ntiruha ubusitani gusa, ahubwo rufasha nk'umuzenguruko w'umutego w'umurima. Ubusitani bwa Keyhole bwatangiriye muri Lesotho kandi buhujwe neza nubutaka bwumutse n'ubutayu. Muri Afurika, bashyizwe hafi y'igikoni kandi bagakoreshwa mu kuzamura icyatsi kibabi nka salitusi, kale, na epinari; ibyatsi; n'ibihingwa by'imizi nk'igitunguru, tungurusumu, karoti, na beterave. Ubusitani bwa Keyhole ni byiza guhingwa cyane, tekinike ibimera bishyirwa hamwe kugirango umusaruro wiyongere. Ibimera bifite sisitemu yagutse cyane nkinyanya na zucchini ntibishobora gukora neza mumurima wurufunguzo.\nUbusitani bw'urufunguzo bwatejwe imbere muri Lesotho n'itsiinda rishinzwe umutekano w\u2019ibiribwa muri Afurika yepfo (C-SAFE), bushingiye ku gishushanyo gikomoka muri CARE mu gihugu cya Zimbabwe. Mu myaka ya za 1990 hagati, Lesotho yari kimwe mu bihugu bifite umubare munini wabanduye SIDA ku isi. C-SAFE yateguye ubusitani bwurufunguzo kubantu barwaye sida cyangwa abandi bataribashoboye kwita cyangwa gutegura ubusitani gakondo busanzwe. Ni burebure bihagije ku buryo abantu batagomba kunama mu gihe barimo kubukorera, burakomeye bihagije kuburyo umuntu ufite intege nke ashobora kubwishingikiriza cyangwa ku bwegamaho mu gihe arimo kuhakora, kandi ni hatoya kuburyo bwose umuntu yabugezaho ikiganza. Ubusitani bwubatswe hifashishijwe ifumbire mvaruganda, ifumbire y'imborera, ivu ryibiti nibindi bikoresho bikungahaye ku ntungamubiri ku buryo bitanga umusaruro kuruta ubusitani bwinshi bwo murugo; bafashe amazi bayayoborayo bigatuma amapfa adashobora kubuhangara. Inkuta zishobora gukorwa mu mabuye asanzwe yatoraguwe mu murima, kuri bariyeri, amatafari, cyangwa ibikoresho byose bikomeye ku buryo byafatwa mu butaka. Amazi meza akoreshwa mu gihe cyo kuvomera ibihingwa hejuru, mu gihe amazi yo mu rugo asukwa mu miseke y'ifumbire.\nMu gihe ubu busitani bwagenewe abantu bari barembye cyane ku buryo batashoborga kwitunganyiriza ubusitani gakondo, kubera ko bwatangaga umusaruro ukwiriye, abantu bafite ubuzima bwiza batangiye kubaka nk'uturima tw'igikoni. Hano umuryango ushobora guhinga ibihingwa bifite agaciro kanini ukoresheje gutera ingemwe. Mu kurangiza, C-SAFE yafashije kubaka ubusitani bw\u2019ibanze burenga 20.000, kandi ubwo bagarukaga nyuma yimyaka ibiri, abarenga 90% baracyabukoresha uyu munsi, ubusitani bw\u2019imfunguzo buboneka ahantu henshi muri Afurika, harimo Etiyopiya, u Rwanda, Kenya, Sudani, na Nijeriya.\u00a0\nUbusitani bukozwe mu buryo bwa Afurika bwubatswe mu mujyi wa Texas n'ahandi hatandukanye muri Amerika. Ishyirahamwe rya Texas \"Master Gardeners Association\" ryashyizeho amahugurwa menshi yo kubateza imbere. Bahinduye igishushanyo mbonera, bagendeye ku bipimo shingiro aho umurima wa metero 6 z'ubugari hamwe n'umuyoboro wa santimetero 12 bikozwe mu ruzitiro rw'urukwavu cyangwa insinga z'inkoko ku gitebo cy'ifumbire. Birasanzwe muri Texas kongeramo inyo zitukura zo mu bwoko bwa wiggler mu gitebo nazo zigashyirwa mu gitebo cy'ifumbire mvaruganda kugirango ifashe kumena ibintu kama.\u00a0 Inyito y'ubusitani bwa keyhole\" ni nayo ikoreshwa mu buhinzi bwimbuto kugirango dusobanure uburiri bwubusitani bwashyizwemo inzira imwe cyangwa nyinshi aho gukomeza, kugirango hagabanuke ubuso bwinzira. Ubusitani bwa permaculture ubusitani bukunda kuba bwagutse kandi bushimishije kuruta ubwoko bwa Afrika kandi ntibusanzwe burimo agaseke k'ifumbire cyangwa ikirundo cy'ifumbire yubatswe muburiri. Ibitanda birebire birimo ifumbire mvaruganda byitwa \"uruziga rw'igitoki\" n'abashinzwe ubuhinzi."}
{"id": "16908", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16908", "title": "Nairobi Java House (Resitora)", "text": "Inzu ya Java (yahoze yitwa Nairobi Java House) ni uruhererekane rw'amazu atunganya ikawa ifite icyicaro gikuru cyayo ahitwa ABC Place ni mu mujyi wa Nairobi mu gihugu cya Kenya, yashinzwe mu mwaka wa 1999 ishingwa na Kevin Ashley afatanyije na Jon Wagner. Ni hamwe mu hantu umuntu ashobora gusanga \"ibicuruzwa byiza byoherezwa mu mahanga\" ikawa ikomoka mu gihugu cya Kenya itetse ndetse inagaburwa mu karere. \nGuhera kuri cafe ya mbere iherereye muri Arcade ya Adam kumuhanda wa Ngong yafunguwe mu mwaka wa 1999, Java House imaze kugera ahantu hatandukanye hangana na 68 mu bihuguu bitandukanye bigize Afurika y'uburasirazuba nkuko byatangajwe mu kwezi kwa Ugushyingo mu mwaka wa 2018. Ikirangantego cya Java kandi ni nyiri uruhererekane rwa pizza rwo mu Butaliyani rwitwa 360 Degrees Pizza ndetse nubwa mbere muri Afurika y'uburasirazuba bwikorera ubucuruzi bwa yogurt zikonje, Planet Yogurt. \nImiyoborere rusange.\nAbayobozi Bakuru Bacyuye igihe.\nKevin Ashley (2010\u20132016)\nKen Kuguru (2016\u20132018)\nPaul Smith (2018 - Kugeza ubu)"}
{"id": "16909", "revid": "11200", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16909", "title": "Autonov 1", "text": "Autonov 1 nizina ryahawe ikinyabiziga cyakozwe mu gihe cyo mu myaka ya za 1970, mu gukora moteri yimodoka isanzwe ikaba ibasha gukora mu byerekezo by'imbere n'inyuma, ikoresheje ibikoresho bine byose byabanje kubaho mu byerekezo. Ikinyabiziga cya kabiri cyatangijwe inyuma, hamwe n'intebe yo kuzenguruka hagati kugirango ikore mu mwanya wa shoferi.\nIntego yo kurema.\nUwayihimbye, yari umwarimu mu buhanga bw'ubukorikori nyakwigendera, Ayodele Awojobi, yatekereje ku nyungu z\u2019ivumburwa mu bihe nk'igihe ikinyabiziga gifite moteri cyakwifashisha kijya imbere mu ruhago kandi kigomba gukora umwihariko mu kwihuta aho cyaba kiri gusubira inyuma. Uburyo bwo kwimuka byihutirwa cyangwa ibihe by'intambara birabigaragaza.\nIpatanti n'ibisobanuro.\nIpatanti yo guhimba ntiyigeze iboneka mbere yuko uwahimbye yahuye n'urupfu rutunguranye. iIjipe yo mu bwoko bwa \"Layland\" yari yaratawe niyo yakoreshejwe mu kuvumbura kandi kugeza na nubu, yerekanwa mu ishami ry\u2019ubuhanga mu bukorikori, rya kaminuza ya Lagos mu cyumweru cyahariwe kwizihiza ishami ry\u2019ubuhanga mu bukorikori. Ahanini igizwe na jip, hamwe na tekinike ya kabiri yo gutwara yubatswe ku mpera ahagana inyuma ihuza umurongo. Ibikoresho byo guhinduranya vitesi nabyo byubatswe hano bihuza, binyuze mu buryo bwubatswe, hamwe n'ibikoresho bine byari bisanzweho, ku buryo ibinyabiziga bivangavanze bishobora gutwarwa hifashishijwe muyobora enye zose uko ari enye, haba imbere cyangwa inyuma. Igice cyo hagati cya jeep cyongeye gushyirwaho kugirango habeho uburyo bwo kuzenguruka bushobora guhinduranya umuntu utuye ku ntebe yinyuma, kugeza imbere.\nMugihe gito cyo kuyisenya igice-ifunguro, ubumenyi burambuye buganisha ku buryo bwateguwe ntabwo buzwi kuko nta gishushanyo cyangwa igishushanyo mbonera kizwi ko cyaba cyarabayeho."}
{"id": "16910", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16910", "title": "Firigo ya inkono-mu-nkono", "text": "Firigo ya inkono-mu-nkono, Akungo gakonjesha gakozwe mu ibumba cyangwa zeer (Arabic) ni igikoresho cyo gukonjesha hifashishijwe umwuka utumaka, ni igikoresho kidakoresha amashanyarazi. Ikoresha inkono y'ibumba yo hanze (itondekanye n'umucanga utose) igizwe n'inkono y'imbere (ishobora guhomwa kugirango wirinde kwinjira kw'amazi) mu gihe ibiryo bishyizwemo. Gutumuka kw'amazi yo hanze akuramo ubushyuhe mu nkono y'imbere. Igikoresho gishobora gukonjesha ikintu icyo aricyo cyose, kandi gisaba gusa gutembera kwumuyaga wumye ugereranije n'isoko y'amazi.\nAmateka.\nInkono nyinshi z'ibumba zabayeho kuva mu mwaka wa 3000 mbere ya Yesu zavumbuwe \"mu mico ya Indus\" kandi zifatwa nkizakoreshejwe mugukonjesha no kubika amazi. Inkono za none zisa na \"ghara\" ya none na \"matki\" ikoreshwa mu buhinde na Pakisitani. \nHariho ibimenyetso byerekana ko gukonjesha hifashishijwe guhumeka cyangwa gutmuka kw'umwuka bishobora kuba byarakoreshejwe muri Afrika ya ruguru hakiri kare \"ubwami bwa kera\" bwa Egiputa, ahagana mu mwaka wa 2500 mbere ya Yesu. Frescoes yerekana imbata cyangwa abacakara bateruye ibibindi by'amazi, byongera umuvuduko w'umwuka uzengurutse ibibindi binini kugirango bifashe guhumeka no gukonjesha ibirimo. Ibibindi bibaho no muri iki gihe kandi byitwa \"zeer\", niyo mpamvu izina rya firimu ikonjesha. Nubwo yatejwe imbere muri Afurika y'Amajyaruguru, aho ikoranabuhanga ryasaga nkaho ryibagiranye kuva haza firigo ikozwe hifashijwe ikoranabuhanga rya kijyambere.\nNyamara, mu duce tugize Ubuhinde harimo, ghara, matka na surahi, byose ni ubwoko butandukanye bw'ibikono byamazi bikozwe mu ibumba, bikoreshwa buri munsi kugirango amazi akonje. Muri Espagne, \"botijos\" irazwi. Botijo n'igikoresho cy'ibumba gikoreshwa mu kubika no gukonjesha amazi; zimaze ibinyejana byinshi zikoreshwa kandi ziracyakoreshwa cyane. Botijos itoneshwa cyane n'ikirere gito cya Mediterane; mu gace, ingaruka zo gukonjesha zizwi nka \"ingaruka ya botijo\". \nMu myaka ya za 1890, abacukuzi ba zahabu bo mu gihugu cya Ositaraliya bateje imbere \"umutekano wa Coolgardie\", bashingiye ku mahame amwe.\nMu gace k'icyaro cyo mu majyaruguru ya Nijeriya mu myaka ya za 1990, Mohamed Bah Abba yateguye uburyo bwo kubika inkono-mu-nkono, igizwe n'inkono ntoya y'ibumba yashyizwe imbere ndetse n'iyindi nini, n'umwanya uri hagati yazo zombi wuzuye umucanga utoshye. Inkono y'imbere yuzuyemo imbuto, imboga cyangwa ibinyobwa bidasembuye kandi bitwikiriye umwenda utose. Abba ukomoka mu muryango w'ababumba inkono, yakoresheje abakozi benshi baho badafite akazi kandi ndetse ahangira akazi ababumba inkono kabuhariwe kugira ngo babyaze umusaruro icyiciro cya mbere cy\u2019ibibumbano 5.000 by'inkono-mu-nkono. Yabonye igihembo cya Rolex cya Enterprises mu mwaka wa 2001 kandi yakoresheje igihembo cye cyari gifite agaciro k'amadorali 75.000 kugirango iki gihangano kiboneke muri Nijeriya. Abba yateguye ubukangurambaga bugamije ubuzima bw\u2019imidugudu n\u2019abaturage batazi gusoma no kwandika bagaragaza umukino wafashwe amajwi n\u2019abakinnyi baho kugirango bagaragaze ibyiza bya firigo yo mu butayu. Inkono zigurishwa amafaranga y'amasenti 40 yo muri Amerika. \nNyuma yo gutambuka kw'ikinyagihumbi, imiryango myinshi itandukanye itegamiye kuri leta ikora ku rwego mpuzamahanga yatangiye gukora ku mushinga w'ikwirakwizwa ry\u2019ikoranabuhanga mu bihugu bitandukanye bya Afurika: Igikorwa gifatika muri Sudani, Ubumuntu bwa mbere muri Gambiya na Mouvement e. V. muri Burkina Faso. \nUbushakashatsi bwagutse nabwo bwakorewe mu gihugu cya Mali bukozwe na D-Lab, ku bufatanye n\u2019ikigo gishinzwe imboga ku isi. \nImyubakire.\n\"Zer\" yubatswe mu buryo bwo gushyira inkono y'ibumba mu nkono nini y'ibumba hamwe n'umusenyi utose hagati yinkono n'igitambaro gitose hejuru. \nIgikoresho gikonjesha mu gihe amazi atumutse, bigatuma hakonjeshwa mu bihe bishyushye kandi byumye. Igomba gushyirwa ahantu humye, ihumeka kugirango amazi azimye neza yerekeza hanze. Imashini zikonjesha zikunda gukora nabi cyangwa ntizikore na gato mu kirere gifite ubuhehere bukabije bw\u2019ibidukikije, kubera ko amazi adashobora gutumuka neza muri ibi bihe biba bigizwe n'ubuhehere bwinshi.\nNiba hari urwego rutandukanijwe rutabasha guhinguranywa hagati y'ibiryo n'amasafuriya, amazi adashobora kunyobwa nk'amazi yo mu nyanja ashobora gukoreshwa mu gutwara ubukonje, atanduya ibiryo. Ibi ni ingirakamaro ahantu humye hafi y'inyanja aho amazi yo kunywa aba ari ibicuruzwa bike, kandi bishobora kugerwaho ukoresheje inkono ifite \"glaze(ibihomo by'ibishingwe) cyangwa\" bidafite amazi cyangwa sima ikoreshwa kurukuta rw'imbere aho ibiryo bibikwa.\nIgikorwa cyagutse gishoboka mu gihe inkono zishobora kuvoma amazi mu bubiko, nk'ikibindi cyumuyaga uhindagurika, cyangwa niba inkono zishyizwe mu bidendezi by'amazi. Umukandara ushobora gukoreshwa kugirango uhambire inkono y'imbere aho gukoresha umucanga kugirango wirinde kureremba.\nUbundi buryo bwo kubaka Inkono-mu-nkono harimo uburyo bwinshi butandukanye nka Pot-in-Dish. Mu gukora izifite ubushobozi bunini bwo kubika, ibyumba byo gukonjesha imyuka itumuka (ECCs) bishobora kubakwa bivuye mu matafari abiri yubatswe n'amatafari hamwe n'icyatsi. Amahame amwe n'amwe arakoreshwa. Amakuru arambuye ku bikoresho by'ubwubatsi n'uburyo mushobora kubisanga mu buyobozi bwiza bwa D-Lab. \nIngaruka.\nGukonjesha inkono-mu-nkono byagize ingaruka nyinshi ku baturage babikoresha birenze ubushobozi bworoshye bwo gukomeza kubika mu buryo burambye ibiryo bishya mugihe kirekire no kugabanya indwara ziterwa nibiribwa. \n\"Zeer\" igura hafi amafaranga y'amanaira 150akoreshwa mu gihugu cyaNijeriiya (hafi US$1.00 muri 2011) kugirango ikore muri Nijeriya, kandi bagurisha kuri naira 180-200 (US$1.20 kugeza US$1.30 muri 2011)."}
{"id": "16911", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16911", "title": "Imashini itonora Fonio", "text": "Imashini itonora fonio yahimbwe na Sanoussi Diakit\u00e9, umuhanga mu bukorikori bw'ubukanishi ukomoka muri Senegali. Diakit\u00e9 yahawe igihembo cya Rolex mu mwaka wa 1996 kubera iyo mashini yahimbye. \nFonio ni kimwe mu bihingwa by'ibanze muri Afrika y'uburengerazuba. Kuberako ibinyampeke bya fonio biba ari bito cyane, igikonjo cyacyo cyo hanze kiragoye kugikuramo. \"Mu myaka amagana yahise, abagore bo muri Afurika bakoze umurimo utoroshye wo gutegura igihingwa cya fonio bahura ndetse no gukubita ingano n'umucanga bivanze n'udukoko. Nyuma y'isaha imwe y'iki gikorwa kiruhije, ibiro bibiri gusa bya fonio nibyo byabashaga kuba birahari kugira ngo bikoreshwe kandi hakenewe byibuze litiro cumi n'eshanu z'amazi kugira ngo ukureho umucanga. \" Hamwe nubwo buvumbuzi inzira yose yagabanijweho aho yakuwe ku isaha 1 ubu ikagezwa ku murimo ukorwa mu minota 6.\nIgisubizo cya Diakit\u00e9 cyari ugutanga umusaruro ungana na igikoresho kikagenda kigabanya buhoro buhoro hejuru yimbuto mbere yo kunyura mu buryo buzunguruka, bukuraho ibishishwa. Imashini ishobora gukuramo umusaruro za fonio mu minota 8. \nIbihembo.\nIgikoresho cya Diakit\u00e9 ni urugero rw'ikoranabuhanga rikwiye ryavumbuwe mu gihe cyanyacyo, kubera ubushobozi bwaryo bwo gukemura ikibazo gikomeye mu bihugu biri mu nzira y'amajyambere ndetse n'ubworoherane gishobora kuba cyakorwa. Mu mwaka wa 2008, umurimo wa Diakit\u00e9 ni umwe mu mirimo itandukanye yatsindiye ibihembo bya Tech Awards mu cyiciro cy\u2019ubuzima. \nDiakit\u00e9 yahawe igihembo cyo guhanga udushya muri Afurika mu mwaka wa 2013. "}
{"id": "16912", "revid": "118354", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16912", "title": "Amoriguard", "text": "Amoriguard ni irangi rishingiye ku mazi hamwe n'ibyuzuzo bishingiye ku bisigazwa by'imyanda itunganyirizwa mu nganda. Ibara rifite ubwinshi bw'ibintu bya 70% bifata ingano byibuze ya 55% ukuyemo umugabane w'amazi. Ryahimbwe muri Afrika yepfo rihimbwa n'uwitwa Mulalo Doyoyo kandi yari afatanije na Ryan Purchase.\nIbintu biboneka mu irangi nkibimera bihindagurika, ammonia, formaldehyde, gur\u015f, alkyl phenol ethoxylate na glycol ni bike mu ngano cyangwa bikaba bitabonekamo. Ryakozwe hashingiwe ku kigero kiri munsi y'ubunini bwa pigment yibintu bivangiye (CPVC) bivuze ko icyuho kinini kiri hagati y'ibice bya pigment muri firime yumye cyuzuyemo ibice bikomeye bitandukanye ndetse n'umwuka uri muri ibyo bicuruzwa hejuru ya CPVC. Irangi ni hydrophobique na chimique -yirwanya. Amoriguard yiyemeje kandi kubungabunga Ibidukikije mu guteza imbere no kwamamaza ibicuruzwa by'imitako y'irangi hamwe na sisitemu zirambye kandi zitangiza ibidukikije."}
{"id": "16913", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16913", "title": "Ikigega cy'Imari Nyafurika", "text": "Ikigega cy'Imari Nyafurika [AMF] (mu icyongereza: Africa Monetary Fund) ni ikigo cy\u2019imari gitegurwa n\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019Afurika Yunze ubumwe, igihe nikigera inshingano zacyo zizoherezwa muri Banki Nkuru ya Afurika. Iki kigo ni kimwe mu bigo bitatu by\u2019imari by\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019Afurika (Mu icyongereza: African Central Bank) Bizaba bishingiye i Yaound\u00e9, muri Kameruni."}
{"id": "16914", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16914", "title": "Banki Nyafurika ishora imari", "text": "Banki nyafurika ishora imari (AIB) mu icyongereza: African Investment Bank) ni kimwe mu bigo bitatu by\u2019imari by\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019Afurika Yunze ubumwe (AU) hamwe n\u2019ikigega cy\u2019imari nyafurika na Banki nkuru y\u2019Afurika. Ifite icyicaro i Tripoli, muri Libiya.\nAmateka.\nInama ya Lome (2000) yemeje itegeko nshinga ry\u2019umuryango w\u2019, risobanura intego, amahame, n\u2019inzego za AU. Ibihugu 27 byo muri Afurika byashyize umukono kuri iki gikorwa, giteganya gushyiraho inzego zitandukanye, harimo n\u2019Inteko ishinga amategeko ya Pan-Afrika; Urukiko rw'Ubutabera; Banki Nkuru ya Afurika; Ikigega Nyafurika cy'Imari; na Banki Nyafurika ishora imari. Mu 2005, AU yakoresheje inama y\u2019inzobere zigenga i Addis Abeba, muri Etiyopiya, kugira ngo isuzume impapuro z\u2019ibitekerezo n\u2019umushinga w\u2019amasezerano yateguwe na komisiyo y\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019Afurika Yunze ubumwe (AUC) yerekeye izo nzego uko ari eshatu. AU kandi yagennye imyanya y'ibigo by'imari, Banki Nkuru Nyafurika (Nijeriya), Banki Nyafurika ishora imari (Libiya), n'ikigega cy'imari nyafurika (Afurika yo hagati)"}
{"id": "16915", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16915", "title": "BMCE Bank of Africa", "text": "BMCE ni banki yo muri Afrika ikorera ibihugu birenga 20 kumugabane.\nIngaruka ziteganijwe.\nIri shoramari rigamije gushyiraho ubufatanye burambye hagati ya CDC na BMCE, hagamijwe kugira uruhare mu iterambere ry\u2019ubukungu bwa Afurika. Ifite icyicaro muri Maroc kandi igera mu bihugu bimwe na bimwe bya Afurika bigoye cyane nka Burkina Faso na Madagasikari. Kwinjira muri banki no kubona imari mu bihugu byinshi bikorera muri BMCE, nko muri B\u00e9nin na Niger, bikomeje kuba bike cyane. Kubuzwa kubona imari bigabanya iterambere ryimiryango, abaturage nubukungu muri Afurika.\nIbidukikije n'imibereho.\nTwateje imbere gahunda y'ibikorwa by\u2019ibidukikije, imibereho myiza n\u2019ubucuruzi ku bufatanye na banki. Twafashije kandi gutangiza komite ishinzwe ibidukikije, imibereho myiza n\u2019imiyoborere (ESG) muri banki iyobora ingamba n\u2019imikorere ya ESG."}
{"id": "16916", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16916", "title": "Ishyirahamwe ryibigo byimari byiterambere rya Afrika", "text": "African Development Finance Institutions ni umuryango w\u2019umuryango w\u2019ibigo by\u2019imari by\u2019iterambere muri Afurika, washinzwe na Banki nyafurika itsura amajyambere mu 1975.\nAmateka.\nInama ya mbere y\u2019abayobozi b\u2019amabanki y\u2019iterambere ry\u2019Afurika yateranye muri Kanama 1969 i Freetown, muri Repubulika ya Siyera Lewone. Intego y\u2019inama, yatumijwe na Banki nyafurika ishinzwe iterambere (ADB), kwari ukumenya ibitekerezo byabo ku buryo n\u2019uburyo bwo gushimangira ubufatanye hagati y\u2019ibigo byabo na Banki.\nIzindi nama zabereye i Abidjan muri Gicurasi 1970 kandi zitabiriwe n\u2019abahagarariye Banki zishinzwe iterambere z\u2019ibihugu 23 by\u2019Afurika ndetse n\u2019intumwa z\u2019inzego z\u2019akarere, nka Banki y\u2019iterambere ry\u2019Afurika y\u2019iburasirazuba na Union Africaine et Malgache des Banques de D\u00e9veloppement. Abahagarariye amabanki mpuzamahanga atandukanye ndetse n\u2019ibindi bigo by\u2019imari na bo bitabiriye iyo nama, baganiriye ku bibazo byinshi bijyanye n\u2019imitunganyirize, imicungire n\u2019imikoreshereze y\u2019amabanki y\u2019iterambere ry\u2019igihugu.\nIbyavuye mu nama yabereye Abidjan kuva ku ya 4 kugeza ku ya 7 Werurwe 1975 ni ishyirwaho ry\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019ibigo by\u2019imari n\u2019iterambere ry\u2019Afurika (AADFI) riyobowe na Banki nyafurika itsura amajyambere. Ishyirwaho ry\u2019ishyirahamwe ryujuje ibyifuzo byo guhuza umugabane wose n\u2019ubufatanye mu bukungu. Inteko yo gutangiza yabereye i Abidjan yashyizeho komite ishinzwe guhuza no kurangiza ibyangombwa byemewe n\u2019ishyirahamwe. Izi zemejwe n'Inteko rusange ya mbere y\u2019ishyirahamwe, yateranye kubera iyo ntego i Dakar, muri Senegali, ku ya 2 na 3 Gicurasi.\nIbikorwa.\nIbikorwa by'ingenzi bya AADFI ni ugutanga amakuru n'amahugurwa mu buhanga bwa banki n'imari ndetse n'inama za politiki z'iterambere ku banyamabanki bo muri Afurika ndetse n'abashinzwe imari."}
{"id": "16917", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16917", "title": "Inganda 6 zambere zo gushoramo imari muri Afrika", "text": "Afurika ni rimwe mu masoko azamuka cyane. Ubukungu bw'inganda na demokarasi bwarazamutse mu Ibihugu nka Nijeriya, Angola, na Afurika y'Epfo birahura n'iterambere ritangaje mu bijyanye n'amafaranga yinjira mu bukungu mu gihe akora muri izo nganda n'imirenge. Ubuhinzi, itumanaho, amabanki, ibikorwa remezo, na peteroli na gaze ni zimwe mu nzego ziyongera cyane.\niterambere rya Afurika rirashimishije, riratandukanye mubihugu no mumirenge. Muri iyi blog, hasuzumwa ibishoboka mu nganda nke. Abanyafurika bagera kuri miliyoni 200 binjiye mu rwego rw'amabanki n'itumanaho. Rero, byongereye cyane igipimo cyo gukura.\nAfurika ifite kimwe cya kane cyubutaka bwahinzwe kwisi. Kandi ibyo sibyo byose. Ibihugu 11 by'Afurika biza mu masoko icumi ya mbere byibuze umutungo umwe. Abahanga bavuga ko amahirwe yo gushora imari muri Afurika rero, atanga icyizere.\nKubera ko ubukungu bwa Afurika bwateye imbere ku muvuduko ukabije, habaye impinduka zikomeye ziva mu bucukuzi bw'amabuye y'agaciro n'ubuhinzi zijya mu zindi nganda nk'ibicuruzwa byinshi, ubucuruzi bw\u2019ibicuruzwa, ubukerarugendo, n'itumanaho. Umugabane watangiye kuva mu bukungu gakondo ujya mu bukungu bushingiye ku bumenyi, aho ikoranabuhanga rya sisitemu, eCommerce, amabanki, n\u2019izindi serivisi bizagira uruhare runini mu gihe kiri imbere.\nUrwego rwa banki n\u2019imari.\nUrwego rw'amabanki rwabonye iterambere ryihuse muri iyi myaka mike. Yahindutse kuba itara ryiburengerazuba rijya mu gihagararo cyashyizweho, kigira uruhare runini mu bukungu bwa Afurika bwaguka. Urwego rwa banki n\u2019imari rwabaye isoko yingenzi yakazi kubanyafurika nubucuruzi bwubwoko bwose. Ku bashoramari b'abanyamahanga, uru rwego rutanga amahirwe atanga icyizere. \nUrwegoItumanaho n'amakuru &amp; Ikoranabuhanga (I.T.).\nUru rwego rwabonye impinduka zikomeye zitera Afurika kubona ubukungu bushya. Inganda zitumanaho n\u2019ikoranabuhanga mu itumanaho zimaze guhatanwa cyane, bituma habaho ibidukikije aho ibyiza gusa bibaho. Kuri uyu mugabane hari abafatabuguzi ba terefone barenga miliyoni 400. Kubera iyo mpamvu, byatumye bishoboka ko abacuruzi bo kumurongo batera imbere kandi bakitwara neza muri niche yabo. Hamwe n\u2019ibisabwa bigenda byiyongera mu rwego rwitumanaho, amafaranga nayo arimo kuyashyiramo.\nInganda zitwara abantu n'ibikoresho.\nMu myaka yashize, guverinoma nyafurika yashora imari mu bikorwa remezo byo gutwara abantu bigezweho kandi byuzuye. Inyinshi muri izo mbaraga zatewe inkunga zigamije gushimangira iterambere ry\u2019ubukungu ryagutse. Hamwe nigihugu cyambere gitanga ibikoresho nka Transnet, Spoornet, Portnet, AutoNet, nibindi byinshi, umugabane utanga serivisi zitangwa nabakinnyi bakomeye. Kurugero, South African Airways (SAA), leta itwara indege yigihugu ya leta, itanga serivisi zo gutwara abantu no kohereza ibicuruzwa ahantu hasaga 700 kwisi. Nubwo SAA na Transnet biganje mu nganda, muri Afurika hari amahirwe menshi y\u2019ubucuruzi mpuzamahanga ndetse n\u2019ibanze. Byongeye kandi, isoko irashobora korohereza abandi bashoramari bose baboneka kandi bashimishijwe.\nInganda zicukura amabuye y'agaciro.\nInganda z\u2019amabuye y'agaciro zahagaze mu gihe gito mu 2015. Ubushobozi budakoreshwa muri uru rwego bwagiye butandukana na gahunda za leta zo kuzamura umusanzu wa GDP kugera kuri 30% mu myaka 15 iri imbere. Muri Afurika, Gabon n\u2019umwanya wa kane ku isi mu gukora manganese ku isi, ikaba ifite ububiko bwa toni miliyoni 150 n\u2019umusaruro wa toni miliyoni 1.8 mu 2015. Iki gihugu gifite toni zirenga miliyari 2 z\u2019amabuye y\u2019icyuma, toni zirenga 40 z\u2019ibigega bya zahabu byagaragaye, hamwe nubutaka butandukanye bwamabuye y'agaciro nka gur\u015f, zinc, umuringa, diyama, niobium, na titanium. Rero, itanga amahirwe yo gushora imari kubashoramari bo hanze. Haguruka IIP parike yinganda zinyuranye (GSEZ) itanga urubuga-rwerekana ejo hazaza mubukungu bwapiganwa cyane hamwe nabaturage bangana.\nUbuhinzi n\u2019inganda zitunganya ubuhinzi.\nMuri Afurika, ubuhinzi bwakomeje kuba urwego ruyoboye imyaka mirongo. Yaba ibikorwa byubukungu bijyanye n'ubuhinzi cyangwa isoko ry'ibicuruzwa bikomoka ku buhinzi, amahirwe yo gushora ni menshi. Byombi ubuhinzi rusange n\u2019inganda zitunganya ubuhinzi bifite imbaraga zidasanzwe zo gukura kandi domaine zombi zigira ingaruka ku buryo bugaragara. Benin, nk'urugero, ni rwo rutanga umusaruro mwinshi w'ibihingwa ngandurarugo kugira ngo ubukungu bwa Afurika bugabanuke. GDIZ ya Arise IIP itanga urubuga rushya rwinganda kubashoramari bo mumahanga binyuze mubufatanye bwa leta n'abikorera hagati ya Repubulika ya B\u00e9nin na Arise IIP.\nInganda zita ku buzima.\nInzego zita ku buzima n\u2019ubuvuzi ziteganijwe kuba zifite agaciro ka miliyari 3 z'amadolari, mu gihe imiti igezweho / imiti yatanzwe ishobora kuba ifite agaciro ka miliyari 1.7. Kugeza ubu, imiti irenga kuri konti ifite agaciro ka miliyoni 378 z'amadolari.\nUmubare w\u2019ibigo bikorerwamo ibya farumasi byiyongera bitanga imiti rusange, ayo masosiyete arashobora kubona ishoramari mu gihugu. N'ubundi kandi, 85% by'abatuye Afurika bashingira kuri serivisi z'ubuzima rusange. Rero, urashobora kwibwira ko abaturage bishimiye kwiyandikisha muri gahunda yubwishingizi bwubuzima bwigihugu kugirango babone imiti ihendutse nubuvuzi.\nUmwanzuro.\nMugihe inzego nka banki n\u2019imari zikomeje kuba ingenzi mu iterambere ry\u2019ubukungu bwa Afurika, ibyiciro bishya nka I.T. n'itumanaho bigenda bigira uruhare runini muri Afurika. Uretse ibyo, icyorezo cyongeye gushimangira ko ari ngombwa kuvugurura ubuvuzi n\u2019ibikoresho, amahirwe yo gukura ni ntarengwa. Bamwe mubandi bakinnyi bakora muri Afrika harimo urwego rwimitungo itimukanwa, inganda zerekana imideli, inganda z\u2019imodoka, n\u2019inganda z\u2019ubwishingizi. Noneho, niba uri umushoramari uzi ubwenge, ni amahirwe yawe ya zahabu yo kubona amahirwe munganda ziterambere rya Afrika byihuse."}
{"id": "16918", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16918", "title": "Ubuhanzi bwa Afurika", "text": "Ubuhanzi nyafurika (Mu icyongereza: Africa art) busobanura ibishushanyo bigezweho n'amateka, ibishushanyo, ibyubatswe, hamwe nundi muco ugaragara uhereye kubanyafurika kavukire cyangwa kavukire ndetse numugabane wa Afrika. Igisobanuro gishobora kandi kuba gikubiyemo ubuhanzi bwa diaspora nyafurika, nka: Abanyafurika-Abanyamerika, Karayibe cyangwa ubuhanzi mu bihugu byo muri Amerika yepfo byatewe n'imigenzo ya Afurika. Nuburyo butandukanye, hariho insanganyamatsiko zubuhanzi zihari iyo urebye ubwinshi bwumuco ugaragara kuva kumugabane wa Afrika\nUmubumbyi, ibyuma, ibishushanyo, ubwubatsi, ubuhanzi bwimyenda nubukorikori bwa fibre nuburyo bukomeye bwubuhanzi bugaragara muri Afrika kandi bushobora gushyirwa mubushakashatsi bwubuhanzi bwa Afrika. Ijambo \"ubuhanzi nyafurika\" ntabwo risanzwe rikubiyemo ubuhanzi bwakarere ka Afrika ya ruguru kuruhande rwinyanja ya Mediterane, kuko utwo turere twari tumaze igihe kinini mumigenzo itandukanye. Mu myaka irenga igihumbi, ibihangano by'uturere nk'ibyo byari bigize igice cy'ubuhanzi bwa Berber cyangwa Ubuyisilamu, nubwo bifite imiterere yihariye yaho"}
{"id": "16919", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16919", "title": "Ayateke Star Company", "text": "Ayateke Star Company ltd ni isosiyete y'amazi itanga amazi meza mu cyaro cy'u Rwanda, Afurika ndetse ikaba icunga ibikorwaremezo by\u2019amazi mu bice by\u2019icyaro."}
{"id": "16920", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16920", "title": "Nthabiseng Mosia", "text": "Nthabiseng Mosia ni umwe mu bashinze CFO (kimwe na CMO) ya Azimuth, izwi nka Easy Solar. Easy Solar ni uruganda rwunguka rufite intego yo gukora ingufu zitanga umuriro w'amashanyarazi y'izuba kubaturage badafite amashanyarazi muri Afurika y'iburengerazuba. Ubucuruzi bukwirakwiza kandi bugatera inkunga ibikoresho bihendutse, byujuje ubuziranenge bikomoka ku mirasire y'izuba ku bukode-ku-bushingiye ku ikorana buhanga rya Pay-As-You-Go. Icyitegererezo cyubucuruzi gishimangirwa nikirangantego cyizewe cyubakiye kuri serivise nziza zabakiriya hamwe numuyoboro wibikorwa byabaturage bigenda ibirometero byanyuma, kugirango izuba rigere kubakiriya benshi batagengwa na gride. Easy Solar kuri ubu ikorera muri Siyera Lewone, aho abarenga 87 ku ijana by'abaturage bayo miliyoni 7 babaho nta mashanyarazi kandi, mu cyaro, 1 ku ijana ni bo bafite. Kuva yatangira ibikorwa muri 2016, Easy Solar yahaye amashanyarazi abantu barenga 40.000 mugihugu.\nAbakozi.\nIsosiyete ifite abakozi 35 n'abakozi 40, ifite amanota yo kugurisha mu turere 8 two muri Siyera Lewone. Kugeza ubu, Easy Solar imaze gukusanya inkunga kuva nka, Acumen, Gaia Impact Fund, Cordaid, Ikigega Nyafurika gishinzwe ibibazo, MasterCard n'Ikigega cya SIMA.\nUburezi.\nMosia yavukiye muri Gana, nyuma yimukira muri Afurika y'Epfo. Nkumuyabaga rimwe na rimwe yahuye numuriro kubera amashanyarazi yizewe, byabanje kumushishikaza ingufu. Mosia yabonye impamyabumenyi y\u2019icyiciro cya kabiri cya siyansi y\u2019ubucuruzi mu bijyanye n\u2019imari n\u2019ubukungu yakuye muri kaminuza ya CapeTown, arangiza afite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya mbere kandi atandukana, nyuma akora nk'umujyanama mu micungire muri Afurika.\nMu mwaka wa 2016 yize icyiciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza cyibanze ku bijyanye n\u2019imari n\u2019ingengo y\u2019imari isukuye mu Ishuri Rikuru ry\u2019Imibereho Myiza n\u2019Imibereho Myiza y'Abaturage, Kaminuza ya Columbiya, aho yahuriye n\u2019abashinze Easy Solar, Eric Silverman na Alexandre Tourre."}
{"id": "16921", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16921", "title": "Oluwatobi Ajayi", "text": "Oluwatobi Ajayi, ni umwe mu bashinze kandi akaba n'umuyobozi mukuru wa Jetvan Automobiles Limited, umucuruzi ukomeye wa Mercedes-Benz Sprinter muri Nijeriya. Yatangiye umwuga we muri Mercedes-Benz Nigeriya aho yabaye Umuyobozi w\u2019ishami (vans zubucuruzi) afite imyaka 24. Mu 2015, yahuje itsinda ry\u2019abashoramari maze ashinga Jetvan igurisha imodoka zirenga 500 buri mwaka."}
{"id": "16922", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16922", "title": "Paul Kihiko", "text": "Paul Kihiko ni we washinze Wing It Nairobi, resitora ya mbere ya Kenya kandi yonyine amababa-gusa Serivise yihuse. Isoko ryayo rya mbere muri Galleria Shopping Mall muri Kenya ryagenze neza cyane kandi rikora imibare 6 buri mwaka. Umwaka ushize, Wing Yakusanyije $ 75.000 mu bashoramari babiri ku mugabane muto muri Kenya ya Dragons 'Den. Uyu mwaka, Kihiko yiteguye gufungura ibindi bicuruzwa."}
{"id": "16923", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16923", "title": "Abubakar Sadiq Mohammed Falalu", "text": "Abubakar Sadiq Mohammed Falalu, ni umunyanijeriya wavutse kuwa 14 Nzeri 1961, yashinze Falgates, uruganda ruhinga kandi rusya umuceri. Falgates ifite ikigo cyo gusya umuceri gifite ubushobozi bwa toni 15 kumunsi kandi gifite umurima wumuceri ukoresha abantu barenga 180 muri leta ya Kaduna mumajyaruguru ya Nigeriya. Isosiyete yinjije amadorari 400.000 muri 2017.\nAmashuri.\nYabonye BSc (Physique) mu 1985 muri kaminuza ya Maiduguri na M.Sc (Physics) muri kaminuza ya Ibadan. \nAkazi.\nYabaye umwarimu muri kaminuza nkuru y\u2019ikoranabuhanga Yola (1986\u20131996). Yabaye Umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019ibigo byinshi hagati ya 1996 na 2002. Yakoraga mu kigo cy\u2019abarimu cy\u2019igihugu, Kaduna (2002\u20132008). Mu 2008 yabaye Umuyobozi mukuru kuri Visi Perezida w\u2019Inteko Ishinga Amategeko, Bayero Nafada."}
{"id": "16924", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16924", "title": "Carine Mukamakuza", "text": "Carine Pierrette Mukamakuza yavukiye mu Rwanda. Afite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza n'impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bumenyi bwa mudasobwa yakuye muri kaminuza yo mu majyepfo yo mu Bushinwa, arangiza impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga. ubushakashatsi muri kaminuza ya tekinike ya Vienne muri Ph.D. Ishuri rya informatika i Vienne, Otirishiya muri Mata 2020. \nMukamakuza numushakashatsi na rwiyemezamirimo. Inyungu zubushakashatsi bwe ziri mubwenge bwubucuruzi, siyanse yamakuru (cyane cyane mukwiga imashini aho yibanze kuri sisitemu ya Recommender), imyitwarire yumukoresha, kwimenyekanisha no gusesengura imbuga za interineti.\nYagiye, akora ubushakashatsi ku ntera y\u2019ingaruka ihuza abantu bafite ku myitwarire y\u2019abakoresha, yiga imibare iboneka ku mugaragaro. Yambaye ingofero ya rwiyemezamirimo, ni umuyobozi mukuru wa Digital Data muri E - Business Group (D2iEB), isosiyete izobereye mu gusesengura amakuru ku bucuruzi bwo kuri interineti, gusesengura imbuga nkoranyambaga, amahugurwa, ubujyanama no kwamamaza ibicuruzwa byita ku bakiriya 'bakoresha icyongereza, Igifaransa, Igishinwa, Igiswahiri n'Ikidage nk'ururimi rwabo rwo gutumanaho mu bucuruzi."}
{"id": "16925", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16925", "title": "Ubucuruzi bw'inyoni nyafurika", "text": "Ubucuruzi bw\u2019inyoni nyafurika bukubiyemo guhiga, gucuruza, no kugurisha mu buryo butemewe inyoni n\u2019ibice bimwe bizigize nk' nyama z\u2019ibihuru no mu mihango bikoreshwa mu idini, nk'imiti gakondo, muri afurika yo munsi y'Ubutayu bwa Sahara. Ubu bucuruzi butemewe n\u2019inyoni n\u2019ibisiga bigira uruhare mu kibazo cy\u2019abaturage ku mugabane wa afurika. Mu mwaka wa 2017, Urutonde rw'ibara ritukura rwa IUCN rwashyize mu majwi amoko 7 y\u2019amoko 11 y\u2019inyoni yo muri Afurika nk\u2019ibangamiwe ku isi cyangwa abangamiwe cyane. Ubushakashatsi buherutse gukorwa bwerekana ko 90% by\u2019ibinyabuzima by\u2019ibisiga n;inyoni bigabanuka muri Afurika bishobora guterwa no guhumanywa hamwe n\u2019ubucuruzi bw\u2019ibinyabuzima butemewe n'amategeko kugirango bikoreshwenk' imiti cyangwa inyama zo mu bihuru. Ubucuruzi bwose bw'ibisiga n 'inyoni byo muri Afrika ntibyemewe, kuko izo nyoni zirinzwe n'amategeko mpuzamahanga.\u00a0\nUbucuruzi bw\u2019ibisiga byo muri Afurika bubarirwa munsi y\u2019ubucuruzi bw\u2019ibinyabuzima, hashingiwe k\u2019ubucuruzi bw\u2019igihugu ndetse n\u2019amahanga. Inkongoro rimwe na rimwe zihigirwa cyane cyane kuribwa nk'inyama zo mu bihuru cyangwa gukoreshwa mu myizerere gakondo. Ba rushimusi nabo bibasira ibisiga, kabone niyo baba batabihigira iinyama cyangwa gukoreshwa mu ntego ijyanye n'imyizerere. Kubera ko ibisiga bizenguruka imirambo, birashobora gukoreshwa nk'inzira, bikamenyesha abashinzwe inyamanswa ibikorwa byo guhiga. Abahigi b'amahembe y'inzovu hamwe na ba rushimusi b'amahembe baribasiye inkongoro kugirango bagabanye amahirwe yo gufatwa. \nBushmeat ni inyama zisarurwa mu nyamaswa zidakorerwa mu rugo zirimo inyamaswa z\u2019inyamabere, amphibian, ibikururuka hasi, n\u2019inyoni. Ba rushimusi bibasira ubwoko bw\u2019ibisimba muri Afurika yo munsi y\u2019ubutayu bwa Sahara kugirango basarure ibihuru kandi babikoreshe. Guhiga no gusarura inkongoro mu bucuruzi bw\u2019isoko ubusanzwe bikubiyemo uburozi bw\u2019inyoni zirisha amatungo n\u2019imirambo y\u2019ibinyabuzima hamwe n\u2019ubuhinzi bw'umwimerere. Ibi bikurura inkongoro zo kugaburira. Inyoni zirya inyama zifite uburozi maze zirapfa, bigatuma umusaruro uboneka byoroshye. Nyamara, uburozi ibisiga byinjira byanyuze mu rwego rw'ibiryo bishyira abantu barya izo nyoni nabo bashobora guhura nubwo burozi. Impamvu ebyiri zitera impfu z\u2019ibisimba ni uburozi n\u2019ubucuruzi mugukora buvuzi buri gakondo, izi mpamvu zombi zigize nibura 90% by\u2019impfu zavuzwe. \nAfurika y'iburasirazuba.\nMu gihe utundi turere tw'afurika dufite umubare munini w\u2019uburozi bwinshi munyama zo mubihuru, ninako biri no muri afurika y'Iburasirazuba. Ibihugu byihariye nka Kenya byahuye n\u2019impfu nyinshi z\u2019inyoni zatewe n\u2019uburozi bujyanye n\u2019ubucuruzi bw\u2019inyama zo mu gihuru, bituma hapfa abantu barenga 3.000 mu gihe cy\u2019amezi 10 gusa. Ibihugu byo muri afurika y'Iburasirazuba, nka Tanzaniya, byagaragaye ko inyama zo mu gihuru ziyongera bitewe no gukenera poroteyine nibindi by'injiza bizikomokaho. Ariko, nta makuru yihariye yerekeye no kugurisha inkongoro ku masoko ya Tanzaniya.\nAfurika y'Iburengerazuba.\nAfurika y'Iburengerazuba igizwe n'ibihugu 15 bikurikira: Benin, Burkina Faso, Cabo Verde, Gambiya, Gineya, Gineya-Bissau, Gana, kote dibuwari, Liberiya, Mali, Nigeri, Nijeriya, Senegali, Siyera Lewone, Togo. Muri ibi bihugu by\u2019iburengerazuba, bamwe bafite abaturage b\u2019agurisha ibisiga bihamye neza nka Hooded Vultures zo muri Gambiya na Gineya-Bissau. Ku rundi ruhande, hari ibihugu nka Senegali bifite uturere twahuye n\u2019igabanuka ry\u2019ibisimba nko 80% mu kinyejana gishize. Ubucuruzi bw'ibisiga nk'inyamanswa, kimwe n'imyizerere, nicyo kintu cya mbere kigabanura ibisimba muri Afrika yuburengerazuba."}
{"id": "16926", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16926", "title": "Ange Imanishimwe", "text": "Dr Ange Imanishimwe ayobora umuryango Biocoor urengera urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima, avuga ko n\u2019ikiremwa muntu gikwiye kubungwabungwa, bityo mu rwego rwo kubungabunga umuryango akavuga ko abakobwa badakeneye guhora bumva ko abagabo ari bo bagomba kubabeshaho "}
{"id": "16927", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16927", "title": "Regis Umugiraneza", "text": "Regis ni umunyamuryango &amp; Diregiteri muri CARL Group akaba na Visi Perezida mu Rugereko rw\u2019Abashoramari ba rwiyemezamirimo bakiri bato muri Federasiyo y\u2019abikorera. Yabanje kuzana icyabanje gufatwa nk \"igitekerezo cyumusazi\", igitekerezo cyo gukora imigati mubijumba - ikintu nyuma byagaragaye ko bishoboka, kandi aho itsinda rya CARL ryaturutse kuri / www.carlgroup.org. Regis yerekana ko afite ijisho ryo kwihangira imirimo; n'umuntu wifuza, wihangana kandi ufite ibyiringiro. Regis afite impamyabumenyi ya Bachelor muri Agribusiness and Economics Economics muri kaminuza yu Rwanda.\nMu mwaka wa kane yize ibijyanye n'ubuhinzi n'ubuhinzi muri kaminuza y'u Rwanda, Regis Umugiraneza yagize igitekerezo kijyanye n'ibijumba mu Rwanda no muri Afurika yo munsi y'Ubutayu bwa Sahara. Yahisemo kugenda ibirometero birenga, yakoresheje igitabo cye kugira ngo abaze iki gitekerezo kurushaho, maze mu 2014, amenya ko ashobora kongera agaciro kuri iki gihingwa."}
{"id": "16928", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16928", "title": "Eve Christine Gadzikwa", "text": "Dr Eva Christine yahoze ari Perezida w\u2019umuryango nyafurika ushinzwe ubuziranenge (ARSO) ufite icyicaro i Nairobi, muri Kenya (2016-2019). Nka Nyampinga wa ARSO muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba n'Amajyepfo akaba n'Umuyobozi wa Afurika Standard Standard Strategy &amp; Umuhanda Ikarita ya Afurika Impinduramatwara ya 4 mu nganda (A4IR) iyobowe n\u2019umuryango wa AU ku mugabane wa ARSO ku bufatanye na IEEE-SA (USA), Eva ateza imbere cyane ibikorwa byiza ku isi, kuba indashyikirwa mu bucuruzi no kugena ibihugu biri mu nzira y'amajyambere ku isoko rimwe rya AfCFTA.\nNi umunyamuryango witsinda ngishwanama ryumuyobozi bwa ISO DEVCO, Dr Gadzikwa yishimiye umwuga mwiza wumwuga, umara imyaka irenga 25 mubigo bya leta n\u2019abikorera. Muri Nzeri 2008, Eve yagizwe umuyobozi mukuru akaba n'Umunyamabanga wa Sosiyete y'Inama y'Ubuyobozi y'Ishyirahamwe ry'ubuziranenge muri Zimbabwe.\nNi umuhanga mu bya laboratoire wu conj ibyangombwa kandi kari () (Bacteriologue) kandi yahoze ari Umuyobozi w'imim ya ya Zimbabwe (ZSE) n'Ikigo cya Zimbabwe (IoDZ). Eva s ash aba nta gutoza urubyiruko kandi yari umuceri uhuza urubyiruko muri 2019 kandi yic bw bugufi fasha guha yaba urubyiruko rwo muri Afrika kabo by K ku ku kukunguukunguukunguukungu politiki."}
{"id": "16929", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16929", "title": "Fahad Awadh", "text": "Fahad Awadh, ni umunyatanzaniya we washinze YYTZ Agro-Processing, isosiyete itunganya cashew yongerera agaciro mu karere mu gihe ihanga imirimo kandi ikazamura amafaranga y\u2019abahinzi n\u2019abaturage muri rusange. Ikigo gitunganya ibicuruzwa muri Zanzibar gifite ubushobozi bwa Toni 2,500 ku mwaka. Umwaka ushize, YYTZ Agro-Processing yakusanyije $ 500,000 $ mu kigega cya Afrika Enterprises Challenge Fund cyo gushinga ikindi kigo gitunganya i Mtwara, mu majyepfo y\u2019amajyepfo ya Tanzaniya."}
{"id": "16930", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16930", "title": "Jean Bosco Nzeyimana", "text": "Jean Bosco ni we washinze Habona Limited, ni Umunyarwanda wavukiye mu akarere ka Nyamagabe, akaba n'umuyobozi mukuru wa sosiyete itanga serivisi zishinzwe gucunga imyanda kandi ikanatunganya imyanda mu bicanwa bihendutse kandi bitangiza ibidukikije nka biyogazi na briquettes za biomass. Isosiyete kandi iratandukanye mu gushyiraho no gukoresha amashanyarazi asukuye, guhera ku myanda kugeza ku mbaraga, nk'izuba, biyomasi, hydro, n'umuyaga, ndetse n'ubuhinzi bwangiza ikirere."}
{"id": "16931", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16931", "title": "Simbarashe Mhuriro", "text": "Mhuriro, ni we washinze Oxygen Energy Private Private Limited, n\u2019umushinga wigenga w\u2019amashanyarazi ndetse n\u2019isosiyete ishinzwe iterambere ry\u2019ingufu zishobora kuba inzobere mu nganda zikoresha amashanyarazi n\u2019imishinga yo hejuru y\u2019ubucuruzi. Muri 2017, Banki Nyafurika itsura amajyambere (AfDB) yayoboye ikigega cy\u2019ingufu zirambye muri Afurika (SEFA) cyemeje inkunga ingana na $ 965.000 US $ Oxygen Energy Private Limited Limited mu rwego rwo gushyigikira itegurwa ry\u2019urubanza rw\u2019ubucuruzi muri banki hagamijwe iterambere ry\u2019izuba rya 20MW ridafite amashanyarazi; umushinga w'amazu ya Photovoltaic ku nyubako zifitwe kandi zicungwa na Old Mutual Property Group, abashinzwe ishoramari rinini rya Zimbabwe. Umushinga nurangira, uzatanga ingufu zizuba zizewe kandi zirushanwe kumasosiyete magana mato mato mato mato muri Zimbabwe.\nSimba ni umwe mu bagize ihuriro ry\u2019ubukungu bw\u2019isi ku isi ku bijyanye no kwihangira imirimo mu mwaka wa 2018 - 2019 hamwe n\u2019inama Nyafurika ya Shared Value Africa Initiative ya 8. Simba kandi ari mu itsinda ry\u2019impuguke zikora impuguke za Enterprises Africa Network umushinga w\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Uburayi &amp; African Union gushiraho urubuga rwubucuruzi rwo guhuza abagore na ba rwiyemezamirimo bakiri bato ku mugabane w\u2019icyitegererezo ku ihuriro ry\u2019ibikorwa by\u2019Uburayi. Muri 2018 Simba yashyizwe ku rutonde n'ikinyamakuru cya Forbes nk'umwe mu ba rwiyemezamirimo 30 bafite icyizere muri Afurika kimwe no mu 2016 yanagizwe umwe mu ba rwiyemezamirimo 30 bo muri Afurika bafite ibyiringiro kandi bitera inkunga muri Afurika n'ikinyamakuru Forbes. Simba yamenyekanye kandi muri Afurika Youth Awards nk'umwe mu Banyafrika 100 bakomeye muri uyu mwaka."}
{"id": "16932", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16932", "title": "Rajiv Mehta", "text": "Rajiv Mehta, ni umunyakenya washinze Tangerine Investments, uruganda rwamamaza hanze rukoresha ibinyabiziga bitwara abantu, imyanda hamwe n\u2019imihanda kugira ngo bigurishe ibicuruzwa by\u2019abaguzi muri Kenya. Tangerine yashinzwe mu 2008, ifite abakiriya nka Kenya Airways, Pizza Inn, Subway na Coca Cola HP n'abandi. Isosiyete yinjije amafaranga arenga miliyoni imwe muri 2017."}
{"id": "16933", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16933", "title": "Patricia Majule", "text": "Patricia Majule ni umunyatanzaniya akaba umuyobozi nuwashinze Unique Favors TZ, isosiyete ikora kandi ikora ibicuruzwa byabigenewe, ibicuruzwa, udusanduku, impano nimpano kumashyaka adasanzwe ndetse nimiryango ikora muri Tanzaniya. Majule yashinze ubwo bucuruzi mu 2014 ubwo yabonaga ko Abanyatanzaniya benshi batumizaga impapuro mu mahanga. Ubucuruzi bwakomeje kwiyongera kuva icyo gihe kandi Majule ubu afite abakozi 10."}
{"id": "16934", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16934", "title": "Village Enterprise", "text": "Imishinga yo mu Mudugudu (mu icyongereza: Village Enterprise) (yahoze yitwa Ikigega cy\u2019imishinga y\u2019imidugudu) ni umuryango w\u2019Abanyamerika 501 (c) (3) Umuryango ukora mu guca ubukene bukabije binyuze mu kwihangira imirimo no guhanga udushya. Uyu muryango ukoresha abayobozi baho hanyuma bagashyira mubikorwa gahunda yo gutanga ubukene bushingiye ku baturage bahujwe n\u2019imiterere itandukanye muri Afurika.\nKurenga 95% by'abakozi ba Village Enterprises ni Abanyafurika y'Iburasirazuba kandi barimo ubuyobozi mu gihugu muri Kenya, Uganda, n'u Rwanda. Icyitegererezo cy\u2019abakozi bo mu Mudugudu cyamenyekanye mu mpeshyi 2013, Isabukuru yimyaka 10 ya Stanford Social Innovation Review.\nAmateka.\nVillage Enterprise yashinzwe mu 1987 na Brian Lehnen na Joan Hestenes kugira ngo berekane uburyo \"kwihangira imirimo bishobora gufasha abakene cyane kwihangira imirimo no kubona icyubahiro cy\u2019akazi karambye.\" ishyirahamwe rito, riyobowe nabakorerabushake ryakorewe mu rugo rwabo."}
{"id": "16935", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16935", "title": "Itegeko ryo gukura no guha amahirwe Afurika", "text": "African Growth and Opportunity Act Kuva iri tegeko ryatangira gukurikizwa mu 2000, itegeko ryo gukura no guha amahirwe Afurika (AGOA) ryabaye ishingiro rya politiki y\u2019ubukungu y\u2019Amerika no gukorana n\u2019ubucuruzi na Afurika. AGOA iha ibihugu by\u2019Afurika yujuje ibyangombwa byo munsi y\u2019ubutayu bwa Sahara uburenganzira bwo kugera ku isoko ry\u2019Amerika ku bicuruzwa birenga 1.800, hiyongereyeho ibicuruzwa birenga 5.000 byemerewe kubona imisoro ku musoro muri gahunda rusange y\u2019uburyo bukunzwe.\nKugira ngo AGOA yujuje ibyangombwa bisabwa kugira ngo umuntu yemerwe, ibihugu bigomba gushyiraho cyangwa gutera imbere bikomeje gushyiraho ubukungu bushingiye ku isoko, kugendera ku mategeko, ubwinshi bwa politiki, n'uburenganzira ku nzira ikwiye. Byongeye kandi, ibihugu bigomba gukuraho inzitizi zibangamira ubucuruzi n\u2019ishoramari ry\u2019Amerika, gushyiraho politiki yo kugabanya ubukene, kurwanya ruswa, no kurengera uburenganzira bwa muntu.\nMu gutanga amahirwe mashya ku isoko, AGOA yafashije mu kuzamura ubukungu, guteza imbere ivugurura ry\u2019ubukungu na politiki, no kuzamura umubano w\u2019ubukungu muri Amerika mu karere. \nIbihugu 36 byemerewe kubona inyungu za AGOA mu 2022. Muri 2015, Kongere yemeje amategeko agezweho kandi yongerera gahunda 2025."}
{"id": "16936", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16936", "title": "Imperial Holdings", "text": "Imperial Holdings Limited ni isosiyete itandukanye itanga serivisi zinyuranye zinganda zikora ibikorwa bya Afrika yepfo, Uburayi, Ubwongereza na Ositaraliya. Isosiyete ikorera mu bice bitanu bikora: ibikoresho, gukodesha imodoka n'ubukerarugendo, kugabura, gucuruza imodoka n'ubwishingizi. Isosiyete yibanze ku bucuruzi butandukanye. Harimo gukwirakwiza ibinyabiziga, ibice, ibikoresho byinganda nindege, ibicuruzwa birenga 200 bishya kandi bikoreshwa mubucuruzi, ibikoresho, ubwikorezi, ububiko, imizigo yihariye, ibisubizo byatanzwe"}
{"id": "16937", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16937", "title": "Sonangol Group", "text": "Sonangol group (Igiporutugali: Grupo Sonangol) ni parastatal yahoze igenzura ibikomoka kuri peteroli na gaze muri Angola. Itsinda ryari rigizwe na Sonangol E.P. (Igiporutugali: Sociedade Nacional de Combust\u00edveis de Angola, E.P.) hamwe n\u2019ibigo byinshi. Amashami muri rusange yari afite Sonangol E.P. nkumukiriya wibanze, hamwe nabandi bakozi, ubucuruzi, nabakiriya kugiti cyabo. Bivugwa ko Angola ifite miliyari zirenga 5 (790.000.000 m3) z\u2019ibikomoka kuri peteroli yo ku nkombe n\u2019inyanja, kandi ubushakashatsi bushya buruta ibyo gukoresha ku kigereranyo cya 5 kuri 1.\nMuri Gashyantare 2019, guverinoma yimuye imirimo yo kugenzura inganda za Sonangol mu kigo gishya cya Leta, Ikigo cy'igihugu gishinzwe peteroli, gaze na peteroli (ANPG). ANPG kandi yungutse muri Sonangol uburenganzira bwo gutanga ubushakashatsi bwibikomoka kuri peteroli, iterambere, namasezerano yumusaruro.\nAmateka.\nKu mugoroba ubanziriza ubwigenge bwa Porutugali, Angola muri Porutugali nyuma ya Revolution ya Carnation no gutorwa kwa guverinoma ishingiye kuri demokarasi muri Porutugali mu 1976, isosiyete ANGOL (ANGOL Sociedade de Lubrificantes e Combust\u00edveis Sarl) yashinzwe mu 1953 nk'ishami rya sosiyete yo muri Porutugali SACOR). abenegihugu kandi bagabanyamo kabiri, bakora Sonangol U.E.E. na Direc\u00e7\u00e3o Nacional de Petr\u00f3leos. Amabwiriza 52/76 yashyizeho Sonangol nk'isosiyete ya Leta ifite inshingano zo gucunga peteroli na gaze bisanzwe mu gihugu. Sonangol akoresheje ibisigazwa bya peteroli bya Texaco, Total, Shell na Mobil, Sonangol yabonye ubufasha bwa Sonatrach yo muri Alijeriya na Eni yo mu Butaliyani."}
{"id": "16938", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16938", "title": "Jean D'Amour Mutoni", "text": "Jean D'Amour Mutoni (Yavutse kuya 1986) ni rwiyemezamirimo w\u2019Abanyarwanda, washinze kandi akaba n'umuyobozi mukuru muri Acts Of Gratitude, ikigo cy\u2019imibereho gikorera mu Rwanda gikemura ibibazo by\u2019ubushomeri mu rubyiruko binyuze mu guhugura abato n'urubyiruko, kugira ngo bikemure ibibazo binyuze mu kwihangira ibigo by'imibereho. Ni ambasaderi umwe ukiri muto ku isi, ni umunyamuryango wa Global Health Corps. \nUbuzima bwambere nuburere.\nMuri 1986, Mutoni yavukiye i Ruhango mu ntara y'amajyepfo y'u Rwanda. Yapfushije abo mu muryango we utaziguye muri jenoside yo mu Rwanda yo muri 1994, aho yabaye afite imyaka umunani. \nMu mwaka wo muri 2011, nk'abanyeshuri bo muri kaminuza y'u Rwanda, Mutoni na bagenzi be 12 bazanye igitekerezo cyo gutangiza ko igikorwa gishobora kubafasha gusubiza umuryango, ari cyo cyatumye hashyirwaho Ibikorwa by'ishimwe. Mu mwaka wo muri 2015, Mutoni yahawe igihembo cy\u2019abayobozi b\u2019Umwamikazi w\u2019Umwamikazi, ashimira imbaraga yashyizeho mu gutera inkunga ba rwiyemezamirimo bakiri bato bo mu Rwanda, abinyujije mu bikorwa by\u2019ishimwe, atanga amahugurwa yo guha urubyiruko ubumenyi bwo kwihangira imirimo. "}
{"id": "16939", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16939", "title": "Rwabigwi Gilbert", "text": "Gilbert Rwabigwi nu umunyarwanda akaba na rwiyemezamirimo uhanga udushya akaba n'umwanditsi w'inzobere mu gusoma no kwandika, ingamba, kwandika no gutera imbere. Niwe washinze umuryango w\u2019u muryango wita ku gusoma no kwandika (YouLI), umuryango utegamiye kuri Leta udaharanira inyungu ufite intego yo guteza imbere gusoma no kwandika no kwiga ubuzima bwabo bwose.\nRwabigwi ni mwanditsi washinze ikinyamakuru The Kigalian, ikinyamakuru cyo kumurongo kubanditsi batekereza ibitekerezo byigenga n'abanditsi b'inkuru. Ari muri Ejo Group, ikigo cy'imibereho kabuhariwe mu bitangazamakuru no kwamamaza ibicuruzwa.\nKwandika no kugira uruhare.\nRwabigwi asohora inyandiko buri gihe kuri The Kigalian, isoko yigenga yibitekerezo, inkuru, hamwe nu mwirondoro by abanditsi bareba ejo hazaza mu Rwanda. Ari mu bantu bakomeye bo mu Rwanda bakomeye kuri Twitter kandi avuga mu birori byinshi ku bibazo bijyanye n'uburezi, gusoma, kwandika, imbuga nkoranyambaga n'umuco. Mu mwaka wo muri 2016, Rwabigwi yinjiye mu nteko y'abacamanza muri Miss Rwanda nk'umucamanza mu gusoza ikomeye. Yatangaje ko azagenda hasigaye iminsi mike ngo ibizamini bya mbere bya Miss Rwanda 2019.\nAmavuko n'ababyeyi.\nGilbert yavukiye i Kigali. Se, Fulgence Bukaka, na nyina, Alphonsine Mukahigiro, bishwe muri jenoside yo mu Rwanda mu 1994.\nUburezi n'ibikorwa.\nRwabigwi yakuriye i Kigali, hamwe na barumuna be na bashiki be; yagiye mu ishuri ribanza rya Camp Kigali na Ecole Primaire l'Horizon amashuri abanza. Yagiye muri Groupe Scolaire Officiel de Butare (GSOB), hanyuma Groupe Scolaire Kigombe (GSK) amashuri yisumbuye. Gilbert yize mu ishuri ry\u2019itangazamakuru n\u2019itumanaho, kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda (NUR).\nRwabigwi ni umuvugizi wubahwa mu kwandika no gutangaza mu Rwanda. Ni umwanditsi wa \"Ejo, Uyu munsi n'ejo: Icyegeranyo cy'imivugo kuri Jenoside \", cyasohotse bwa mbere mu 2008. Muri 2011, yagaragaye hejuru yurutonde rwabahanzi 10 ba mbere bakomeye bo mu Rwanda kumenya. "}
{"id": "16940", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16940", "title": "Gerard Sina", "text": "Sina G\u00e9rard (yavutse muri 1963) ni rwiyemezamirimo w'umunyaRwanda, akaba ari nyir'umuyobozi w'ikigo gitunganya ibiribwa rwitwa Entreprise Urwibutso. Ni n'umworozi w'ingurube, ukora ibiti, nyir'imigati, nyiri supermarket, ukora ibirungo. Yavukiye mu Ntara y'Amajyaruguru, akarere ka Rulindo; umurenge wa Bushoki na cerile ya Nyirangarama. Nyuma, yubatse izina rye kubera ingaruka z'ubucuruzi ku baturage. Ni umugabo w'ubatse kandi afite abana 5 (abakobwa gusa).\nSina Gerard azwiho ubwitange mu iterambere ryaho. Isosiyete yatangije mriu 1983, Urwibutso Enterprises, yavuye mu iduka rito igera ku mashami menshi hirya no hino mu gihugu cy'u Rwanda. Isosiyete Urwibutso, yatanze akazi 280 k'igihe cyose n'akazi 600 k'igihe gito mu cyaro aho Sina akomoka. Isosiyete ikorana n'impuzandengo y'imiryango 3.000 ifitanye isano n'ubuhinzi. Sina kandi yahaye abahinzi basezeranye na gahunda mbonezamubano nko gutera inkunga inguzanyo ziciriritse, uburezi, na gahunda yo guhugura ubuhinzi.\nIngaruka z'umurimo we zamenyekanye ku rwego mpuzamahanga, kandi yahawe ibihembo byinshi na yo. Urutonde rwibihembo bye birimo ikamba rya Diamond International Quality Crown na New Era Award for Technology, hamwe Quality, na Innovation, and Made muri Rwanda Award. \nKuri ubu Sina ni umwe mu bagabo bakize cyane mu Rwanda kandi Urwibutso Enterprises ni ubwami bw\u2019amadorari miliyoni menshi. \nUmwuga.\nTangira.\nSina G\u00e9rard yatangije Urwibutso Enterprises afite imyaka 20, muri 1983. Yakoresheje imari shingiro y'amafaranga miliyoni 33.000 (agaciro kyo muri 2013) kandi atanga umusaruro mubuhinzi bwababyeyi be kugirango atangire imigati mito. Hamwe n\u2019imigati ye, yashyize umukono ku nkono ya Urwibutso, nyuma yaje kuba izina ryimishinga myinshi. Igihe imigati ye yatangiraga gutanga umusaruro ku ishoramari, Sina yagutse maze yinjira mu gukora imbuto-umutobe.\nUmwuga wo hagati.\nMuri 1999, abonye ko ibicuruzwa bye bishya byongeweho byagenze neza, ishora imari muri bikoresho byo gukora umutobe. Sina yafatanije na bahinzi benshi baho, bashora imari mubushakashatsi bwubuhanga bwo kubungabunga umutobe. Imitobe ya Agashya, cyane nectar y'imbuto, nayo yamenyekanye kumasoko. Sina yahise atandukanya imishinga ye kurushaho: yongeyeho umushinga w'ingurube; inka, ihene, ibice byo korora urukwavu; n'umuvinyu n'umusaruro wa chili. Chili Akabanga yabaye kimwe mu bicuruzwa akoresha cyane, atari mu Rwanda gusa, ahubwo no ku mugabane wa Afurika no mu bindi bice by'isi. Sina avuga kuri Akabanga, Bisobanura ikintu nk' ibanga '. Nushira ku biryo byawe, uzumva ibanga."}
{"id": "16941", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16941", "title": "Entreprise Urwibutso", "text": "Entreprise Urwibutso izwi nka Nyirangarama, aho ari kampani yashizwe na Rwiyemezamirimo witwa Gerard Sina, yasobanuriye byihariye aho abitabiriye imurikagurisha ry\u2019i bikorerwa mu Rwanda, aho serivisi itanga zishingiye ahanini ku buhinzi, ku muvinyo (Wine).\nIbyo Bakora.\nEntreprise Urwibutso ibafitiye udushya twinshi dutandukanye turimo nko gufata amafunguro mutaramiwe n\u2019a babyinnyi benshi, abahanzi, abakorobate, ndetse n'itorero rya kinyarwanda. Niho honyine usanga ibyo kurya wiyarurira kandi ugahitamo ibyo ushaka kurya, hari inyama zokeje z\u2019ubwoko bwose kandi ziryoshye. Unahasanga kandi amata meza y\u2019umwimerere, hari ikivuguto n\u2019inshyushyu ku babikunda ndetse ntiyibagiwe n\u2019abafata agahiye.\nIbindi.\nEntreprise Urwibutso, bimaze kubaka izina ku isoko ry'ubucuruzi mu Rwanda no mu mahanga harimo ibyo bakora birimo Agashya, Akabanga, Akarusho, Akandi, Akarabo, Divayi ikorwa mu bitoki, amafu y\u2019Akanozo, urwibutso n\u2019ibindi bikorwa mu bihingwa byo mu Rwanda.\nAmashuri.\nEntreprise Urwibutso kandi iramurika serivisi itanga zitandukanye zirimo nk\u2019izitangirwa mu ishuri ry\u2019imyuga n\u2019ubumenyi ngiro ryitwa ni College Foundation Sina Gerard, Turashaka kwigisha abana b\u2019abanyarwanda imyuga n\u2019ubumenyingiro no kwihangira umurimo ariko cyane dushingiye kuri Laboratwari n\u2019inganda biri kuri Nyirangarama, Abize muri iri shuri ntabwo bagorwa no gushaka aho bimenyereza umwuga kuko bitewe n\u2019icyo yize ahita yimenyereza muri iki kigo cya Entreprise Urwibutso ndetse abarangijemo benshi bagahabwamo rwose akazi."}
{"id": "16942", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16942", "title": "Rwiyemezamirimo", "text": "Kwihangira imirimo ni inzira y'abantu ku giti cyabo, cyangwa amatsinda yantu, y'ibigo bitangiza cyangwa ba rwiyemezamirimo, aho batezimbere, bagatera inkunga kandi bagashyira mu bikorwa ibisubizo by'ibibazo by'imibereho, umuco, cyangwa se ibidukikije. Iki gitekerezo gishobora gukoreshwa m'uburyo butandukanye bw'amashyirahamwe, atandukaniye mu bunini, ahari intego, n'imyizerere. Ba rwiyemezamirimo bunguka ubusanzwe bapima imikorere bakoresheje ibipimo byubucuruzi nkinyungu, amafaranga yinjira no kuzamuka kwibiciro byimigabane. Bawiyemezamirimo bashinzwe imibereho, ariko, ntabwo ari inyungu, cyangwa bahuza intego zinyungu no kubyara kugaruka muri societe nziza. Kubwibyo, bakoresha ibipimo bitandukanye. Kwihangira imirimo isanzwe igerageza kurushaho kugera ku ntego zagutse z\u2019imibereho, umuco n\u2019ibidukikije akenshi bifitanye isano n\u2019urwego rw\u2019ubushake nko kurwanya ubukene, ubuvuzi ndetse n\u2019iterambere ry\u2019abaturage.\nIbiranga.\nBill Drayton yashinze Ashoka muri 1980, umuryango utera inkunga ba rwiyemezamirimo baho. Drayton abwira abakozi be gushakisha imico ine: guhanga, ireme ryo kwihangira imirimo, ingaruka z'imibereho y'igitekerezo. Guhanga bifite ibice bibiri: kwishyiriraho intego no gukemura ibibazo. Ba rwiyemezamirimo bashinzwe guhanga bahagije kugirango bagire icyerekezo cyibyo bashaka kubaho nuburyo bwo gukora icyo cyerekezo. Mu gitabo cyabo cyitwa \"Imbaraga z'abantu badafite ishingiro,\" John Elkington na Pamela Hartigan bagaragaza impamvu ba rwiyemezamirimo bashinzwe imibereho, nk'uko babivuze. Bavuga ko aba bagabo n'abagore bashaka inyungu mu musaruro rusange aho abandi batiteze inyungu. Birengagije kandi ibimenyetso byerekana imishinga yabo izananirwa no kugerageza gupima ibisubizo ntawe ufite ibikoresho byo gupima. Kuri iki kibazo, Fondasiyo ya Schwab avuga ko ba rwiyemezamirimo bafite, ishyaka ryo gupima no gukurikirana ingaruka zabo. Ba rwiyemezamirimo bafite amahame yo mu rwego rwo hejuru, cyane cyane ajyanye n'imbaraga z'umuryango wabo ndetse no gusubiza abaturage bakorana. Amakuru, yaba menshi kandi yujuje ubuziranenge, ni ibikoresho byabo by'ingenzi, bayobora ibitekerezo bikomeza kandi bitezimbere. \" Ashoka ikorera mu bihugu byinshi.\nUbwiza bwo kwihangira imirimo bwubaka kuva guhanga. Ntabwo ba rwiyemezamirimo bafite igitekerezo gusa bagomba gushyira mubikorwa, bazi kubishyira mubikorwa kandi bifatika mubikorwa byo kubishyira mubikorwa. Drayton agira ati: rwiyemezamirimo bafite imitwe yabo icyerekezo cy'ukuntu isosiyete izaba itandukanye mu gihe igitekerezo cyabo kiri ku kazi, kandi ntibashobora guhagarara kugeza icyo gitekerezo kidakorerwa ahantu hamwe gusa, ahubwo kiri ku kazi muri rusange. sosiyete. Ibi bigaragarira mubitekerezo bisobanutse kubyo bizera ko ejo hazaza hazaba hameze hamwe nogushaka gukora ibi. Usibye ibi, ba rwiyemezamirimo ntibishimiye uko ibintu bimeze: bashaka impinduka nziza. Ubu buryo bwo guhindura ibintu bwasobanuwe nkugushiraho indwara ya d\u00e9quilibriya ku isoko binyuze muri guhindura imitungo irwanya ubwuzuzanye. \nInzitizi.\nKuberako isi yo kwihangira imirimo ari shyashya, hariho ibibazo byinshi byugarije abacengera m'urwego. Ubwa mbere, ba rwiyemezamirimo bagerageza kubamaso, gukemura no guhanga ibibazo by'ubaka kandi akenshi bahura n'ibibazo byo kumenya ibibazo bikwiye byakemuka. Bitandukanye na rwiyemezamirimo benshi bakora ubucuruzi, bakemura ibibazo biriho ubu ku isoko, ba rwiyemezamirimo bashinzwe imibereho myiza bakemura ibibazo bishingiye ku bitekerezo, bitagaragara cyangwa akenshi bidakorerwa ubushakashatsi, nk'abaturage benshi, amasoko y'ingufu zidashoboka, ibura ry'ibiribwa. Gushiraho ubucuruzi bwimibereho myiza kubisubizo byonyine birashobora kuba bidashoboka kuko abashoramari badashaka gutera inkunga imishinga ishobora guteza akaga. Niba ba rwiyemezamirimo bashoboye kubona inkunga kubashoramari, imbogamizi ntizihagarara hamwe no kuringaniza imibereho nubucuruzi mubucuruzi. "}
{"id": "16944", "revid": "10890", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16944", "title": "Water Consulting East Africa", "text": "Water Consulting East Africa (WCEA) ni Kampanyi cyangwa rwiyemezamirimo aho itanga ubujyanama butandukanye, ubu ifite icyicaro mu umujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda. Aho ikora ibucuruzi bw'amazi n'ubwubatsi, imiyoborere y'ubwubatsi mu Rwanda no muri afurika y'iburasirazuba ndetse na kure. WC EA ni ubujyanama bwa mbere muri Afrika yuburasirazuba.\nYashinzwe muri 2014 n\u2019uwashinze Jean-Paul Skoczylas. WC EA yatanze serivisi zitandukanye nko kuri Bechtel Corporation, USAID, UNICEF, IFC, Fondasiyo ya Cricket yu Rwanda na Fondasiyo ya Howard G. Buffet no ku mishinga iterwa inkunga na DFID na Fondasiyo ya Bill &amp; Melinda Gates.\nAmateka.\nAmazi yo kugisha inama Afurika y'Iburasirazuba yashinzwe muri 2014 kugira ngo akorere cyane cyane isoko ry\u2019amazi n\u2019ubwubatsi mu Rwanda, Afurika y'Iburasirazuba na Hagati\nIbikorwa.\nAmazi agisha inama Afurika y'Iburasirazuba afite uburambe bwo gukorera mu Rwanda no muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Abakozi bakomeye ba WC EA bafite uburambe bwo gukora muri Amerika y'Amajyaruguru, Uburayi, Uburasirazuba bwo hagati na Afurika."}
{"id": "16945", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16945", "title": "Vuga Ltd", "text": "Vuga Ltd ni isosiyete yo mu Rwanda, itanga ni serivisi yo kwambukiranya imipaka ya VugaPay. Iremera ubucuruzi n\u2019abakoresha kohereza amafaranga muri sisitemu nini yo kwishyura, harimo imiyoboro y'amakarita yinguzanyo, amafaranga ya terefone igendanwa na Bitcoin ukoresheje porogaramu yabigenewe, porogaramu y\u2019inyongera, porogaramu ya terefone igendanwa, cyangwa interineti. Yatunganije ibicuruzwa bisaga miliyoni 5 muri 2016. Kuva mu Kuboza 2016, VugaPay itanga ubwishyu bwihuse kuri 40 n\u2019itumanaho rya terefone zigendanwa / zitwara abantu nko Rwanda, Kenya, Uganda, Nigeri, Malawi, Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, Gana, Tanzaniya na Zambiya. \nSerivisi.\nVugaPay ni serivisi yo kwishyurana yambukiranya imishinga ituma ubucuruzi n\u2019abakoresha byohereza amafaranga muri sisitemu nkuru yo kwishyura. Irakurikiza uburyo bwubucuruzi busa kuri PayPal. VugaPay yisobanura nka umufuka wa digitale. Abakoresha biyandikisha kandi bashiraho konti batanga amakuru yibanze namakuru ya konti ya banki ukoresheje porogaramu zabo zigendanwa, USSD kuri terefone ziranga cyangwa kurubuga rwa VugaPay kandi bashobora kubona abandi bakoze konti. Inshuti n'abakira ibicuruzwa murashobora kubisanga mukoresheje nimero ya terefone, izina rya VugaPay, cyangwa imeri.\nAbakoresha bafite impagarike ya Vuga Pay ikoreshwa m'ubikorwa byabo. Barashobora guhuza amafaranga yabo agendanwa, bitcoin, konte ya banki ya PayPal, amakarita yo kubikuza, cyangwa amakarita y'inguzanyo kuri konti yabo ya VugaPay. Kwishura amafaranga ya mobile ni ubuntu, ariko amakarita yinguzanyo, bitcoin, PayPal na konti za banki bifite amafaranga 3% kuri buri gikorwa. Niba umukoresha adafite amafaranga ahagije kuri VugaPay ubwayo mugihe akora transaction, izahita ikuramo amafaranga yinyongera mu mafaranga ya mobile, konte ya banki cyangwa ikarita.\nAmateka.\nVuga Pay yashinzwe n'abavandimwe babiri bo mu Rwanda, Patrick Muhire na Cedrick Muhoza. Nyuma y'imyaka mike yo kureba M pesa ihinduka kuva kuri platifomu ntoya yimurwa igahinduka igisubizo cyuzuye cyo kwishyura, Patrick yibajije uko bishobora kumera niba byarahinduwe kuva hasi; gusa ku bihugu byose. Nk\u2019uko Patrick abitangaza ngo igitekerezo cya Vuga Pay cyatangiye igihe Patrick yashakaga kohereza amafaranga ku mukoresha wa terefone igendanwa ku yindi. Igikorwa cyo kohereza amafaranga kumukoresha umwe wa terefone igendanwa kurindi cyari ikibazo, nuko batangira gukora muburyo bwo kohereza amafaranga mubakoresha imiyoboro yose igendanwa, imikoranire y'amafaranga agendanwa. Porotipire yabo yumwimerere yohereje amafaranga binyuze muri MTN, TIGO, AIRTEL mu Rwanda, ariko amaherezo bava mu Rwanda bajya muri Afurika y'uburasirazuba bwose, bahuza itumanaho muri utwo turere. Iyi porogaramu yagiye ahagaragara mu nama yo muri Transform Africa 2015 ya TAS yabereye i Kigali. \nKu ikubitiro, VugaPay yari ishingiye ku mafaranga agendanwa. Ihererekanyabubasha rya VugaPay rifatwa nkigisambo binyuze mubitwara amafaranga kandi birashobora gukorwa kubitwara byose hamwe na serivisi zamafaranga. Iyimurwa ryihuse, hamwe numubare munini wabatwara baturutse muri Afrika. Afurika y'Iburasirazuba ivuga ko amayeri amwe n'amwe akoreshwa kuri sisitemu y'amafaranga agendanwa no mu zindi serivisi. \nMu mpera zo muri 2016, Timothy C. Draper yashoye ishoramari rye rya kabiri muri Afurika muri VugaPay. Nyuma VugaPay yazanye isoko ifunguye amafaranga mobile api, kubacuruzi bazemera amafaranga ya mobile nkubwishyu. "}
{"id": "16946", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16946", "title": "Iposita Mu Rwanda)", "text": "Ibiro by'iposita by'igihugu ni isosiyete ishinzwe serivisi y'iposita mu Rwanda. Kuva muri 2009, Umuyobozi mukuru w'Ibiro by'Amaposita ni Celestin Kayitare. \nU Rwanda rugizwe n\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019amaposita, rusaga abantu 9000 ku ishami ry\u2019iposita. Kugeza muri 2009, abatuye u Rwanda bagera kuri miliyoni icumi, bakaba bakeneye amashami y\u2019iposita 1,111 kugira ngo iki cyifuzo kibe gikora neza. Kuva muri 2009, u Rwanda rwari rufite amashami ya posita cumi n'icyenda. \nMuri Mata 2010, Ibiro by'igihugu bishinzwe amaposita byatangaje, binyuze mu ihuriro ry\u2019amaposita ku isi, ko ibibazo byinshi by\u2019uburiganya bya kashe byakwirakwijwe. \nAbanywanyi batemewe.\nIbiro by\u2019ibiro by\u2019igihugu byahawe uburenganzira bwo kwiharira imyaka mirongo itatu muri 1992 n\u2019Inteko ishinga amategeko y\u2019u Rwanda, icyo gihe kizwi ku izina ry\u2019Inama y\u2019igihugu ishinzwe iterambere. Serivise yigenga ikora ubucuruzi mu gihugu nubwo leta ya y'amaganye. Bus ya Atraco, Sotra Tours, Okapi, Virunga, na Muhabura bise amaposita nk'amasosiyete akora mu buryo butemewe n'amategeko. Kuva mu Kwakira 2009, hategurwaga itegeko ryo guhashya serivisi zitwara abantu mu buryo butemewe. \nIkigega mpuzamahanga cy'amafaranga.\nRaporo yo mu Gushyingo 2000 n'Ikigega Mpuzamahanga cy'Imari impine (IMF) ku bijyanye no kugabanya ubukene mu Rwanda yavuze ko IMF izagerageza gutuma ibiro by'igihugu bishinzwe amaposita byifashisha mu rwego rw'a mafaranga, ndetse binatanga serivisi zihendutse. Nkuko raporo ibigaragaza, ibi byazamura imiterere y'itumanaho, bigatuma ababa mu bukene babona akazi mu buryo bworoshye. Muri Gushyingo 2000 ku bijyanye n\u2019imfashanyo na IMF, guverinoma y\u2019u Rwanda yemeye ko ibiro byihagije bitarenze muri Nzeri 2001. "}
{"id": "16947", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16947", "title": "Ikawa ya Bourbon", "text": "Ikawa ya Bourbon ni rwiyemezamirimo ufite i kawa ruherereye i Kigali, mu Rwanda. Kugeza ubu ifite ikawa 8 i Kigali, iyambere muri Union Trade Center (UTC) mu Kiyovu, iya kabiri iri mu kigo cya MTN i Nyarutarama, iya gatatu mu Munara wa Kigali, iya kane ku Kibuga cy\u2019indege mpuzamahanga cya Kigali. \nUbu bucuruzi buraguka kuko buri ku isoko ry\u2019Amerika, ifungura ahantu icyarimwe i Boston no i Washington, DC kuri 2101 L St NW muri Amerika. "}
{"id": "16948", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16948", "title": "Akagera Aviation School", "text": "Ishuri ry\u2019indege rya Akagera (AAS), ni ishuri ryigisha iby'indege mu Rwanda, ni isosiyete icuruza kajugujugu zo kugurisha cyangwa se gukodesha, kandi ritanga amahugurwa ku bashobora kuba abapilote, haba mu ndege zizunguruka kandi zihamye, zikorera mu ingabo z\u2019u Rwanda, RwandAir na General Aviation. \nAho biherereye.\nIcyicaro cy\u2019iryo shuri giherereye ku Kibuga cy\u2019indege mpuzamahanga cya Kigali, hafi ya kilometero 5, ku muhanda, muburasirazuba bw'akarere ka bucuruzi hagati mu mujyi wa Kigali, umurwa mukuru mu Rwanda. ikigo cyishuri ry'indege rya Akagera aho riherereye ni: 01 \u00b0 57'48.0 \"S, 30 \u00b0 08'06.5\" E (Ubunini: -1.963333; Uburebure: 30.135139). \nIncamake.\nIkigo cyamahugurwa gifite abikorera ku giti cyabo na Rwanda Aviation, isosiyete icuruza kajugujugu zo kugurisha no / cyangwa kubakodesha. Iri shuri ryashinzwe kugira ngo rikemure ikibazo cy\u2019ibura ry\u2019inzobere mu ndege mu Rwanda no mu karere. Kugeza mu Kuboza 2017, RwandAir ifite abaderevu 150, muri bo 25 gusa ni Abanyarwanda, naho babiri gusa ni bo ba kapiteni b'u Rwanda. Ishuri rirateganya gutangira imyitozo yubukanishi bwindege hamwe nabakozi bashinzwe serivisi zindege, nyuma. \nIngano y'ibyiciro.\nAmasomo y'ubucuruzi kuri kajugujugu hamwe n'indege zihamye zamezi 18 ashize. Ingano y\u2019icyitegererezo cya kajugujugu igera ku bantu 11, hamwe na buri kwezi. Ingano yindege itwara indege nini ni abanyeshuri 20, hamwe no gufata, buri Gashyantare. Abenshi mu barangije aya masomo babona akazi mu RwandaAir ndetse no mu gisirikare cy'u Rwanda. \nIhuza ryo hanze.\n&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Coordinates/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;01\u00b057\u203248\u2033S 30\u00b008\u203206.5\u2033E\ufeff / \ufeff1.96333\u00b0S 30.135139\u00b0E\ufeff / -1.96333; 30.135139"}
{"id": "16949", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16949", "title": "Crystal Telecom Rwanda", "text": "Crystal Telecom Rwanda, bakunze kwiyita Crystal Telecom, ni isosiyete y\u2019imari n'imigabane yo mu Rwanda ifite icyicaro gikuru mu mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda. Ikigo gifite imigabane igera kuri 20% muri MTN Rwandancell nk'igishoro cyonyine. \nAho biherereye.\nCrystal Telecom ikomeza icyicaro cyayo mu biro bya Crystal Ventures, kuri Grand Pension Plaza, mu igorofa rya 14, kuri 2 KN 3 Avenue, i Kigali, umurwa mukuru w\u2019u Rwanda n\u2019umujyi munini. icyicaro gikuru kiri: 01 \u00b0 56'47.2 \"S, 30 \u00b0 03'37.4\" E (Ubunini: -1.946444; Uburebure: 30.060389). \nIncamake.\nCrystal Telecom n'isosiyete idasanzwe y'imodoka ifite intego 20% ya MTN Rwandacell, umunyamuryango wa MTN Group. Kugeza muri 2015, iyo migabane niyo shoramari ryonyine. Kugeza mu Kuboza 2019, Crystal Telecom yari ifite umutungo wose wa miliyari 24.038 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda (miliyoni 26 z'amadorali y'amerika), hamwe n\u2019abanyamigabane bangana na miliyari 23,971 (miliyoni 25.9 z'amadorali y'amerika. \nAmateka.\nCrystal Telecom yashinzwe mu 2013 igihe ikigo cy\u2019ishoramari cyitwa Crystal Ventures gishingiye ku Rwanda, cyahagaritse imigabane yacyo muri MTN Rwandantell ku kigo cyacyo gishya cyashizweho binyuze muri IPO. IPO yakozwe muri kamena 2015 kandi yiyandikishije hejuru ya 123%. \nImigabane y\u2019isosiyete yatangiye gucuruza ku Isoko ry\u2019imigabane mu Rwanda ku ya 17 Nyakanga 2015 ku kimenyetso cya CTL, bituma iba sosiyete ya gatatu y\u2019ibanze ku rutonde rw\u2019ivunjisha, inyuma ya Bralirwa na Banki ya Kigali. \nImiyoborere.\nIsosiyete ikurikiranwa ninama y'ubuyobozi igizwe nabantu batanu. Imbonerahamwe ikurikira irerekana abagize inama y'ubutegetsi guhera ku ya 31 Ukuboza 2017. Evelyn Kamagaju Rutawenda yari umuyobozi naho Iza Irame yari umuyobozi mukuru. "}
{"id": "16950", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16950", "title": "Akabari ka Ilojo", "text": "Akabari ka Ilojo, gakunze kwitwa amazina atandatukanye nk'Inzu ya Olaiya cyangwa Casa da Fernandez, yari inyubako y\u2019amateka yubatswe na Berezile iherereye hafi ya Square ya Tinubu mu kirwa cya Lagos, muri Leta ya Lagos, mu gihugu cya Nijeriya. Yubatswe bwa mbere ari akabari na resitora mu mwaka wa 1855 bikorwa n'umuryango wa Fernandez aho yakoresheje abahoze ari imbata z'abaretwa ariko bize kandi bafite ubumenyi n'ubugeni mu myubakire mu gihe bari bakiri muri Amerika y'Epfo. Akabari ka Ilojo kaje kugurishwa na Alfred Omolana Olaiya wo mu muryango wa Olaiya mu mwaka wa 1933 maze bitangazwa ko ari urwibutso rw'igihugu mu mwaka wa 1956 hamwe na komisiyo y'igihugu ishinzwe ingoro ndangamurage n'inzibutso. \nIzina \"Akabari ka Ilojo\".\nIyi nzu imaze kugurishwa na Alfred Omolona Olaiya mu mwaka wa 1933, yahise ahindurira iyo nyubako izina ahita ayita \"Akabari ka Ilojo\" nyuma yaho ariwo umujyi yari yaravukiyemo wahoze witwa \"Ilojo\" muri Ijesa Isu, muri Leta ya Ekiti.\nGusenya.\nIyi nyubako yashenywe ku cyumweru, tariki ya 11 Nzeri 2016, mu bihe biteye amakenga mu mpera z'icyumweru cya Eid i Lagos. Kugeza nanubu ikibazo kiracyakurikiranwa. Ubu butaka bugenzurwa na guverinoma ya Lagos. "}
{"id": "16951", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16951", "title": "MTN Rwanda", "text": "MTN Rwanda (MTN Rwandacell Plc) ni sosiyete y'itumanaho ikorera mu Rwanda. Ni yo sosiyete nini y'itumanaho mu gihugu. Ni ishami rya sosiyete mpuzamahanga MTN Group.\nMTN Rwanda itanga serivisi za telefoni igendanwa na interineti. Itanga kandi serivisi ya Mobile Money (MoMo) yo kohererezanya amafaranga kuri telefoni.\nAmateka.\nMTN Rwanda yashinzwe mu 1998. Icyo gihe u Rwanda rwari mu bihe byo kwiyubaka nyuma ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nKu wa 4 Gicurasi 2021, imigabane ya MTN Rwanda yashyizwe ku isoko ry'imigabane ry'u Rwanda. Icyo gihe, agaciro ka MTN Rwanda kari hafi miliyoni 364 z'amadolari y'Amerika.\nMu mpera za Kamena 2026, MTN Rwanda yari ifite abafatabuguzi bagera kuri miliyoni 8.7.\nMobile Money.\nMTN Rwanda yatangije serivisi ya Mobile Money muri Gashyantare 2010. Iyi serivisi ituma abantu bohererezanya amafaranga kuri telefoni igendanwa. Abantu bayikoresha kandi mu kwishyura mu maduka.\nMuri Mata 2021, MTN Rwanda yashinze ishami ryihariye ryitwa Mobile Money Rwanda Ltd. Umuyobozi mukuru w'iri shami ni Chantal Kagame. Mu mpera za Kamena 2026, Mobile Money yari ifite abakoresha bagera kuri miliyoni 6.4.\nImiyoborere.\nMuri Mata 2025, Monzer Ali yagizwe umuyobozi mukuru wa MTN Rwanda. Monzer Ali yasimbuye Mapula Bodibe. Mapula Bodibe yari ayoboye MTN Rwanda kuva mu 2022.\nIcyicaro.\nIcyicaro gikuru cya MTN Rwanda kiri ahitwa MTN Centre, i Nyarutarama. Nyarutarama iri mu Akarere ka Gasabo, mu mujyi wa Kigali."}
{"id": "16953", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16953", "title": "Inzu ya Bogobiri", "text": "Inzu ya Bogobiri ni hoteri ya boutique ifite insanganyamatsiko nyafurika na resitora iherereye Ikoyi, muri Lagos. \nIbisobanuro n'imitako.\nInzu ya Bogobiri igizwe n'inyubako ebyiri, buri nzu irimo resitora hamwe n'icyumba cy'abashyitsi. Ibikoresho ndetse no mu imbere ya resitora bigizwe ahanini n'imitako y'ubuhanzi n'ibirugu ndetse n'ibikoresho byo mu nzu, birimo intebe, intebe zometseho, sofa, ameza ndetse n'udutebe duto n'ibishusho biremereye by'ubutabazi bwa Afurika kandi bikozwe mu ruvange rw'ibiti bibisi, ibyatsi, jute, amabuye. n'ibikoresho by'uruhu biva mu gihugu. Hano hari kandi utubari, ububiko bw'ubugeni n'imfuruka zitsinda rya jazz rya Live muri resitora. "}
{"id": "16954", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16954", "title": "Gishoma Thermal Power Station", "text": "Amashanyarazi ya Gishoma, ni umuyoboro w'amashanyarazi witwabGishoma ikora megawati 15 MW (20,000hp) y\u2019amashanyarazi, kirimo kubakwa i Gishoma, mu Karere ka Rusizi, mu Ntara y\u2019Uburengerazuba.\nAho biherereye.\nSitasiyo y\u2019amashanyarazi iherereye i Gishoma, mu Karere ka Rusizi, mu Ntara y\u2019Uburengerazuba, kiri mu kilometero 210, ku muhanda, mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bw'umujyi wa Kigali, umurwa mukuru. \nIncamake.\nMu rwego rwo gushyira ingufu mu gutandukanya amasoko y\u2019ingufu z\u2019igihugu, kandi urebye umubare munini w\u2019amashanyarazi mu gihugu, guverinoma y\u2019u Rwanda, ibinyujije mu kigo cyayo gishinzwe ingufu z\u2019amazi n\u2019isuku (EWSA), yagiranye amasezerano na Shengli Energy Group Limited, isosiyete y'Abashinwa, kubaka yi Gishoma Thermal Power Station, iyobowe n'ikigo cy'Ubuhinde, Punj Lloyd Limited. \nIfu yo gutwika sitasiyo yamashanyarazi yakurwa mubishanga bya Gishoma, hafi y\u2019aho amashanyarazi aherereye. Uruganda rwa Peat Energy, uruganda rwigenga rwo gucukura no gutanga amasoko mu Rwanda, rwagiranye amasezerano na EWSA gutanga ibikoresho bibisi. \nAmasezerano yo kubaka amaze gutangwa, byaragaragaye ko amakosa yakozwe mugushushanya sitasiyo y\u2019amashanyarazi, ibigereranyo bishoboka ndetse n\u2019amasoko y\u2019amazi akenewe kugira ngo sitasiyo ikore. Vuba aha bimaze kumenyeshwa abategura, ko Gishoma marshes ibigega byimbuto bishobora gukomeza uruganda rwa 15MW gusa mugihe cy'i myaka itanu. Icyo gihe uruganda rwaba rwimuwe, cyangwa ifu yagombaga gutwarwa mu turere twa kure two mu Rwanda. \nIngengabihe n'inkunga.\nIyubakwa ry'iyi sitasiyo y'amashanyarazi muri ntangiriro ryateganijwe gutwara miliyoni 36 z'amadolari y'Amerika (hafi miliyari 24.8 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda), yatijwe na Banki ya Kigali, banki nini y'ubucuruzi mu Rwanda mu mutungo. N'ubwo gutinda no kubara nabi, biteganijwe ko sitasiyo y\u2019amashanyarazi izaza kuri interineti muri Kanama 2016. Urugomero rw'amashanyarazi rwaje kuri interineti muri Mata 2017. "}
{"id": "16955", "revid": "10890", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16955", "title": "Prime Cement Limited", "text": "Prime Cement Limited (PCL) ni uruganda rukora sima mu Rwanda. Ni ishami rya Mil bridge Holding SA, ni uruganda rukora ibikoresho byo kubaka no kugabura, rufite amashami muri Angola, leta zunze ubumwe bw'abarabu, Rwanda na Afurika yepfo. \nAho biherereye.\nInganda nkuru za PCL ziherereye muri Zone y\u2019inganda ya Musanze, mu Murenge wa Kimonyi, Akarere ka Musanze, mu Ntara y\u2019Amajyaruguru y\u2019u Rwanda. Ubu ni kuri kilometero zigera kuri, ku muhanda, mu majyaruguru yuburengerazuba bwa Kigali, umurwa mukuru. \nIncamake.\nMuri 2018, PCL yatangiye kubaka uruganda rushya rwa miliyoni 65 z\u2019amadolari y\u2019Amerika mu karere ka Musanze, mu karere ka Rwanda. Uruganda rwaba rwubatswe mubice bibiri byubushobozi bwa toni 600.000 metero imwe imwe. Icyiciro cya mbere, cyubatswe ku giciro cya miliyoni 40 z'amadolari (hafi. miliyari 37 z'amanyarwanda) zaje ku murongo muri Kanama 2020. LOESCHE GmbH, isosiyete y\u2019u bwubatsi yo mu Budage ifite icyicaro i D\u00fcsseldorf, yatanze ibikoresho yubaka uruganda. Umusaruro w\u2019ubucuruzi watangiye ku ya 1 Nzeri 2020. \nNyirubwite.\nPCL ni ishami rya 100% rya Milbridge Holding SA, inyubako y'ibikoresho byubatswe, aho ifite icyicaro muri Angola, ifite amashami muri Afurika yepfo, na leta zunze ubumwe bw'abarabu hamwe nu Rwanda. \nGahunda z'ejo hazaza.\nBiteganijwe ko mu gihe icyiciro cya mbere cyuruganda rushya ruzaba rwuzuye, ruzakoresha abakozi bagera kuri 300. Nyuma, mugihe icyiciro cya kabiri cyubatswe, abandi bakozi 300 bari guhabwa akazi, kugirango abakozi buzuzanye 600. \nicyiciro cya kabiri cyo muri PCL kirangiye, u Rwanda umusaruro wa sima mu gihugu uteganijwe kuzamuka ugera kuri toni miliyoni 1.9 buri mwaka. Isima yakozwe izakoreshwa mugace, hamwe nibisohoka byoherezwa mukarere. \nIhuza ryo hanze.\n&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Coordinates/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;1\u00b029\u203235\u2033S 29\u00b039\u203237\u2033E\ufeff / \ufeff1.49309\u00b0S 29.66028\u00b0E\ufeff / -1.49309; 29.66028"}
{"id": "16956", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16956", "title": "Nation Media Group", "text": "Nation Media Group (NMG) ni itsinda ry'itangazamakuru ryo muri Kenya ryanditswe ku Isoko ry'imigabane rya Nairobi. NMG yashinzwe hamwe na Aga Khan IV muri 1959 iyobowe na AKFED kandi ni inzu nini y\u2019itangazamakuru ryigenga muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba no Hagati ifite ibiro nko muri Kenya, Uganda, na Tanzaniya. Muri 1999, NMG yatangije NTV, umuyoboro w'a makuru muri Kenya, na Easy FM. \nIbitangazamakuru.\nIbitabo byiri tsinda birimo ni nka: The EastAfrican, Daily Nation, Business Daily Africa, Daily Monitor, Umuturage, Briefing abashoramari ba NMG, hamwe na Taifa Leo na Zuqka. Ikinyamakuru Daily Nation hamwe n\u2019i cyumweru cyasohotse mu kinyamakuru kimwe, Sunday Nation, bizihije isabukuru yimyaka 50, cyiswe National Media Group cyiswe Imyaka 50 ya Zahabu, muri 2010. \nNMG ifite imigabane 76.5% muri Monitor Publications Limited hamwe na 93.3 KFM, radiyo ishingiye kuri Kampala muri Uganda. Ifite kandi televiziyo ebyiri mu gihugu, NTV Uganda na Spark TV. NMG ifite imigabane 60% muri Mwananchi Communications Limited muri Tanzaniya. Iri tsinda ryi shamikiye kuri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, cyane cyane ubucuruzi bwa Tanzaniya, rigira uruhare runini mu kuzamuka muri iryo tsinda. \nMuri Werurwe 2016, NMG yashyizeho imashini nshya yo gucapa ibihangano ku muhanda wa Mombasa i Nairobi. Ikigo gishya gifite ubushobozi bwo gucapa ibinyamakuru 86.000 mu isaha. Yatwaye KSh2 miliyari (hafi miliyoni 20 z'amadolari) kandi izacapura buri munsi Daily Nation, Business Daily, Taifa Leo hamwe nicyumweru cyitwa EastAfrican. \nUmugabane.\nImigabane y'i migabane yitsinda yashyizwe ku isoko ry\u2019imigabane rya Nairobi kandi yashyizwe ku rutonde rw\u2019imigabane ya Uganda ndetse n\u2019ivunjisha ry\u2019u Rwanda, igurisha kuri bourses zose uko ari eshatu ku kimenyetso NMG. Nko mu Kuboza 2014, muri sosiyete hari abanyamigabane 10.436. Muri bo, 4.135, yari ifite imigabane 1 kugeza kuri 500 buri umwe, hamwe hamwe hamwe hamwe imigabane 782.157, igenzura 0.41 ku ijana by'isosiyete. Abanyamigabane barindwi bakomeye bagenzuye 62.57 ku ijana byimigabane yose. Muri byo harimo:"}
{"id": "16957", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16957", "title": "KCB Group", "text": "KCB Group Limited, (KCB), ni serivisi y\u2019imari ifite isosiyete ikora mari ikorera mu karere ka Afurika y'Ibiyaga Bigari. Icyicaro cy\u2019iryo tsinda kiri i Nairobi, muri Kenya, amashami yayo akaba ari KCB Bank Kenya Limited, KCB Bank Burundi Limited, KCB Bank Rwanda Limited, KCB Bank y'Amajyepfo Sudani Limited, KCB Bank Tanzania Limited, KCB TMB Congo na KCB Bank Uganda Limited. \nIncamake.\nKugeza muri Kuboza 2017, Itsinda ryari rifite umutungo wa Miliyari 6.47 z'amadolari ya Amerika (nka KSh: Miliyari 646.7) hamwe n\u2019abanyamigabane bangana na Miliyari 1.06 z'amadolari (KSh: miliyari 105.97 z'amadolari). Muri Nyakanga 2015, ibitangazamakuru by'amakuru byatangaje ko iryo tsinda rikurikirana gahunda yo kwagura muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, Etiyopiya, na Mozambike. \nAmateka.\nAmateka ya Banki y\u2019ubucuruzi ya Kenya Limited yatangiye guhera muri Nyakanga 1896, igihe uwayibanjirije, Banki nkuru y\u2019Ubuhinde (NBI), yafunguye ishami i Mombasa kugira ngo akore ubucuruzi icyo cyambu cyari gikurura icyo gihe.\nMuri 1958, Banki ya Grindlays yifatanije na NBI ishinga Banki nkuru y\u2019igihugu na Grindlays (NGB). Nyuma y'ubwigenge, guverinoma ya Kenya yaguze imigabane 60% muri NGB mu rwego rwo kurushaho kwegera amabanki hafi ya benshi mu Banyakenya. Mu 1970, guverinoma yaguze 100 ku ijana by'imigabane muri NGB kugira ngo igenzure neza banki nini y'ubucuruzi muri Kenya. NGB yaje kwitwa Banki y'Ubucuruzi ya Kenya, (KCB). Mu 1972, KCB yaguze Savings &amp; Loan Kenya Limited, izobereye mu bijyanye n\u2019imari y\u2019inguzanyo.\nMuri 1988, 20 ku ijana bya mbere by\u2019imigabane ya guverinoma muri iyo sosiyete byagurishijwe binyuze mu Isoko rya mbere ryatangiwe ku isoko ry\u2019imigabane rya Nairobi. Guverinoma mu myaka yashize yagabanije imigabane yayo igera kuri 23,6 ku ijana. Mu kibazo cy\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019umwaka wa 2010, guverinoma yakomeje kugabanya imigabane yayo igera kuri 17.31 ku ijana.\nNyirubwite.\nUmugabane witsinda rya KCB urutonde kurutonde rwimigabane ya Nairobi munsi yikimenyetso KCB. Imigabane yitsinda ry'ambukiranya urutonde rwimigabane ya Dar es Salaam, Isoko ry\u2019imigabane mu Rwanda, n\u2019ivunjisha rya Uganda. \nKugeza ku ya 31 Ukuboza 2017, abanyamigabane icumi bakomeye mu itsinda rya KCB bari ku rutonde rukurikira: \nImiyoborere.\nUmuyobozi w'inama y'ubutegetsi ya banki ni Andrew Wambari Kairu. Paul Russo ni umuyobozi mukuru akaba n'umuyobozi mukuru w'itsinda rya banki. \nAmashami y'ishami.\nBanki y\u2019ubucuruzi ya Kenya Burundi Limited ni banki y\u2019ubucuruzi n\u2019ishami ry\u2019itsinda rya KCB muri Burundi, byemewe na Banki ya Repubulika y\u2019U burundi, umugenzuzi w\u2019amabanki mu gihugu. KCB Burundi igizwe 0,6 ku ijana by'u mutungo wose wa KCB. Biteganijwe ko umutungo wa banki wose wari hafi miliyoni 33.6 z'amadolari ya Amerika (KSh 3.34), guhera muri Kuboza 2015.\nMuri Gashyantare 2012, Itsinda rya KCB ryemerewe amabwiriza yo gushinga ishami mu Burundi. Ku ya 8 Gicurasi 2012, KCB Burundi yatangiye gutanga serivisi z\u2019amabanki, imaze guhabwa uruhushya rw\u2019amabanki y\u2019ubucuruzi ku ya 18 Mata 2012. Ishinzwe, KCB ibaye itsinda rya mbere rya serivisi zimari yashinze amashami mubihugu byose byumuryango wibihugu bya Afrika yuburasirazuba. "}
{"id": "16958", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16958", "title": "Repubulika y'inkoko", "text": "Repubulika y'inkoko ni urusobe ry'ibiryo byihuta by'abanijeriya baherewe ubushobozi mubyerekeranye n'ubunararibonye mu guteka inkoko, cyane cyane inkoko zikaranze. Yashinzwe na Deji Akinyanju, naho resitora ya mbere yashinzwe i Apapa, i Lagos mu mwaka wa 2004. Resitora ya mbere y\u2019inkoko yafunguwe i Lagos mu mwaka wa 2004, ubu ikaba icuruza ahantu hasaga 150 muri Nijeriya na Gana. \nIncamake.\nRepubulika y'inkoko ifite icyicaro i Lagos, muri Nijeriya. Sosiyete ikora ibiryo muri Nigeriya. \nIyi sosiyete twavuga ko muri Nijeriya ariyo nini cyane muri resitora y\u2019inkoko ifite ibyicaro bisaga 40 i Lagos hamwe n\u2019ibindi byicaro bisaga 190 mu gihugu hose. Repubulika y'inkoko kandi yaguye serivisi mu bindi bihugu byo muri Afurika y'Iburengerazuba harimo na Gana. "}
{"id": "16959", "revid": "11198", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16959", "title": "Kassim Basma", "text": "Kassim Basma (wavutse mu 1960 mu mujyi wa Koidu, muri Siyera Lewone) ni umuherwe w\u2019umucuruzi wo muri Siyera Lewone kandi akaba uwa kabiri mu bihugu byohereza ibicuruzwa bya diyama hanze y'igihugu muri Siyera Lewone, bingana na 38% by\u2019ibicuruzwa byoherezwa na diyama byo muri Siyera Lewone. Basma yavukiye mu Karere ka Kono mu burasirazuba bwa Siyera Lewone. Yavukiye mu muryango ukomoka mu gihugu cya Libani ukomoka mu mudugudu wa Ain Baal wo mu majyepfo ya Libani. Ni umwe mu bagize umuryango wa Basma, umwe mu miryango ya cyera cyane ikomoka muri Libani mu gihugu cya Siyera Lewone."}
{"id": "16960", "revid": "11198", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16960", "title": "Jumai Bello", "text": "Hajia Jumai Bello ni umuyobozi mukuru w'itangazamakuru mu gihugu cya Nijeriya. Niwe mugore wa mbere wabaye umuyobozi wa radiyo muri radiyo ya Bauchi. Yabaye umuyobozi wa mbere w\u2019umugore uyobora Bauchi Radio Corporation. Yemejwe n'uwahoze ari guverineri Mohammed Abubakar wo muri Leta ya Bauchi. Mbere yo kugirwa MD (umuyobozi mukuru) w'ikigo, yakoraga nk'umuyobozi ushinzwe amakuru n'ibikorwa bigezweho. Mu 1982, yarangije muri kaminuza ya Bayero, i Kano aho yize itumanaho rusange. "}
{"id": "16961", "revid": "11596", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16961", "title": "Kilimanjaro (resitora)", "text": "Kilimanjaro ni umuyoboro wihuta wa resitora muri Nigeriya wafunguwe mu mwaka wa 2004 ukaba ufite icyicaro i Port Harcourt. Iyi resitora ni imwe mu ziri kuzamuka vuba muri Nijeriya. Uyu munsi ifite ibyicaro bisaga 51 muri Nijeriya, harimo umurwa mukuru wa Abuja, Lagos, ndetse no mu bindi bice bya federasiyo. \nKilimanjaro ifitwe na marike ya resitora ya Sundry Foods, kandi bakorera mu murenge w'ihuse wa Resitora (QSR). Kilimanjaro kuva yatangira kwigaragaza nk'imbaraga zo gutumbagira mu kirere, kandi izwi nk'imwe mu murikagurisha rya resitora ryihuta cyane muri Nijeriya, rifite amaduka arenga 48 akorera ahantu hatandukanye."}
{"id": "16962", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16962", "title": "Mama Cass (resitora)", "text": "\"Mama Cass Resitora\" ni imwe mu masosiyete ashingiye ku biribwa muri Nijeriya. \nAmateka.\nUgushyingo mu mwaka wa 1983, Charis Grace Onabowale yafunguye ahantu ha mbere kuri Allen Avenue, Ikeja, muri Leta ya Lagos. Isoko rya mbere ryatwaye bwa mbere ikirango cya \"Mama Cass Cafeteria\". Muri iki gihe Mama Cass Resitora ifite urusobe rw\u2019amaresitora agera kuri 14 yihuta mu kunoza serivisi za resitora ndetse inagura aho ikorera mu tundi turere tw\u2019igihugu. Usibye Lagos, andi mashami aherereye mu zindi ntara za Nigeriya harimo Ogun, Edo, FCT, ndetse no mu Bwongereza. Mama Cass n'inzobere mu mafunguro gakondo (afurika) yo mu rugo hamwe no guteka ibiryo mpuzamahanga nibindi bintu nka Oven Fresh pasties, Jaydens Sliced Bread. Usibye urusobe rwa resitora, banakora imigati ndetse n'inganda nazo zirakora. Yagutse kandi mu micungire ya kantine y'inganda, ibikorwa byigenga byokurya no gutanga imigati myinshi. "}
{"id": "16963", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16963", "title": "Mr Bigg's", "text": "Mr Bigg's ni imwe muri resitora zigira ibiryo byihuta byo muri Nigeriya. Ifitwe na sosiyete Nyafurika Yunze ubumwe ya Nijeriya PLC, kuri ubu hari ahantu hafi 170 muri Nijeriya, harimo na resitora ya mbere yakirira abakiriya mu modoka batavuye mu binyabiziga byabo muri iki gihugu, hamwe n\u2019ibindi bine muri Gana. Mu mwaka wa 2013, Itsinda ry'Ibyamamare byo muri Afurika yepfo, byaguze imigabane 49% muri rwarusobe rw'amaduka. \nResitora izwiho ibara ry'umutuku n'umuhondo hamwe n'ibiryo by'inyama. Amateka ya Mr Bigg yatangirana n'amaduka ya kawa imbere y'ububiko bwa Kingsway mu myaka ya za 1960. Mu mwaka wa 1973, ayo maduka yiswe Kingsway Rendezvous, aba Mr Bigg mu mwaka wa 1986. Urwo rusobe rw'amaduka rwagutse vuba nyuma yo kuba rumwe mu masosiyete ya mbere yo muri Nigeriya yagurishije impushya ku bashoramari."}
{"id": "16964", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16964", "title": "Tantalizers", "text": "Tantalizers ni umuyoboro wambere wihuta kandi ukagira ibiryo bimeze neza bya abanijeriya. Yafunguye aho gukorera ha mbere ahagana mu mwaka wa 1997 mumujyi wa Festac, Lagos. Aha hantu bwa mbere habanje resitora ntoya y'abaturanyi yakoraga hamburg. Intsinzi ya mbere babonye aha hantu yabagejeje ku kwaguka kwatumye habaho sosiyete ndetse banaboneraho impushya zo gufungura andi ma resitora mumijyi nka Lagos, Ibadan, Abuja, na Port Harcourt. Kugeza mu mwaka wa 2015, iyi resitora yari ifite andi mashami agera kuri 50 muri Nijeriya. Tantalizers itanga ibiryo byihuta byo muri Nigeriya nk'ibinyama, umugati urimo amagi, inkoko, umuceri wa jollof, umuceri ukaranze, keke, na hamburg. "}
{"id": "16965", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16965", "title": "Gasegereti", "text": "bimwe mubituma u Rwanda rwihuta mu iterambere harimo no gucukura amabuye y'agaciro (Gasegerei)\nmbere 'ubukoroni abanyarwanda bari bataramenya ko bafite ubutunzi munsi 'ubutaka bwu Rwanda\nahagana mu mwaka wi 1945 ni abazungu baturutse mugihugu cy'ububirigi batahuye ko mu Rwanda aho kuri\nubu twita mu karere ka kayonza mu murenge wa Rwinkwavu hari amabuye y'agaciro (Gasegereti)\nMbere y'ubwigenge mu Rwanda.\nmu myaka yo hambere nko muri 1945 Ababirigi bamaze gutahura ko mu Rwanda hari ubutunzi bukomeye munsi y'ubutaka batangiye gucukura gasegereti mu murenge wa Rwinkwavu gusa icyogihe u Rwanda nabanyarwanda nta nyungu nimwe babiguzemo kuko ababirigi bacukuraga bohereza mugihugu cyabo. gusa nago byatinze u Rwanda ahagana mu mwaka 1962 rwaje kubona ubwigenge byari ibyagaciro gakomeye kubanyarwanda bose kuko ibirombe byeguriwe Leta yu Rwanda batangira gucukura amabuye y'agaciro (Gasegereti) ndetse batangira no kubibonamo inyungu.\nIterambere.\nkugeza ubu U Rwanda ni igihugu kiri munzira y'iterambere biturutse munzira nyinshi zitandukanye kubaka inganda, Imihanda, imiturirwa, amavuriro,amashuri ndetse ndettse nibindi kugeza ubu mu karere ka Kayonza mu murenge wa Rwinkwavu hari uruganda rwitwa Wolframe Mining and Process LTD rushinzwe gucukura ndetse no guttunganya aya mabuye y'agaciro acukurwa muri aka karere\nImiterere t ya Gasegereti.\nAya mabuye yitwa Gasegereti utayazi wagirango ni ibuye risanzwe kuburyyo wanaryubakisha waryitiranyije nandi mabuye asanzwe gusa gasegeretti yavuye mumazi ndetse niyavuye ku musozi ziba zitandukanye inyuma ariko imbere ari zimwe kimwe muu bikubwira ko ari Gasegereti iyo uriteruye riba rifitte uburemere butandukane kure cyane n'ingano yaryo. abacukura aya mabuye bavuga ko riba riruta uburemere ibuye risanzwe bingana inshuro 10 bitewe nibirigize (\u00e9tain/tin)\nIbyagezweho.\nU Rwanda rufite ubwoko 5 bw'amabuye y'agaciro yoherezwa ku isoko mpuzamahanga Gasegereti, Coltan, Wolfram, Zahabu na Gemstone cyangwa amabengeza mu Kinyarwanda. Rufite kandi sosiyete 120 zikora ubwo bucukuzi.\nu Rwanda kandi ruvugako rufie amabue ahagije kandi aboneka hose mugihugu "}
{"id": "16966", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16966", "title": "Ifashabayo Dejoie Sylvain", "text": "Ifashabayo Dejoie Sylvain (yavutse ku ya 30 Mata 1994) ni rwiyemezamirimo ukomoka mu Rwanda. Yashinze umuryango Hope initiative muri 2016. Ni umuyobozi ushinzwe ibikorwa muri Anidaso.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nDejoie yavukiye mu majyepfo y'u Rwanda, ku Kamonyi akurira mu mujyi wa Kigali. Muri 2015, yimukiye muri Gana mu gukurikirana amashuri makuru muri kaminuza ya Ashesi nk'umuhanga wa MasterCard.\nUburezi.\nDejoie yize muri Lyc\u00e9e de Kigali mu mashuri yisumbuye. Kuri ubu ari muri kaminuza ya Ashesi atanga Ubuyobozi n'Ubuyobozi\nIbihembo no kumenyekana.\nYakiriye ibihembo byinshi nka MasterCard bourse Award. Kuri ubu ni mugenzi wa Dalai Lama. Afite kandi ibihembo muri kaminuza ya Ashesi nka, yatsindiye ikibuga kinini."}
{"id": "16967", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16967", "title": "Abashoramari ku mugabane w'afurika", "text": "Ishoramari muri Afurika ni ibikorwa byo gushyira imari mu bikorwa by\u2019ubukungu, imishinga cyangwa imitungo bigamije kubona inyungu mu gihe kizaza. Rikorwa n\u2019abashoramari bo ku mugabane wa Afurika ndetse n\u2019abaturuka mu mahanga, kandi rikorwa mu nzego zirimo ibikorwa remezo, ubuhinzi, ingufu, ikoranabuhanga, ubucuruzi n\u2019inganda\nAmateka.\nUmugabane wa Afurika ukomeje kwakira igice gito cy\u2019ishoramari mpuzamahanga ugereranyije n\u2019indi migabane, ariko ukagaragaza amahirwe menshi yo kubona inyungu ku bashoramari. Ubwiyongere bw\u2019abaturage, umutungo kamere, amasoko agenda yaguka ndetse n\u2019ivugurura ry\u2019amategeko agamije koroshya ubucuruzi biri mu bituma inyota yo gushora imari muri Afurika ikomeza kwiyongera \nMugihe mu mwaka wa 2050 ahandi kw'isi abaturage bazaba bagabanuka muri Afurika ho bazaba barikubye aho bazaba bangana na 25\u0325% by'abaturage batuye isi bose bavuye kuri 17%. \nImbogamizi.\nNubwo Afurika ifite amahirwe menshi y\u2019ishoramari, hari imbogamizi zikomeje kugabanya umuvuduko w\u2019ishoramari kuri uyu mugabane. Muri zo harimo imiyoborere idahagije, ruswa, amakimbirane ya politiki, umutekano muke, ibibazo by\u2019ibikorwa remezo ndetse n\u2019amabwiriza y\u2019ubucuruzi adahoraho mu bihugu bimwe na bimwe. Izi nzitizi zishobora gutuma bamwe mu bashoramari bagira impungenge zo gushora imari yabo muri Afurika cyangwa bagasaba ingamba zihariye zo kugabanya ibyago by\u2019ishoramari.\nIngamba zo koroshya ishoramari muri Afurika.\nUmugabane w'Afurika witeze imbaraga mu ishoramari riturutse hanze y'umugabane w'afurika aho rizatiza imbaraga ishoramari mu bikorwa remezo ribariwa muyagera kuri Miliyari 108\u032f$ ku mwaka.\nRaporo ya W orld Bank Doinng Busoness ya 2017 yari ibaye ku nshuro ya 14, aho iba isuzuma amabwiriza n'ibisabwa kugirango mu gihugu runaka umuntu atangire bizinesi.\nMuri ibyo harimo kureba uko umuntu yoroherezwa gutangira businesi, guhabwa ibyangombwa byo kubaka, kugezwaho amashanyarazi, kwandikisha umutungo, kubona inguzanyo, kurinda abashoramari baciriritse n'ibindi birimo kwishyura imisoro."}
{"id": "16968", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16968", "title": "Great Lakes Energy", "text": "Great Lakes Energy yashinzwe na Sam Dargan muri 2005. Ni Isosiyete ifite icyicaro mu mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda kandi ikorera cyane isoko rya Afurika y'Iburasirazuba. Isosiyete ifite ubuhanga bwo gukoresha ingufu zituruka ku mirasire y'izuba. Mu myaka icumi ishize, isosiyete yibanda cyane mu gusobanukirwa no gukemura ibibazo by\u2019ingufu by\u2019abo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba. Uyu munsi dukoresha ubwo bumenyi nuburambe mugushushanya, kubaka, no kubungabunga sisitemu yizuba yizewe, irambye, kandi ihendutse. Isosiyete itanga imiryango itegamiye kuri leta, ibitaro, n\u2019ishuri hamwe na sisitemu nziza y\u2019amafoto. Isosiyete ifite ubuhanga bwo kuvugurura ibishushanyo mbonera bya PV bituruka kuri grid hamwe na verisiyo nziza. Mubihe byashize iyi sosiyete yatanze akazi ko guhugura abanyarwanda baho uburyo bwo gukora injeniyeri no gushyiraho sisitemu. Isosiyete kandi yatanze amahugurwa kubandi ba rwiyemezamirimo bashinzwe imibereho biga gukorera muri Afurika. \nIngufu nini zo mu biyaga bigari zikwirakwiza amatara ya sun King lamps nka Green Light Energy muri 2013 zemerera gutanga igisubizo cyu mucyo urambye\u00a0 ingo zo mucyaro mu Rwanda. \nMu mwaka wo muri 2014, ingufu z\u2019ibiyaga bigari zafatanije na Global Bright Light Foundation gukwirakwiza amatara y\u2019umwami w\u2019izuba ku mpunzi ziri mu nkambi y\u2019impunzi ya UNHCR Kiziba muri Rwanda. \nMuri 2016 Ingufu z'Ibiyaga Bigari zabaye umugabuzi wemewe wa Victron Energy https://www.victronenergy.com/"}
{"id": "16969", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16969", "title": "Rwamagana Solar Power Station", "text": "Rwamagana Solar Power Station ni urugomero rw'amashanyarazi aho akomoka ku mirasire y'izuba rukora wate 8.5MW mu Rwanda,kandi ruri m'ubukungu bwa kane mu bunini muri muryango w'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba.\nAho biherereye.\nRwamagana Solar Power Station ni urugomero rw'amashanyarazi aho akomoka ku mirasire y'izuba rukora wate 8.5MW mu Rwanda, \u00a0ruri m'ubukungu bwa kane mu bunini muri muryango w'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba.\nSitasiyo y'amashanyarazi yiherereye ku butaka budakodeshwa, mu kigo cy;umudugudu w'urubyiruko rwa Agahozo shallom, mu karere ka \nRwamagana mu ntara y;iburasirazuba nko mu birometero 58 ku muhanda, mu majyepfo y;uburasirazuba bwa kigali. \n(-2.026111:uburebure:30.37722\nINSHAMAKE\nMuri Nyakanga 2013, guverinoma y'u Rwanda yagiranye amasezerano na GigaWatt Global, isosiyete yo mu Buholandi, guteza imbere urugomero rw'amashanyarazi akomoka ku mirasire y'izuba ya Megawatt 8.5 mu Karere ka Rwamagana, mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba, ku giciro cy'amadorari miliyoni 23 z'amadolari y'Amerika (miliyari 15 z'amafaranga). Giga Watt Global yatera inkunga, kubaka, gutunga no gukoresha icyo kigo imyaka 25, hamwe n\u2019ingufu zakozwe zagurishijwe mu Rwanda Energy, ikigo cy\u2019amashanyarazi mu gihugu.kandi uyu mushinga ukaba utanga ingufu zikomoka ku izuba. \nMuri Gashyantare 2014, GigaWatt Global yashoboye kugera ku ihagarikwa ry\u2019amafaranga, bituma kubaka bitangira. Guhuza imiyoboro y'amashanyarazi y'igihugu byagezweho muri Nyakanga 2014, kandi muri Nzeri 2014, urugomero rw'amashanyarazi rwakoraga ku bushobozi buhebuje. Sitasiyo y'amashanyarazi igizwe na 28.360 panele yamashanyarazi ikwirakwizwa kuri muri 50 z' umurima. Igiciro cya nyuma cyubwubatsi, harimo nigiciro cyo kugera kuri gride yigihugu cyageze kuri miliyoni 23.7 z'amafaranga y'uRwanda. Inkunga yaturutse ahantu henshi, harimo (a) Isosiyete ishinzwe imari y\u2019iterambere ry\u2019Ubuholandi (b) Ikigega cy\u2019ibikorwa Remezo cya Afurika kivuka na (c) Norfund. Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019ishoramari ryigenga muri Leta zunze ubumwe za Amerika hamwe n\u2019ubufatanye bwa ingufu n\u2019ibidukikije muri Finilande byatanze inkunga. \nSitasiyo y\u2019amashanyarazi iherereye ku butaka bukodeshwa, mu kigo cy\u2019umudugudu w\u2019urubyiruko rwa Agahozo Shalom, mu Karere ka Rwamagana, mu Rwanda rw\u2019iburasirazuba, nko mu kilometero 58 kumuhanda, mu majyepfo yuburasirazuba bwa Kigali. sitasiyo yamashanyarazi iherereye kuri: 2 \u00b0 01'34.0 \"S, 30 \u00b0 22'38.0\" E (Ubunini: -2.026111; Uburebure: 30.377222). \nIncamake.\nMuri Nyakanga 2013, guverinoma y'u Rwanda yagiranye amasezerano na GigaWatt Global, isosiyete yo mu Buholandi, guteza imbere urugomero rw'amashanyarazi akomoka ku mirasire y'izuba ya Megawatt 8.5 mu Karere ka Rwamagana, mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba, ku giciro cy'amadorari miliyoni 23 z'amadolari y'Amerika (miliyari 15 z'amafaranga). Giga Watt Global yatera inkunga, kubaka, gutunga no gukoresha icyo kigo imyaka 25, hamwe n\u2019ingufu zakozwe zagurishijwe mu Rwanda Energy, ikigo cy\u2019amashanyarazi mu gihugu. \nMuri Gashyantare 2014, GigaWatt Global yashoboye kugera ku ihagarikwa ry\u2019amafaranga, bituma kubaka bitangira. Guhuza imiyoboro y'amashanyarazi y'igihugu byagezweho muri Nyakanga 2014, kandi muri Nzeri 2014, urugomero rw'amashanyarazi rwakoraga ku bushobozi buhebuje. Sitasiyo y'amashanyarazi igizwe na 28.360 panele yamashanyarazi ikwirakwizwa kuri muri 50 z' umurima. Igiciro cya nyuma cyubwubatsi, harimo nigiciro cyo kugera kuri gride yigihugu cyageze kuri miliyoni 23.7 z'amafaranga y'uRwanda. Inkunga yaturutse ahantu henshi, harimo (a) Isosiyete ishinzwe imari y\u2019iterambere ry\u2019Ubuholandi (b) Ikigega cy\u2019ibikorwa Remezo cya Afurika kivuka na (c) Norfund. Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019ishoramari ryigenga muri Leta zunze ubumwe za Amerika hamwe n\u2019ubufatanye bwa ingufu n\u2019ibidukikije muri Finilande byatanze inkunga. \nUru rugomero rukora imyirasire hifashishijwe Silicon. Imyirasire aho iba iteretse igenda yerekeza aho izuba ryerekeza,mu gitondo yerekeza iburasirazuba nimugoroba ikerekeza iburengerazuba saa Sitaiba ireba hejuruI. Uko iyo myirasire yubakiye biratangaje kuba ibasha kugana aha izuba rigana. "}
{"id": "16970", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16970", "title": "Kawanda\u2013Birembo High Voltage Power Line", "text": "Kawanda\u2013Birembo High Voltage Power Line ni uruganda rukora amashanyarazi, rurimo kubakwa hagati y'u Rwanda na Uganda. \nAho biherereye.\nUmuyoboro w'amashanyarazi wa kilovolt zigera kuri 220 utangirira kuri sitasiyo y\u2019amashanyarazi ya Uganda ahitwa Kawanda, mu Karere ka Wakiso, mu karere ko hagati ya Uganda, nko muri kilometero 15.5, mumajyaruguru ya Kampala, umurwa mukuru nu mujyi munini wa Uganda. Kuva aha, umurongo ujya mu majyepfo y\u2019iburengerazuba bwa Uganda umujyi wa Masaka, intera igororotse igera kuri kilometero 121. Kuva i Masaka, umurongo w'amashanyarazi ukomeza iburengerazuba ugana mu mujyi wa Mbarara, intera igororotse igera kuri kilometeero 1310. Kuva Mbarara umurongo w'amashanyarazi ugenda werekeza mu majyepfo ugana mu mujyi wa Mirama Hills, intera ya kilometero 66. Uhereye kuri sitasiyo yo mu gace ka Mirama Hills / Kagitumba, umurongo w'amashanyarazi urakomeza werekeza mu majyepfo y'iburengerazuba kugira ngo urangire kuri sitasiyo i Birembo, Umurenge wa Kinyinya, Akarere ka Gasabo, u Rwanda, mu nkengero z'amajyaruguru ya Kigali, umurwa mukuru n'umujyi munini. y'u Rwanda, intera igororotse igera kuri kolometero 110. \nIncamake.\nUyu murongo w'amashanyarazi uhuza umuyoboro w'amashanyarazi wa Uganda n'u Rwanda ruturanye. Ijyanye na gahunda y'ibikorwa byo mu biyaga bya Nil Ekwatoriya, Guhuza umushinga w'amashanyarazi, iyobowe n'umuyobozi w'akarere, Grania Rubomboras. Uyu murongo w'amashanyarazi urimo gutezwa imbere hamwe na Karuma y\u2019amashanyarazi ya Karuma, biteganijwe ko umusaruro wa 600 MW uzakoreshwa mu karere ndetse n\u2019amafaranga asigaye akagurishwa mu karere, u Rwanda, u Burundi na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo bikaba bishoboka ko ari abakiriya. \nUbwubatsi muri Uganda.\nUmushinga kuruhande rwa Uganda ugabanyijemo ibice bitatu: (a) igice cya Kawanda - Masaka, gipima kilometero 137 (b) igice cya Masaka - Mbarara, gipima kilometero130 na (c) igice cya Mbarara - Mirama Hills, gipima kilometero 66.\nIgice cya Kawanda ugana Masaka cyubatswe ku ngengo y\u2019imari ingana na miliyoni 153.20 z\u2019amadolari y\u2019Amerika, muri yo Banki y\u2019isi ikaba yagurije miliyoni 120 z'amadolare. Kurangiza byari biteganijwe muri Mutarama 2019. Icyakora, muri Nyakanga 2018, Daily Monitor yatangaje ko umurongo wa 220 kV watangijwe. \nIgice cya Masaka kugeza Mbarara cyateganijwe miliyoni 50 z'amayero, kugurizwa mu kigega cy\u2019ibikorwa remezo cy\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Uburayi. Biteganijwe ko imirimo izatangira mu gihembwe cya kane cya 2017 bikaba biteganijwe ko izarangira muri 2019. Muri Werurwe 2018, Ikinyamakuru Uganda Independent cyatangaje ko guverinoma ya Uganda yagurije miliyoni 37.1 z'amayero mu kigo cy\u2019iterambere ry\u2019Ubufaransa n\u2019indi miliyoni 35 z\u2019amayero muri Banki y\u2019iterambere ry\u2019Ubudage kugira ngo itere inkunga igice cya Masaka-Mbarara cy\u2019uyu murongo. \nIgice cya Mbarara Mirama Hills cyarangiye mu 2015. \nUbwubatsi mu Rwanda.\nIgice cya Mirama / Kagitumba - Birembo gipima hafi kilometero 100. Igice cya Mbarara - Birembo gipima kilometero 166. Nkuko byatangajwe na EastAfrican muri Gicurasi 2015, uyu muyoboro wa 220 kV umaze kubaho. U Rwanda narwo ruri mu nzira yo kubaka sitasiyo ya 220 kV i Birembo. \nAmajyambere ya vuba.\nKu munsi ukurikiraho, biteganijwe ko umurongo wa Kawanda Birembo Umuyoboro mwinshi w'amashanyarazi uzamurwa kuri 400kV. Muri Gicurasi 2018, guverinoma ya Uganda yagujije miliyoni 37.1 z'amayero (hafi miliyoni 44.2 z'amadolari y'Amerika), mu kigo gishinzwe iterambere ry'Ubufaransa, kugira ngo izamure kilometero 135, hagati yimijyi ya Masaka na Mbarara kugeza 400 kV. Mu Gushyingo 2020, ikinyamakuru New Vision cyatangaje ko Banki ishinzwe iterambere ry\u2019Ubudage (KfW) yateye inkunga igice cyo kuzamura igice cya Masaka - Masaka kigera kuri 400kV. "}
{"id": "16971", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16971", "title": "Kigoma\u2013Butare\u2013Ngozi\u2013Gitega High Voltage Power Line", "text": "Kigoma\u2013Butare\u2013Ngozi\u2013Gitega High Voltage Power Line, ni umuyoboro w'amashanyarazi uhuza u Rwanda - Burundi, U ni umuyoboro w'amashanyarazi munini, urimo kubakwa, uhuza amashanyarazi menshi i Kigoma mu Rwanda n'undi muyoboro munini wa Gitega mu Burundi. \nAho biherereye.\nUmurongo w'amashanyarazi wa kilovolt 220 utangirira mu itsinda ry\u2019ingufu z\u2019u Rwanda (REG) 220kV mu mujyi wa Kigoma Rwanda, hafi kilometero 76.5, mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bwa Kigali, umurwa mukuru wu Rwanda. Kuva aha, umurongo w'amashanyarazi ujya mu majyepfo ya Rwanda mu mujyi wa Butare (Huye), umuhanda uri hagati y'ibirometero muyoboro w'amashanyarazi 51. Kuva i Butare, umurongo w'amashanyarazi ukomeza mu majyepfo kugera ku mupaka mpuzamahanga n'Uburundi. Yambuka umupaka ikomeza igana mu mujyi wa Ngozi, intera y'ibirometero bigera kuri muyoboro w'amashanyarazi 75 \nKuva i Ngozi, umurongo w'amashanyarazi ugenda werekeza mu majyepfo ugana mu mujyi wa Gitega, umurwa mukuru w'u Burundi, umuhanda uri hagati y'ibirometero muyoboro w'amashanyarazi 83, bikarangirira ku zindi 220 kV, iyi ifitwe na REGIDESO Burundi. Uburebure bw'uyu murongo w'amashanyarazi ngo ni muyoboro w'amashanyarazi 140.7, kuva ku mpera kugeza ku iherezo, hamwe na muyoboro w'amashanyarazi 61.5 mu Rwanda na muyoboro w'amashanyarazi 79.2 mu Burundi. \nIncamake.\nUyu muyoboro w'amashanyarazi uhuza umuyoboro w'amashanyarazi w'u Rwanda n'uw'abaturanyi b'Uburundi. Ijyanye na gahunda y'ibikorwa byo mu biyaga bya Nil Ekwatoriya, Guhuza umushinga w'amashanyarazi, iyobowe n'umuyobozi w'akarere, Grania Rubomboras. Umuyoboro w'amashanyarazi urimo gutegurwa mu rwego rwo koroshya guhanahana amashanyarazi hagati y'ibihugu byombi bituranye no kwitegura kugura amashanyarazi mu bindi bihugu byo muri afurika y'Iburasirazuba Power Pool (EAPP), ifite ingufu zisumbuye zo kugurisha. Ibihugu bifite ingufu zisagutse muri EAPP birimo Etiyopiya, Kenya na Uganda.\nUbwubatsi mu Burundi.\nUbwubatsi mu Burundi bwatangiye muri Kanama 2020. Amasezerano y'ubwubatsi, amasoko nu bwubatsi (EPC) yahawe ihuriro rigizwe na \"Transrail Lighting\" yo mu buhinde na \"Hanbaek\" ukomoka muri Koreya yepfo. Igice cy'Uburundi cy'uyu muyoboro w'amashanyarazi giterwa inkunga n'inguzanyo zahawe leta y'Uburundi, gitangwa na Banki Nyafurika itsura amajyambere ndetse n'Umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Uburayi. \nUbwubatsi mu Rwanda.\nMuri 2018, byavuzwe ko KfW igiye gutera inkunga igice cy'u Rwanda kuri uyu murongo w'amashanyarazi. Mu 2022, ibitangazamakuru byo kuri interineti byatangaje ko umurongo wose mu bihugu byombi uzaterwa inkunga na Banki nyafurika itsura amajyambere ndetse n\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Uburayi. \nIbindi bitekerezo.\nUmurongo w'amashanyarazi wakozwe muburyo butuma ikora kuri 110 kV cyangwa 220 kV, niba nibikenewe. Akazi karimo kubaka insimburangingo nshya kuri Kigoma na Gitega, ndetse no guhuza impande zombi z'umurongo w'amashanyarazi ugana ibigo bigenzura i Kigali, u Rwanda mu majyaruguru na Bujumbura, u Burundi mu majyepfo. "}
{"id": "16972", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16972", "title": "Ingufu mu Rwanda", "text": "Ikoreshwa ry'ingufu mu Rwanda ririmo guhinduka vuba mu ntangiriro z'ikinyejana cyo muri 21.\nAmashanyarazi.\nUmuyoboro.\nIngano y'amashanyarazi ni nke cyane kandi yibanze cyane hafi ya Kigali. Benshi mu gihugu bakoresha inkwi nk\u2019isoko nya mukuru y\u2019ingufu. U Rwanda ruteganya kwaguka kuva kuri MW 276 z'amashanyarazi muri 2022 rukagera kuri MW 556 muri 2024 kandi rushobora gutumiza amashanyarazi y\u2019inyongera mu bihugu duturanye. Byongeye kandi, irimo gushyiraho imirasire y'izuba ntoya mu gihugu hose kugira ngo ingo ziherereye mu turere twa gride zitabona amashanyarazi, cyangwa zifashe guhangana n\u2019umuriro w'amashanyarazi. Kugeza ubu, guverinoma irateganya kugeza amashanyarazi ku baturage 100% mu 2024, bitandukanye na 74.5% muri 2022. \nIgisekuru.\nHamwe n\u2019ibikorwa remezo by\u2019amashanyarazi bigarukira, u Rwanda rufite urwego rwo hejuru rwo gukoresha ingufu zishobora kongera ingufu. Amashanyarazi menshi mu gihugu aturuka ku mashanyarazi. Umusaruro w'amashanyarazi wagize 4% by'ingufu zikoreshwa mu gihugu muri 2014,\nAmashanyarazi.\n53% by'amashanyarazi bitangwa niganda nto z'amashanyarazi. Mu mpera za 2018, uruganda rw\u2019amashanyarazi ruhuza u Rwanda rwatanze nka 221.1 MW. \nUmwuka wa gaze.\nUmushinga wa KivuWatt ni umushinga w'ingufu zo gukuramo gaze karemano yashonze mu kiyaga cya Kivu no gukoresha gaze yakuwe mu kubyara amashanyarazi. Muri 2016, urugomero rw'amashanyarazi rwa MW 25 rushobora gutanga ingufu zihagije ku bantu 45.000 mu Rwanda. Biteganijwe ko umushinga wo kwagura ibikorwa uzongerwaho MW 26 z'a mashanyarazi mu cyiciro cyayo cya mbere, kandi amaherezo uzagera kuri MW 100 mu myaka iri imbere. \nIkigereranyo cyizuba.\nUmurima wa mbere ufite ingufu zikomoka ku mirasire y'izuba muri Afurika yo munsi y'Ubutayu bwa Sahara hanze y'afurika y'Epfo ni uruganda rwa MW 8.5 ku Mudugudu w'Urubyiruko rwa Agahozo Shalom, mu Karere ka Rwamagana, Intara y'Iburasirazuba bw'u Rwanda. Yakodesheje hectare zigera 20 z'ubutaka mu mudugudu akaba ari umugiraneza wo kubakira no kwigisha abahohotewe na jenoside mu Rwanda. Uruganda rukoresha amashanyarazi 28,360 kandi rutanga 6% yu muriro w'amashanyarazi mu gihugu. Uyu mushinga wubatswe n\u2019abahanga muri Amerika, Isiraheli, Ubuholandi, Noruveje, Finilande n\u2019Ubwongereza. \nMicro izuba.\nImikoreshereze y'amashanyarazi akomoka ku mirasire y'izuba yariyongereye kuko ibiciro by'izuba byagabanutse kandi uduce twinshi ntitwiteze guhuza imiyoboro ya vuba. Imirasire y'izuba itanga amashanyarazi arenga 2% mu gihugu. Igihugu kiri mu kwaguka byihuse umuyoboro w\u2019amashanyarazi kandi hashyizweho ibihingwa byinshi bishya cyangwa byubakwa.\nBiomass.\nBiomass ni isoko yingenzi y'ingufu zikoreshwa hifashishijwe inkwi n'imyanda yu buhinzi mu guteka. Muri 2014, ibyo byagaragaje 85% by'ingufu zikoreshwa mu Rwanda. Peat iva mu bishanga byo mu majyepfo y\u2019iburengerazuba bw\u2019u Rwanda bizatanga amashanyarazi abiri. Uruganda rwa MW 15 rwa mbere ruteganijwe kumurongo muri 2015 hamwe nuwa kabiri, uruganda rwa MW 80, ruteganijwe muri 2017.\nAndi masoko y'ingufu.\nIbikomoka kuri peteroli, cyane mu bwikorezi, byagaragaje 11% by\u2019ingufu z\u2019u Rwanda muri 2014. N\u2019ubwo bivugwa ko u Rwanda rufite peteroli na gaze gasanzwe hafi y\u2019ikiyaga cya Kivu, guhera muri 2014, nta musaruro w\u2019umutungo wabonetse kandi ibyifuzo byatumijwe mu mahanga. Umuyoboro wa peteroli wa Kenya - Uganda - Rwanda watwara peteroli hagati yibi bihugu niyubakwa."}
{"id": "16973", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16973", "title": "KivuWatt Power Station", "text": "Sitasiyo ya KivuWatt ni uruganda rukora amashanyarazi aho rutanga EgaWate 26 za gaze metani hamwe n'ingufu zamashanyarazi mu Rwanda. \nAho biherereye.\nUrugomero rw'amashanyarazi ruherereye ku Kibuye, mu Karere ka Karongi, mu Ntara y'Iburengerazuba bw'u Rwanda, mu bilometero 130, iburengerazuba bwa Kigali, umurwa mukuru wu Rwanda \nIncamake.\nUmushinga wa KivuWatt uzakuramo metani m'umazi y'ikiyaga cya Kivu kandi ukoreshe gaze kubyara amashanyarazi. Amashanyarazi azagurwa na Rwanda Electricity Corporation (RECO), ishinzwe amashanyarazi yo mu Rwanda.\nUyu mushinga wa miliyoni 200 z'amadorali, ufitwe na Contour Global ukanashyirwa mu bikorwa ku bufatanye na W\u00e4rtsil\u00e4, biteganijwe ko uzongerera 26MW ubushobozi bwo gutanga ingufu mu cyiciro cyayo cya mbere kandi amaherezo uzagera kuri 100 MW mu myaka iri imbere. Mu gihugu cyateye imbere, 25 MW y'ubu yatanga ingufu zihagije ku bantu 45.000. \nIcyiciro cya 1 cy'umushinga, gifite ubushobozi bwa 25 MW, byari biteganijwe ko kizatangira ibikorwa byubucuruzi muri 2012. Icyiciro cya 2 cyu mushinga, gifite ingufu zingana na MW 75, biteganijwe ko kizatangira kubakwa nyuma y\u2019amezi atandatu itangiye icyiciro cya 1. Uyu mushinga urimo gutegurwa na KivuWatt Limited, ishami rya Contour Global, hashingiwe ku masezerano y\u2019inyungu yagiranye na guverinoma y\u2019u Rwanda muri 2009. KivuWatt Limited irateganya gukuramo zimwe muri metero kibe zigera kuri miliyari 60 za gaze metani yafatiwe munsi y\u2019ikiyaga cya Kivu no guhindura iyo gazi amashanyarazi, ikintu kikaba kitarakozwe ku bucuruzi bunini mbere. Ubwubatsi bwarangiye muri Gushyingo 2015 kandi sitasiyo y\u2019amashanyarazi yari irimo kugeragezwa no gukurikizwa guhera mu Gushyingo 2015 kugeza itangiye gukoreshwa muri Kamena 2016.\nUrugomero rw'amashanyarazi rwa KivuWatt rwafunguwe na perezida w'u Rwanda Paul Kagame ku ya 16 Gicurasi 2016. "}
{"id": "16974", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16974", "title": "Terracom", "text": "Terracom ni isosiyete y'itumanaho yo mu Rwanda, itanga serivisi za interineti na serivisi za telefone. Isosiyete ifite icyicaro i Kigali naho indi campanyi bakora bimwe mu Rwanda ni Rwandatel."}
{"id": "16975", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16975", "title": "Airtel Rwanda", "text": "Airtel Rwanda ni sosiyete y'itumanaho ikorera mu Rwanda. Itanga serivisi za telefone igendanwa na interineti. Ni ishami rya Airtel Africa. Airtel Africa iri mu itsinda rya sosiyete y'Abahinde Bharti Airtel.\nAirtel yatangiye gukorera mu Rwanda mu 2012. Mu 2018, Airtel Rwanda yaguze Tigo Rwanda. Ubu ni sosiyete ya kabiri y'itumanaho mu gihugu, nyuma ya MTN Rwanda.\nAmateka.\nMu 2011, Urwego Ngenzuramikorere (RURA) rwahaye Airtel uruhushya. Urwo ruhushya rwari urwo gukoresha imiyoboro ya telefone igendanwa ya 2G na 3G. Airtel yatangije ibikorwa byayo mu Rwanda muri Mata 2012. U Rwanda rwabaye igihugu cya 17 Airtel ikoreramo muri Afurika. Airtel yateganyaga gushora miliyoni zirenga 100 z'amadolari mu myaka itatu.\nMu Ukuboza 2017, Airtel Rwanda yasinye amasezerano yo kugura Tigo Rwanda yose. Tigo Rwanda yari iya sosiyete Millicom. Icyo gihe, Tigo yari ifite abafatabuguzi bagera kuri miliyoni 3,4. Airtel yari ifite abafatabuguzi bagera kuri miliyoni 1,6. Inzego zishinzwe kugenzura zemeje ubwo bugure muri Mutarama 2018.\nNyuma yo kwihuza, sosiyete yitwaga Airtel-Tigo. Muri Mutarama 2020, yafashe izina rya Airtel Rwanda. Icyo gihe, yari ifite uruhushya rw'imyaka 12.\nEmmanuel Hamez yayoboye Airtel Rwanda imyaka ine. Mu Ukwakira 2025, Sujay Chakrabarti yamusimbuye ku mwanya w'umuyobozi mukuru.\nIbikorwa.\nAirtel Rwanda itanga serivisi za telefone igendanwa na interineti. Ahantu hose Airtel ifite iminara hari 4G. Airtel ni yo sosiyete ya mbere mu Rwanda yatangije VoLTE na eSIM.\nAirtel yatangije gahunda yitwa \u00abAirtel Imagine\u00bb ifatanyije na Minisiteri y'Ikoranabuhanga n'Inovasiyo (MINICT). Iyo gahunda yafashije abakiriya barenga miliyoni 1,2 kubona telefone zigezweho (\"smartphone\").\nMu gihembwe cya kabiri cya 2025, Airtel Rwanda yari ifite 36 % by'abafatabuguzi ba telefone igendanwa mu Rwanda. MTN Rwanda yari ifite 64 %."}
{"id": "16976", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16976", "title": "SORAS Group Limited", "text": "SORAS Group Limited isanzwe izwi nka SORAS, ni itsinda rya serivisi z'ubwishingizi. Itsinda ritanga ibicuruzwa byinshi na serivisi z'ubwishingizi, umutungo na banki mu Rwanda.\nIncamake.\nIcyicaro gikuru cya SORAS giherereye i Kigali, mu Rwanda. Iri tsinda rifite amashami mu Rwanda hamwe n\u2019undi mufatanyabikorwa mu Burundi. SORAS niyo sosiyete yambere y'ubwishingizi bw'igenga yiyandikishije kandi ikorera mu Rwanda. \nItsinda rya SORAS ni isosiyete nini y\u2019ubwishingizi mu Rwanda ifite isoko rya 35%. \nAmateka.\nItsinda rya SORAS ryatangiye imirimo yaryo ku ya 15 Ugushyingo 1984 nka Soci\u00e9t\u00e9 Rwandaise d'Assurances, nk'ishami ry'a Union des Assurances De Paris (UAP) International, kugira ngo ritange serivisi z'u bwishingizi mu Rwanda. \nKu ya 27 Nzeri 2010, ikigo cyahinduwe isosiyete ikora ifite amashami abiri ni ukuvuga SORAS Yizeza Generales Limited na SORAS VIE Limited. Kuriyo yimuye ibikorwa byayo bigufi kandi birebire murwego rumwe. Ibi byari mu rwego rwo kubahiriza Itegeko ry\u2019u Rwanda nomero 52/2008 ryo ku wa 10/09/2008 ryategekaga ibigo by\u2019u bwishingizi kugabanya ibikorwa by\u2019igihe gito n\u2019igihe kirekire. \nMu mwaka wa 2012, mu rwego rwo kwagura akarere, Itsinda rya SORAS ryabonye 33% by'imigabane ya sosiyete y'ubwishingizi mu Burundi, SOCAR SA. Uku kugura gushya kwatumye guhindura ibisobanuro byikigo, SORAS, biva muri Soci\u00e9t\u00e9 Rwandaise d'Assurances bihinduka Soci\u00e9t\u00e9 R\u00e9gionale d'Assurances. Guhindura izina kwari ukugaragaza uko Itsinda rihagaze nka sosiyete yo mukarere.\nMu mwaka w\u2019ingengo y\u2019imari wa 2013, Itsinda rya SORAS nubwo amashami yaryo ya SORAS Assurances Generales Limited na SORAS VIE Limited yatakaje imigabane yagenzuraga muri Banki ya Agaseke nyuma y\u2019i mpinduka nini zagize mu miterere y\u2019imigabane ya banki. Ibi byatumye igabanuka rya SORAS Group muri banki riva kuri 75% rigera kuri 25%. Kuvana muri banki ya Agaseke byari mu ngamba z'itsinda ryo kongera ingufu mu bucuruzi bw'ubwishingizi. \nKu ya 3 Werurwe 2014, Sanlam Emerging Markets Itsinda ry\u2019imari y\u2019imari muri Afurika yepfo, yatangaje ko ryagiranye amasezerano yo kubona inyungu za 63% muri Soras Group mu masezerano afite agaciro ka miliyoni 24.3 z'amdrale. Uku kugura kwarangiye muri kamena 2014 bituma SORAS igize itsinda rinini ku isi. \nInkunga nishoramari.\nIbigo bigize SORAS Group Limited birimo ibi bikurikira: \nNyirubwite.\nUmugabane witsinda ufunzwe wenyine. Guhera ku ya 30 Kamena 2014, imigabane mu itsinda rya SORAS nkuko bigaragara mu mbonerahamwe ikurikira:\nImiyoborere.\nItsinda rya SORAS riyobowe n'Inama y'Ubuyobozi igizwe n'abantu batanu hamwe na Moranyi Charles nk'umuyobozi w'iryo tsinda."}
{"id": "16977", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16977", "title": "Sanlam Rwanda", "text": "Sanlam ni itsinda ry\u2019ibikorwa by\u2019imari ryo muri Afurika yepfo rifite icyicaro i Bellville, muri Cape, muri Afurika yepfo. Sanlam ni isosiyete nini y'ubwishingizi muri Afurika. Urutonde rwimigabane ya Johannesburg, Isoko ry'imigabane rya Namibiya na A2X. Yashinzwe muri 1918 nk'isosiyete y'ubwishingizi bw'ubuzima, Sanlam Group yateye imbere mu bucuruzi butandukanye bwimari. Ibice bitanu by'ubucuruzi bigizwe na Sanlam Imari Yumuntu, Isoko rya Sanlam Emerging, Ishoramari rya Sanlam, Sanlam Corporate na Santam. \nItsinda ry'inzobere mu matsinda harimo ubwishingizi (ubuzima na rusange), igenamigambi ry\u2019imari, amafaranga y\u2019izabukuru, ikizere, ubushake, ubwishingizi bw'igihe gito, gucunga umutungo, gucunga ibyago n'ibikorwa by'isoko ry'imari, ishoramari n'ubutunzi. Iri tsinda rikorera muri Afurika, Namibiya, Botswana, Swazilande, Zimbabwe, Ubuhinde_ Malesiya_ Ubwongereza_ Amerika, Ositaraliya, Uburundi, Lesotho na Philippines. Ifite imigabane yinzobere mu bwishingizi, Naho Micro-Ensure Holdings Limited ikorera mu Bwongereza, ifite icyicaro muri Afurika no mu Buhinde ikorera abakiriya barenga miliyoni 10.\nKugura mu kwa 2018 kwa SAHAM Finance byatumye iba umukinnyi ukomeye muri Afurika muri serivisi z\u2019imari itari iy'amabanki kandi iha imurikagurisha Maroke, Angola, Alijeriya, Tuniziya, Niger, Mali, Senegali, Gineya, Burkina Faso, kote Divuwari, Togo, Benini, Kameruni, Gabon, Repubulika ya Kongo, Madagasikari, Libani na Arabiya Sawudite.\nAmateka.\nMuri Gashyantare 2023, umuyobozi w\u2019umurage n\u2019umutungo wa Afurika yepfo na Sanlam batangaje ko bazahuriza hamwe bashiraho ubucuruzi, isambu hamwe n\u2019icyizere hamwe. Ubucuruzi bugomba kwemezwa n\u2019amabwiriza, buzabona Sanlam Life Insurance Limited (Sanlam Life) igurisha ubucuruzi bwayo bwizewe, Sanlam Trust, muri Capital Legacy na Sanlam Life ibona hafi inyungu zigera kuri 26% mu itsinda ryagutse ry\u2019umurage mukuru ririmo Sanlam Trust, ubucuruzi nyuma yo kurangiza ibikorwa. Ikigo cyahujwe kizacungwa nu Murage Murage. \nKongera imbaraga mu bukungu.\nSanlam kuva muri 1993 yagize uruhare mu kuzamura ubukungu bw\u2019abirabura (B-BBEE) binyuze mu bufatanye n\u2019iryo tsinda n\u2019Ubuntu-Botho Investments. \nUbufatanye bwa Ubuntu-Botho B-BBEE bwatumye ihuriro rinini ry\u2019ingufu z\u2019abirabura zigura imigabane 10% muri Sanlam mu cyagombaga kuba kimwe mu bikorwa bigera kure cyane muri Afurika yepfo kugeza ubu.\nMu Ukuboza 2013, igihe cya mbere cy'amasezerano y'imyaka 10 yu bucuruzi na Ubuntu-Botho cyarangiye, hamwe na miliyoni 66.5 yatinze imigabane yujuje ibisabwa kugirango ihindurwe imigabane isanzwe. Amasezerano yashyizeho agaciro kangana na miliyoni 15, bigatuma twavuga ko ari kimwe mubikorwa byatsinzwe muburyo bwayo mumateka ya Afrika yepfo. Muri 2014, habaye amasezerano yo kongera ubufatanye na Ubuntu-Botho mu bihe biri imbere. \nSantam.\nSanlam ifite inyungu 60% muri Santam, nayo ikora binyuze mubucuruzi bukurikira:\nAmakuru ya vuba.\nSanlam yatangaje ko kwiyongera kwa 22% mu bucuruzi bushya bugera kuri miliyari 100 mu mezi atandatu kugeza muri Kamena 2015, ugereranije n\u2019icyo gihe cyo muri 2014. Umusaruro uva muri serivisi zimari wazamutseho 5% mugice cya mbere cyumwaka wa 2014, naho 11% mugihe ibintu bimwe byigihe kimwe. Buri mwaka RoGEV kumugabane wa 13% yarenze intego ya 12.1%. Itsinda ryibanze ryibikorwa byo gupima agaciro kinyamigabane ni RoGEV.\nMuri Gashyantare 2023 Umurage Umurage na Sanlam batangaje ko bagiye guhuriza hamwe imbaraga mu gushyiraho ubushake bukomeye, imitungo ndetse n\u2019ubucuruzi hamwe. "}
{"id": "16979", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16979", "title": "Amabuye y'agaciro mu Rwanda", "text": "Ubucukuzi bw'amabuye y'agaciro mu Rwanda bugizwe ahanini no gucukura amabuye y'agaciro harimo nka tin, tantalum, na tungsten, Muri 2020, u Rwanda rwinjije amadolari ya Amerika 733 avuye mu bicuruzwa byoherezwa mu mahanga, bituma ubucukuzi bw'amabuye y'agaciro aribwo bwinjira cyane mu Rwand bijya mu mahanga nyuma y\u2019ubukerarugendo.\nMu mwaka wa 2019, iki gihugu cyari icya 7 mu bihugu bitanga tungsten kandi kikaba icya 12 mu bihugu bitanga tin. \n* Cassiterite (amabati) yari afite umusaruro mwinshi n\u2019ibyoherezwa mu mahanga kuri toni zigera ku 3.874 zifite agaciro k'a miliyoni za madolari 42.2m muri 2010 (ukamanuka kuri toni 4.269 muri 2009).\n* Yakurikiwe na coltan ifite toni 749 muri 2010 ifite agaciro ka amadolari ya Amerika 18.48 (toni 949 muri 2009), na wolfram (ubutare bwa tungsten) hamwe na toni 843 muri 2010 zifite agaciro k'amiliyoni amadolari ya Amerika 7.1m, zikamanuka kuri toni 874 muri 2009.\n* U Rwanda rutanga hafi 9% ya tantalum ku isi, ikoreshwa mu gukora ibikoresho bya elegitoroniki, hamwe na 4% bya tungsten ku isi. \nAmabuye y'agaciro yakuwe.\nMuri Kwakira 2012, Minisiteri y\u2019Umutungo Kamere w\u2019u Rwanda yahagaritse ibikorwa by\u2019ubucukuzi bw\u2019amabuye y'agaciro mu ntara y\u2019iburengerazuba bw\u2019igihugu hashingiwe ko babangamiye uruzi rwa Sebeya. Iki cyemezo cyakemuwe nabi bitewe n\u2019amasosiyete yibucukuzi y\u2019amabuye y'agaciro yatakaje umusaruro ndetse no gutakaza akazi ibihumbi n\u2019ibihumbi ku bakozi bakora mu birombe. "}
{"id": "16980", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16980", "title": "East Africa Exchange", "text": "East Africa Exchange (EAX), n'Isoko ry\u2019ibicuruzwa byo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, ni isoko ry\u2019abikorera ku giti cyabo, harimo guhana ibicuruzwa mu buhinzi muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba. ryatangijwe i Kigali, mu Rwanda, muri Nyakanga 2014. EAX ni iya gatatu mu bucuruzi bw\u2019ibicuruzwa by\u2019ubuhinzi muri Afurika, nyuma y\u2019ivunjisha ry\u2019ejo hazaza muri Afurika yepfo no kuvunja ibicuruzwa muri Etiyopiya. \nAho biherereye.\nIcyicaro gikuru cya EAX giherereye mu igorofa rya 12, ku munara wa Kigali City, Avenue du Commerce, mu mujyi wa Kigali, umurwa mukuru w'u Rwanda. Umuhuzabikorwa w'icyicaro gikuru cya EAX kiri ni: 1 \u00b0 56'37.0 \"S, 30 \u00b0 03'34.0\" E (Ubunini: -1.943601; Uburebure: 30.059431). \nIncamake.\nIntego y'ibanze yo kungurana ibitekerezo ni korohereza abahinzi n\u2019abakora umusaruro w\u2019ubuhinzi kubona ibiciro byiza ku bicuruzwa byabo n\u2019ibicuruzwa ndetse no kubona inkunga ikwiye ku bucuruzi bwabo. Guhera ku bigori n'ibishyimbo, guhana birateganya kwaguka mu ikawa, icyayi, n'umuceri. Kuva muri Werurwe 2016, EAX ikorera mu Rwanda na Kenya ifite gahunda yo kwinjira muri Uganda mu 2016. \nUmugabane.\nImbonerahamwe ikurikira irerekana imigabane muri EAX: \nIhuza ryo hanze.\n&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Coordinates/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;01\u00b056\u203237\u2033S 30\u00b003\u203234\u2033E\ufeff / \ufeff1.94361\u00b0S 30.05944\u00b0E\ufeff / -1.94361; 30.05944"}
{"id": "16981", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16981", "title": "Amabati ya Karuruma", "text": "Amabati ya Karuruma ni uruganda rukora amabati mu murwa mukuru w\u2019u Rwanda, Kigali, kuri ubu rukoreshwa na sosiyete ya LuNa Smelter Ltd. Uru ruganda rwakoranaga mbere na Phoenix Metal Ltd.\nAmabati ya Karuruma yubatswe mu ntangiriro zo muri 1980 kugira ngo atange amabati avuye muri concent\u00e9te yaturutse muri Soci\u00e9t\u00e9 des Mines du Rwanda (SOMIRWA). SOMIRWA yayoboye urugamda kugeza muri 1985 igihe yahombye. Uruganda rwongeye gufungura mu mpera zo muri 1990 n\u2019isosiyete yitwa ALICOM ariko yongera gufungwa muri Mata 1994 ubwo itsembabwoko ry\u2019u Rwanda ryatangiraga ryokwica abatutsi. Guverinoma y'u Rwanda yari ifite uruganda rukora ibicuruzwa, yarayigurishije muri gahunda yo kwegurira abikorera ku giti cyabo. Uruganda ruherereye hafi ya Kigali, umurwa mukuru wu Rwanda.\nAmateka yisosiyete munsi ya NMC Metallurgie.\nMuri 2002 Tin Smelter yaguzwe na NMC Metallurgie. Kugeza mu mpera z'umwaka wo muri 2003 amatsinda ya tekiniki yakoraga ku ishoramari no kuyitaho mu rwego rwo gusana uruganda, gutumiza no gushyira imashini zabuze, gutangira ibikorwa byo gushonga hamwe no kunoza imikorere. Muri Kamena na Ukuboza 2003 ibizamini byakozwe neza kandi umusaruro w\u2019inganda wari witeguye gutangira mu mpera za 2003. Muri 2005 isosiyete yafashe icyemezo cyo guhindura izina ryisosiyete ikitwa Phoenix Metal no guhindura n\u2019amasezerano y\u2019ishyirahamwe. Igiciro cy'amashanyarazi, kugabanuka kwamashanyarazi nikibazo cyibintu byinshi by'umurongo byari byategetse guhagarika ibikorwa byo gushonga. \nMuri 2006, isosiyete yagerageje inzira nshya ishingiye kubikorwa bidasanzwe. Ibyo bizamini byagenze neza mu buhanga ariko izamuka rya kabiri ry\u2019igiciro cy\u2019amashanyarazi mu Kuboza 2005 n\u2019ikibazo gisigaye cy\u2019ibikoresho fatizo nticyagaragajwe n\u2019ibintu byiza byakozwe muri gahunda nshya. Nyuma y'imyaka itanu abikorera ku giti cyabo, ubugenzuzi bwuzuye bwa tekiniki n\u2019imari bwakozwe na Privateatisation kugira ngo harebwe niba amasezerano yubahirijwe n\u2019impande zombi. Hafashwe umwanzuro hagati y\u2019ababuranyi, ko Phoenix Metal itagifite inshingano. Phoenix Metal yasezeranije kuzirikana gushonga kandi izakora ibishoboka bidasanzwe kugirango utangire gushonga mumahirwe y'ambere. \nMuri 2017, isosiyete yinjiye mu kwakira abantu kandi yaguzwe na guverinoma y'u Rwanda kuri miliyari 1.2 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda. \nUruganda.\nAmabati yubatswe muri 1980 n\u2019Ababiligi. Intego yuyu mushinga kwari ugushonga cassiterite yose kuva kariya gace. Ubushobozi busanzwe bwa mabati bwari toni 10 za cassiterite ku munsi kandi bwiyongereye kugera kuri toni 15 ku munsi. \nUruganda rufite ibyuma 2 by'amashanyarazi. Ubushobozi bw'itanura buri hagati ya toni 10 na 15 zo kuvanga kumunsi. Amatanura atatu yo gutunganya ni ayo kugenzura umwanda. Amatanura abiri yo gutandukanya akoreshwa mugutunganya ibisigazwa.\nOre.\nUmuti.\nBamwe mu bakora ibicuruzwa byo mu Rwanda ntibafite ibikoresho cyangwa ubumenyi bwo gusukura amabuye y'agaciro. Phoenix Metal ibasaba koza no gutegura amabuye y'agaciro yoherezwa hanze harebwa ibisobanuro byamasezerano yohereza ibicuruzwa hanze. Kubwibyo, Phoenix Metal ifite nka Crusher, Mills, Spirals, Shacking Table yumye kandi itose, Magnetique separation.\nGucuruza.\nHamwe nibikorwa byo gushonga bidakora, Phoenix Metal yatangiye igikorwa cyubucuruzi. Ubucukuzi bw'amabuye y'agaciro na Phoenix Metal ni:\n1. Cassiterite\n2. Wolfram\n3. Tantalite\n4. Beryl\n5. Amabati\nPhoenix Metal yakoranye numukiriya umwe witwa Sideral Development. Sideral yabanje guterwa inkunga Phoenix Metal yo kugura amabuye y'agaciro. "}
{"id": "16982", "revid": "10890", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16982", "title": "Trade Union Centre of Workers of Rwanda", "text": "Trade Union Centre of Workers of Rwanda ni ikigo cy\u2019igihugu cy\u2019abakozi mu Rwanda. Yashinzwe muri 1985 nk'ikigo cyonyine cy'igihugu.\nKuva muri 1991 hashyirwaho gahunda ya politiki y'amashyaka menshi CESTRAR yatangaje ubwigenge bwa politiki.\nCESTRAR ifatanije n\u2019umuryango mpuzamahanga w\u2019abakozi."}
{"id": "16983", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16983", "title": "Ubukerarugendo bw'ibimera", "text": "Ubukerarugendo bw'ibimera.\nMu Rwanda kimwe nahandi hose ibidukikije bigizwe n'ibice bibiri, ibidukikije karemano, ibidukikije kamere,n'ibidukikije biva kubikorwa bya muntu kandi bigengwa na Poliike, inzego z'ubuobozi n'amategeko mumikorere,mu kurindwa no mumicungire yabyo, Ibidukikije kamere bigizwe n'ubutaka, n'ikuzimu, umwuka, urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima, ubwiza nyaburanga, ahantu nyaburanga n\u2019inyubako. Ibidukikije biva ku bikorwa bya muntu birebana n\u2019imitunganyirize y\u2019imijyi n\u2019icyaro n\u2019imibereho y\u2019abantu.\nAkamaro.\nibimera mu Rwanda nibimwe mubintu byitaweho cyane kuko byagaragaye ko bigira uruhare runini mu iterambere ry'igihugu mu Rwanda ndettse no hanze yyarwo hariho ingamba zo kubungabunga umusaruro ukomoka ku bimera"}
{"id": "16984", "revid": "10890", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16984", "title": "Union of Workers in Industry, Garages, Construction Firms, Mines and Printers", "text": "Ihuriro ry\u2019abakozi mu nganda, mu igaraje, mu bigo by\u2019ubwubatsi, mu birombe no mu icapiro (STRIGECOMI) ni ihuriro ry\u2019abakozi mu Rwanda. Ifatanije n\u2019umuryango mpuzamahanga w\u2019abakozi."}
{"id": "16985", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16985", "title": "Rwanda Over The Counter Exchange", "text": "Rwanda Over The Counter Market (ROTCE), ryari isoko ry'imari n'imigabane mu Rwanda. Yashinzwe ku ya 31 Mutarama 2008 ikorera mu mujyi wa Kigali, umurwa mukuru w'u Rwanda. Isoko ryayoborwaga na guverinoma yu Rwanda, rifite intego yo kwigenga. Ku ikubitiro kuvunja byagurishijwe gusa rimwe yatanzwe na banki nkuru y'igihugu; Banki nkuru y'u Rwanda n'indi Banki y'Ubucuruzi y'u Rwanda. Nyuma muri 2009, imigabane yatangiye gushyirwa ku rutonde.Mu Ukubuza 2010 imigabane ihwanye no kuvunja nkuko byavuzwe mu mbonerahamwe ikurikira.\nGuhagarika ibikorwa no kubisimbuza.\nKu ya 31 Mutarama 2011, ibikorwa by'u Rwanda hejuru y\u2019ivunjisha byafashwe n\u2019ivunjisha ry\u2019u Rwanda, ibikorwa byacyo bigenzurwa n\u2019inama ngishwanama y\u2019imari y\u2019imari (CMAC). "}
{"id": "16986", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16986", "title": "Ishoramari mu Rwanda", "text": "Imibare igaragaza ko igice kinini cy\u2019ishoramari rishya kiri kukigero cya 77.3% by\u2019ishoramari ryose, ni ukuvuga ngo nibura miliyari 1,2 yamadolari yashyizwe mu Mujyi wa Kigali. Hakurikiraho Intara y\u2019Amajyaruguru yihariye 11.7%, bingana na miliyoni 192.09 z'amadolari. Igereranya ryerekana ko iri shoramari rishya ryitezweho guhanga imirimo 57.000.Muri iyo mishinga, urwego rw\u2019ibikorerwa mu nganda, serivisi z\u2019imari n\u2019ubwishingizi byihariye 45.6% by\u2019ishoramari rishya ryanditswe, izi nzego zikazahanga 38.5% by\u2019imirimo mishya yose. U Rwanda rufite isoko rinini kuko ruri mu miryango irimo uwa Afurika y'Iburasirazuba kandi iryosoko rika rimaze kwaguka cyane kuko na Congo yamaze kwiyongeraho.\nIbindi Wamenya.\nMu masezerano y\u2019ishoramari rihuriweho u Rwanda rwemeranyije n\u2019ibindi bigo mu mwaka ushize, harimo amasezerano ya Arise IIP yo kuvugurura icyanya cyahariwe inganda cya Bugesera, amasezerano ya ENI, ikigo gishinzwe ingufu cyo mu Butaliyani, amasezerano agamije ubufatanye mu buhinzi, kurengera urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima, ikoranabuhanga n\u2019ubuzima. Kandi hari amasezerano u Rwanda rwasinyanye na TRW Investment Limited, amasezerano azatuma murwanda hashirwa ishuri ry'icyitegererezo ry'umupira w'amaguru, binyuze muri gahunda yiswe Tony Football Exellence Program(TFEP). Hari kandi amasezerano ya Startstone DMCC na Ecole H\u00f4teli\u00e9re azafasha mu kubaka mu Rwanda Ishuri ry\u2019icyitegererezo mu bijyanye no kwakira abantu ku rwego mpuzamahanga Umushinga wa KOKO networks ufite agaciro ka miliyoni 25 z'amadolari witezweho gufasha u Rwanda murugendo rwo kugeza kubanyarwanda bose ibicanwa bitangiza ibidukikije, ni umushinga uzageza mu mwaka wa 2030."}
{"id": "16987", "revid": "10890", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16987", "title": "Masaka Inland Container Depot", "text": "Ububiko bwa Masaka Imbere mu Gihugu (MICD), ni icyambu cyumye kiri mu mujyi wa Kigali, umurwa mukuru w'u Rwanda. \nAho biherereye.\nIkigo giherereye mu gace ka Masaka, mu mujyi wa Kigali, nko mu kilometero 17.5 y'iburasirazuba bw'umujyi rwagati rw'ubucuruzi. \nIncamake.\nMuri Mutarama 2016, guverinoma y'u Rwanda yasinyanye amasezerano na Dubai Ports World (DPW) yo kubaka icyitwa Kigali Logistics Platform (KLP). DPW noneho yacunga kandi igakoresha depo yumye ku myaka igera kuri 25 uhereye igihe yarangirije. \nIterambere ryicaye kuri hectare 30 z'umutungo utimukanwa. Serivise zirimo serivisi za gasutamo no kugenzura ibicuruzwa, serivisi zinjira, kubungabunga no gusana, ibikoresho bya banki nibikoresho bya IT. \nIcyambu cyumye kizatanga uburyo bwo gupakurura no gupakurura amakamyo atwara abantu, ububiko, bukonje. Ibicuruzwa biva mu mahanga birashobora kandi gutangwa binyuze mu bikoresho byoherejwe mu mijyi ituranye, Goma na Bukavu mu ntara ya DR Congo y'Amajyaruguru n'Amajyepfo ya Kivu. Ikigo gihujwe n\u2019icyambu cya Dar es Salaam aho abantu binjirira umuhanda wa koridori rwagati. \nUbwubatsi.\nIcyiciro cya mbere cyicyambu cyimbere cyubatswe hagati ya 2016 na 2018, kuri kuri hectare 13 ku giciro cyateganijwe miliyoni 35 z'amadolari.\nIcyiciro cya kabiri, biteganijwe ko kizakurikira icya mbere, gikubiyemo kubaka ibikoresho bigezweho bikonje bikonje kuri hecitare 7. Igiciro cy'ibyiciro byombi giteganijwe kuri miliyoni 80 z'amadolari. \nNyirubwite.\nMICD irimo gutezwa imbere na Dubai Ports World, umushinga mpuzamahanga ushinzwe iterambere ry\u2019inyanja n\u2019umuyobozi, ufite ama terminal arenga 70 ku isi, afite abakozi barenga 35.000. DPW izatunga kandi icunge ikigo mu myaka 25 uhereye igihe yatangiriye. "}
{"id": "16988", "revid": "10890", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16988", "title": "Umuhanda wo hagati (Afurika)", "text": "Umuhanda wo hagati (Central Corridor) ni inzira yo gutwara no gucuruza iherereye muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba no Hagati. Iherezo ryayo ni umujyi wa Dar es Salaam uri ku cyambu cya Tanzaniya, aho uhurira n\u2019isi yose ukoresheje ubwikorezi. Kuva i Dar es Salaam, koridoro ikorera mu gihugu imbere, ikorera imbere muri Tanzaniya harimo umurwa mukuru wa Dodoma n'umujyi wa kabiri wa Mwanza, ndetse n'u Rwanda n'Uburundi bidafite inkombe z'amazi, ndetse no mu burasirazuba bwa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Iyi nzira igizwe ikoresha umurongo wo hagati wa Tanzaniya kimwe no guhuza imiyoboro.\nUmuhanda wo hagati utanga ubundi buryo bwerekeza ku nyanja kuva mu Rwanda, mu Burundi no muri DRC uva mu muhanda munini wa koridori y'Amajyaruguru, unyura muri Uganda na Kenya kugera ku cyambu cya Mombasa."}
{"id": "16989", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16989", "title": "Umuhora wo mu majyaruguru y'afurika", "text": "Umuhanda wa ruguru (Northern Corridor)ni inzira ihuze kandi ikomeye y'ogutwara abantu n'ibinyu mu bihugu byo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba no Hagati nko mu Burundi, Uburasirazuba bwa DR Congo, Kenya, u Rwanda, Sudani y'Amajyepfo na Uganda. \nUmuyoboro munini wo gutwara abantu mu majyaruguru uhuza icyambu cya Mombasa kandi harimo n' umuhanda wa gari ya moshi za Kenya Railways Corporation na Uganda Railways Corporation; ubwikorezi bwa gari ya moshi; inzira y'amazi yo mu gihugu imbere; kontineri isanzwe ifatwa nkaho ari ICD (Inland Container Depots); Icyambu cya Tororo Imbere - amasezerano yahawe na Great Lakes Ports Limited yo muri Kenya mu gihe abatavuga rumwe n\u2019ibigo bitwara ibicuruzwa n\u2019abatwara amakamyo; bongeyeho umuyoboro wa peteroli.\nUbundi buryo bwo gutwara abantu bukorera mu karere k'ibiyaga bigari bidafite inkombe binyuze muri Tanzaniya, bwitwa Umuhanda wo hagati uhuza Dar es Salaam. Ibi bifashisha umurongo wo hagati wa Tanzaniya."}
{"id": "16990", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16990", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Livingstone - Stanley", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Livingstone - Stanley i Mugere rugaragaza ahantu umushakashatsi ndetse n\u2019umumisiyonari Dr David Livingstone hamwe n\u2019umunyamakuru n\u2019umushakashatsi Henry Morton Stanley basuye kandi barara amajoro abiri ku ya 25-27 Ugushyingo mu mwaka wa 1871 mu gihugu cya Burundi. Ni kilometero 12 mu majyepfo y'umujyi munini ndetse ukaba n'umurwa mukuru witwa Bujumbura, ureba ikiyaga cya Tanganyika. Mu gifaransa, yitwa \"La Pierre de Livingstone et Stanley\". Bamwe mu barundi bavuga ko aho ariho habereye inama ya mbere izwi cyane ya Livingstone na Stanley, aho aba nyuma bavuze amagambo azwi cyane \"Dr Livingstone, ndakeka?\".\nIcyakora, iyo nama yabereye i Ujiji muri Tanzaniya kuri tariki ya 10 Ugushyingo mu mwaka wa 1871 nk'uko bisobanurwa neza mu gitabo cya Stanley cyitwa, \"Nigute Nabonye Livingstone\". Ikinyamakuru cya David Livingstone nacyo cyemeza ko Ujiji ariho hantu, nkubwinjiriro bwa mbere y'umunsi w\u2019inama witiriwe ngo \"Umuseke, uzimye ujye Ujiji\", umujyi yari azi neza. Livingstone yahise asobanura inama n\u2019abantu benshi b\u2019abarabu batuye Ujiji harimo n\u2019uwagombaga kubika ibicuruzwa bye muruzinduko ruzakurikira, mbere yo kwandika ko Stanley yahageze. \nDuhereye ku nyandiko zabo, uruzinduko rw'i Mugere rujya gusa nk'urwo ku ya 25-27 Ugushyingo ubwo Livingstone na Stanley bavuze ko ari bamwe mu bakiriwe neza. Iyo tariki ya 25 Ugushyingo mu mwaka wa 1871 iragaragara kuko yashushanyije ku rutare. hanyuma buhagurukira mu ubwato berekeza mu majyaruguru y\u2019iburasirazuba bw'ikiyaga kugira ngo babashe kumenya amakuru n'ubumenyi bw'imigezi ishobora kuva mu kiyaga cya Tanganyika. Ku mugezi wa Mugere bahabonye umudugudu wa Chief Mukamba wabakiriye abaha akazu baruhukiramo. Baraye amajoro abiri, Stanley yanditse ko umugaragu wa Livingstone Susi yasinze cyane kubera ubwakiranyi bw'Umukuru. Nk\u2019abanyaburayi ba mbere basuye kariya gace, ukuhagera kwabo ntikwibagiranye, kandi bigomba kuba nyuma y'igihe runaka ibirori byabaye urujijo mubitekerezo by'abantu bamwe nk'inama yambere yahuje Livingstone na Stanley. Imbuga nyinshi zitanga iki kirego kitari cyo."}
{"id": "16991", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16991", "title": "Umuhora w'aruguru wo guhuza no gutwara abantu m\u2019umajyaruguru", "text": "Ikigo (Northern Corridor Transit and Transport Coordination Authority) cyangwa umuhora uhuza no gutwara abantu n'ibintu mu majyaruguru (NCTTCA) ni urwego rwa guverinoma, rukubiyemo ibihugu bitandatu byo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, rufite inshingano zo guhuza ibikorwa remezo byo gutwara abantu n'ibintu. \nUmuhanda wa ruguru harimo icyambu cya Mombasa, umuyoboro mpuzamahanga w\u2019imihanda, imiyoboro ya gari ya moshi, inzira z\u2019amazi yo mu gihugu hamwe n\u2019ubwikorezi bwo mu miyoboro. Ikintu cy'ibanze cya Koridori y'Amajyaruguru ni icyambu cya Mombasa, icyambu kinini muri Kenya, gihuza Kenya n'ibindi bihugu bitanu bidafite inkombe ku nyanja ndetse n'ubukungu bw'isi. Ibihugu bitandatu bikubiye muri NCTTCA ni Kenya, Uganda, u Rwanda, u Burundi, Sudani y'Amajyepfo na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Koridor y'Amajyaruguru nayo ikorera mu majyaruguru ya Tanzaniya no mu bice bya Etiyopiya. \nAho biherereye.\nIcyicaro gikuru cya NCTTCA n'Ubunyamabanga buhoraho bw'uyu muryango biherereye ku nzu ya 1196, Umuhanda uhuza, i Nyali, umuturanyi wa Mombasa, icyambu kinini n'umujyi wa kabiri munini wa Kenya. Imiterere ya geografiya y' icyicaro gikuru ni: 04 \u00b0 02'59.0 \"S, 39 \u00b0 41'30.0\" E (Ubunini: -4.049722; Uburebure: 39.691667). \nIncamake.\nImwe mu ntego nyamukuru zayo ni ukubaka gari ya moshi zisanzwe zihuza Uganda, u Rwanda, Sudani y'Amajyepfo ndetse n'iburasirazuba bwa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, n'umujyi wa Mombasa uri ku cyambu cya Kenya. \nUmuyoboro w\u2019ibikomoka kuri peteroli utunganijwe, utwara lisansi yindege, peteroli na kerosene nabyo biri gutezwa imbere. Umuyoboro, upima nka umurambararo 20, irashyirwa ku nkombe za Kenya kugera muri Uganda no mu Rwanda. na kilometero 450, umuyoboro uzasimbuza amakamyo agera kuri 700 y\u2019amavuta atwara peteroli atwara lisansi mu muhanda uhuza Mombasa na Nairobi, buri munsi nkuko byatangajwe n\u2019isosiyete ikora imiyoboro ya Kenya. "}
{"id": "16992", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16992", "title": "Umuhanda wa Gariyamoshi", "text": "Umuhanda wa gari ya moshi wu Rwanda ni gahunda ya gari ya moshi, irimo gutezwa imbere, ihuza igihugu n'ibihugu bituranye nka Tanzaniya na Uganda. Biteganijwe ko ubwo buryo buzahuzwa, mu gihe kiri imbere, n\u2019abandi baturanyi b\u2019u Rwanda, u Burundi na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, mu rwego rwo gutegura neza igishushanyo mbonera cya gari ya moshi yo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba. Binyuze muri Uganda, SGR izemerera kugera ku cyambu cya Mombasa cya Kenya, u Rwanda rwinjira mu nyanja. Kubera ko nta muyoboro wa gari ya moshi wari usanzweho, u Rwanda rutezimbere gahunda ya gari ya moshi kuva kera. \nAho biherereye.\nSisitemu ya gari ya moshi izaba igizwe n'ibice byinshi by'ingenzi:\nIki gice, gipima kilometero 150, ni igice cya gari ya moshi Isaka - Kigali Standard Gauge, gari ya moshi ihuriweho na guverinoma y'u Rwanda na Tanzaniya. Biteganijwe ko kubaka bizatangira mu Kwakira 2018, [bikeneye kuvugururwa] igice cya Rusumo - Kigali giteganijwe gutwara miliyoni 847 z'amadolari. \nSGR imaze kugera i Kigali, biteganijwe ko guverinoma y'u Rwanda na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo izakora uburyo bwo kwagura iyi gari ya moshi kugera ku butaka bwa DR Congo. Igice kuva Kigali kugera Rubavu ni kilometero 150. Muri Kamena 2019, guverinoma ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo yerekanye ubushake bwo kugira uruhare mu nyigo ishoboka SGR igera i Rubavu na Goma. \nIki gice, gipima kilometero 60, kuva i Masaka, mu mujyi wa Kigali, unyuze ku Kibuga cy'Indege Mpuzamahanga cya Bugesera kugera i Nemba, ku mupaka mpuzamahanga n'Uburundi, ntikirahabwa umushoramari, guhera muri Nzeri 2018. Guverinoma y'u Rwanda yiyemeje kugeza SGR ku Kibuga cy'Indege Mpuzamahanga cya Bugesera, ku ngengo y\u2019imari ingana na miliyoni 85 z'amadolari. \nIyo gari ya moshi ya Uganda Standard Gauge yubatswe, SGR yo muri Uganda iteganijwe guhuza u Rwanda SGR kuri Mirama Hills / Kagitumba. Kuva aho, umurongo wanyuraga Nyagatare, Gatsibo, Gicumbi, Rwamagana, Gasabo ukarangirira i Masaka kubera imizigo na Ndera kubagenzi. Iki gice gipima hafi. \nIncamake.\nIyi milimetero 1435 umurongo wa gari ya moshi ugamije koroshya koherezana hagati y\u2019ibyambu bya Dar es Salaam na Mombasa, i Kigali mu Rwanda hanyuma i Bujumbura mu Burundi, na Goma, muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Mu rwego rwo guhuza abaturanyi bayo Uganda na Tanzaniya, u Rwanda ruzakoresha amashanyarazi mu guha ingufu za lokomoteri. Ibi bizafasha umuvuduko wa gari ya moshi zitwara abagenzi kwiyongera kugera kuri ku isaha hamwe na moteri yimizigo kugera kuri kilometero 120 ku isaha. Mu Kwakira 2018, ikinyamakuru cya East African cyatangaje ko kubaka bizatangira mu Kuboza 2018. "}
{"id": "16993", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16993", "title": "Cascades de Karfigu\u00e9la (Ahantu nyaburanga)", "text": "Cascades de Karfigu\u00e9la cyangwa Cascades ya Banfora (nanone Isumo rya Karfiguela, Isumo rya Tagbaladougou, cyangwa Isumo rya Banfora) ni uruhererekane rw'amasoko aturuka hejuru ku ruzi rwa Komo\u00e9 mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bwa Burkina Faso. Ziherereye nko mu birometero 12 mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bwa Banfora kandi ni kimwe mu bibanza by'ubukerarugendo muri Burkinafaso. Intara ya Cascades ibona izina ryayo kumasoko. Urujya n'uruza rw'amazi asuma rubaho mu gihe cy'imvura kuva muri Kamena kugeza muri Nzeri. \nAHANTU NYABURANGA:"}
{"id": "16994", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16994", "title": "Inema Arts Center", "text": "Inema Arts Centre ni ikigo cyubuhanzi n'ubukorikori giherereye mu mujyi wa Kigali, umurwa mukuru wu Rwanda. \nIki kigo cyashinzwe muri 2012 n\u2019abashushanyo babiri: Innocent Nkurunziza na Emmanuel Nkuranga. Abashushanya bombi n'abavandimwe batangije Inema Arts Centre bafite intego yo kwerekana ubuhanga bwubuhanzi bwu Rwanda rwihishwa, bakoresheje imvugo yo guhanga kugirango ubuzima n\u2019igihugu kibeho, kandi batange urubuga kubahanzi bo mu Rwanda.\nInema Ubuhanzi.\nInema Arts Centre yahindutse urubuga rwabahanzi batandukanye bavugana binyuze mumagambo yo guhanga. Abahanzi benshi bahanga mu Rwanda bagize Centre yu buhanzi. Inema Arts Centre kuri ubu ifite ibibanza byabahanzi icumi batuye kugirango bamenye ubushobozi bwabo bwo guhanga. Umwihariko muri Inema ni umuziki, imbyino, ubuhanzi bwa none bwo muri Afurika n'ubukorikori. \nUbugeni bwa Inema bugaragaza amashusho, ibishusho, nibindi bintu byubuhanzi byakozwe kandi byerekanwe nabahanzi ba Inema. Iki kigo kandi gikora imishinga n'ibikorwa bitandukanye bigamije guteza imbere ibihangano byo guhanga u Rwanda no gutanga ihuriro ryo kwerekana ibitekerezo \nbinyuze mu mahugurwa, amahugurwa, ndetse n\u2019inyigisho zifatika. \nIhuza ryo hanze.\n&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Coordinates/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;1\u00b056\u203236\u2033S 30\u00b005\u203227\u2033E\ufeff / \ufeff1.94346\u00b0S 30.09080\u00b0E\ufeff / -1.94346; 30.09080"}
{"id": "16995", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16995", "title": "Inzu Ndangamurage ya Manega", "text": "Inzu ndangamurage ya Manega ni inzu ndangamurage iherereye mu birometero 55 mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bw'umujyi wa Ouagadougou, mu mudugudu wa Manega, mu gihugu cya Burkina Faso. Yashinzwe na Fr\u00e9d\u00e9ric Pac\u00e9r\u00e9 Titinga.\nInzu ndangamurage zirimo \"imyironge ya Boura,\" ibice 40 byo gushyingura, imiyoboro, amajerekani ya terracota, ibikomo hamwe n\u2019ibikoresho byakoreshwaga mu mihango yo mu kibaya cya Niger, guhera mu kinyejana cya 2 kugeza mu cya 11. Hazwiho kandi imbunda ya Mossi imaze imyaka 200. "}
{"id": "16996", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16996", "title": "Sitade ya Kigali Pel\u00e9", "text": "Sitade ya Kigali Pel\u00e9, yitiriwe Sitade y'akarere ka Nyamirambo, ni stade ikorerwamo ibintu byinshi, iherereye mu gace ka Nyamirambo mu mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda. Kugeza ubu ikoreshwa cyane mu mikino y'umupira wamaguru kandi yakira amakipe menshi muri shampiyona yu Rwanda, harimo APR FC na Rayon Sports.\nIfite ubwatsi bw'ubukorikori ndetse ifite imyanya 22,000 abantu bicaye neza. Iyi stade yabonaga idakwiriye kwakira imikino mpuzamahanga muri 2021 n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru nyafurika kandi ikorerwa ivugurura ryatangiye muri Mutarama 2023 mbere ya Kongere ya 73 ya FIFA, yakiriwe na Kigali. Yongeye gufungura ku ya 15 Werurwe 2023, ahindurirwa izina mu rwego rwo guha icyubahiro Pel\u00e9 wahoze ari umupira w'amaguru muri Berezile na perezida w\u2019u Rwanda, Paul Kagame na perezida wa FIFA, Gianni Infantino. \nMuri 1998, sitade yakoreshejwe mu kwicisha mu ruhame abantu 21 bahamwe n'icyaha cyo kugira uruhare muri jenoside yo mu Rwanda, barimo Froduald Karamira. "}
{"id": "16997", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16997", "title": "Inzu Ndangamurage y\u2019umuziki (Burkina Faso)", "text": " Iyi ni ingingo y'inzu ndangamurage muri Burkinafaso. Kubireba inzu ndangamurage muri Amerika, reba inzu ndangamurage y'umuziki \".\"\nInzu Ndangamurage y\u2019umuziki iri muri Ouagadougou, mu gihugu cya (Burkina Faso) mu nyubako y\u2019amagorofa abiri ku Muhanda wa Oubritenga mu majyepfo y\u2019ishuri rya Phillipe Zinda Kabore.\nInyubako yahoze irimo Ishyirahamwe rishinzwe iterambere ry\u2019imyubakire nyafurika n\u2019imyubakire y\u2019imijyi (ADAUA) yaravuguruwe kugira ngo yakire inzu ndangamurage. Iyi nyubako iri muburyo bw'inyubako za abasudani baba Sahelian ifite ibisenge bimeze nk'ububiko. Iri hagati mu mujyi kandi biroroshye kugera kubaturage muri rusange.\nIcyegeranyo cya mbere, cyashyizwe hamwe hagati ya Nzeri mu mwaka wa 1998 na Werurwe mu mwaka wa 1999, gihora gikura. Ibikoresho byo mumiryango yose bigaragazwa harimo aerofone, membranofone, idiophone na chordophone. Buri kintu nicyo cyonyine cy'ubwoko bwacyo kandi kiratandukanye kuva kumyaka 5 kugeza ku myaka 200.\nInzu ndangamurage iyobowe n'umurinzi witwa, Parfait Z. Bambara\nAmashakiro.\nIshami ry'umurage ndangamuco wa Burkina Faso"}
{"id": "16998", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16998", "title": "Urwibutso rwo kurwanya ruswa", "text": "Urwibutso rwo kurwanya ruswa mu Rwanda (Anti-corruption monument of Rwanda) ni urwibutso ruherereye mu kigo cy\u2019amasezerano ya Kigali (KCC) Kigali convention Center, mu Rwanda, ni ukwemeranya politiki y\u2019u Rwanda yo kurwanya ruswa hamwe na guverinoma ya Qatari muri 2019, cyahashyizwe ari mu gihembo cyari mpuzamahanga cy\u2019indashyikirwa mu kurwanya ruswa. Igishushanyo gitangaje cyuru rwibutso rw'amaboko kiri inyuma y'umuhanzi wo muri Iraki witwa Ahmed Al Bahrani. \nIbisobanuro.\nIbyanditswe byera byerekana imikindo yagutse, bivuze ko u Rwanda ntacyo rufite cyo guhisha isi yose. Ifite imikindo ifunguye, igereranya gukorera mu mucyo no gufungura. Urwibutso rufite uburebure bwa metero 12 rugizwe na pivot hamwe n\u2019ibihuza byerekana akamaro k\u2019ubufatanye n\u2019isi yose mu kurwanya ruswa.\nIhuriro rya mpandeshatu 186 rigize urwibutso ryerekana abashyize umukono ku masezerano y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye arwanya ruswa. Intego yacyo ni ugushishikariza abantu kurwanya ruswa bafite imyifatire itigera ivuga-gupfa. "}
{"id": "16999", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16999", "title": "Ikibuga cya Cricket cya Polytechnic College kigali", "text": "Integrated Polytechnic Regional College Ground ni ikibuga cya Cricket, kiri mu mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda. \nMu Kwakira 2021, iki kibuga ni cyo cyabereyeho imikino mu itsinda A mu majonjora yo guhatanira itike yo guhatanira itike yo kuzakina igikombe cy\u2019isi cya 2021 cya ICC mu bagabo mu gikombe cy\u2019isi cya Afurika cyitabiriwe n\u2019amakipe yabaye aya mbere mu gikombe cy\u2019isi cya Afurika cya Eswatini, Gana, Lesotho, Malawi, Seychelles, Uganda ndetse n\u2019u Rwanda rwakira. Mbere yo gutangira amarushanwa ikibanza cyaravuguruwe cyane kugirango kibe ku rwego rwo kwemerera ICC. "}
{"id": "17000", "revid": "10890", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17000", "title": "Stade Huye", "text": "Sitade ya Huye ni sitade ikoreshwa cyane i Butare, mu Rwanda. Kugeza ubu ikoreshwa cyane mu mikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandi ni ikibuga cya Mukura Victory Sports FC. Sitade yakira abantu 10,000. "}
{"id": "17002", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17002", "title": "Les Afriques (Ikinyamakuru)", "text": "Les Afriques n'ikinyamakuru cyo muri Afurika cy'ubukungu n'imari gisohoka buri cyumweru. Mu mwaka wa 2007, kivuga ko aricyo kinyamakuru cya mbere cy\u2019imari Pan-African. Gitangazwa buri cyumweru kandi kiboneka hafi mubihugu byose bivuga igifaransa.\nAmateka.\nIki kinyamakuru cyatangiye gusohoka mu kwezi kwa Nyakanga mu mwaka wa 2007. Itangizwa ryayo ryatangajwe ku \"kinyamakuru TV cyo mu Gifaransa de L\u00e9man bleu\" no ku mbuga nyinshi za Afurika zihariye. \nNyuma y'ikinyamakuru cya mbere nigihe gikenewe cyo guhuza imihindagurikire gikoresha sisitemu ya francise, ikinyamakuru \"Les Afriques\" cyatangije inyandiko zacyo mu gihugu cya Maroc, Senegali na Kameruni. \nIntego.\nMu rwego rwo guhuza ibitekerezo \"by'umugabane wa kera\", abanyamakuru bafite icyicaro mu bihugu bya Afurika aribyo (Maroc, Senegali na Alijeriya) kandi bubahwa cyane mu muryango w\u2019imari nyafurika.\nAbanyamakuru.\nAdama Wade, muri Maroc.\nAdama Wade, umunyamorutania, yashinzwe i Casablanca byibuze mu imyaka cumi n'itatu. Yateye imbere nkumunyamakuru mubice by'ubukungu n\u2019imari mubinyamakuru bya Maroc.\nCh\u00e9rif Elvalide Seye, Senegali.\nYabaye umujyanama wihariye mu itumanaho rya perezida Abdoulaye Wade mu mwaka wa 2000 kugeza mu mwaka wa 2002 kandi yashinze cyangwa acunga ibitangazamakuru byinshi mu gihugu cye. Ch\u00e9rif Seye yapfuye ku ya 18 Kamena 2012 i Nairobi muri Kenya "}
{"id": "17003", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17003", "title": "Amashanyarazi kuri Rukarara", "text": "Amashanyarazi ya Rukarara ni uruganda rutanga amashanyarazi angana na megawate 9.5 ikaba ari mu Rwanda. \nAho biherereye.\nSitasiyo y'amashanyarazi iherereye ku mugezi wa Rukarara, mu Karere ka Nyamagabe, mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo y'u Rwanda, kuri kilometero 182 mu majyepfo ashyira uburengerazuba bwa Kigali, umurwa mukuru wu Rwanda. \nIncamake.\nUrugomero rw'amashanyarazi rwa 9,6 MW rw'ubatswe mu byiciro byinshi. Icyiciro cya mbere, gifite ubushobozi bwa MW 6.9, cyarangiye muri 2011. Icyiciro cya kabiri, gifite ubushobozi bwa MW 2,2 cyarangiye muri 2014. Amafaranga yo kubaka sitasiyo yose y\u2019amashanyarazi yari miliyoni 13.12 z'amadolari, inkunga yatanzwe na guverinoma yu Rwanda, Umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Uburayi n\u2019ikigo gishinzwe iterambere ry\u2019Ababiligi. \nIbindi bitekerezo.\nAmashanyarazi yatanzwe yimurwa binyuze muri sitasiyo nshya i Rukarara no kunyura ku murongo mushya w'amashanyarazi mwinshi kuva Rukarara kugera Kirinda. "}
{"id": "17004", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17004", "title": "Urugomero rw'Akanyaru", "text": "Urugomero rwa Akanyaru rufite intego nyinshi, ni urugomero ruteganijwe kwambuka uruzi rwa Akanyaru, ku mupaka mpuzamahanga uhuza u Rwanda n'Uburundi. Urugomero ruzakora ikigega gifite ubushobozi bwo kubika nibura na meterokube 333,000,000. Biteganijwe ko ayo mazi azatanga nibura amazi yo kunywa ku bantu bagera kuri 614.200 mu bihugu byombi. Biteganijwe kandi ko iki kigega kizatanga amazi yo kuhira hafi hegitare nibura 12,474 z\u2019ubutaka bw\u2019ubuhinzi mu Burundi no mu Rwanda, bikagirira akamaro abahinzi bagera nibura ku 24.948. Urugomero ruzakira kandi amashanyarazi ya Akanyaru, afite ingufu za wate 14.5.\nAho biherereye.\nSitasiyo y\u2019amashanyarazi izaba ku ruzi rwa Akanyaru, ku mupaka w\u2019u Rwanda n\u2019Uburundi, mu Karere ka Gisagara muri iki gihe mu Ntara y\u2019Amajyepfo, u Rwanda ndetse no muri Komini ya Ntega mu Ntara ya Kirundo, mu Burundi. \nUrugomero rufite, kumuhanda, mu majyepfo yuburengerazuba bwa Kigali, umurwa mukuru wu Rwanda. Ubu ni kuri kilometero 150, mu majyaruguru ya Gitega, umurwa mukuru wu Burundi. \nAmateka.\nMu mwaka wa 2012, ibihugu byombi byo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba hamwe na gahunda y'ibikorwa byo mu biyaga bya Nili Ekwatoriya (NELSAP), byagaragaje \"umushinga wo guteza imbere umutungo w'amazi Akanyaru\". Muri uwo mwaka, NELSAP yakoze ubushakashatsi bwibanze. \nMuri 2015, Inama y'abaminisitiri ya Nili yemeje umushinga wa Akanyaru. Intumwa zaturutse mu Rwanda no mu Burundi zapimye ikibanza cy\u2019umushinga muri Gicurasi 2016. Muri Werurwe 2018, NELSAP yateguye inkunga yuzuye muri Banki Nyafurika itsura amajyambere (AfDB). Mu mwaka wa 2020, hatanzwe amasoko kugira ngo hasuzumwe ubushakashatsi ku ngaruka z\u2019ibidukikije n\u2019imibereho (ESIA), Gahunda y\u2019ibikorwa byo Gutuza (RAP), ubushakashatsi bwuzuye bushoboka, igishushanyo mbonera no gutegura inyandiko z\u2019ipiganwa ku mushinga. Biteganijwe ko ubushakashatsi bwumushinga buzarangira muri Werurwe 2022. \nInkunga.\nMuri Gashyantare 2021, ikiguzi cy'umushinga cyabazwe miliyoni 190 z'amadolari y'amerika. Gusaba inguzanyo byakorewe muri AfDB, munsi y\u2019umushinga w\u2019ibikorwa remezo bya NEPAD (NEPAD-IPPF). \nIbindi bitekerezo.\nIcyifuzo cya megawate 14.5, Amashanyarazi ya Akanyaru, biteganijwe ko azatanga amashanyarazi kumazu nibura 141.111 yo mu bihugu byombi, akorera abantu bagera kuri 846.000. Uyu mushinga urimo no gusana amasoko yangiritse hejuru y\u2019urugomero rwa Akanyaru. "}
{"id": "17005", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17005", "title": "Nyanza, Rwanda", "text": "Nyanza, izwi kandi ku izina rya Nyabisindu, ni umujyi uherereye mu Karere ka Nyanza mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo y'u Rwanda. Nyanza n'umurwa mukuru w'Intara y'Amajyepfo.\nAmateka.\nNyanza yari umurwa mukuru w'Ubwami bw'u Rwanda, kuva 1958 kugeza 1962.\nMuri 1994, mu bihe by\u2019intambara y\u2019abaturage yo mu Rwanda, Front Patriotic Front yo mu Rwanda yarwanye n\u2019ingabo z\u2019u Rwanda i Nyanza iminsi myinshi, isenya umujyi. Abatutsi benshi bishwe n'ingabo za leta hariya muri Jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda. \nIbintu bigaragara.\nNyanza azwi cyane mu mateka ya yogurute na kefir (gakondo bita ikivuguto muri Ikarwanda, ururimi rwu Rwanda). Ikivuguto, kuba ikinyobwa gisembuye, yari, kandi n'ubu iracyakunzwe kubera imico myiza. Umujyi urimo amata abiri. Laiterie de Nyabasindu ni imwe mu isiyete manini yo mu Rwanda akora amata na yogurute. Amaresitora mato menshi n'amaduka mumujyi bigurisha ikivuguto kubikombe cyangwa mubikoresho binini bya plastiki kugirango bikuremo. Amaduka menshi yo mumujyi agurisha amacupa cyangwa apakiye kugiti cya ikivuguto cyangwa yogurt wongeyeho isukari cyangwa uburyohe, nka vanilla cyangwa strawberry. \nIkaba kandi ibamo inyubako nini, igezweho, ifite amagorofa menshi yubatswe kugira ngo ibe Urukiko mpuzamahanga rw\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye rw\u2019u Rwanda (ICTR), urukiko rukomeje kuburanisha imanza zerekeye Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994 mu Rwanda. Iyi nyubako kandi irimo Urukiko Rukuru.\nAmakuru kubakerarugendo.\nUmujyi wa Nyanza urasaba kuzimya umuhanda munini uhuza Kigali na Butare. Nyanza ni urugendo rwa bisi kuva Kigali, Gariyamoshi iri hagati mu mujyi wa Nyanza, iruhande rw'isoko ryo hanze. Amasosiyete akomeye ya bisi akorera Nyanza ni Ibirunga na Horizon, bigenda buri saha nigice bikicara abagenzi bagera kuri 28. Hariho kandi amamodoka mato azwi nka bisi ya Twegerane ihuza abantu benshi bashoboka kandi igenda iyo yuzuye. Gutwara abantu mu mujyi binyuze muri tagisi ya moto cyangwa tagisi yamagare, cyangwa n'amaguru.\nIngoro yum \"umwami\" wanyuma (umwami gakondo) wu Rwanda iherereye hagati yumujyi rwagati kandi niwo mukerarugendo ukurura umujyi. Ngaho, umuntu arashobora kubona ingoro gakondo yuwahoze ari umwami akayigereranya ningoro ya kijyambere yubatswe kure nabakoloni b'Ababiligi kubwami. Mu gihe ibyinshi mu ngoro y'umwami bikomeje kuba uko byari bimeze igihe umwami yabayemo mu myaka ya za 1950 na 60, ibikoresho bimwe na bimwe byibwe cyangwa birasenywa mu gihe cya jenoside yo mu 1994. Rimwe na rimwe, hashyizweho kopi yibikoresho byumwimerere. Nta mafoto yemerewe imbere ibwami. Umugore wu Rwanda wambaye \"umushanana\" (imyenda yubudozi yu Rwanda, itemba gakondo) ayobora abashyitsi mu ngoro.\nUmujyi wa Nyanza ufite nibura amashuri abiri yisumbuye: Kaminuza y'Abadiventisti b'Abalayiki ba Kigali (UNILAK), ku muhanda ujya i Nyanza, n'Ikigo gishinzwe imyitozo ngororamubiri n'iterambere (ILPD), giherereye ku muhanda ugana ku ngoro y'Umwami kuri ihuriro rya Avenue des Siporo. ILPD yakiriye amasomo y\u2019impamyabumenyi y\u2019amezi atandatu nyuma y\u2019icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza, itanga inyigisho zifatika mu by'amategeko ku barangije amashuri y\u2019amategeko. Ifite kandi amasomo magufi (ubusanzwe icyumweru kimwe cyangwa munsi yayo) amasomo yo gukomeza gutura mumashuri cyangwa amasomo ajyanye namategeko kubacamanza, abanyamategeko, abahesha b'inkiko n'abandi. Abanyeshuri bo muri ILPD baturuka mu bihugu byinshi, birimo u Rwanda, Uganda, Gana, Gambiya, Kameruni, Sudani y'Amajyepfo na Kenya. Kuruhande rw'umuhanda uva Ikigo ni isoko rito rifite resitora ntoya (zitanga ibiryo n'ibinyobwa), ishuri ritwara ibinyabiziga hamwe nububiko buto bwo mu biro.\nNyanza afite amatorero menshi, arimo abagatolika, abadiventiste b'umunsi wa karindwi, ADEPR (Pentekote) n'andi, ndetse n'imisigiti myinshi."}
{"id": "17006", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17006", "title": "Urutonde rw'ibigo byo mu Burundi", "text": "Uburundi, ku mugaragaro ni Repubulika y\u2019Uburundi, ni igihugu kidafite inkombe mu karere ka Afurika y\u2019ibiyaga bigari byo mu majyepfo y\u2019iburasirazuba bwa Afurika, gihana imbibi n\u2019u Rwanda mu majyaruguru, Tanzaniya mu burasirazuba no mu majyepfo na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo mu burengerazuba. Inganda nini mu Burundi n\u2019ubuhinzi, bungana na 30% by'Umusaruro mbumbe w'igihugu. Uturima tw'ikikoni ni 90% by'ubuhinzi. Igice kinini cy'injiza amafaranga menshi ni ikawa, kurugero rwa 93% by\u2019ibyoherezwa mu Burundi. U Burundi ni kimwe mu bihugu bikennye cyane ku isi, bitewe na geografiya yayo idafite inkombe, amategeko mabi, kutagira ubwisanzure mu bukungu, kutabona amashuri, no gukwirakwiza virusi itera SIDA. Abagera ku 80% by'abatuye u Burundi babaho mu bukene. \nIbigo bizwi.\nUru rutonde rurimo ibigo bizwi bifite icyicaro gikuru giherereye mu gihugu. Inganda n'umurenge bikurikiza inganda zerekana ibyiciro by'imisoro. Amashyirahamwe yahagaritse ibikorwa arimo kandi agaragara nkayacitse."}
{"id": "17007", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17007", "title": "Uruganda rwa Kibuye 1", "text": "Urugomero rw'amashanyarazi rwa Kibuye 1, cyangwa nanone Amashanyarazi ya Kibuye 1 (KP1), ni urugomero rutanga megawate 3.6 za gaze metani yakongejwe n'ingufu zamashanyarazi mu Rwanda. \nAho biherereye.\nUrugomero rw'amashanyarazi ruherereye i Kibuye, mu Karere ka Karongi, mu Ntara y'Uburengerazuba bw'u Rwanda, hafi kilometero 135, iburengerazuba bwa Kigali, umurwa mukuru wu Rwanda. \nIncamake.\nGuhera mu 2006, ku nkunga yatanzwe n\u2019ikigo mpuzamahanga gishinzwe imari (IFC), guverinoma y\u2019u Rwanda yatangiye gushakisha amasosiyete y\u2019ubuhanga yujuje ibyangombwa byo gushushanya, kubaka no gukoresha amashanyarazi akomoka kuri gaze metani y\u2019amashanyarazi, akoresheje gaze yakuwe mu nyanja y\u2019ikiyaga. Kivu. Imwe mu ntego z'uyu mushinga, kwari ukugaragaza ko bishoboka kubyara amashanyarazi muri gaze metani mu kiyaga ku buryo bwunguka. Umushinga watwaye hafi miliyoni 20 z'amadolari yo gushiraho. \nNyirubwite.\nUyu mushinga ni uw'ubutegetsi bwa Rwanda. Ubufatanye na Dane Associates, uruganda rukorera mu mujyi wa Edinburgh rwaciwe kubera kutumvikana mu bijyanye n'amafaranga. Mu mwaka wa 2015, kubera ko umushinga udashoboye kwishyura imyenda yawo, Urukiko Rukuru rw\u2019Ubucuruzi mu Rwanda rwashegeshe Isosiyete ya Kibuye Power 1, bisabwe na guverinoma y\u2019u Rwanda. Guverinoma yatangiye kwakira amasoko yatanzwe n'abashoramari bashya kugira ngo batangire umushinga. \nMuri Kwakira 2016, Symbion Power, uruganda rukora amashanyarazi muri Amerika, rwaguze uruganda rukora amashanyarazi rwa Kibuye 1 ku mafaranga ataramenyekana. Symbion irateganya kuzamura buhoro buhoro, icyiciro cya mbere kugeza kuri MW 25 muri 2018, na MW 50 muri 2019. \nIbindi bitekerezo.\nUrugomero rw'amashanyarazi rwa Kibuye 1 ni umushinga wa kabiri w'amashanyarazi Symbion yiyemeje guteza imbere ku kiyaga cya Kivu. Yemeye kandi guteza imbere sitasiyo ya Kivu 56, na megawatte 56, uruganda rukora amashanyarazi rukoreshwa na metani. Muri ayo masezerano, hari megawatte 14 biteganijwe muri 2018. "}
{"id": "17008", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17008", "title": "Amashanyarazi kuri Kivu 56", "text": "Symbion Thermal Power Station niurugomero rw'amashnyarazi rutanga megawatts 56 ya gazi ya metani, rutanga umuriro w'amashanyarazi iherereye kuri Cape ya Busororo hafi y'umujyi wa \"Nyamyumba\" mu Karere ka Rubavu, mu Ntara y'Uburengerazuba bw'u Rwanda. \nAho biherereye.\nSitasiyo y'amashanyarazi iherereye i Cape Busororo, hafi ya Nyamyumba mu Burengerazuba bw'u Rwanda, nko muri kilometero 163, mu majyaruguru yuburengerazuba bwa Kigali, umurwa mukuru wu Rwanda. Aha hantu hareshya na kilometero 20, mumajyepfo ya Gisenyi, umurwa mukuru wintara. \nIncamake.\nKivu 56 Amashanyarazi afite kandi akoreshwa Symbion Power LLC, ikigo cyigenga gitanga ingufu gifite icyicaro muri Amerika. Uruganda rugizwe nibikoresho bibiri: (a) kwishyiriraho hanze yinkombe ikuramo, itandukanya kandi itunganya gaze ya metani, ishonga mumazi maremare yikiyaga cya Kivu, hanyuma ikayigeza kuri (b) ikigo gitanga ku nkombe giherereye. kuri Cape ya Busororo, aho gaze ikoreshwa muguhindura gaz turubine kubyara amashanyarazi. \nSitasiyo ya Kivu 56 ni sitasiyo ya gatatu ikoreshwa na gaze metani mu Rwanda, nyuma y\u2019amashanyarazi ya KivuWatt, itanga MW 25 kandi ikaba iri mu rwego rwo kwagura ingufu kugera kuri MW 100, na megawate 3.6, Urugomero rw'amashanyarazi rwa Kibuye 1, narwo rukaba rufite Symbion kandi rugenda rwiyongera kugeza kuri megawate50. \nSymbion Power yiyandikishije mu isosiyete ifasha u Rwanda ko ifite 100 ku ijana ku izina rya \"Shema Power Lake Kivu Methane Limited\", gushushanya, gutera inkunga, kubaka, gutunga, gukora no kubungabunga sitasiyo ya Kivu 56. Turbine enye, buri gipimo cya megawatt 16, giha uruganda kubyara megawatt 56 z'ingufu zisukuye. \nUbwubatsi.\nDukurikije amasezerano yo kugura amashanyarazi yasinywe n\u2019impande bireba, megawate 14, kuva kuri iyi sitasiyo y'amashanyarazi, biteganijwe muri 2018. Muri Nzeri 2017, Symbion yagurishije miliyoni 100 z\u2019amadolari y\u2019Amerika mu mishinga yayo ibiri yo mu Rwanda; aribyo Kibuye Amashanyarazi 1 na Kivu 56 Sitasiyo. Amafaranga azakoreshwa mugutezimbere amashanyarazi yombi kubyara megawate 106. Miliyoni 370 z'amadorali y'Amerika ziteganijwe gutegurwa kugira ngo zigere kuri iyo ntego. "}
{"id": "17009", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17009", "title": "Maison St Benoit", "text": "Maison St Benoit ni inzu y'umubikira muto wo mu Benedigito i Kigufi, mu Rwanda.\nAho biherereye.\nKigufi ni umudugudu wo mu Rwanda, muri Afurika yo hagati, yegeranye n'ikiyaga cya Kivu, kimwe mu biyaga binini bya Rift Valley. Kigufi iherereye mu Ntara y'Iburengerazuba bw'u Rwanda, mu Karere ka Rubavu, mu gice cya Nyamyumba, mu Kagari ka Kiraga. Iherereye mu majyaruguru y\u2019ikiyaga cya Kivu kuri kamwe mu duce duto duto two mu majyepfo ya Rubavu, umujyi ukomeye cyane. Ibi bishyira umudugudu hafi ya Goma, ku mupaka na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nAmateka.\nMu gihe cyabakoloni umugabo w\u2019umwongereza witwa Jack Mat Wilson Poelaert yashinze ibibanza yubaka inyubako igizwe n\u2019ikigo kinini cy\u2019ababikira. Yashyizeho ubusitani burimo ibiti byinshi byiza kandi bituma abantu bavuga ko ubu Umubikira ari ikibuga cy\u2019icyatsi kibisi cya paradizo gishyigikira inyoni nyinshi zifite amabara kandi zitanga no koga neza\". Poelaert yahaye umutungo itegeko rya Benedigito muri Kuboza 1970.\nUmubikira uyu munsi.\nMuri iki gihe, Ababikira ba Mutagatifu Benedigito babayo basenga kandi bakora nk'uko babigiriwemo inama na Mutagatifu Benedigito, wagize ati: Ora et Labora. Bakorera inzu yabatumirwa ifite ibyumba 30 bituma iba kamwe mu hantu heza-heza kandi heza cyane kuguma mu gace ka Rubavu. Mushikiwabo Beata, umwe mu babikira batanu bayobora inzu y'abashyitsi, asobanura agira ati: Ababikira bakunda kugira abashyitsi, kubakira ntabwo ari ubucuruzi ni kimwe mu bigize ubutumwa. Bashaka ko wumva uri mu rugo.\nAbashyitsi berekana ko izuba rirenze ari umunezero kubona kandi umuntu akumva afite amahoro umaze kugera i Kagufi. "}
{"id": "17010", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17010", "title": "Kigali Solaire", "text": "Kigali Solaire ni urugomero rw'amashanyarazi akomoka ku mirasire y'izuba mu Rwanda kandi mu gihe cyo kubaka ni cyo gihugu cya Afurika kinini cyashyizeho amashanyarazi akomoka ku mirasire y'izuba. Yubatswe mu 2006 kuri Mont Jali hafi y'umurwa mukuru Kigali. Uruganda rukoresha amafoto yerekana amashanyarazi kandi rufite umusaruro mwinshi wa 250 kilo hamwe nibisohoka buri mwaka biva kuri kilowate 325.000. Yatewe inkunga n\u2019umujyi w\u2019Ubudage isosiyete ikora ibikorwa by\u2019ingirakamaro ya Stadtwerke Mainz AG (ubu ni: Mainzer Stadtwerke AG), Mainz ikaba umurwa mukuru wa Rhineland-Palatinate, ifitanye ubufatanye n\u2019u Rwanda.\nUruganda rugizwe gusa na gahunda, rugizwe no gukwirakwiza panne 30 yifoto ya 1 kilo imwe mu midugudu yo hanze y'igihugu amashanyarazi, agera kuri 5% yi gihugu gusa. Sitasiyo ntoya isanzwe ishyirwa hejuru yinzu yi bitaro cyangwa amashuri. Iyi gahunda kandi ni gutera inkunga no guhugura abatekinisiye baho kugirango babungabunge ibyashizweho byose. "}
{"id": "17011", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17011", "title": "Ihuriro ry\u2019ubucuruzi muri Kongo", "text": "Ihuriro ry\u2019ubucuruzi muri Kongo n\u2019umuryango w\u2019abakoresha nyamukuru muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Yashinzwe mu mwaka wa 1997, yari ifite abanyamuryango bangana 2, 700 mu mwaka wa 2010. Yabonye inkunga y'amafaranga n'ikigo gishinzwe iterambere ry'Ubufaransa mu mwaka wa 2010. Perezida wacyo ni Albert Yuma. "}
{"id": "17012", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17012", "title": "Christopher E. Abebe", "text": "Christopher Ebhodaghe Abebe (Yavutse mu mwaka wa 1919 - Apfa tariki 22 zu kwezi kwa Werurwe mu mwaka wa 2018) OFR, KSM, KSS, uzwi ku izina rya \"Pa Abebe\", yari umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019abakozi bo muri Nijeriya, nyuma aza kuba umuyobozi wa sosiyete yunze ubumwe bwa Afurika (UAC) muri Nijeriya. Yari intwari isumba izindi mu Itorero Gatolika rya ba Knight ba Mutagatifu Mulumba. \nUbuzima bwambere n'umuryango.\nChristopher Abebe yavutse mu mwaka wa 1919. Umukobwa we w'imfura, Stella Obasanjo, yari umugore w'uwahoze ari perezida wa Nijeriya, Olusegun Obasanjo. \nUmwuga.\nAbebe ubuzima bwe bwose yabukoresheje muri sosiyete yunze ubumwe ya Afurika, atangira kuba umwanditsi wa konti muri Uromi mu mwaka wa 1935. Mu mwaka wa 1951 yabaye umuyobozi ushinzwe umurimo i Warri, Umunyafurika wa mbere kavukire muri UAC washyizweho kuri uwo mwanya. Mu mwaka wa 1958 yagizwe umuyobozi ushinzwe iterambere n\u2019amahugurwa y\u2019abakozi bo muri Afurika muri Nijeriya maze umwaka ukurikira aba umunyafurika wa mbere w\u2019abasangwabutaka washyizweho mu nama y\u2019ubuyobozi ya UAC Nigeria. Yabaye umuyobozi wungirije mu mwaka wa 1972, aba umuyobozi ndetse na MD mu mwaka wa 1975. \nYagiye mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru mu mwaka wa 1980, agirwa umuyobozi w'Iteka rya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Nijeriya mu mwaka wa 1981. \nIbindi bikorwa.\nKuva mu mwaka wa 1996 kugeza mu mwaka wa 2000, yari intwari ikomeye mu Iteka rya ba Knight ba Mutagatifu Mulumba. Yabaye umuyobozi wungirije akaba n\u2019umuyobozi w\u2019inama ya kaminuza eshatu zo muri Nijeriya (Benin, Nsukka na Calabar). \nUrupfu.\nAbebe yapfuye ku ya 22 Werurwe 2018. "}
{"id": "17013", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17013", "title": "Hisham Mackie (Umucuruzi)", "text": "Hisham Mackie (yavutse mu mwaka wa 1969) ni umucuruzi wo mu gihugu cya Siyera Lewone. Kugeza ubu ni we mu Siyera Lewone w'umucuruzi ukora akazi ko kohereza diyama mu mahanga, ku kigero cya 51% by'ibicuruzwa byoherejwe mu mahanga bya diyama zituruka mu gihugu cya Siyera Lewone Mackie ayobora HM Diamond, sosiyete ikaba yari ifite 40% by'ibyoherezwa mu mahanga bya diyama mu mwaka wa 2005. \nUbuzima.\nHisham Mackie yavukiye i Freetown, muri Siyera Lewone tariki ya 6 ukwezi kwa Mata mu mwaka wa 1969 avukira mu muryango wa Siyera Lewone-Abanyalibani ukora ubucuruzi bwa diyama kuva mu mwaka wa 1952. Se we, igisekuru cya kabiri cya Siyera Lewone-Abanyalibani, yari mu bacuruzi ba mbere ba diyama babiherewe uburenganzira na guverinoma ya Siyera Lewone mu ntangiriro ya mirongo itandatu. Mackie yize amashuri yisumbuye mu ishuri rya Bo ryamamaye kandi rikomeye muri Bo arangiza mu mwaka wa 1986. Amaze kurangiza amashuri kuricyo kigo cya Bo, yagiye mu Bwongereza aho yize muri kaminuza ya London mu mwaka wa 1987. Mackie yinjiye mu bucuruzi bwa diyama mu mwaka wa 2002 nk'umuntu ufite uruhushya rwo kohereza ibicuruzwa hanze."}
{"id": "17014", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17014", "title": "Rajan Mahtani (Umucuruzi)", "text": "Rajan Mahtani (wavutse tariki 14 z'ukwezi kwa Gashyantare mu mwaka wa 1948) ni umucuruzi ukomeye muri Zambiya akaba umuyobozi wa Banki y\u2019imari Zambia, ishami ry\u2019amabanki aciriritse mu gihugu cya Zambiya. Yakurikiranye umwuga mu by'imari n'amategeko. Ni Umufatanyabikorwa w\u2019ishyirahamwe ryemewe ry\u2019abacungamari bemewe kandi afite impamyabumenyi ya PhD mu mategeko y\u2019ubucuruzi yakuye mu kigo cy\u2019ubucuruzi cy\u2019i Londere.\nTariki ya 13 mu kwezi kwa Mata mu mwaka wa 2015, Mahtani yemeye gutanga ikirego cye ku ruganda rwa sima rwa Zambezi Portland, aho abanyamigabane bayo bake 'Ventriglias' bari barigaruriye ku tariki ya 7 ukwezi kwa Mata mu mwaka wa 2015. Kwitanga hagamijwe kurengera inyungu z'abakozi bakora ku ruganda rwa sima rwa Zambezi Portland.\nGutsindira mu rukiko rwisumbuye rwa Malawi mu mwaka wa 2015.\nTariki ya 28 ukwezi kwa Nyakanga mu mwaka wa 2015, Urukiko Rwisumbuye rwa Malawi rwemeje icyemezo cyo gushyigikira Dr. Rajan Mahtani aho byagaragaye ko Nyasa Times, yasohoye ibintu bisebanya mu izina rya Dr. Mahtani. Kubera ko nta kimenyetso cyihariye n\u2019impaka zidafite ishingiro zivuye ku ruhande rwa Nyasa Times, Urukiko Rukuru rwahaye icyubahiro Dr. Rajan Mahtani intsinzi kandi Nyasa Times yasabwe gukuraho ibintu byose bisebanya ku rubuga rwayo hamwe no kwishyura amafaranga nk\u2019indishyi ku gikomere cyatewe. \nGutsindira mu rukiko rwisumbuye rwa Lusaka mu mwaka wa 2015.\nNk\u2019uko ikinyamakuru The Post kibitangaza ngo ku tariki ya 19 ukwezi kw'Ugushyingo mu mwaka wa 2015, umucamanza w'Urukiko Rwisumbuye rwa Lusaka, Mwiinde Siavwapa yaciriye urubanza aho byahamijwe ko gufunga burundu bidashobora gusubirwamo kugira ngo habeho urubanza rushya. Iki kibazo kijyanye no gusaranganya amafaranga y\u2019impimbano umuryango wa Ventriglia washyize Dr. Rajan Mahtani ku bijyanye n\u2019uruganda rwa sima rwa Zambezi Portland. Hanzuwe ko mu izina ry\u2019umuyobozi w\u2019agateganyo w\u2019ubushinjacyaha n\u2019umwunganira mukuru ko byaba ari amakosa gushyigikira ifatwa ry\u2019uwahoze ari umuyobozi wa banki y\u2019imari, Dr. Rajan Mahtani. \nUrubanza.\nIcyemezo cyafashwe mbere mu mwaka wa 2012, kizahagarara bityo rero, Mahtani ntashobora kubazwa ikibazo cy\u2019inyandiko mpimbano ukundi."}
{"id": "17015", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17015", "title": "Nkosana Makate (Umushoramari)", "text": "Nkosana Makate (wavutse mu mwaka wa 1977), ni umunyafurika yepfo wasabye Vodacom igitekerezo cyitwa \"Ndakwinginze umpamagare\". Igitekerezo cye cyari kigizwe no kohereza ubutumwa kubuntu kubandi bakoresha Vodacom kugirango bagusabe ko baguhamagara, nubwo waba udafite inguzanyo ihagije yo kubikora. Nkosana Makate yasangiye igitekerezo n'umukoresha we, ariko ntabwo yigeze abona ubwishyu. Yashinjeje Vodacom kandi yatsinze urwo rubanza nyuma y'intambara y'imyaka 8.\nUrubanza.\nVodacom yatangiye serivisi yiswe Ndakwinginze umpamagare mu mwaka wa 2001. Urubanza rwaciwe mu mwaka wa 2014 mu rukiko rwisumbuye rwa Gauteng rwo mu majyepfo rwashyigikiye ikirego cya Makate ko ariwe nyiri gitekerezo cyaturutseho cya Ndakwinginze umpamagare. Yanze kandi icyifuzo cy'uwahoze ari umuyobozi mukuru, Alan Knott-Craig, avuga ko yazanye igitekerezo cya serivisi y'ubutumwa. Nyamara Urukiko Rukuru rwasanze Makate, ruvuga ko Geissler atari afite ububasha bwo gusezeranya Makate izo ndishyi kandi ko umwenda wari kurangira (mu buryo bwemewe n'amategeko, byateganijwe) mu myaka itatu.\nMakate yajuririye urwo rubanza, nyuma aza kurujyana mu Rukiko Rushinzwe Kurinda Iremezo ry'Itegeko Nshinga. Muri Mata mu mwaka wa 2016, umutabera Chris Jafta yasanze kuruhande rwa Makate no kurwanya Vodacom. "}
{"id": "17016", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17016", "title": "Samuel Ndashyikirwa", "text": "Tariki ya 29 ukwezi kwa Kamena mu mwaka wa 2005, Samuel Ndashyikirwa, wahoze ari umucuruzi muto i Kirwa, mu Rwanda, yakatiwe mu Bubiligi kubera uruhare yagize muri jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu mwaka wa 1994. Ababyiboneye bavuga ko yari yitabiriye ubwicanyi bwabereye i Kirwa kandi ko yagize uruhare rutaziguye muri ubwo bwicanyi, abashinjacyaha bavuga ko we na murumuna we, Etienne Nzabonimana, batanze imodoka, intwaro, n'inzoga ku basirikare b'u Rwanda bakora itsembabwoko mu karere ka ngoma.. Bombi bahamwe n'icyaha cyo gufasha imitwe ya gisirikare y'Abahutu mu kwica Abatutsi 50.000. Ndashyikirwa azamara imyaka icumi muri gereza, naho murumuna we azamara imyaka cumi n'ibiri."}
{"id": "17018", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17018", "title": "TakeAlot", "text": "Takealot ni sosiyeti yo muri Afrika y'epfo igurisha kumurongo kubaguzi bashaka uburyo bworoshye kugura kumurongo hamwe nuburambe bwabakoresha. Uru rubuga rumaze imyaka irenga icumi, rushyizweho mu mwaka wa 2002. Urutonde rwarwo rwagutse hamwe n\u2019ibicuruzwa bitandukanye mu myidagaduro bitanga urwego rushimishije. Abakiriya barashobora kugura ikintu cyose kuva mubitabo kugeza kumikino, mudasobwa na TV.\nBimwe mubituma Takealot yerekana intsinzi ya e-ubucuruzi nuko umucuruzi wo kumurongo yihatira guha abakiriya bayo ibicuruzwa bigezweho kumasoko, hamwe nibisobanuro bigezweho.\nMuri Mata 2017, Takealot yatsindiye ishoramari rikomeye rya miliyoni zisaga 69 z'amadolari ya Amerika muri Naspers, imwe mu masosiyete akomeye ya Afurika. Ibi bibaye nyuma y\u2019uko umucuruzi wo kuri interineti yakiriye miliyoni 100 z\u2019amadolari y\u2019Amerika mu kigo cy\u2019ishoramari Tiger Global Management mu 2014. Naspers ifite imigabane 53,5% muri Takealot, naho Tiger Global ifite 34%."}
{"id": "17019", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17019", "title": "Urugomero rw'Amashanyarazi rwa Nyabarongo I", "text": "Amashanyarazi ya Nyabarongo Yambere (I) ni uruganda rutanga umuriro ugera kubushobozi bupimwa mumbaraga ibizwi nka megawate, aho zisaga 28 (28MW). \nIncamake.\nUrugomero rwa Nyabarongo I ni urugomero rw'amashanyarazi ruri mu Rwanda, rwuzuye mu Kwakira 2014, rukaba rwaratangiye gukoreshwa mu Gushyingo 2014. Biteganijwe ko kizatwara miliyoni 110 zamafaranga yu Rwanda hateganijwe kwishyiriraho ubushobozi ni MW 28. Uyu mushinga urimo urugomero, rufite igishushanyo mbonera cy\u2019umugezi, hakurya y'Uruzi Mwogo, umwe mu masoko y'uruzi rwa Nyabarongo. Uyu mushinga wakozwe na Angelique International Limited na Bharat Heavy Electricals Limited yo mu Buhinde, niwo mushinga munini w'amashanyarazi mu Rwanda, kugeza ubu. Naresh Kapoor Sr., Umuyobozi mukuru ni Umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019umushinga washyizweho na Angelique International Limited yo mu Buhinde. Bimwe mubikorwa byubwubatsi byanasezeranye nisosiyete yo muri Ositaraliya Snowy Mountains Engineering Corporation (SMEC). Ibyo bice byombi byahujwe na gride yo mu Rwanda ku ya 27 Ukwakira 2014 na 30 Ukwakira 2014. Guverinoma y'u Rwanda yahaye rwiyemezamirimo igihe ntarengwa mu Kwakira 2014. Sitasiyo y\u2019amashanyarazi yararangiye ishyikirizwa umukiriya ku ya 28 Ugushyingo 2014. Yafunguwe ku mugaragaro na perezida wa Repubulika y'u Rwanda ku ya 5 Werurwe 2015. "}
{"id": "17020", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17020", "title": "Urugomero rw'amashanyarazi rwa Rusumo", "text": "Urugomero rw'amashanyarazi ya Rusumo, ruzwi ku izina rya Rusumo, ni urugomero rw\u2019amashanyarazi rwubatswe, hakaba hari hateganijwe gushyirwaho megawate zigera 80. Uyu mushinga wari urimo kubaka urugomero, hifashishijwe igishushanyo mbonera. megawate igishushanyo mbonera cy\u2019ibigega cyatekerejweho mbere yo gutereranwa hashyirwaho umushinga wa MW 80 ufite ingaruka nkeya ku bidukikije ndetse bikaba bivugwa ko byatwaye miliyoni 300 amadolari ugereranije na miliyoni 400 z'amadolari ku mushinga munini. Banki y'isi yatangaje ku wa 6 Kanama 2013 ko yemeye inguzanyo ingana na miliyoni 340 z'amadolari y'Amerika yerekeza kuri miliyoni 468.60 z'amadolari y'Amerika yarakenewe muri uyu mushinga. Muri Gushyingo 2013, Banki Nyafurika itsura amajyambere yemeje inguzanyo ingana na miliyoni 113 z'amadolari y'Amerika kugira ngo umushinga urangire. \nAho biherereye.\nSitasiyo y\u2019amashanyarazi iri ku mugezi wa Kagera, hafi y\u2019umupaka w\u2019u Rwanda na Tanzaniya hamwe na kilometero 2 hepfo na ruguru aho ibihugu byombi bisangiye umupaka uhuriweho nu Burundi. Uyu mushinga wubatswe ku isoko ya Rusumo, hafi yumujyi wa Rusumo, hafi ya kilometero 164.5 mu majyepfo yuburasirazuba bwa Kigali, umurwa mukuru numujyi munini wu Rwanda. Isumo rya Rusumo ni, mu majyepfo yuburasirazuba bwicyicaro cyintara i Kibungo, mukarere ka Ngoma. Iyi sitasiyo yamashanyarazi iri ni: 02 \u00b0 22'47.0 \"S, 30 \u00b0 47'09.0\" E (Ubunini: -2.379722; Uburebure: 30.785833). \nIbindi bitekerezo.\nImbaraga zitangwa zigabanywa bimwe mu bihugu nk'Uburundi, u Rwanda, na Tanzaniya. Amashanyarazi azavanwa mu ruganda rw\u2019amashanyarazi akoresheje imirongo ya kilovolt 220 yohereza kuri sitasiyo zoherejwe muri: Gitega, u Burundi, intera ya kilometero 158 ; Kigali, u Rwanda, intera kilometero 115 na, Nyakanazi, Tanzaniya, intera ya kilometero 98. \nAmajyambere ya vuba.\nMu Gushyingo 2016, hasinywe amasezerano abiri yo kubaka inzira y\u2019amashanyarazi yasinyiwe i Kigali, mu Rwanda. Amasezerano ya mbere yari hagati ya Rusumo Power Company Limited hamwe n\u2019ihuriro ry\u2019abashoramari barimo umushinga uhuriweho na CGCOC Group Limited na Jiangxi Water and Hydropower Construction Company Limited. Aya masezerano ateganya imikorere yimirimo ya leta, harimo gutanga no gushyiramo ibikoresho bya hydro-mashini. \nAmasezerano ya kabiri yasinywe hagati ya Rusumo Power Company Limited n\u2019urugaga rw\u2019a masosiyete, harimo Rusumo Falls Andritz Hydro GmbH yo mu Budage na Andritz Hydro PVT Limited yo mu Buhinde, kugira ngo ikore amashanyarazi yo kubyaza ingufu amashanyarazi. \nKugeza mu Gushyingo 2016, amafaranga ateganijwe muri uyu mushinga ni miliyoni 340 z'amadolari, azaterwa inkunga na Banki y'isi. Imirongo itatu y\u2019amashanyarazi ihanitse izavana ingufu ziteganijwe biteganijwe ko izatwara miliyoni 121 z'amadolari, iterwa inkunga na Banki nyafurika ishinzwe iterambere. Biteganijwe ko imirimo yo kubaka izatangira muri Mutarama 2017. "}
{"id": "17021", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17021", "title": "Ingufu m'ibiyaga Bigari", "text": "Ingufu nini zo mu biyaga bigari, ni umuriro w'amashanyarazi ya pano soleye akorwa na EPC yashinzwe na Sam Dargan muri 2005. Isosiyete ifite icyicaro mu mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda kandi ikorera cyane cyane isoko rya Afurika y'Iburasirazuba. Isosiyete ifite ubuhanga bwo gukoresha ingufu zituruka ku mirasire y'izuba. Mu myaka icumi ishize, isosiyete yibanda cyane mu gusobanukirwa no gukemura ibibazo by\u2019ingufu by\u2019abo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba. Uyu munsi dukoresha ubwo bumenyi nuburambe mugushushanya, kubaka, no kubungabunga sisitemu yizuba yizewe, irambye, kandi ihendutse. Isosiyete itanga imiryango itegamiye kuri leta, ibitaro, n\u2019ishuri hamwe na sisitemu nziza y\u2019amafoto. Isosiyete ifite ubuhanga bwo kuvugurura ibishushanyo mbonera bya PV bituruka kuri grid hamwe na verisiyo nziza. Mubihe byashize iyi sosiyete yatanze akazi ko guhugura abanyarwanda baho uburyo bwo gukora injeniyeri no gushyiraho sisitemu. Isosiyete kandi yatanze amahugurwa kubandi ba rwiyemezamirimo bashinzwe imibereho biga gukorera muri Afurika. \nUmuriro.\nIngufu nini zo mu biyaga bigari zikwirakwiza amatara yizuba rya King King na Green Light Energy muri 2013 zemerera gutanga igisubizo cyu mucyo urambye\u00a0 ingo zo mucyaro mu Rwanda. \nMuri mwaka wa 2014, ingufu z\u2019ibiyaga bigari zafatanije na Global Bright Light Foundation gukwirakwiza amatara y\u2019umwami w\u2019izuba ku mpunzi ziri mu nkambi y\u2019impunzi ya UNHCR Kiziba mu Rwanda. \nMuri 2016 Ingufu z'Ibiyaga Bigari zabaye umugabuzi wemewe wa Victron Energy https://www.victronenergy.com/"}
{"id": "17022", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17022", "title": "Ikigo cya Akilah", "text": "Ikigo cya Akilah ni ishuri ridaharanira inyungu ku bagore i Kigali, mu Rwanda. Ni kaminuza ya mbere y\u2019abagore mu gihugu. Ikigo gitanga impamyabumenyi y'imyaka itatu mu kwihangira imirimo nka rwiyemezamirimo, gucunga neza abashyitsi, hamwe na sisitemu yamakuru. Akilah yemerewe binyuze muri Minisiteri y'Uburezi mu Rwanda. \nAmateka.\nIkigo cya Akilah cyashinzwe muri 2008 na Elizabeth Dearborn Hughes na Dave Hughes. Elizabeth Hughes yimukiye mu Rwanda nyuma yo kurangiza muri kaminuza ya Vanderbilt muri 2006. Amaze kwitanga hamwe n\u2019ibikorwa byinshi byo mu nzego z'ibanze, yashinze Amani Afurika gutanga buruse ku bana bo mu muhanda. \nDave Hughes yinjiye muri gahunda nk'umukorerabushake. Bombi bafashe ingamba zo guhuza abagore mu Rwanda amahirwe yo kubona akazi igihe kirekire. Muri 2008, bateguye icyitegererezo cya Akilah Institute. \nIkigo cyafunguwe ku mugaragaro i Kigali, mu Rwanda, muri Mutarama 2010 gifite impamyabumenyi ijyanye no gucunga abashyitsi. Abanyeshuri 50 biyandikishije mu cyiciro cya mbere. Muri 2012, ikigo cyatangije impamyabumenyi yo kwihangira imirimo. Nyuma yimyaka ibiri, yatangije impamyabumenyi ya sisitemu.\nImikorere.\nInshingano ya Akilah ni gutanga uburezi bujyanye n\u2019isoko butuma abakobwa bakiri bato bagera ku bwigenge mu bukungu no kubona inshingano z\u2019ubuyobozi mu kazi ndetse no muri sosiyete. Inyigisho zateguwe ku bufatanye n\u2019abakoresha baho na guverinoma yu Rwanda. Ibyiciro byamasomo byatoranijwe ukurikije isoko ryakarere. \nIkigo cya Akilah ubu gifite abanyeshuri 1100 n\u2019abanyeshuri 990 barangije. Ikigo gifite igipimo cyo kugumana 93 %, naho 88 % by'abanyeshuri barangije babona akazi mu mezi atandatu barangije. \nIkigo cy'Uburundi.\nMuri Mutarama 2014, Akilah yaguye mu Burundi maze afungura ishuri rya mbere ry'abagore mu gihugu. Muri Mata 2015, ikigo cyafunzwe kubera ihungabana rya politiki mu gihugu. Abanyeshuri 44 bo mu Burundi bimuriwe mu kigo cya Kigali cya Akilah. \nInkunga.\nAkilah iterwa inkunga cyane cyane binyuze mu guhuza imisanzu n'impano. Andi masoko yatanzwe harimo amafaranga yishuri ryabanyeshuri, impano yubwoko, nibikorwa bidasanzwe. \nUbufatanye bwa Marriott.\nMuri 2012, Akilah yafatanije na Marriott International gutangiza gahunda yo guhugura abashyitsi barangije muri hoteri ya Marriott muri Dubai na Doha. Kuva gahunda yatangira, abize muri Akilah benshi bimukiye mu burasirazuba bwo hagati kugira ngo bitabira iyo gahunda. Marriott yahaye akazi 23 barangije Akilah mu bakozi bayo Hotel ya Kigali Marriott, yafunguwe muri 2016.\nItsinda ry'impaka.\nMuri 2015, Akilah yashinze u Rwanda itsinda ryambere ry\u2019abagore biga impaka muri kaminuza. Ikipe yatsinze amarushanwa mu gihugu cyose muri uwo mwaka. Mu Kwakira 2015, Akilah yakiriye Shampiyona yambere y\u2019igihugu ihuza amakipe y'abagore.\nMindSky.\nMuri Mutarama 2015, Elizabeth Dear born Hughe s washinze Akilah yatangije Mind Sky hamwe n\u2019uwashinze Anastasia Uglova mu rwego rw\u2019itsinda rya Akilah, icyegeranyo cy\u2019ibigo by\u2019imibereho byibanda ku burezi, ikoranabuhanga, ndetse n\u2019akazi. Mind Sky ni urubuga rw'impano ku murongo ruhuza abakoresha nabashaka akazi muri Afurika yuburasirazuba. "}
{"id": "17023", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17023", "title": "Ubucuruzi bw'Urumogi mu Rwanda", "text": "Urumogi mu Rwanda rwemewe kubera ruvamo imiti, ariko nanone rutemewe mu rwego rwo kwidagadura. \nAmateka.\nUbushakashatsi bwakozwe muri 1959 \u2013 1960 bwerekanye ko kunywa urumogi mu Rwanda muri kiriya gihe byagarukiraga ku baturage bake ba Twa. Amashyirahamwe mabi y\u2019urumogi n\u2019urugomo, hamwe n\u2019imibereho mike ya Twa, byatumye imikoreshereze yacyo igarukira muri ubwo bwoko. \nIvugurura.\nMu mwaka wa 2010, Minisitiri w\u2019ubuzima yasabye itegeko ryemerera urumogi gukoreshwa mu buvuzi mu gihugu. Muri 2021, u Rwanda rwemeje itegeko ryo gukora urumogi hagamijwe imiti. "}
{"id": "17024", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17024", "title": "Ivunjisha muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba", "text": "Ihererekanya ry'amafaranga ry'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, n'Isoko ry\u2019ibicuruzwa byo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, ni isoko ry\u2019abikorera ku giti cyabo, guhana ibicuruzwa mu buhinzi muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, yatangijwe i Kigali, mu Rwanda, muri Nyakanga 2014. ivunjisha ni iya gatatu mu bucuruzi bw\u2019ibicuruzwa by\u2019ubuhinzi muri Afurika, nyuma y\u2019ivunjisha ry\u2019ejo hazaza muri Afurika yepfo no kuvunja ibicuruzwa muri Etiyopiya. \nAho biherereye.\nIcyicaro gikuru cya EAX giherereye mu igorofa rya 12, ku munara wa Kigali City, Avenue du Commerce, mu mujyi wa Kigali, umurwa mukuru w'u Rwanda. icyicaro gikuru cyiri ni: 1 \u00b0 56'37.0 \"S, 30 \u00b0 03'34.0\" E (Ubunini: -1.943601; Uburebure: 30.059431). \nIncamake.\nIntego y'ibanze yo kungurana ibitekerezo ni korohereza abahinzi n\u2019abakora umusaruro w\u2019ubuhinzi kubona ibiciro byiza ku bicuruzwa byabo n\u2019ibicuruzwa ndetse no kubona inkunga ikwiye ku bucuruzi bwabo. Guhera ku bigori n'ibishyimbo, guhana birateganya kwaguka mu ikawa, icyayi, n'umuceri. Kuva muri Werurwe 2016,ivunjisha ikorera mu Rwanda na Kenya ifite gahunda yo kwinjira muri Uganda mu 2016. \nUmugabane.\nImbonerahamwe ikurikira irerekana imigabane muri ivunjisha: "}
{"id": "17025", "revid": "13539", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17025", "title": "Sitasiyo y'Amashanyarazi", "text": "Sitasiyo y'amashanyarazi, cyangwa uruganda rw'amashanyarazi rimwe na rimwe ni uruganda rutanga amashanyarazi, ni uruganda rukora amashanyarazi. Amashanyarazi muri rusange ahujwe na giride y'amashanyarazi.\nAmashanyarazi menshi arimo ahari moteri imwe cyangwa nyinshi, imashini izunguruka ihindura ingufu za mashini mu mashanyarazi atatu. Icyerekezo kigereranije hagati yu murongo wa manyeti n'uyobora ikora amashanyarazi.\nInkomoko yingufu zikoreshwa muguhindura generator ziratandukanye cyane. Amashanyarazi menshi ku isi atwika ibicanwa nka amakara, peteroli, na gaze karemano kugirango bitange amashanyarazi. Amashanyarazi make ya karubone arimo ingufu za kirimbuzi, no gukoresha ibishobora kuvugururwa nk'izuba, umuyaga, geothermal, na hydroelectirike.\nAmateka.\nMuri ntangiriro za 1871, uwahimbye umubiligi Z\u00e9nobe Gramme yahimbye generator ifite imbaraga zihagije zitanga ingufu ku rwego rw\u2019ubucuruzi ku nganda. \nMuri 1878, sitasiyo y\u2019amashanyarazi yateguwe kandi yubatswe na William, Lord Armstrong ahitwa Cragside, mu Bwongereza. Yakoresheje amazi ava mu biyaga kumurima we kugirango ingufu za Siemensi. Amashanyarazi yatangaga amashanyarazi ku matara, gushyushya, kubyara amazi ashyushye, gukora lift hamwe nibikoresho bizigama abakozi ninyubako zu buhinzi. \nMuri Mutarama 1882, sitasiyo ya mbere y\u2019amashanyarazi rusange y\u2019amakara ku isi, Edison y\u2019amashanyarazi ya Edison, yubatswe i Londres, umushinga wa Thomas Edison wateguwe na Edward Johnson. Imashini ya Babcock &amp;amp; Wilcox yakoresheje kilowate 93 moteri yatwaraga moteri zigera 27. Ibi byatanze amashanyarazi muri bibanza byo muri ako gace byashoboraga kugerwaho binyuze mu miyoboro ya gari ya moshi utabanje gucukura umuhanda, wari wiharira amasosiyete ya gaze. Abakiriya barimo Urusengero rw'umujyi na Bailey ishaje. Undi mukiriya w'ingenzi yari Ibiro bya Telegraph by'Ibiro Bikuru by'Amaposita, ariko ntibyashobokaga kugerwaho binyuze mu mwobo. Johnson yateguye umugozi wo gutanga kugirango ukoreshwe hejuru, unyuze kuri Holborn Tavern na Newugate. \nAmashanyarazi.\nMuri 2018, Inter RAO UES na Grid ya Leta, hateganijwe kubaka urugomero rw'amashanyarazi rwa wate 8 GW, akaba ariwo mushinga munini wo kubaka urugomero rw'amashanyarazi muri Burusiya. \nImbaraga zituruka ku mbaraga zishobora kubaho.\nAmashanyarazi arashobora kubyara ingufu z'amashanyarazi ziva mu rugomero rwa mashanyarazi.\nBiomass.\nAmashanyarazi manini akoreshwa n\u2019a makara, nucleaire, n\u2019amashanyarazi arashobora kubyara megawate amagana kuri gigawate nyinshi. Ingero zimwe:"}
{"id": "17026", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17026", "title": "Ubucuruzi bwa Gaze mu Rwanda", "text": "Umuriro wa Gaze isanzwe (nanone yitwa gaze ya fosile cyangwa gaze gusa) ni ibisanzwe bivangwa na hydro karibone ya gaze igizwe ahanini na metani hiyongereyeho umubare muto wa alikane ndende. Urwego rwo hasi rwa gaze nka gaze karuboni, azote, hydrogen sulfide, na helium nabyo birahari. Methane idafite ibara kandi nta mpumuro nziza, bityo impumuro nziza nka mercaptan (ihumura nka sulfuru cyangwa amagi yaboze) ikunze kongerwa mu bikoresho bya gaze karemano kugirango umutekano ube byoroshye. \nGaze isanzwe ni lisansi y\u2019ibinyabuzima n\u2019umutungo udashobora kuvugururwa ukorwa iyo ibice by\u2019ibinyabuzima (cyane ibinyabuzima byo mu nyanja) byangirika mu bihe bya anaerobike kandi bigashyirwa n\u2019ubushyuhe bukabije n\u2019umuvuduko mwinshi mu myaka miriyoni. Ingufu ibinyabuzima byangirika byabonetse ku zuba hakoreshejwe fotosenteze za bibikwa nkingufu za chimique muri molekile ya metani nizindi hydro karbone. \nGaze.\nGaze isanzwe irashobora gutwikwa kugirango ishyushye, guteka, no kubyara amashanyarazi. Ikoreshwa kandi nk'ibiryo bya chimique mugukora plastike nindi miti mvaruganda ikomeye mubucuruzi kandi ntibikoreshwa cyane nka lisansi yimodoka.\nGukuramo no gukoresha gaze karemano n\u2019ingenzi kandi bigenda byiyongera mu mihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere. Gazi ubwayo (cyane metani) na karuboni ya dioxyde, isohoka iyo gaze naturel yatwitse, ni gaze ya parike. Iyo itwitswe kubera ubushyuhe cyangwa amashanyarazi, gaze karemano isohora imyuka ihumanya ikirere nkeya, dioxyde de carbone nkeya, kandi hafi ya byose nta kintu na kimwe kigereranije ugereranije n\u2019ibindi bicanwa n\u2019ibinyabuzima. Nyamara, guhumeka gaze hamwe n\u2019imyuka itabigenewe itangwa mu ruhererekane rw\u2019ibicuruzwa birashobora gutuma gaze karemano igira ikirenge cya karuboni kimwe n\u2019ibindi bicanwa muri rusange. \nAmateka.\nGaze isanzwe irashobora kuva mubutaka igatera umuriro muremure. Mu Bugereki bwa kera, umuriro wa gaze ku musozi wa Chimaera wagize uruhare mu mugani w'ikinyabuzima gihumeka umuriro Chimera. Mu Bushinwa bwa kera, gaze yavuye mu gucukura brine yakoreshejwe bwa mbere na 400 mbere ya Yesu. Abashinwa batwaye gaze yinjira mu butaka mu miyoboro itavanze imigano aho yakoreshwaga mu guteka amazi y'umunyu kugira ngo bakuremo umunyu mu Karere ka Ziliujing muri Sichuan. "}
{"id": "17028", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17028", "title": "Inkomoko Business Development", "text": "Inkomoko Business Developmen Ni ikigo cyashinzwe muri 2012 mu Rwanda bikozwe nka Julienne Oyler hamwe na Sara Leedom. Mu byo gikora harimo gutanga igishoro, amasomo ajyanye no gucuruza, guhuza ba rwiyemezemirimo bato n\u2019ibigo bikomeye. ni kimwe mu bigo muri Afurika mu kuzamura ba rwiyemezamirimo mu bihugu bya Afurika y\u2019Iburasirazuba, cyibanda ku rubyiruko rukizamuka n\u2019impunzi.\nIbyo bakora.\nInkomoko Business Development ni kompanyi ikorana na ba rwiyemezamirimo bato ndetse baciriritse, harimo nki impunzi, guhanga imirimo, kuzamura imibereho kuri bose, no guteza imbere imiryango itera imbere muri Afurika, aho cyakoranye na ba rwiyemezamirimo bagera kuri 40.000. \nIbindi.\nInkomoko Entrepreneur Development igira gahunda zitandukanye zizamura urubyiruko, urugero nka BK Urumuri Initiative gahunda ifatanya na Banki ya Kigali, yahinduriye benshi ubuzima."}
{"id": "17029", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17029", "title": "BK Urumuri Initiative", "text": "BK Urumuri Initiative ni amahugurwa n'amarushanwa, yagenewe ba rwiyemezamirimo bato, kugaragaza uburyo barengera ibidukikije, hatoranywa ibigo bigera kuri 25, ba nyirabyo bahabwe amahugurwa n\u2019ubujyanama bugezweho mu gihe kigera ku mezi atandatu, nyuma hatoranywemo ba rwiyemezamirimo habwa inguzanyo yishyurwa nta nyungu nimwe yongeweho.\nAmahugurwa.\nBK Urumuri Initiative itanga Amahugurwa kuri ba rwiyemezamirimo bahabwa ajyanye ni micungire inoze y\u2019imishinga yabo, uburyo bashobora guteza imbere ubucuruzi ndetse no guhanga imirimo. muri ibi bihe bazita ku mishinga ifasha abaturage guhangana n\u2019ingaruka z\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe, mu rwego rwo gutegura ejo hazaza harangwa n\u2019Isi itoshye kandi inogeye buri wese. Ni mu gihe inkomoko business development yo itanga ubujyanama n\u2019amahugurwa ku bakora ubucuruzi.\nImishinga.\nImishinga yatoranyijwe muri iki gihe\n1. Exalto Engineering and Supply Solutions Ltd\n2. Uzi Collections\n3. Vakman Ltd\n4. Slice and Cakes\n5. Nova Leather Ltd\n6. ABCD Great Life Ltd\n7. Farmia Group Ltd\n8. Bee Light Ltd\n9. DM Bricola Ltd\n10. La Fotolia Ltd\n11. Huza Press Ltd.\n12. WEYA Creations Ltd.\n13. Jotete Investment Ltd\n14. Feed The World Company Ltd\n15. Gukora no Gucuruza Inkweto\n16. SHARAMA Events &amp; Tours\n17. The Gold World Company Ltd\n18. Savior Civil Engineers Ltd\n19. Work Roselyne Ltd\n20. Berwa Crochet Ltd\n21. Endless Trading Company\n22. Data Systems Ltd\n23. Mugisha Timber Hub\n24. Bellavitae Medical Clinic\n25. Iwacu Poultry Ltd"}
{"id": "17030", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17030", "title": "Ubucuruzi bw'Imyenda yo muri Afurika", "text": "iImyenda ny'afurika ni imyenda ituruka ahantu hatandukanye k'umugabane wa Afrika. Hirya no hino muri Afurika, hariho uburyo bwinshi butandukanye, tekinike, uburyo bwo gusiga amarangi, n'intego zo gushushanya no gukora. Iyi myenda ifite umuco kandi ifite akamaro nk'inyandiko za mateka y'ubushakashatsi bwa Afurika.\nAmateka.\nZimwe mu myenda ya kera ya Afurika yarokotse yavumbuwe ahahoze aruheologiya ya Kissi mu majyaruguru ya Burkina Faso. Bikozwe mu bwoya cyangwa umusatsi mwiza mugufi w'inyamanswa harimo uruhu rwumye kugirango ube inyangamugayo. Ibice bimwe na bimwe byarokotse kuva mu kinyejana cya cumi na gatatu Umujyi wa Benine muri Nijeriya. Amateka imyenda yakoreshejwe nk'uburyo bw'ifaranga kuva mu kinyejana cya cumi na kane muri Afurika y'Iburengerazuba no muri Afurika yo hagati. Hano hepfo ni incamake ya tekinoroji isanzwe hamwe nibikoresho byimyenda ikoreshwa mukarere ka Afrika ndetse nibihugu bitandukanye.\nKuboha imyenda.\nStripweaving, imaze ibinyejana byinshi ikora imyenda yo gukora imyenda yo kuboha imyenda hamwe, iranga kuboha muri Afrika yuburengerazuba, bashimira abadozi ba Mande cyane cyane abanya Tellem nkabambere mu buhanga bwo kuboha imyenda igoye yo kuboha. 4 Ibyavuye mu buvumo bwa Escarpment ya Bandiagara muri Mali byerekana ko byakoreshwa kuva mu kinyejana cya 11. Imyenda ya stripwoven igizwe nimirongo migufi yaciwe muburebure bwifuzwa kandi idoda hamwe. Kuva muri Mali, tekinike yakwirakwiriye muri Afurika y'Iburengerazuba kugera kuri Coryte d'Ivoire, Gana, na Nijeriya. Raphia fibre yavuye mumababi yumye yimikindo ya raphia yakunze gukoreshwa muri Afrika yuburengerazuba no muri Afrika yo hagati kuko iboneka cyane mubihugu bifite ibyatsi nka Kameruni, Gana, na Nijeriya. Ipamba y'ipamba iva ku giti cya kapok yakoreshejwe cyane na Da gomba kugirango itange imirongo miremire ya fibre kugirango Gana itere. Ibindi bikoresho bya fibre harimo ubudodo bwo mu gasozi budasize bwakoreshejwe muri Nijeriya mu kudoda no kuboha, ndetse n'igitambaro cyo mu biti by'imitini byakoreshwaga mu gukora imyenda y'ibirori muri Uganda, Kameruni, na Kongo. Nyuma yigihe kinini, fibre nyinshi zasimbuwe nipamba. Imyenda yaboshywe kumurongo utambitse cyangwa uhagaritse bitandukanye bitewe n'akarere. \nAfurika y'Iburasirazuba.\nIpamba rya Etiyopiya: Usibye Etiyopiya, kuboha imyenda ntibikunze kugaragara muri Afrika y'uburasirazuba. Mu kinyejana cya 1, ipamba yatumizwaga muri Etiyopiya n'Abarabu. Etiyopiya ifite ibihe byiza byo guhinga ipamba bityo ipamba noneho ikahingwa m'ugace hanyuma ikaboshywa mu myenda y'ipamba k'umurongo utambitse 20 ikoreshwa cyane n'abafite imibereho myiza.\nAfurika yo hagati.\nAbanyafurika y\u2019iburengerazuba bakeneye imyenda y\u2019ipamba byongereye ingufu mu majyepfomu gihe cy'abakoloni. \nIngero.\nIngero zimwe z'imyenda nyafurika ni izi zikurikira: "}
{"id": "17032", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17032", "title": "Skol mu rwanda", "text": "Skol Lager ni yatunganijwe mbere n\u2019inzoga zikorwa na Ind Coope breweries i Alloa, muri ekosse yo hagati. Muri 1958, Continental Graham yatangije (ishingiye ku nzoga yaho yitwa Graham's Gorden) ihita ihinduka Skol ya Graham kugirango itange igitekerezo cyo muri Scandinaviya (uruganda rwose rwatumijwe muri Suwede). Izina ryaje kuvugururwa ubu ni Skol gusa.\nAllied Breweries (UK), Labatt (Kanada), Pripps-Bryggerierna (Suwede), na Unibra (Ububiligi) bashinze isosiyete nshya yitwa Skol International muri 1964. Intego yacyo kwari ugushiraho ikirango cy\u2019inzoga kuri isi, Skol, gishobora gutangwa, gukora no gucuruzwa ku isi hose. Mu mpera z'imyaka ya z 1960, ryamamajwe cyane kuri Radiyo pirate yo mu Buholandi yitwa Veronica nka Skol International, hamwe n'ijwi ryamamaza ryaririmbwe na Patrica Paay, waje kuba umuririmbyi wa pop mu Buholandi akaba n'umunyamakuru wa TV. Kuva icyo gihe kwitabira isosiyete byahindutse ku buryo bugaragara. \nAmateka.\nKuva muri 1973 kugeza 1982, byeri munsi yikirango cya Skol yatekwaga n\u2019inzoga yo mu Buholandi Oranjeboom, ariko ntibyagenze neza ku isoko ry\u2019Ubuholandi. \nMuri 1980, Skol yari umuterankunga mukuru wa Automotive ya Fittipaldi, nyuma yuko inkunga ya Copersucar irangiye shampiyona irangiye. Ikirango kandi cyateye inkunga marushanwa y\u2019igikombe cya Scottish League kuva 1984 - 1992, igikombe cya kabiri Skol Cup gihabwa abatsinze hamwe n'igikombe gisanzwe cya shampiyona muri iki gihe. \nMuri 1992, ihuriro hagati ya Allied Breweries na Carlsberg ryateje Carlsberg Tetley's, yimuye umusaruro wa Skol uva Alloa ujya mu ruganda rwabo i Leeds kugeza ubwo inzoga zafunzwe muri 2011. Ikomeje gukwirakwizwa mu Bwongereza, hamwe na ABV yagabanutse kugera kuri 2.8%. \nCarlsberg afite uruhushya rwo guteka no gucuruza inzoga ku isi hose, usibye Afurika na Amerika y'Epfo. Unibra ifite uruhushya rwa Afurika. Mu Burayi, byeri nayo ikorerwa kandi igacuruzwa muri Rumaniya na Turukiya. Muri Aziya, ikwirakwizwa muri Maleziya, Ubushinwa, Hong Kong, na Singapore. Muri Afurika, iri muri Angola, u Burundi, Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, Gineya, Madagasikari, n'u Rwanda. Izina ni ururimi rw'icyongereza ruhindura ibinyobwa bya Scandinaviya sk\u00e5l. Mu gihe runaka, H\u00e4gar the cartrible cartoon character yakoreshejwe mu kuzamurwa. \nKu isoko rya Berezile Skol yongeyeho ibinyobwa bishya ku kirango cyabo cyitwa Skol Beats gifite uburyohe bwa citrus hamwe nuburyohe bwinshi, harimo ubururu, umutuku, n'icyatsi, hiyongereyeho umurongo mushya wa gin ya Skol Beats n'ibinyobwa bya tonike byose birimo hafi 7.9% inzoga. \nIbihembo.\nIkirango cyahawe igihembo cya Zahabu mu guhitamo ubuziranenge bw\u2019isi 2012, cyateguwe na Monde Selection. Iki cyari igihembo cya kabiri mpuzamahanga Skol yatsindiye. Inzoga yahawe kandi umudari wa zahabu wo gupakira ndetse n\u2019umudari wa feza mu cyiciro cy uburyohe mu bihembo mpuzamahanga by\u2019inzoga bya Ositaraliya 2005. "}
{"id": "17034", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17034", "title": "Isoko rimwe rya afurika ryo gutwara abantu n'ibintu mu kirere", "text": "Isoko rimwe ryo gutwara abantu n'ibintu mu kirere (Single African Air Transport Market (SAATM)) ni umushinga w\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019Afurika yo gushyiraho isoko rimwe ryo gutwara indege muri Afurika. Iyo isoko rimwe imaze gukurikizwa, isoko rimwe rigomba kwemerera ubwisanzure bukomeye bwo gutwara abantu n'ibintu muri Afurika, igateza imbere gahunda ya AU 2063. \nIcyambere, intego ya SAATM ni ugushyira m'ubikorwa by'imazeyo Icyemezo cya Yamoussoukro muri 1999. Ibi bivuze ko abitabiriye amahugurwa bose bemeye gukuraho imipaka y\u2019isoko ry\u2019indege, kuvanaho imipaka ku nyungu zabo, guha buri wese uburenganzira bwo kugenda mu kirere (mbere y\u2019ubwisanzure bwa gatanu, ntibibangamira uburenganzira bwa cabotage), no guha uburenganzira bwo kuguruka no kugabanya ubushobozi. Indege zombi zitwara abagenzi n'imizigo zirimo. Irashaka kandi guhuza amabwiriza y\u2019umutekano n\u2019umutekano mu ndege, ishingiye ku bisabwa na ICAO. Kugenzura SAATM bikorwa n\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019Afurika, Umuryango w\u2019ubukungu w\u2019akarere, na komisiyo nyafurika ishinzwe indege za gisivili (AFCAC). \nAmateka.\nInyungu yo kwishyira ukizana mu kirere, cyane cyane umudendezo wa gatanu, yemejwe bwa mbere mu itangazo rya Yamoussoukro ryo mu 1988. Iri tangazo ryongeye gushimangirwa mu 1999, igihe Umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019Afurika watoye icyemezo cya Yamoussoukuro. Icyakora, ishyirwa mu bikorwa ry'icyemezo ryahuye n'inzitizi, kubera ko inzego zishinzwe kugenzura ibikorwa zitatangiye gukora nk'uko biteganijwe mu masezerano. Ibihugu byinshi bigize uyu muryango ntabwo byahaye uburenganzira bwa gatanu ubwisanzure ku ndege zituruka mu bindi bihugu. \nMu mwaka wo muri 2015, Declaration for the Establishment of a Single African Air Transport Market ryashyizeho urwego rwi soko rimwe rishyira mu bikorwa icyemezo cya Yamoussoukro kizashyirwaho muri 2017. Iki gihe ntarengwa cyongerewe gahunda yo gutangiza isoko rimwe mu nama ya 30 y\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika yabereye i Addis Abeba. Aho, itangizwa rya SAATM ryashyizwe ku mugaragaro ku ya 28 Mutarama 2018 na Perezida w\u2019u Rwanda, Paul Kagame, nk'umuyobozi mushya w\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019Afurika. Uyu muryango washatse kugira abanyamuryango 40 mu mpera za 2019. \nUruhare.\nIbihugu 23 bigize Umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019Afurika byabanje kwemera kwinjira muri SAATM nkabitabira gutangira. Nyakanga\u00a02022 hari ibihugu 34 byitabiriye: \nIsuzuma.\nBamwe muri guverinoma n\u2019indege za Afurika banenze umushinga. By'umwihariko indege ntoya, kimwe na guverinoma ya Uganda, bavuga ko ayo masezerano yatuma indege nke nini ziganje ku isoko, bityo bikazimya amarushanwa. \nBanki nyafurika itsura amajyambere, hamwe n\u2019abandi basesenguzi, yahanuye ko SAATM izageza ku ndege zihendutse, ubwinshi bw\u2019abagenzi n\u2019inyungu z\u2019ubukungu. \nIshyirahamwe mpuzamahanga ryo gutwara abantu n'ibintu mu kirere ryashimye Umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019Afurika gutangiza isoko rimwe, ariko uraburira ko hazakenerwa byinshi kugira ngo iyi politiki ishyirwe mu bikorwa neza. \nAbd\u00e9rahmane Berth\u00e9, umunyamabanga mukuru w\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019indege ny'afurika, yavuze ko icyorezo cya COVID-19 cyafashije ishyirwa mu bikorwa rya SAATM. "}
{"id": "17035", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17035", "title": "Isoko rishinzwe indege za gisivili muri Afurika", "text": "Komisiyo Nyafurika ishinzwe iby'indege za gisivili (African Civil Aviation Commission, AFCAC) ni ikigo cy\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019Afurika gifite icyicaro i Dakar, muri senegal. Intego yacyo ni uguteza imbere no kugenzura indege za gisivili muri Afurika. \nIsoko.\nAFCAC yashinzwe nk'ikigo cyihariye cy\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019Afurika ku ya 17 Mutarama 1969. Icyemezo cya Yamoussoukro cyanditswe muri 1999 gitangira gukurikizwa muri 2002. Ubu AFCAC ni ikigo gikora isoko rimwe ryo gutwara abantu n'ibintu mu kirere, rishyira mu bikorwa Icyemezo cya Yamoussoukro. Ubufatanye bwayo n\u2019umuryango mpuzamahanga w\u2019indege za gisivili burimo guteza imbere ishyirwa mu bikorwa ry\u2019ubuziranenge bwa ICAO hamwe n\u2019ibikorwa byasabwe. \nIkigo cyakira ubufasha bw\u2019ubuyobozi n\u2019imari na ICAO kandi cyabonye inkunga na Banki ny'afurika itsura amajyambere. Muri 2015 leta nyinshi ntabwo zishyuye umusanzu wabanyamuryango na 90 % by'amafaranga AFCAC yinjiza yakoreshejwe ku mushahara n'amafaranga y'ubuyobozi. "}
