{"id": "17066", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17066", "title": "Ikiraro cy'umuhanda wa Alfred Beit", "text": "Ikiraro cy'umuhanda wa Alfred Beit ni ikiraro cy'umuhanda cyambuka uruzi rwa Limpopo hagati ya Musina mu gihugu cy'Afrika y'epfo na Beitbridge muri Zimbabwe.\nAmateka.\nUmwimerere w'ikiraro Alfred Beit Bridge, wari ukwikorera umuhanda wa gari ya moshi gusa, iki kiraro cyuzuye mu mwaka wa 1929 kubufatanye na sosiyete yitwa Dorman Long. Nyuma yaho cyaje kwitirirwa Alfred Beit, wari umuherwe wa zahabu na diyama, cyamutwaye 600,000 by'amadorari ya Amerika, cyaje gufungurwa n'umuyobozi w'ingabo z'Ubwongereza Earl ya Athlone ku ya 31 Kanama 1929. \nIkiraro gishya cy'umuhanda, cy'ubatswe mu mwaka wa 1995 kibangikanye n'ikiraro gishaje cyari kihahoze aricyo bitaga Alfred Beit Bridge, cyari kigamije ukwikorera imodoka ziremereye cyane kurusha ikiraro cyari kihahoze. Cyubatswe na Murray &amp; Roberts mu izina rya New Limpopo Bridge Ltd ubu ikora ikiraro. "}
{"id": "17067", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17067", "title": "Komite ishinzwe amafaranga n\u2019imari", "text": "Komisiyo ishinzwe ifaranga n\u2019imari (Committee on Monetary and Financial Affairs) ni imwe muri komite icumi zihoraho z\u2019Inteko ishinga amategeko ya Pan afurika. Ikemura ibibazo bikurikira:\nPerezida wa Komite ni Peter Daka ukomoka muri Zambiya.\nUmuyobozi wungirije Babacar Gaye ukomoka muri Senegali.\nRapporteur ni Wycliffe Oparanya ukomoka muri Kenya."}
