{"id": "17234", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17234", "title": "Tabitha Karanja", "text": "Tabitha Mukami Muigai Karanja ni umucuruzi w\u2019umunyakenya, rwiyemezamirimo, inganda n\u2019umusenateri w\u2019intara ya Nakuru. Niwe washinze kandi akaba n'Umuyobozi mukuru muri iki gihe cya Keroche Breweries, uruganda rwa mbere rukora inzoga nini muri Kenya rufite sosiyete idaharanira inyungu. Uruganda rwa Keroche rufite 20% by\u2019inzoga za Kenya, guhera mu Kwakira 2012\nUbuzima n'uburezi.\nTabitha yavukiye hafi ya Kijabe, muri Kenya rwagati. Amaze kwiga amashuri yo muri Kenya, yatangiye akazi muri Minisiteri y'Ubukerarugendo nk'umwanditsi w'ibaruramari. Yahuye arongora umugabo we, wari ufite iduka ryibikoresho byiza mumujyi wa Naivasha. Mu 1997, abo bashakanye bafunze ububiko bw\u2019ibikoresho maze bajya mu bucuruzi bwo gukora divayi\nAkazi.\nGuhera mu 1997, Tabitha Karanja n'umugabo we batangiye gukora divayi ikomeye, yibasira isoko ryo hepfo. Mu 2007, igihe guverinoma yashyizeho imisoro iremereye kuri divayi ikorerwa mu karere, ibicuruzwa bye byaguzwe ku isoko. Yahinduye gukora gin na vodka yiteguye kunywa, uruganda rwe rugezweho rukora na nubu. Mu mwaka wa 2008, yongeyeho inzoga mu ndirimbo ze z\u2019ibinyobwa bisindisha, ahereye ku kirango cyitwa Summit. Muri 2013, uruganda rwatangiye gahunda yo kwagura umusaruro winzoga uva kumacupa 60.000 kumunsi ugera kumacupa 600.000 kumunsiUruganda rwavuguruwe rwatwaye miliyari 5 KSh (miliyoni 55.5 zamadorali y\u2019Amerika), rwashinzwe na, umunyamabanga w\u2019inama y\u2019abaminisitiri y\u2019inganda, ku ya 31 Werurwe 2015\nUmuyobozi mukuru wa Keroche Breweries, Tabitha Karanja yatsindiye umwanya wa Senateri ya Nakuru mu 2022, akaba n'umusenateri w'intara ya Nakuru, muri Kenya.\nUbuzima bwite.\nTabitha yashakanye na Joseph Muigai Karanja kandi hamwe, ni ababyeyi b'abana bane; James Karanja, Anerlisa Muigai, Edward Muigai na nyakwigendera Tecra Muigai. Joseph Muigai Karanja akora nk'umuyobozi wa "}
{"id": "17235", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17235", "title": "Keroche Breweries", "text": "Keroche Breweries ni uruganda rukora inzoga n\u2019ibinyobwa bisindisha. Isosiyete yashinzwe mu 1997 na Tabitha Karanja n'umugabo we Joseph Karanja nk', iyi sosiyete imaze gukura iba iya kabiri mu binyobwa bisindisha muri Kenya. Icyicaro gikuru giherereye i Naivasha, muri Kenya. Umuryango wa Karanja ni abanyamigabane benshi ba sosiyete kimwe nabayobozi ba C-Suite. Ikirangantego cy'isosiyete ni Summit Lager. Ikora kandi Summit Malt na KB Lager\nIsosiyete ikora kandi divayi zitandukanye munsi yikirango cya Valley Wines, inzoga ziteguye kunywa munsi yikirango cyayo cya Viena Ice hamwe na roho zirimo gin yumye, whisky, brandi na vodka munsi yikirango cya Crescent.\nAmateka.\nUruganda rwa Keroche rwatangijwe mu 1997 na Tabitha Karanja, icyo gihe wari ufite imyaka 32, n'umugabo we Joseph Karanja, mu isambu yabo. Batangiranye nabakozi batanu nigishoro bakuye mububiko bwibikoresho bari bafite.Icyo gihe cyiswe Keroche Industries Limited kandi gitanga divayi ikomeye igenewe abinjiza amafaranga make. Hamwe nigihe, nanone yiyemeje gukora imyuka, na none, yibasiye abinjiza amafaranga make. Byari bimwe mubigo by\u2019ibinyobwa by\u2019inzoga bya Kenya byaho byapakiye imyuka mu masakoshi ahendutse, biganisha ku gushinja ubusinzi. Mu 2004, amasake yabujijwe muri Kenya bituma igabanuka ry\u2019iri soko. Nyuma yimyaka ibiri, mu 2007, imisoro kuri divayi yakozwe mu karere yatumye uruganda rutandukana na divayi ikomeye. Yatangiye gukora voka yiteguye-kunywa. Umwaka umwe, mu mwaka wa 2008, isosiyete yinjiye mu byeri byenga inzoga, igice cy\u2019isoko icyo gihe cyiganjemo Diageo yari ifite ikigo cy\u2019iburasirazuba cya Breweries Limited. Muri icyo gihe, ibicuruzwa byacyo biva mu mushahara muto ujya mu binyobwa byemewe muri rusange ku isoko rya Kenya maze biba umukinnyi ukomeye ku isoko rya byeri."}
{"id": "17236", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17236", "title": "David Asiamah", "text": "Dr. Asiamah ni inzobere mu by'imitekerereze ya muntu ukorana cyane cyane n\u2019abaturage badafite uburenganzira kandi bahejejwe inyuma kugira ngo bagabanye itandukaniro ry\u2019ubuzima binyuze mu mpinduka za buri muntu na sisitemu. Umwizera ushishikaye muburyo bwinshi bwo kumenya, yizera ko bigira ingaruka kumpinduka zifatika binyuze mumuryango mwiza, gufata ibyemezo hamwe no kubaka umubano. David yarakoze kandi abona intsinzi mubice bitandukanye kuva mubigo kugeza kudaharanira inyungu. Yigisha kandi mu ishami ry\u2019ubuzima rusange muri kaminuza ya Leta ya Montclair. David azobereye mubuzima bwabaturage, ubushakashatsi bwibikorwa byabigizemo uruhare, ibikorwa rusange byimibereho, iterambere ryumuryango no gucunga no kugisha inama inyungu.\nAmashuri.\nDavid afite impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga. muri Clinical-Community Psychology yo muri kaminuza ya Carolina yepfo."}
