{"id": "17257", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17257", "title": "Ubukwe bubumbatiye umuco nyarwanda gute?", "text": "Ubukwe ni kimwe mubimenyetso bibumbatiye umuco kubera ko ariwo mwanya mwiza wo gukora imwe mumihango ndetse n'imigenzo yakorwaga mu Rwanda rwo hambere. sibyo gusa no muri ibi bihe iracyakorwa kandi niyo nzira igaragaza abo turi bo nkabanyarwanda. harimo nko:Gusaba no gufata irembo, Gusaba no gukwa, Gutanga indongoranyo, Gutebutsa, kogosha,gutwikurura, kugeramurugo ndetse n'ibindi.\nGusaba no gufata irembo.\nGusaba no gufata irembo ni umuhango wakurikiraga kurambagiza ikabera iwabo w'umukobwa Iyo se w\u2019umuhungu yabaga amaze kumvikana na se w\u2019umukobwa igihe bazazira gusaba irembo, yatumaga ku muryango we akabagezaho urubanza afite. Umukuru w\u2019umuryango akaba ari we ufata inshingano zo kuzajya gusabira irembo umuhungu wabo cyangwa akagira undi aziha cyanecyane akaba ari se w\u2019umwana. Habagaho gusaba irembo bamara kuribemerera noneho nyuma hakaba umuhango wo gufata irembo.\nGukwa umugeni.\nMu Rwanda, gukwa ni ugutanga ikintu kemewe nk\u2019inkwano kugira ngo ubone umugeni, kikaba ari ikimenyetso cyo kwerekana ko umugeni afite aho aturuka, ko atishyingiye, ko ashyingiwe n\u2019umuryango. Inkwano rero yari ishimwe ry\u2019umubyeyi w\u2019umukobwa kubera ko yabaga yarareze neza, umwana akaba agiye gushinga urwe rugo.\nGutanga Indongoranyo.\nMu Rwanda, gukwa ni ugutanga ikintu kemewe nk\u2019inkwano kugira ngo ubone umugeni, kikaba ari ikimenyetso cyo kwerekana ko umugeni afite aho aturuka, ko atishyingiye, ko ashyingiwe n\u2019umuryango. Inkwano rero yari ishimwe ry\u2019umubyeyi w\u2019umukobwa kubera ko yabaga yarareze neza, umwana akaba agiye gushinga urwe rugo.Iyo umukobwa wasabwe akanakobwa ageze mu rugo rwe, Imana ikamuha urubyaro n\u2019inka bamukoye ikabyara ubugira gatatu, inyana ivutse bwa gatatu se w\u2019umukobwa ayirongoranya umukwe we.\nGutwikurura.\nGutwikurura mu muco w\u2019u Rwanda, ni imihango ikorwa hagamijwe gusohora umugeni no kumuha uburenganzira bwo kugira imirimo akora."}
{"id": "17276", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17276", "title": "Mukeshimana Gloria", "text": "Dr Mukeshimana Gloria.\nmukeshimana Gloria ni umwe mubagore bindashyikirwa mu Rwanda akora nk'uhagarariye ibikorwa byo kubaga \numutima nubuvuzi bw'indwara zimbere mumubiri akaba akorera mubitaro byitiriwe Umwami Faisal akaba ari umwe \nmu inzobere mubijyanye no kuvura abantu bakuze bibasiwe n'indwara 'umutima.\nAmashuri ize.\nDr Mukeshimana Gloria yize muri Kaminuza yu Rwanda mu ishami ry'ubuvuzi by'umwihariko mubijyanye n'indwra\nzimbere mumubiri si aho gusa ize kuko nyuma yo gusosa amasomo e mu Rwanda aje gukomereza mugihugu \ncy'Afurika yepfo aho yize ibijyanye nubuvuzi bwibasira indwara z'umutima.\nUmwihariko wa Dr Gloria Mukeshimana.\nDr Gloria Mukeshimana niwe mugore rukumbi mu Rwanda wazobereye ibyo kuvura indwara z'umutima\nbivuzeko umusanzu we kugihugu ndetse nibitaro avuraho byitiriwe Umwami Faisali udashidikanywaho."}
{"id": "17277", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17277", "title": "Esperance Munganyinka", "text": "Dr Munganyinka Esperance.\nDr Esperance ni umuyobozi wishami ry'igihugu ry'igihugu ry'ubushakashatsi n'ikigega cyashyiriweho \ninnovation (NRIF) mukigo cy'igihugu cy'ubumenyi n'ikoranabuhanga (NCST). akaba ari umwe mubagore\nb'indashyikirwa mu Rwanda.\nImirimo yo hambere.\nMadamu Dr Esperance mbere yuko atangira imirimo ye muri (NCST) mu mwaka 2020, yari amaze imyaka 12\nakora nk'umushakashatsi mubya siyanse mukigo k'igihugu kiterambere ry'ubuhinzi n'ubworozi mu Rwanda \naho yibandaga mubyubushakashasi, amahugurwa n' amasomo ajyanye nibinyabuzima nubumenyi mubuhinzi.\nUbushakashatsi n'akamaro.\nubushakashasi bwe bwa mubashishije gusohora inandiko 10,bimwe mubyatumye atsindira ibihembo\nbyinshi bitandukanye bishingiye ku mishinga itandukanye y'ubushakashatsi.\nReba.\n`"}
{"id": "17279", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17279", "title": "Dr Alice Ikuzwe", "text": "Dr Alice Ikuzwe.\nMadamu Dr Alice Ikuzwe ni umuyobozi mukuru wungirije muri Kamiuza ya IPRC- kIGALI yasoje amasomo ye mu mwakawa 2012 ayasoreza muri Afurika y'Epfo Alice kandi afite Impamyabumenyi y'ikiciro cya gatatu Kaminuza mubijyanye na mechanical engineering akuye muri kaminuza ya stellenbosch. \nIbyo yagezeho.\nMadamu Dr Alice ubushakashatsi bwe n igitabo anditse kubyerekeranye na Modeling, Design ndese \nnubwubatsi byaumye ahabwa impamyabumenyi yikirenga."}
{"id": "17286", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17286", "title": "Christine Bakundufite", "text": "BAKUNDUFITE Christine ni umunyarwandakazi wavutse ku itariki ya 29 Nzeri 1970 mu Rwanda,akaba ari n'umunyapolitiki. Kugeza ubu ni umwe mu bagize Inteko ishinga amategeko mu mutwe w\u2019abadepite bo mu Rwanda akaba ahagaririye mu Karere ka Gatsibo mu Ntara y\u2019Iburasirazuba. \nBAKUNDUFITE yatorewe kuba umwe mu bagize inteko ishinga amategeko mu mwaka wa 2018. Yabanje gukora nk'umuyobozi w'ikigo mukuru w'ikigo cy'amashuri, yabaye umucungamari, ndetse mu mirimo ye yari nk'inzobere mu ibaruramari. \n= Amashuri =\nBakundufite afite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza mu ishami ry'imiyoborere y'ubucuruzi. \n= Imirimo y'ingenzi ="}
{"id": "17289", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17289", "title": "Dr Annette Uwineza", "text": "Dr Annette Uwineza.\nMadam Dr Annette Uwineza ubusanzwe ni umwarimu wigisha muri Kaminuza yu Rwanda akaba inzobere mubijyanye\nn'imiterere y'umubiri w'umuntu ikindi kandi akaba numwe mubashakashatsi bashimiwe mu mwaka wa 2021 nyuma yo\ngukora ubushakashatsi mu bya siyansi mu karere k'Afurika yo munsi y'ubutayu bwa Sahara.\nImirimo ye kugeza ubu akora.\nMadamu Dr Annette Uwineza ibyo akora ubu abifatanya no kuba umuyobozi wa service zihuriweho mubitaro\nbya Kaminuza bya Kigali (CHUK) akaba kandi yarakoze ubushakashatsi butandukanye mugusesengura ibizamini \nby'abarwayi b'Abanyarwanda hifashishijwe mudasobwa,by'umwihariko ababaga bafite ibibazo n'imikurire y'ubwonko.\nAkamaro kuri sosiyete.\nDr Uwineza kandi numwe mubagore babera ikitegererezo abana babakobwa bakiri bato\nmukubona ko byose bishoboka igihe umuntu ateye intambwe mukugera kundoto ifuza kugeraho\nsi ibyyo gusa kandi batanga n'umusaruro ugaragara ku Rwanda ndetse n'abanyarwanda.\nAkamaro n'iterambere.\nmu mwaka wa 2021 mu Rwanda habereye umuhango wo gutanga ibikombe cyanga ishimwe kubagore \nbindashyikirwa cyangwa babera abandi urugero. kunshuro ya 12 uyu muhango ukorwa nikigo cyo m' Ubufaransa\nkitwa L\u2019Or\u00e9al Group gikora make up amavuta ndetse n'imibavu. binyuze mu kigo cyacyo gishinzwe guteza imbere imibereho myiza hibandwa ku bagore, Foundation L\u2019Or\u00e9al ku bufatanye n\u2019Ishami ry\u2019Umuryango w\u2019Abibumbye ryita ku Burezi, Ubumenyi n\u2019Umuco (UNESCO). hashimwe abagore bageze kuri 20 bo muri Afurika yo munsi y'ubutayu bwa sahara ari nabwo Madamu Dr Annette Uwineza yaje muri abo bagore bindashyikirwa mu mirimo yabo. "}
{"id": "17290", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17290", "title": "DR Jennifer Batamuliza", "text": "Jennifer Batamuliza.\nMadamu Dr Jennifer Batamuliza afite impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga mu bijyanye n'ikusanya n'isesengura amakuru. Akagira impamyabumenyi y'ikiciro cya gatatu (3) cya Kaminuza yaboneye \nmuri Kaminuza y'ikoranabuhanga n'ubumenyi mubya mudasobwa iherereye mugihugu cy'Ubushinwa (UESTC)\nDr Batamuliza kandi afite impamyabumenyi y'ikiciro cya kaminuza yakuye muri Kaminuza yu Rwanda\nishami ry'ubumenyi n'ikoranabuhanga mucyahoze kitwa KIST riherereye m' Umujyi wa Kigali aho yigaga ibijyanye n'ubumenyi mubya \nmudasobwa.\nImirimo ye kugeza ubu.\nMadamu Dr Jennifer Batamuliza n'umwarimu muri Kaminuza y'uRwanda aho yigisha amasomo ajyanye n'ikoranabuhanga. Ayobora ishami rifasha abanyeshuri kwihangira imirimo akanayobora imishinga itandukanye muri Kaminuza y'uRwanda.Dr Jennifer ni umuyobozi mukuru wa RWA TECH HUB igamije gufasha abana\nbabakobwa biga mumashuri yisumbuye mukugira ubumenyi mu bijyanye n'ikoranabuhanga\nmadamu Dr Batamuliza kandi niwe washinze iki kigo k'indashyikirwa mu Rwanda"}
{"id": "17291", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17291", "title": "Prof Eugenie Kayitesi", "text": "Prof Eugenie Kayitesi.\nMadamu Prof Eugenie Kayitesi ni umwarimu wungirije mu ishami rijyanye nubumenyi mubyimirire\nmuri Kaminuza ya Pretoria. akaba kandi afite impamyabumenyi y'ikiciro cya kabiri cya Kaminuza\nmubijyanye nubumenyi mubiribwa n'ikoranabuhanga, akaba yarayiboneye mu Rwanda\nmuei Kaminuza yu Rwanda mbere yuko yerekeza muri Afurika y'Epfo aho kandi yakuye\nindi mpamyabumenyi yikiciro cya gatatu muri iryo shami. kugeza ubu akaba ari umwarimu muri \nKaminuza ya Pretoria nkuko byavuzwe haruguru."}
{"id": "17292", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17292", "title": "Valentine Dushimimana", "text": "Madamu Valentine Dushimimana.\nValentine Dushimimana ni umunyarwandakazi afite impamyabumenyi yakuye muri Kaminuza ya Mount Kenya\naho yigaga ibijyanye n'ubuzima Rusange (Public Health) hamwe nindi nkiyo yakuye muri Kaminuza yu Rwanda\nMadamu Valentine Kandi akomeje gukataza amasomo ye mugushaka Impamyabumenyi yikirenga (PHD)\nmuri Kaminuza ya Cape Town aho yiga kubijyanye n'indwara ya SIDA hamwe nizindi ndwara zibasira Umutima.\nIbihembo yatsindiye.\nValentine kandi yatsindiyye Igihembo ku bwubushakashatsi yakoze mubijyanye no gutunganya no gusesengura\namashusho hagamijwe gupima indwara z'umutima n'imitsi mu bantu babana nubwandu bw'agakoko gatera SIDA\nndetse nubuvuzi bwifashisha antiretroviral. ibi kandi bikorwa hashingiwe kubipimo by'amarason'ibikorwa by'ubuvuzi.\nakaba ari umwe mu badamu bamaze guhabwa iki gihembo mu Rwanda"}
{"id": "17297", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17297", "title": "BATAMULIZA Mireille", "text": "BATAMULIZA Mireille ni umunyarwandakazi wavukiye mu Rwanda akaba ari Umunyamabanga Uhoraho muri Minisiteri 'Uburinganire n'Iterambere ry'Umuryango (MIGEPROF) \nAmashuri yize.\nBATAMULIZA afite ikiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza "}
{"id": "17304", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17304", "title": "Umukazana Germaine", "text": "Umukazana Germaine.\numukazana Germaine ni umunyarwandakazi ukora itangazamakuru kuri Radio imwe mu Rwanda \nGermaine uyu mwuga witangazamakuru yawigiye mu gihugu cy'abaturanyi cya Uganda. \nmu ishuri rya United Media Consultant And Trainers (UMCAT) ari naho yakuye impamyabumenyi\nya Journalism na Mass communication\nkugeza ubu akaba akora umwuga w'itangazamakuru mu Rwanda\nImirimo ye.\nGermaine Umukazana yatangiye imirimo ye mu mwaka wa 2016 aho yakoraga nk'umukorerabushake\nkuri Radio abaturage yo mu Karere ka Gicumbi (Radio ishingiro) nyuma yyaho gatto yahinduye imirimo\nyerekeza kuri KT Radio mri nzeri 2019 akaba ariho akorera kugeza ubu akazi ko gutara no gutangaza amakuru\nGusoma amakuru ndetse no kuyobora ibiganirompaka"}
{"id": "17305", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17305", "title": "Usher Kamugisha", "text": "Usher Kamugisha ni umunyamakuru wa siporo akaba ari umugandekazi wamamaye mu Rwanda ubwo akoreraga\nikinyamakuru The new Times. \nKamugisha vutse mu mwaka wi 1988.yagie akora ku masoko mpuzamahanga harimo nka supersport\nFIBA, ESPN, SKY SPORT nibindi.\nUsher kamugisha.\nUretse gukorera ishyirahamwe rya Basketball ku Isi, FIBA, mu marushanwa atandukanye aho afite izina rikomeye muri Basketball, akurikirana andi marushanwa akomeye mu mupira w\u2019amaguru. cyane muri Afurika\nMu Gikombe cya Afurika cya 2021 giheruka kubera muri Cameroun, yakoreraga Sky Sports, mu gihe mu Gikombe cy\u2019Isi cya 2022 cyabereye muri Qatar, yari umusesenguzi wa Al Jazeera.\nAmavu n'Amavuko.\nUsher Kamugisha yavukiye mugihugu cy'abaturanyi cya Uganda ahitwa i Kilembe mu karere ka kasese muburengerazuba bwa Uganda Kamugisha yakuze ari umukobwa ukunda sport gusoma ibitabo ndetse\nnibinyamakuru bya sport kuburyo byamuviriyemo gukabya inzozi ze ndese kugeza ubu akaba agikaba inzozi ze kuko gukora umwuga w'itangazamakuru ndetse mu ruhando rwa siporo.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nUsher Kamugisha kuva mubwana bwe yagiye akina imikino myinshi itandukanye mubigo yigagaho harimo nko gukina umupira wa Dodge Volley Ball, Netball, Tenis, Gusiganwa ku magare, Kwiruka, Golf ndetse nindi\nmikino myinshi itandukanye.gusa iyo mikino yose siko yakomeje kuikina ahubwo ageze muri Kaminuza ya Makerere yahisemo gukimeza umukino wa Basktball.\nImirimo ye kugeza ubu.\nUsher Komugisha ni umunyamakuru wa sport a Multmedia muri Uganda gusa si mubugande gusa kuko\nimirimo muri Afurika hose. kuri ubu akora nk'umwanditsi wa Basketball muri FIBA \u200b\u200bakaba n'Umunyamakuru w\u2019umupira w'amaguru muri Afurika muri Soccer Africa, ikinyamakuru Gikorera ku mugabane wa Afurika kinyura kuri TV ya SuperSport buri kuwa kane nijoro. Ni n'umusesenguzi kuri NTV Press Box, yatowe nk'imikino ngororamubiri nziza muri Uganda mu myaka ibiri ikurikira - 2018 na 2019."}
{"id": "17307", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17307", "title": "Annet Mugabo", "text": "Annet Mugabo.\nIzina Annet Mugabo ni izina ritari rishya mu mattwi y'abanyarwanda bose cyane cyyane cyane abatuye mu Rwanda ni izina rymenyekanye cyane mu biganiro bya siporo mu Rwanda Annet Mugabo ni umunyarwandakazi umaze imyaka isaga icumi (10) mu itangaza makuru rya Sport\nUmwihariko.\nAnnet Mugabo ni umwe mubanyamakuru bo mu Rwanda babashije kwitabira igikombe kisi Giheruka kubera\nmu gihugu ca Qatar cyabayye mu mwaka ushize wa 2022 cyegukanyywe n'ikipe yya Argentine Annet Mugabo\namaze ukwezi kurenga i Doha aho yarimo akurikiranira hafi igikombe k ISI \nImirimo ye.\nAnnet Mugabo yabanje kwimenyereza umwuga kuri Radio Isango Star mu mwaka wa 2013 nyuma yaho aza kwerekeza\nmuri Radio 10 mumwaka wa 2014 kugeza muri 2016 aza gusezera ajya guomeza amasomo ye nubwo\nbitamuhiriye ahubwo akagaruka gukorera Radio 10 ari naho agikorera umwuga we w'itangazamakuru. nk'umurimo yakundaga kuva mubwana bwe."}
{"id": "17310", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17310", "title": "Umuhoza cynthia Naissa", "text": "Umuhoza Cynhia Naissa.\nUmuhoza Cynthia Naissa ni umunyamakuru wumunyarwandakazi ukorera ikigo cyitangazamakuru(SK FM) akaba yaramenyekanye kuri Radio Rwanda \nkubera ibiganiro bya siporo ni umwe mubari nabategarugore bake\nbakora uyumwuga wo gutangaza amakuru yy'imikino mu Rwanda mugihe bari bimenyerewe ko\nari umwuga ukorwa n'abagabo.\nAho akora.\nUmuhoza Cynthia Naissa umwuga we wiangazamakuru awukorera kuri Radio ya SK FM MU Rwanda"}
{"id": "17311", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17311", "title": "Mutsindarwejo Jolie", "text": "Mutsindarwejo Jolie.\nMutsindarwejo Jolie ni umukobwa w'umunyarwandakazi winjiye mu itangazamakuru rya sport \nnk'umwuga we \nImirimo ye.\nMutsindarweje Jolie ni umwari ukora umwuga witangazamakuru kuri Voice Of Africa Kigali\nndetse na Izuba TV nakabuza nawe ni umwe mubari bakiri bake bakora umwuga witangazamakuru muruhando rwa Siporo."}
{"id": "17312", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17312", "title": "Muhayimpundu Ishimwe Adelaide", "text": "Muhayimpundu Ishimwe Adelaide.\nIshimwe Adelaide ni umwari witabiriye irushanywa rya nyampinga wu Rwanda mu mwaka wa 2022\nahagarariye Intara y'amajyaruguru nubwo bitagenze neza ngo agere kure muri aya marushanwa\nntago yahagaritse.kuri ubu yinjiye mu Itangazamakuru ry'imikino.\nku Itariki 25 ukwakira 2022 nibwo Radio /TV 10 yerekanye Ishimwe Adelaide nk'umunyamakuru \nwayo mushya w'imikino\nUbuzima bwo Hambere y'itangazamakuru.\nIshimwe Adelaide mbereho ko yinjira mu Itangazamakuru yari avuye mumarushanwa ya nyampinga wu Rwanda\nnubwo atabashije kuryegukana gusa munzozi ze ndetse no mumushinga yari afite harimo guteza imbere siporo\ncyane yibanda kuri siporo y'abagore. Ntakabuza rero inzozize zibaye impamo kuko azabasha gukora ibyo yiyemeje \nkuko agiye muruhando rwa Siporo. "}
{"id": "17328", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17328", "title": "Mukantwari Jolie", "text": "Mukantwari Jolie.\nMukantwari Jolie ni umunyarwandakazi ukora umwuga w'itangazamakuru kuri Radio/TV10\nJolie yinjiye mu mwuga w'itangazamakuru umwaka ushize wa 2022 nibwo Radio/TV10 \nabamugaragaje nk'umukizi wayo kumugaragaro mu Rwanda\nImirimo ye.\nMukantwari Jolie niwe uhagarariye abakunzi ba Radiona TV10 mu kiganiro ayoboye cyo guteka"}
{"id": "17329", "revid": "123828", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17329", "title": "Uwizera Esca Fifi", "text": "Esther Fifi Uwizera.\nUwizera Esther FIFI wamenyekanye nka ESCA Fifi ni umunyarwandakazi ukora umwuga w'itangazamakuru kuri Radio/TV10 byumwihariko akora ibiganiro bya Siporo ni umwe mubanyamakuru b'igitsinagore bakora uyu mwuga wo gutangaza amakuru \nya siporo kuko byari bimenyerewe ahanini ku Bagabo ko aribo bakora ibiganiro bya siporo mu Rwanda\nImirimo akora.\nUwizera Esca Fifi ni umunyamakuru ufite uburambe mu biganiro bya siporo kuri Radio/TV10 mu Rwanda\nyamenyekanye cyane mukiganiro bita Urukiko rwa siporo kuri Radio10\nsibyo gusa kuko akora ikindi kiganiro cyamenyekanye ku izina bita ibyaranze umunsi mumateka ya siporo (TODAY IN SPORTS HISTORY) niwe wazanye iyi segment aho abwira abakunzi ba siporo ibyaranze italiki iba igezweho mu mateka ya siporo akanavugamo abasportif baba bavutse kuriyo taliki.\nUyu munyamakurukazi ni umuhanga kuko akora no mu gisata cy'imyidagaduro ariko akibanda mu bijyanye n'iyobokamana (Gospel) haba kuri Radio ndetse na Television mu kiganiro TEN TO NIGHT ndetse no mu kitwa 10 PLUS, ajya anatangamo umusada mu makuru iyo bamwitabaje.\nIndi mirimo.\nEsther Fifi Uwizera bakunda kwita ESCA FIFI kugeza ubu kandi nyuma y'ibiganiro bya siporo n'imyidagaduro akora kuri Radio10 na Television 10 anafite ikinyamakuru cye gikorera kuri murandasi yise ESCA FIFI TV SHOW usangaho amakuru atandukanye,ibyegeranyo,siporo,Gospel News,videwo zisekeje zazengurutse ku mbugankoranyambaga n'ibindi. "}
{"id": "17330", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17330", "title": "Urubyiruko mu Rwanda", "text": "Urubyiruko ni umuntu wese uri hagati y'umwaka umwe ndetse n'imyaka 35 mu rwanda ubu urubyiruko rugize 40% by'abatuye mu Rwanda. Muri 2012, abagera kuri miliyoni 4.1 bari urubyiruko, Minisiteri y\u2019urubyiruko, umuco, na Siporo ya Repubulika y\u2019u Rwanda isobanura urubyiruko nkabafite kuva ku myaka 14 kugeza 35. Kimwe n'ibihugu byinshi bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere, abatuye u Rwanda muri rusange ni bato. Kurenga 50% byabatuye u Rwanda bari munsi yimyaka 20 naho hagati yabaturage bafite imyaka 22 kuzamura. Imijyi y'u Rwanda ifite umubare munini w'urubyiruko kurusha icyaro, nubwo 80% by'urubyiruko rwo mu Rwanda rutuye mu cyaro. Urubyiruko rugizwe na 53% by'abaturage mu murwa mukuru, Kigali. Umubare w'urubyiruko mu Rwanda wiyongereyeho 30% kuva 2002 kugeza 2012. \nJenocide yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda mu 1994 yangije ubukungu, iterambere, n'imiryango. Hishwe abantu 500.000 kugeza 1.000.000 abatutsi n'abahutu bose bagizweho ingaruka na jenocide ndetse nabatishoboye muri rusange. Muri iki gihe urubyiruko rwo mu Rwanda ugereranyije nicyo gihe bari impinja gusa muri jenoside cyangwa zitaravuka. Perezida uriho ubu, Paul Kagame yise iki gisekuru \"u Rwanda rushya,\" yerekeza ku byababayeho gusa nyuma ya jenoside, guverinoma iyobowe na FPR. Mu rwego rwo gufasha urubyiruko kumenya amateka ndetse gufasha igihugu mwiterambere guverinoma y'u Rwanda yateguye gahunda zo kwigisha no kwibuka jenocide yakorewe abatutsi ibigira igikorwa ngaruka mwaka. Izi gahunda za leta zikora kugirango zihuze urubyiruko ninkuru yihariye, ya jenoside nibyabaye batigeze bahura nabyo. \nIngaruka za jenoside zikomeye harimo ihinduka ry'imibereho y\u2019abaturage bose bo mu Rwanda kandi zagize ingaruka zihariye ku myigire y\u2019urubyiruko, ubuzima, ndetse n\u2019umuryango. Harimo no gusenyuka kwa gahunda z\u2019ubukungu, guverinoma, n\u2019imiryango, umubare munini w\u2019urubyiruko rwo mu Rwanda rubaho mu bukene kandi ntirukurikirana amashuri abanza. jenocide yagize ingaruka mu kwiyongera k'ubukene, n'impfu zatewe na virusi itera SIDA byatumye abana b'abanyarwanda barenga 95.000 ubu ari impfubyi abandi arabafakazi bityo niyomamvu twahagurukiye kuyirwanya binyuze mukwigisha amateka yaranze u Rwanda muri 1994. \nUburezi.\nMbere y'ubukoloni, gahunda y'uburezi yo mu Rwanda ntiyari yubatswe neza. Abadage bakolonije igihugu ariko bahita basimburwa n\u2019Ububiligi bwasobanuye gahunda nyinshi z\u2019u Rwanda zirimo uburezi. Abamisiyonari gatolika bari bageze mu Rwanda hakiri kare kurusha abakoloni b'Abadage bari barashinze amashuri y'abamisiyoneri bigisha urubyiruko rwo mu Rwanda kandi abakoloni b'Ababiligi bakomeje kwemerera Kiliziya gukora imirimo y'uburezi. Ububiligi bwashizeho amashuri yonyine hagati ya 1923 na 1925 ariko byose byarafunzwe mbere ya 1929. Ububiligi ahubwo bwigaruriye mu buryo butaziguye amashuri y'abamisiyoneri. Igihe u Rwanda rwabonaga ubwigenge mu 1962, guverinoma nshya yashyize mu bikorwa amashuri abanza ku buntu kandi hateganijwe gukomeza gahunda y'ubukoloni. \nUyu munsi, Minisiteri y\u2019Uburezi iragenzura gahunda zose z\u2019uburezi rusange mu gihugu kandi igakomeza kugira intego yuko \" buri umuturage w\u2019u Rwanda akomeza kuba isoko y' ubumenyi bugamije iterambere ry\u2019imibereho myiza y\u2019ubukungu n\u2019igihugu hagamijwe kugera ku buringanire bw\u2019uburezi bufite ireme bwibanda ku kurwanya ubujiji, guteza imbere siyanse no ikoranabuhanga, gutekereza kure n'indangagaciro nziza. \" Nyuma ya 1994, serivisi rusange zagombaga gusubirwamo no kongera gutekereza ku gukora intego nshya n\u2019ibitekerezo by\u2019u Rwanda.\nGahunda yabanjirije amashuri abanza kugeza mu yisumbuye mu Rwanda igabanyijemo ibice bine, ikurikirwa n\u2019amashuri makuru. Amashuri abanza kwiyandikisha bikomeza kuba bito ariko bigenda byiyongera kubana bafite imyaka 3-6. Amashuri abanza yakira abanyeshuri kuva 7-12 kumyaka 6. \"Tronc commun,\" iyongerwa ryimyaka itatu yuburezi bwibanze ku buntu, ikora nkicyiciro cyo hasi cyamashuri yisumbuye. Amashuri yisumbuye arasaba amafaranga n'ikizamini cyo kwinjira nyuma yo gusoza \"tronc commun\". 60 ku ijana by'amashuri yisumbuye ni amashuri acumbikira abanyeshuri. Nyuma yishuri ryisumbuye, abanyeshuri barangiza ikizamini A-kigena ubushobozi bwabanyeshuri nubushobozi bwo kwiga kaminuza nibindi bigo byisumbuye. U Rwanda rwahurije hamwe amashuri makuru ya leta kuko kaminuza yu Rwanda n\u2019ibigo by\u2019amashuri makuru yigenga byatejwe imbere kandi bikura. \nIntego z'iterambere z'ikinyagihumbi.\nU Rwanda rwasinye kandi ruharanira kugera ku ntego z'umuryango w'abibumbye z'ikinyagihumbi (MDG). Umubare umwe w\u2019abahungu n\u2019abakobwa biyandikisha mu mashuri abanza, bagera kuburinganire bwibanze. Itandukaniro ryinjiza ku bushobozi bwababyeyi riracyari ikibazo muri gahunda yuburezi. U Rwanda rugaragaza intego z'ikinyagihumbi rushimangira ubushobozi bw\u2019uburezi mu kugabanya ubukene no guteza imbere ubukungu n\u2019iterambere rirambye. intego z'ikinyagihumbi z'ibanda ku kugera ku gipimo cyo gusoma no kwandika 100%. 84,6% by'imyaka 15-19 na 79,9% by'imyaka 19-25 bafite gusoma no kwandika kandi bajijutse \nIbintu bibiri intego zikinyagihumbi zibandaho harimo kwiyandikisha kwambere mumashuri abanza no kurangiza icyiciro cyuburezi. 98% by'ingimbi biyandikisha mu mashuri abanza mugihe runaka mu Rwanda. Abenshi mu banyeshuri ntibakomeza kwiga ngo barangize amashuri mu Rwanda. \nIgipimo cyo kwiyongera ku rubyiruko mu Rwanda.\nKuva mu 1998 kugeza 2009, kwiyandikisha mu mashuri abanza bwikubye hafi kabiri, hatangijwe uburezi bw'ibanze ku buntu mu 2003. Kugeza mu mwaka wa 2008 abanyeshuri bagera kuri miliyoni 2.2 bariyandikishije mu mashuri abanza. Mugihe amashuri abanza yiyongereye ku kigero cya 5.4 ku mwaka, muri icyo gihe amashuri yisumbuye yiyongereye ku gipimo cya 11%. Igipimo cyo kuguma mu mashuri kuva ku mashuri abanza kugeza mucyiciro cya kabiri cyaragabanutse mugihe. 42% by'abanyeshuri binjira mu mashuri abanza mu 2002 barangije amashuri barangije ayisumbuye, mu gihe biteganijwe ko abatageze kuri kimwe cya gatatu bazabikora ku banyeshuri binjiye mu mashuri abanza mu 2008. 85% by'abanyeshuri binjira \"mu kiciro cya mbere cy'amashuri yisumbuye,\" barangiza amashuri yisumbuye yisumbuye ateganijwe. \nItandukaniro ryinjiza nuburinganire hagati yuburinganire bigira uruhare mubanyeshuri batarangije icyiciro cyuburezi. Abanyeshuri bari hejuru ya 20 ku ijana byubutunzi mu Rwanda bafite amahirwe umunani yo kurangiza icyiciro cy\u2019uburezi kurusha abanyeshuri bari munsi ya 20% byubutunzi. Amafaranga ataziguye yuburezi bwibanze n\u2019amafaranga y\u2019ishuri asabwa mu mashuri yisumbuye bituma bigora abanyeshuri bo mu miryango ikennye cyangwa / cyangwa urubyiruko ruyobora ingo gukomeza binyuze muri gahunda y\u2019uburezi. Ikizamini cya OLevel, cyakozwe nyuma ya \"tronc commun\", kigena abanyeshuri biyandikisha mumashuri yisumbuye. Abasore birashoboka cyane kurusha abakobwa bakiri bato gutsinda ikizamini cya OLevel bakiyandikisha mumashuri yisumbuye. \nAmashuri makuru yongera umubare w'abiyandikisha hamwe n\u2019ubwiyongere bwa buri mwaka bwa 19% hagati ya 1999 na 2008. Abakobwa bakiri bato bahagarariye 42 ku ijana by'abanyeshuri bo mu mashuri makuru. \nUbuzima.\nAmahirwe yo gupfa kubagabo nigitsina gore mbere yimyaka 15 ni 23% na 19%. Urubyiruko, muri rusange, rufite ibibazo byinshi byubuzima nkabantu bakuru mu Rwanda. Indwara zandura, cyangwa zandura zigize 90% by'ibibazo by'ubuzima. Malariya ikomeje kuba ibyago byinshi by\u2019impfu mu Rwanda ariko byagaragaye ko igabanuka rikabije ry\u2019imfu n\u2019impfu. Hagati ya 2001 na 2007, malariya yapfuye yavuye kuri 10.1% igera kuri 2%. Kunywa itabi n'ubundi buryo bwo gukoresha itabi biriyongera mu gihugu ku rubyiruko. 24% by'abanyeshuri bo mu mashuri yisumbuye banywa itabi mu 2004 nk'uko ubushakashatsi bwakozwe n'umuryango w'abibumbye ryita ku buzima. 12.3% by'abana kuva ku myaka 13 kugeza ku myaka 15 banywa itabi muri 2008. Ibitaro n\u2019amavuriro byanditseho ubwiyongere bw\u2019abarwayi bemewe n\u2019indwara ziterwa n\u2019itabi. \nUbuzima bw'imyororokere.\nUbwandu bwa virusi itera SIDA mu Rwanda ni 3 ku ijana by'abaturage bari hagati y\u2019imyaka 15 na 49. Urubyiruko rwo mu mijyi rushobora kwandura virusi itera SIDA mu cyaro ku kigero cya 7.3 ku ijana na 2,2 ku ijana mu cyaro. Abakobwa bo mu mijyi, bafite hagati ya 15-24, banduye 3,9 ku ijana, mu gihe abasore bafite ubwandu bwa 1,1%. Kimwe cya gatandatu cyurubyiruko mu Rwanda rufatwa nkintege nke kubera ingaruka za sida mubuzima bwabo. \nGuverinoma y'u Rwanda yibanda kuri gahunda z'ubuzima bw'urubyiruko ku buzima bw'imyororokere n'imibonano mpuzabitsina. Urubyiruko rubona amakuru menshi kuri gahunda yubuzima bwimibonano mpuzabitsina na gahunda kuri radio. Gahunda nyinshi zo kwigisha urubyiruko kuri virusi itera SIDA zibanda ku kwifata gusa kandi ntizishimangira akamaro ko gukoresha agakingirizo. Igikorwa cyimibonano mpuzabitsina cyurubyiruko rwu Rwanda rugaragaza urwego rwo hasi rwuburezi ku gukoresha agakingirizo. Abagera kuri 20 ku ijana by'urubyiruko rwo mu Rwanda ruri hagati ya 20 na 24 bemera ko bakoze imibonano mpuzabitsina mbere y\u2019imyaka 18. Igikorwa cyimibonano mpuzabitsina cyiganje cyane mu bagore bo mu ngo zifite ubukire ndetse no mu rubyiruko rw\u2019abagabo n\u2019abagore bayobora ingo. Gukoresha agakingirizo ntibigaragara cyane muri urwo rubyiruko rumwe n'abaturage muri rusange. Ubuvuzi bwa virusi itera SIDA (ART) buboneka mu gihugu butuma abantu banduye virusi itera SIDA bakomeza kubaho mu mibonano no mu mibonano mpuzabitsina bakuze. Ibyavuye mu kumenya niba urubyiruko rwabana na virusi itera SIDA rwandika cyangwa rwinshi rwerekana imyitwarire y\u2019imibonano mpuzabitsina ishobora kuba nyinshi cyangwa nkeya kurusha ababana na virusi itera SIDA ntibishoboka. \nUmubare munini w\u2019u Rwanda rw\u2019imfubyi n\u2019urubyiruko rufite ibyago byinshi bibasirwa n\u2019imibonano mpuzabitsina. Ubu buryo bwo guhuza ibitsina bufitanye isano n\u2019ibyago byinshi byo kwandura virusi itera SIDA. Imibonano mpuzabitsina ikunze kugaragara muri Afurika yo munsi y'Ubutayu bwa Sahara ku rubyiruko mu kwagura ubukungu hagamijwe kubaho neza. Minisiteri y\u2019urubyiruko irimo gukora ibishoboka ngo ikureho ikibazo cy\u2019imibonano mpuzabitsina n\u2019ubukangurambaga bwa \"Singurisha\" (Ntabwo ngurishwa) yigisha ubucuruzi, amatorero, n\u2019abandi bayobozi ku bijyanye n\u2019inshingano z\u2019abaturage mu gukemura iki kibazo. \nImfubyi n'urubyiruko rutishoboye.\nJenoside yakorewe abatutsi yagize ingaruka zirambye ku miryango yo mu Rwanda. kuruhande rwa guverinoma ndetse n\u2019abikorera ku giti cyabo hamwe n'imfubyi zarasenyewe mu gihe cya jenoside kandi ubwicanyi ubwabwo bwasize hafi icumi ku ijana by\u2019abana bafite hagati y\u2019imyaka 0-18 ari impfubyi. Ingo zigera ku 10 ku ijana, cyangwa ingo 65.000, mu Rwanda ubu ni ingo ziyobowe n\u2019urubyiruko. Abana barenga 300.000 baba murugo nk'urwo 90 ku ijana bayobowe nabakobwa. Imiryango iyobowe nurubyiruko ishyira mu kaga abakobwa bakagira ibyago byo gukoreshwa imibonano mpuzabitsina no guhuza ibitsina bakiri bato. \nImfubyi zo mu Rwanda zumva ko zatewe isoni kandi zidashyigikiwe mu gace batuyemo kubera isano bashobora kuba bafite kuri virusi itera SIDA. VIH / SIDA ikomeje kwiyongera mu Rwanda bityo impfubyi zabuze ababyeyi umwe cyangwa bombi bazize virusi itera SIDA bigaragara ko zanduye. Nanone, impfubyi zimwe na zimwe za jenoside ni abana babagize uruhare muri jenocide yakorewe abatutsi. Imfubyi zifatwa nkizitera ibibazo kandi ntizifite inshingano mu Rwanda. Muri jenoside na nyuma yayo, ibibazo byo kwizerana byagaragaye mu gihugu kandi bikomeje kugabanya umubano runaka. Abana bafite ababyeyi nabana badafite ababyeyi ni urugero rwo rwibyo mu Rwanda. Bitewe bitewe n'impamvu zimwe na zimwe, imfubyi zibona inkunga nke mumiryango yabo. Ubukene bukabije bugabanya ubushobozi bw'abaturage bamwe bwo gutunga imfubyi cyangwa urubyiruko rufite ingo. Hamwe n'inkunga nke, ibibazo byo guhangayika, kwiheba, hamwe no guhungabana bikomeje gukara kandi birakomeje. Abakobwa bakiri bato bakunze guhura nibibazo byuko nta muntu mukuru uba uhari ngo abayobore cyangwa abagire inama cyane cyane ab'imfupfi bigatuma bahura nibibazo byinshi bishingiye kwihohoterwa.\nUmusore utishoboye ntabwo byanze bikunze ari impfubyi. 80 ku ijana by'urubyiruko rwo mu cyaro bafatwa nk'abatishoboye mu Rwanda. Urubyiruko rufite intege nke rwimukira i Kigali rwizeye ko ruzatera imbere mu bukungu ariko rukagira amahirwe make cyangwa ubushobozi buke bwo kubona akazi karambye. Urubyiruko rwo mu mijyi rufite intege nke rukunze kubaho umunsi kuwundi mubihe bitaboroheye \nUrugendo rwo kuva mu cyiciro kimwe bajya mukindi.\nUburyo gakondo kubasore bava mu cyiciro kimwe bajya mu kindi mu Rwanda ni ugukora bukwe. Mbere yo gushyingirwa, umusore agomba kubaka inzu y'umuryango wejo hazaza. Guverinoma y'u Rwanda yashyizeho amabwiriza asobanura uburyo n'aho amazu mashya agomba kubakwa. Guverinoma yu Rwanda yatangiye imishinga mishya y'imiturire yabaturage. miryango myinshi ituye mukarere hagendewe ku midugudu; bitandukanye na \"gakondo, Muri\" gakondo byabaga ari urugo rw'umuryango wose ku butaka bumwe, kenshi babaga ari abahinzi. Guverinoma ifite amabwiriza y'ukuntu amazu agomba kubakwa mumugi wa kigali kandi abasore biracyabagoye kuyubaka kubera ubushobozi Inzitizi nini ku basore ni ukubona amabati yo hejuru akenewe mu kubaka inzu kandi arahenze mu Rwanda. Abasore bashakisha amahirwe yo kubona akazi kugirango babone uko bubaka inzu mu ndetse ngo babone n'ibikoresho. \nAmategeko yu Rwanda abuza gushyingirwa mbere y'imyaka makumyabiri n'umwe. Urubyiruko rw'abakobwa, cyane cyane mu cyaro cy'u Rwanda, bafatwa nk'abashaje cyane iyo bageze ku myaka makumyabiri n'itanu. Urubyiruko rwabakobwa babangavu narwo ntirukunze gutegereza iyo myaka ngo bashake. 12 ku ijana by'urubyiruko rw'abakobwa birangira badakoze ubukwe, bitewe nuko abagore ari benshi kurusha abagabo mu Rwanda"}
{"id": "17331", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17331", "title": "Mugisha dua", "text": "Mugisha Dua.\nMugisha Dua ni umunyarwandakazi ufata amashusho tumenyereye kwita gafotozi cyangwa camera man\nmugisha byumwihariko yibanda kumafoto ya siporo mu Rwanda\nAho akora.\nuyu mwari wiyeguriye umwuga wo gufotora yabanje gukorera imirimo ye kubinyamakuru bitandukanye harimo\nnka FLASH TV Nibindi.\nnyumayaho gato ikinyamakuru IGIHE cyaramubenguttse muntangiriro z'uyumwaka wa 2023 kugeza ubu akaba ariho akorera imirimo ye."}
{"id": "17332", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17332", "title": "Nyirabahire Safynat", "text": "Nyirabahire Safynat.\nNyirabahire Safynat ni umunyarwandakazi akaba umunyamakurukazi wa bigize umwuga ukora inkuru zi mikino na siporo abinyujije mu mafoto. Nyirabahire Safynat yakoze kubitangazamakuru bitandukanye haba ibyandika ndetse na radiyo, yakoze kubitangazamakuru bitandukanye nka Flach Fm yakomeje akazi ki tangazamakuru rya siporo kuri Flach TV Rwanda aha hose yavugaga imikino n\u2019inkuru za siporo mu mafoto. Nyirabahire Safynat abarizwa mu ishyirahamwe rya banyamakuru ba siporo AJSPOR. Nyirabahire Safynat\u00a0 ni umufana wa Manchester United yo mu gihugu cyu bwongereza ku mugabane w'iburayi.\nMu itangazamakuru.\nNyirabahire Safynat yagiye yigaragaraza vyane mu marushanwa agiye atandukanye atari amwe aho yagiye abera mu gihugu cyu Rwanda no hanze m'u mahanga, aho yagiye kandi y'itabira bitandukanye, y'umupira w'amaguru yaba aya bahugu cyangwa abakobwa, yagiye agaragara nanone mu marushwa atandukanye yo gusiganwa ku igare, nkaho yaje kuba umwe mubagore bakora itangazamakuru rya kimwuga bari bari muri Tour du Rwanda, afata amafoto, amashusho inkuru z'icukumbuye, ndetse n'ibiganiro, akorera ikigo cy'itangazamakuru cya Flach."}
{"id": "17333", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17333", "title": "Usanase Anitha Dolton", "text": "Usanase Anitha Dolton.\nUsanase Anitha Dalton ni umukobwa ukiri muto wamenyekanye cyane mu gufata amashusho\ny'ikipe ya Reyon sport hano mu Rwanda\nUburambe n'imirimo.\nAnitha Dalton ni umufotozi wabigize umwuga amaze imyaka isaga itandatu akora aka kazi\nni umukobwa ukiri muto ufotora ikipe ya Reyon Sport \nInama n'akamaro.\nAnitha Dalton avugako uyumwuga wo gufotora ari umwuga wagutunga nubwo sosiyete nyarwanda\nikibifata nk'ibidashobotse kugitsina gore mu Rwanda. ngo uretse kwihangana no kwiga ibishya burimunsi \nntayindi ntwaro watsindisha."}
{"id": "17334", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17334", "title": "Uwase Aaliah", "text": "Uwase Aaliah.\nUwase Aaliah ni umukobwa w'umunyarwandakazi umenyerewe mu itangazamakuru rya siporo\nkuri ubu akaba arimo kwamamara mu gufata amafoto ya siporo mu Rwanda\nAaliah kandi yakoze ku binyamakuru byinshi bitandukanye harimo nka FUNCLUB ndetse na IGIHE.COM"}
{"id": "17337", "revid": "9488", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17337", "title": "Car free Day", "text": "Car free Day ni umusi uba kabiri mukwezi mu Rwanda ni umunsi udasanzwe wahariwe abanamaguru bkora siporo mu Rwanda \nKigali Car Free Day.\nuyumnsi ni umunsi udasanzwe uba kabiri mukwezi mu Rwanda mumujyi wa Kigali uba kucyumweru cyambere ni cya gatatu icyogihe imodoka amamoto nibindi binabiziga byose birahagarikwa kugirango abari muri siporo yo kwiruka namaguru badahura n'inkomyi iyo ariyo yose \nUmwihariko.\nKigali car Free Day ni siporo yiabirwa ningeri zose abana, abakuru, urubyiruko, abasaza,ndetse nabakecuru\nikirenze kuri ibyo nuko abanyamahanga bababasuyebu Rwanda nabo badahezwa muri iryo siganwa ramaguru namagare umukuru wigihugu cy'URwanda na madamu nabo ntago bajya basiba kwitabira iyi siporo."}
{"id": "17340", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17340", "title": "Ngamije Voisine", "text": "Ngamije Voisine.\nNgamije Voisine ni umukobwa w'umunyarwandakazi ukiri muto ukora umwuga w'itangazamakuru mu Rwanda\nni umwe mu bakobwa bake bakora umwuga wo gutangaza amakuru agendanye na siporo\nAho akora.\nNgamije Voisine uyumwugawe w'itangazamakuru awukorera kuri CITY RADIO mubiganiro \nbya siporo akba yaramenyekanye cyane mukiganiro bita City Sports gikorerwa kuri City Radio"}
{"id": "17341", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17341", "title": "Mukeshimana Laurence Samillah", "text": "Mukeshimana Laurence Samillah ni umunyarwandakazi akaba umunyamakurukazi wari wara bigize umwuga ukora inkuru zi mikino na siporo bitandukanye. Mukeshimana Laurence Samillah yakoze kubitangazamakuru byari bigiye bitandukanye haba ibinyamakuru byandika cyangwa se na radiyo, yakoze kubitangazamakuru bitandukanye nka Fine FM yakomeje akazi ki bitangazamakuru rya siporo kuri Fine FM aha hose yavugaga imikino n\u2019inkuru za siporo. Mukeshimana Laurence Samillah abarizwa mu ishyirahamwe rya banyamakuru ba siporo AJSPOR. Mukeshimana Laurence Samillah\u00a0 ni umufana wa Manchester United yo mu gihugu cyu bwongereza ku mugabane w'iburayi. \nMu itangazamakuru.\nMukeshimana Laurence Samillah yagiye agaragara mu marushanwa atandukanye atari amwe aho yagiye abera mu gihugu cyu Rwanda ndetse hamwe no m'u mahanga, aho yagiye kandi y'itabira amarushanwa atandukanye, umupira w'amaguru yaba ari aya bahugu cyangwa abakobwa, yagiye agaragara nanone yitabiriye mu marushwa atandukanye yo gusiganwa ku ma gare, nkaho yaje kuba umwe mubari bakora itangazamakuru bari bari muri Tour du Rwanda, aho y' a fataga amafoto, inkuru zi cukumbuye, ndetse n'ibiganiro kuri radiyo, akorera ikigo cy'itangazamakuru cya Fine FM Rwanda."}
{"id": "17343", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17343", "title": "Uwase Rachel", "text": "Uwase Rachel.\nUwase Rachel ni umunyarwandakazi ukora umwuga w'itangazamakuru mu Rwanda akaba akora kuri IZUBA TV ndetse akaba yaramenyekanye cyane mu kiganiro gica ku Izuba TV bita APR SUN TIME kibanda ku makuru yihariye ku ikipe ya APR.\nUmwihariko.\nUwase Rachel ni umwe mubakiri bake bakora umwuga w'itangazamakuru rya Siporo mu Rwanda\nmu gihe byari bimenyerewe ko uyu mwuga ubusanzwe ari uw'abagabo gusa."}
{"id": "17344", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17344", "title": "Nyaminani Isabelle", "text": "Nyaminani Isabelle ni umunyarwandakazi ukora umwuga wo gufata amashusho mu Rwanda yakoreyye\nibinyamakuru byinshi bitandukanye birimo RBA, AZAM TV, RADIO/TV10 ndetse nibindi\nImirimo ye kugeza ubu.\nNyaminani uretse kuba yarakoreye ibyo binyyamakuru byavuzwe haruguru ni umuhanga mugufatta amashusho\naho kuri ubu akorera umwugawe mu ikipe ya AS KIGALI \nUmwihariko.\nNyaminani Isabelle kandi urettse kuba yyarihebeye umwuga umwuga wo gufata amashuro yateraga inkunga \nChampiona y'ikiciro cyambere mu Rwanda"}
{"id": "17345", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17345", "title": "Uwamahoro Latifah Tharcille", "text": "Tariki ya 18 Nzeri 2016 nibwo Inteko rusange idasanzwe ya Ferwafa emeje Uwamahoro Latifah nk'umunyamabanga mushya wa Ferwafa asaimbuye kuri uwo mwanya Mulindahabi Olivier. nubwo Latifah atari azwi mubijyanye na Ruhago,icyogihe Perezida wa Ferwafa yatangaje ko bamutoranyije kubera ubundi buhanga afite hanze y'umupira w'amaguru. \nUwamahoro Latifah Tharcille.\nUwamahoro kugeza ubu ni umunyamabanga mukuru wa Ferwafa akaba ari umwe mubagore bari mubuyobozi\nmu Rwanda muruhando rwa siporo. Uwamahoro kandi ninawe munamabanga mukuru wa komisiyo ishinzwe \ngutegura amatora ya Perezida wa Ferwafa"}
{"id": "17347", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17347", "title": "Marie Mediatrice Izabiliza", "text": "IZABILIZA ni umunyarwandakazi w'umunyapolitki akaba ari mubagize intenko ishinga amategeko umutwe w' abadepite mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "17348", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17348", "title": "Mbakeshimama Chantal", "text": "Mukeshimana Chantal ni umunyarwandakazi w'umunyaporiki, akaba ahagaririye umuryango wa FPR mu nteko ishinga amatego umutwe w' abadepite mu Rwanda.\nAmashuri yize.\nMukeshimana Chantal afite ikiciro cya mbere cya Kaminuza mu gashami ku ubuvuzi bwo mu mutwe (Clinical Psychology)."}
{"id": "17349", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17349", "title": "Mukabunani Christine", "text": "Mukabunani Christine (yavutse 1972) avukira mu Rwanda, n'umunyarwandakazi w'umunyapolitiki uhagarariye ishyaka rya PS IMBERAKURI mu nteko ishinga amategeko yu Rwanda mu mutwe wa abadepite mu Rwanda.\nAmashuri yize.\nMukabunani Christine afite icyiro cy' akamunuza mu ishami ry'icungamari yakuye ibukavu.\nIbindi.\nDepite Mukabunani Christine akaba ari umuyobozi w\u2019ishyaka rushyashya rya PS Imberakuri, aravuga ati \" abageni bazajya bananirwa gufata indahiro mu mutwe bagiye gusezerana imbere y'inzego z'umurenge mu mategeko, bazajya basibizwa bakazagaruka gusezerana mu matefeko ubutaha \" avugako bagomba kwigisha buri bageni bose maze bagafata mu mutwe iriya ndahiro bavuga mu mategeko."}
{"id": "17354", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17354", "title": "Isambaza", "text": "Isambaza.\nIsambaza ni ubwoko bw'indagara ariko ziva mumazi gusa nubwo zibarwa mu ndagara ntago ziba zingana n'indagara\nkuko zo aba ari nini kandi zifite umubyimba uruta uwi Indagara\nUko isambaza zitunganywa naho ziva.\nIsambaza ni ubwoko bw'indagara ziva mumazi ahenshi ni mu Kivu mukarere ka Rubavu Rusizi\nmukarere ka Karongi ndetse nahandi Isambaza aenshi mbere yo kuziteka barabanza bakazikawusha\nibyo twakwita nko kuzinyuza mumavuta bakabona kuzitekamo isosi,ibyo kandi ntibikuyeho ko hari nabaziteka\nzitogosheje.\nAkamaro n'umusaruro.\nIsambaza ni ubwoko bw'imboga cyangwa isosi itegurwa kumea hari uburisho nubwo Isambaza \nziboneka muturere turangwamo amazi intibivueko ariho ziribwa gusa kuko isambaza zirambuka\nzikaza no mumujyi wa Kigai ndetse no mutundi turere tudakora kumazi."}
{"id": "17355", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17355", "title": "Umurenge wa Mwiri", "text": "Umurenge wa Mwiri ni umwe mu mirenge 12 igize Akarere ka Kayonza, mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba y\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Mwiri wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 37 931. Igice cy\u2019iburasirazuba cy\u2019umurenge kiri muri Pariki y'Akagera.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbumenyi bw\u2019isi.\nUmurenge wa Mwiri ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 514,8. Ugizwe n\u2019utugari tune: Kageyo, Migera, Nyamugari na Nyawera.\nUhana imbibi n\u2019Umurenge wa Murundi mu majyaruguru. Uhana imbibi n\u2019Umurenge wa Gahini mu burengerazuba. Uhana imbibi n\u2019Umurenge wa Mukarange mu majyepfo y\u2019uburengerazuba. Uhana imbibi n\u2019Umurenge wa Rwinkwavu mu majyepfo. Igice cy\u2019iburasirazuba cy\u2019umurenge kiri muri Pariki y\u2019Akagera.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Mwiri wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 22 933. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 37 931. Abagabo bari 18 640. Abagore bari 19 291. Abaturage bose batuye mu cyaro."}
{"id": "17357", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17357", "title": "Igisoro", "text": "Igisoro.\nIgisoro ni umwe mumikino gakondo mu Rwanda ni umukino ahanini umenyerewe ko ukinwa n'abasaza\nbataramye cyane cyane igisoro gikinwa mumasaha ya nimugoroba barimo basangira banaganira\nImivuno y'igisoro.\nimivuno nubwoko bwimikinire akina igisoro bakoresha bashaka gutsinda aribyo twakita amayeri yumukino muriyomivuno harimo: guca umuvuno bita ihene;\nImikinire n'imiterere.\nIgisoro ni umukino ukinwa hagati y'abantu babiri (2) ni umukino umenyerewe gukinwa mu bihugu\nby'Afurika birimo nku Rwanda ni umukino ufatwa nkumwe mumikino y'umuco mu Rwanda\nsiho gusa no mugihugu cy'abaturanyi cya Uganda Burundi naho baina Igisoro cyane\nIgisoro kibaba kigizwe n'Imirongo 2 y'imyobo kuri buri mukinnyi ndettse n'imbuto 64\nburi mukinnyi attangirana umukino n;imbuto 4 muri buri cyobo kandi aba yemerewe gukina kumurongo \nashaka mu mirongo 2 yiwe.\numukino urangira gute.\numukino wigisoro urangira aruko muri buri mwobo wuwo muhanganya hasigaye urusoro rumwe rwumwe aribyo bita guta urunyana."}
{"id": "17358", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17358", "title": "Umwuga w'Abarobyi", "text": "Abarobyi:.\nAbarobyi ni abantu bakura amafi cyangwa izindi nyamaswa zibera mu mazi mu mazi. Twatanga ingero nyinshi nk'insambaza, indagara, indugu n'izindi. Uburobyi bufitiye abanyarwanda akamaro, igihugu ndetse n'ibihugu byo mu karere.\nUburobyi ni umwuga uhabwa agaciro n'igihugu kuko nko mu Karere ka Nyamasheke ku itariki ya 5 Kanama 2025 habaye inama igamije kuganira ku kurwanya uburobyi butemewe, kwirinda impanuka zituruka kuguparika ubwato birenze ubushobozi, ndetse no gukangurira abarobyi gukoresha ibikoresho byemewe n'amategeko. Hari hitabiriye abakuru b'amakoperative y'abarobyi, abafatanyabikorwa bacunga umutekano wo mu mazi, ndetse n'inzego z'umutekano aho umushyitsimukuru yari ACP Charles Butera, Umuyobozi wa Polisi ushinzwe Marine ya Polisi mu Rwanda. \nAbarobyi mu Rwanda bagize uruhare runini mu burobyi bw'amafi, cyane cyane mu kiyaga cya Kivu; bafite amakoperative yo gutegura akazi kabo bakaba ashyigikirwa na leta mu buryo bwo gutegurwa ku buryo bugezweho, bigatuma bakoresha uburyo bushya n'ibikoresho bigezweho, harimo n'ubwo gutanga amakuru ku gihe no gukurikiza amategeko. Uturere rdukikije ikiyaga vya kivu nitwo dufite abarobyi benshi bityo ku itariki ya 5 Kanama 2025 mu karere ka Nyamasheke habaye inama yari iyobowe n'uwungirije umukuru w'akarere ushinzwe iterambere ry'ubukungu, Bwana Muhayeyezu Joseph desire. Inama yitabiriwe n'abayobozi b'inzego z'umutekano, ndetse n'abahagariye amakoperative y'abarobyi, hamnwe n'abandi bafatanyabikorwa mu gucunga umutekano wo mu mazi.\nUrwego rw'uburobyi mu Rwanda.\nAba baroba amafi nk'insambaza, Tilapiya, Inkube n'imamba mu biyaga bitandukanye, bagashira imbere uburobyi bunoze kandi bwubahiriza amategeko.\nBakoze amakoperative atandukanye abafasha gutegura no gucuruza amafi, amwe akorera mu kiyaga cya Kivu nka COOPILAC, ndetse no mu kiyaga cya Rweru, nka COOPARWE.\nLeta yashyizeho gahunda zo gufasha abarobyi gutera imbere, ibafashije kubbona ibibanza byo gukoreramo, kubona ibikoresho bigezweho, ndetse no kubona amashanyarazi n'ibindi bikorwa by'amajyambere.\nHari zimwe mu inzitizi bagihurana nazo birimo kuroba mu buryo bunyuranyije n'amategeko, gukoresha ibikoresho bitujuje ubuziranenge birimo Kaningiri, indobani,n'ibindi no guhangana n'ibindi binyabuzima bigira uruhare mu kurya isambaza."}
{"id": "17359", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17359", "title": "Uruvu", "text": "Uruvu.\nUruvu rubarirwa munyamanswa zibikururanda aka gasimba k'amabara nikamwe munyamanswa nke zishobora guhinduranya amabara 'uruhu rwazo. gusa benshi mu Rwanda nahandi bibeshya ko Uruvu Cyangwa Chameleons ruhindura amabara kugirango rwisanishe naho rugeze gusa ubushakashatsi buvugako ariko biri.\nImirire y'Uruvu.\nInzumvu zirya udusimba n\u2019inyoni. Kugirango zibone umuhigo wazo, ziranyonyomba zikegera aho icyo zishaka kurya kiri, zigasohora ururimi rwazo ruzinze nk\u2019igikombe zigahita zifata agasimba. Ururimi rw\u2019uruvu rushobora kuba rurerure inshuro ebyiri kuruta uko rureshya ubwarwo mugihe rurusohoye rugiye gufata nk\u2019agasimba\nImico n'imyiwarire.\nInzumvu nyinshi zigira imirizo ifatira ku buryo ziyikoresha mu gufata amababi cyangwa amashami y\u2019ibiti. Amaboko yazo n\u2019ibirenge bifite amano maremare azifasha kugundira amashami y\u2019ibiti.\nUretse guhindangura ibara ry\u2019uruhu,chameleons zifite undi mwihariko izindi nyamaswa zitagira. Amaso yazo zishobora kuyahindukiza uko zishaka, kuburyo zishobora kureba mu byerekezo bibiri bitandukanye icyarimwe.\nUbuzima n'Imyororokere.\nChameleon zitandukanye cyane n\u2019ibindi bikururanda kubera ko hari izishobora, imwe yonyine kubyara abana 30 icyarimwe nyuma yo gutwita amezi ane cyangwa atandatu. Nubwo ibyana byazo biba biri mu magi, inzumvu zibibyara ari bizima kuko aho gutera amagi ngo ziyararire, zo ziyararira ari mu nda aho kuya raririra mu cyari."}
{"id": "17360", "revid": "9488", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17360", "title": "Icyari", "text": "Icyari.\nIcyari ni Inzu ituramo inyoni z'ubwoko butandukanye ni Inzu inyoni yubaka mubuhangabwayo ikoresheje\nibyatsi igenda itoragura hirya no hino"}
{"id": "17361", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17361", "title": "Ibigega", "text": "Ibigega.\nIbigega ni ibituro bibi abanyyarwanda bakera bubukaga bakabihunikamo imyaka cyangwa kubikamo imyaka ni ibintu byyabaga ari binini byubatse nk'inzu cyangwa ibibumbiro binini mu Rwanda ni kimwe mubihugu bigihunika\nmu bigega nkaho tuzi uturere tumwe natumwe tugifite ibigega nko mukarere ka Nyanza n'ahandi`"}
{"id": "17362", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17362", "title": "Gusya", "text": "Gusya.\nGusya n' Igikorwa cyakorwaga n'Abanyarwanda bakera mu Rwanda batunganya amasaka \nyogusongamo umutsima igikoma n'ibindi.\nIgikoresho.\nGusya babikoreraga ku ibuye ryabigenewe bagasukaho amasaka make ubundi bagasunikisha\nakandi kabuye gato ubundi hakavamo ifu ariyo batekagamo utsima w'amasaka uzwi nka rucakarara\nabandi bagakoramo agakoma k'abana gakoze mu Ifu y'amasaka.\nIterambere.\nkugeza ubu mu Rwanda nubwo hari uturere tumwe natumwe tukibikora ntago ari cyane\nkuko haje imashini zisya zibikora vuba kandi zabugenewe."}
{"id": "17363", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17363", "title": "Umutiba", "text": "Umutiba.\nUmutiba ni ikintu kiboshye mu migwegwe mu birere by'inshina cyangwa nahandi bitewe nuko bawukora\numutiba twavugako ari inzu bororeramo inzuki hanyuma zigattanga ubuki"}
{"id": "17364", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17364", "title": "Igitogotogo", "text": "Igitogotogo.\nIgitogotogo cyangwa icuguti ni ikinabiziga gikozwe mu biti biva mu ishyamba iyo ukirebye ubona ari \nibiti biteranyije.wakwibeshya ko kidakomeye ariko siko biri kuko kirakomera kandi gitwara ibinu biemereye\nAkamaro n'Imirimo.\nIgitogotogo bakunze kwita icuguti kibarizwa mubice byo mubyaro mu Rwanda nahandi muri Afurika\nni ikinabiziga gikorwa nabantu ubwabo bidasabye kujya mu nganda kuko giteranywa n'intoki gusa\nubusanzwe gikoreshwa gitwara abantu ahantu hamanuka ariko si abantu gusa gusa kuko kikorera\nimizigo itari mike"}
{"id": "17365", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17365", "title": "Uruho", "text": "Uruho.\nUruho ni igikoresho gakondo cyifashishwaga mu Rwanda nk\u2019igikombe cy\u2019ubu mu kudaha inzoga mu mivure basuka mu bibindi cyangwa mu gacuma, ni narwo bakoreshaga mu kunywa igikoma kubana n\u2019inzoga ku bagore.\nkugeza ubu.\nUruho ni igikoresho cyakoreshwaga mu Rwanda mbere y'umwaduko wabakoroni\ngusa kugeza ubu ntahantu bagiikoresha uruho kuko haje ibikombe amajagi nibindi \nbikoreshwa byasimbuye Uruho. ariko bitavuzeko hari ingo zimwe nazimwe mu Rwanda\nwasangamo iki gikoresho\nIbindi bikoresho Gakondo by'umuco wa Kinyarwanda.\nUruho\numudaho\nurusyo\ningasire\numudaho\numuvure\nicyungo\nurwabya\nigikwasi\nuruhindo\nindosho\ninkooko\nintara\nisekuru\numuhururu\nurujyo\nubutanda\numuheto\numwabi...\nhamwe nibindi byinshi bitandukanye ibi ni ibikoresho byakoreshwaga mu Rwanda rwo hambere\ngusa muri byo kuri ubu ibyinshi ntibigikoreshwa kuko haje ibikoresho bya kijyambere bibisimbura\nariko nka tumwe mu duce tw'ibyaro usanga hari aho bakibikoresha kandi bikabagirira umumaro\ngusa ibyinshi muri ibi bikoresgho byavuzwe haruguru ubu ibyinshi wabisanga munzu ndangamurage yu Rwanda."}
{"id": "17366", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17366", "title": "Umuvure", "text": "Umuvure.\numuvure ni igikoresho gakondo gikozwe mugiti gifukuye, mu Rwanda bakoreshaga benga umitobe wogukoramo Inzoga iyo uvuze umuvure\nUmunyarwanda wese ahita yumva urwagwa cyangwa umutobe w'ibitoki \nAkamaro.\nmu muco nyarwanda bahoze banywa inzoga ndetse numutobe ukorwa mubitoki ibyo ntahandi byavaga uretse gutara\nibitoki bikavamo imineke ubundi bakenga mu muvure hakavamo inzoga ndetse n'umutobe,sukuvugako \numuvure wacitse kuko henshi mu Rwanda barakenga bakoresheje umuvure\nImikorere y'umuvure.\nUmuvure ni igikoresho kibaje mu giti kandi gikomeye.\numuvure akinshi ubu ubajwe mu giti cy'umuvumu."}
{"id": "17367", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17367", "title": "Ishoka", "text": "Ishoka.\nIshoka ni igikoresho cyo hambere nanubu kigikoreshwa mu Rwanda bakoreshaga basa inkwi cyangwa imbaho\nnibindi bintu bikomeye bashaka gusatura\nishoka kandi ikaba izwiho gutazirwa amazina menshi harimo indyankwi nayandi menshi"}
{"id": "17368", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17368", "title": "Uruhimbi", "text": "Uruhimbi.\nuruhimbi cyangwa kuruhimbi ni ahantu abanyarwanda bo hambere baterekaga amata ibyansi nibindi\nbyose bifittanye isano n'amata\nUko uruhimbi rukoze.\nUruhimi ni ahantu bubakaga mumbere cyane cyane mungoro y'Umwami bagasasaho ibirago\ninshinge nibindi kugerango batereke amata ahantu hizewe"}
{"id": "17369", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17369", "title": "Imbehe", "text": "Imbehe.\nmu Rwanda rwambere, mbere y'umwaduko w'abakoroni abanyarwandaga bariraga kugikoresho\nkibaje gikoze nk'isahani y'ubu aho wasanganga muri buri rugo aho basaga ibiti bakabikoramo ibikoresho byo kuriramo bizwi nk'imbehe ndetse n'ibindi bikoresho binyuranye bakoreshaga m'ugikoni\nIbibihe.\nImbehe ni igikoresho babazaga mubimera ubundi bakagikoresha bagifunguriraho (kura) ariko kuri ubu haje ibigezwho barira ku masahani"}
{"id": "17370", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17370", "title": "Igihoho", "text": "Igihoho.\nigihoho n'igikoresho babohaga mubirere by'insina bakabikamo ibintu bitandukanye\nAkamaro.\nigihoho ni igikoresho babohaga mubirere bakakifashisha babikamo ibintu bitandukanye harimo nka\n-umunyu\n-amavuta y'inka\n-aamagi\n-umunyu wa gikukuru\n-ubunyobwa ndetse nibindi"}
{"id": "17371", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17371", "title": "Dieudone Ndayisaba ndizeye", "text": "Ndizeye Dieudonne.\nNdizeye ni umukinnyi wa Basket ball mu Rwanda yavutse tariki 14 Ukwakira 1996 akinira ikipe ya REG mu Rwanda\nndetttse agakina no mu ikipe y'Igihugu.\nAmateka.\nNdizeye yatangiye umwuga we wo gukina Basket mu ikipe yya Kaminuza ya IPRC nyuma muri champiyona y'Igihugu ya Basket ball mu mwaka wa 2015. Mu mwaka wa 2017; Ndizeye yinjiye mu ikipe ya PATRIOT; mu mwaka 2018-2019 yahawe igihembo cya champiyona y'igihugu cya MVP. Mu mwaka wa 2021 mu Gushyingo yinjiye mu ikipe ya Cobra sport yo Muri Sudani y'Amajyepfo mu rwego rwo kuyifasha gushaka itike yo kwinjira mu BAL 2022\nIbihembo.\nMu bihembo byinshi yagezeho bitandukanye harimo no kuba yaregukanye umudari wa Bronze wa FIBA AFROCAN hamwe n'igihugu cye mu mwaka wa 2023."}
{"id": "17372", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17372", "title": "Akabanga", "text": "Akabanga.\nAkabanga ni bimwe mu bicuruzwa bya \"Entreprise\" Urwibutso cyangwa bakunze kwita kwa Nyirangarama.\nHabarizwa mu karere ka Rulindo mu Ntara y'Amajyaruguru mu gihugu cy'u Rwanda\nAkabanga ni iki?\nAkabanga ni urusenda bongera mu byo kurya. Kubarukoresha ni urusenda bokera mu mavuta.\nAbarurya bavuga ko ari urusenda rw'umwimerere."}
{"id": "17373", "revid": "9488", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17373", "title": "Imishaba", "text": "Imizuzu.\nImishaba cyangwa Imizuzu ni ubwoko bw'Ibitoki abatabizi bayita imineke ariko mubyukuri si imineke\nahubwo ni ibitoki byera bigahira ku Insina bigasa nk'imineke ariko ntibikoreshwa nk'imineke\nImikoreshereze.\nImishaba cyangwa Imizuzu ni ibitoki bakoramo Ifiriti"}
{"id": "17374", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17374", "title": "Abapfumu", "text": "Mu muco n'amateka y'u Rwanda habagaho umuhango wo kuragura no kuraguza, ukaba umwihariko wakorwaga n'abareba kera bitaga \"Abapfumu\".\nNi umuhango wafatiye runini u Rwanda mugihe cyo hambere ariko ubu ugenda uteshwa agaciro uko abanyamadini bacengerwa n'umuco mushya w'imyemerere. Nubwo ibyo byabayeho ariko uko iminsi irushaho kugenda yicuma, usanga uwo muco urimo kugenda ugaruka ndetse ugasanga ari bwo ufitiwe inyota kuruta mu bihe byo hambere. Cyane cyane bigaragara mu bakiri bato ariko ugakorwa mu isura nshya kimwe no kuwita amazina mashya mu rwego rwo kuyobya uburari ngo hato batitwa abapagani bihambira ku mihango n\u2019imigenzo ya kera kandi barakisitutse. Aha akaba ariho tugiye kurebera hamwe imiterere y\u2019ubupfumu mu bihe byo hambere ndetse tuze no kunaga akajisho aho ubw\u2019ubu buhagaze ugereranyije n\u2019umwimerere bwahanganywe. \nAbapfumu.\nUbupfumu no kuragura ni numuhango wafatiye igihugu cyu Rwanda akamaro kanini ariko nyuma y'umwaduko w'abazungu ugenda ucyendera \nnyuma kuzana amadini muri Afurika ndetse no mu Rwanda\nUbupfumu mugihe cyo Hambere.\nKuraguza ni ibikorwaga byakorwaga n'Abanyarwanda mbere yo kugira icyo bakora cyose ngo bamenye niba bazagira insinzi kuragura no kuraguza kw'abanyarwanda ntago kwari ukuyoba cyangwa se ibikorwa byubujiji nkuko benshi babikeka. ahubwo cyari igikorwa kigaragaza ko abanyarwanda biyitagaho. bifuza kumenya uko bahagaze ndetse no kumenya icyerekezo cyaho bakeneye kugera no kumenya ahazaza h'igihugu cyabo.\nAbapfumu ni bo babarwaga nk'abareba kure b'igihugu, ni bo bagombaga guhanuzwa, babaga bazwi mu gihugu. Ubupfumu bwari uburebakure no gupfumura ukageza ijisho aho iry'abandi ritagera.\nUmwuga w'ubupfumu wari uw'ikirenga ku gihugu ku buryo abawukoragamo babaga bubashywe by'ikirenga kugeza no ku mwami nyirigihugu ku buryo hari n'abashakaga icyubahiro n'indonke bakaba bawiyitirira babihanirwaga ndetse bikomeye kugeza no ku gihano cy'urupfu.\nAbanyarwanda iyo bajyaga gukorwa icyo ari cyo cyose nki guhiga,kujya ku rugamba, gukora ubukwe cyangwa iyo bagiraga ikibazo kibakomereye bagombaga kubiraguza kugira ngo bamenye niba bizatungana cyangwa se niba bitazatungana birimo inzitizi, bakabamenyesha icyo bagomba gukora kugira ngo bizatungane ari byo bitaga guhambwa instinzi.\nKuragura ni umuco w'uburebakure Abanyarwanda bose basangiye. Nta munyarwanda utari umurebakure ahubwo ijanisha ry'ubwo burebakure ni ryo ritangana. Umwe ashobora kugira 10%, undi akagira 40%, undi akaba afite 80%. Ufite ingano nini y'uburebakure, ni we ufata icyemezo cyo gutangaza ko ashobora kuragurira buri wese kandi bihanitse.\nMu muhango wo kuraguza no kuragura hifashishwaga ibintu bitandukanye bitewe n'urwego umuntu arimo, icyo baraguriza n'ibindi.\nIbyifashishwaga baragura.\nKuragura inka.\nUmwami ni we wenyine baraguriraga bakoresheje inka, impamvu ni uko inka zose zo mu gihuggu aba ari iz'umwami, umwami ni we wazanaga inka mu Rwanda, kuko ni yo zabaga icyorezo cyazirimbuye, yeguraga umuheto we akajya kuzinyaga amahanga, zigasubira mu Rwanda.\nKuragura Inkoko.\nYakoreshwaga mu kuraguriza umugeni, inkoko yakoreshwaga yabaga ari umushwi, yaba uw'isake cyangwa inkokokazi.\nKuragura Intama.\nYaragurizwaga cyane cyane abatunzi n'ibikomangoma n'abatware n'imfura z'ibwami.\nKuragura Amavuta.\nAmavuta yakoreshwaga n'undi muntu wese w'umutunzi w'inka; yakoreshwaga cyane cyane mu kuraguriza ikibanza n'amatungo.\nKuraguriza urugimbu.\nUrugimbu rwakoreshwaga n'undi muntu wese w'umutunzi w'inka. Inyama y'urugimbu bakoreshaga ni urw'inka cyangwa urw'intama ndetse n'urw'ihene.\nKuragura Inzuzi.\nInzuzi zakoreshwaga mu kuraguriza umugeni, inzuzi ni amagufwa babaza y'ikimasa babaga baterekereje.\nKuragura Umutwe.\nByakoreshwaga n'uwari we wese, Umupfumu waraguzaga umutwe yabaga ari umuntu uzi gukeka, akagereranya akurikije ibyo abona n'ibyo yumva k'uwo aragurira, akabivugamo indagu.\nKuragura Igikondo.\nNi uburyo bakoreshaga baragurisha imbehe yaramvuwe mu giti cy'umuko kuragura uburo n'inzuzi, ni uburyo bwakoreshwaga n'abaturage baciriritse kuko buhendutse.\nUbupfumu mu bihe bya none.\nMu mpera z'ikinyejana cya 19, nibwo hagaragaye inkubiri y'uko abantu benshi bazamukanye inyota yo kubaza abarebakure.\nnubwo iyo nyota yari irembeje benshi, wasangaga n'abafite iyo mpano bakabikora rwihishwa ku bwo gutinya abanyamadini badutse mu gihugu. \nAho ni ho benshi bagiye baca undi muvuno wo kuragura no kuraguza mu bundi buryo aho babbikora mu izina rya yesu mu gihe abo mu Rwanda rwo hambere babikoraga mu izina ry'abakurambere."}
{"id": "17375", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17375", "title": "Inganzo ngari", "text": "Inganzo Ngari.\nInganzo Ngari ni itsinda ribyina imbyino gakondo rikorera mu Rwanda ryashinzwe mu mwaka wa 2006\nni Itsinda ryemewe n'amategeko\nImirimo n'ibihembo.\nIri tsinda ni rimwe mu matsinda abyina imbyino gakondo mu Rwanda rimaze kwigarurira imitima yabenshi\nmu Rwanda ndettse no hanze yarwo ni itsinda rimaze kwitabira amaserukiramuco atari make kwisi hose\nAndimakuru.\nMu 2019 Itororero Inganzo ngari ryasohokeye mugihu cyiburayi (USA) bamwe muribo 8 batorokerayo abandi 20 bururikira Ikigali tariki ya 15 Gicurasi 2019"}
{"id": "17376", "revid": "11826", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17376", "title": "Ikiyongoyongo", "text": "Ikiyongoyongo.\nIkiyongoyongo ni bumwe mu bwoko bw'Ibisiga bikunda kugaragara muri Africa cane n' Ibisiga\nbifite umwihariko wo kugira umunwa murere kuruta ibindi"}
{"id": "17377", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17377", "title": "Igikatsi", "text": "Igikatsi.\nmu Rwanda iyo benga umutobe bakoresha ibyatsi bita inshinge basoroma hirya no hino bakengera mumuvure\nnawo babaza mubiti, Igikatsi ni Ibyo batsi bamaze kwengesha umutobe"}
{"id": "17378", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17378", "title": "Ikibindi", "text": "Ikibindi.\nikibindi cyangwa Inkono nini ni igikoresho gakondo gikoreshwa mu Rwanda n'abandi muri Afurika bakoreshaga mu gihe cyo hambere mubikorwa byinshi bitandukanye mubuzima bwaburimunsi ibi bikoresho bikaba bikunda gukoreshwa babikamo amazi cyangwa se kakagikoresha bataramo inzoga za Kinyarwanda cyangwa se imitobe.\nImikoreshereze y'Ikibindi.\nikibindi ni igikoresho babumbaga mu Ibumba cyakoraga imirimo myinshi itandukanye harimo nko\n- kubikamo inzoga (Urwagwa)\n- Ikigage ndetse bakagikoresha basangiriramo inzoga imitobe ibigage mu birori byabo burimunsi."}
{"id": "17379", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17379", "title": "Umuheto", "text": "Umuheto.\numuheto ni kimwe mubikoresho gakondo mu Rwanda bakoreshaga nk'igikoresho cy'ubwirinzi kurugamba Akenshi umuheto ugendana n'umwambi byose bikaba ari ibikoresho gakondo mumuco nyarwanda.\nSi mu Rwanda gusa ahubwo hari nibindi bihugu bitandukane byo muri Afurika muri rusange byafataga umuheto nk'Intwaro.\nAkamaro k'umuheto.\nUretse kuba umuheto warakoreshwaga kurugamba ikindi umuheto wari utunze benshi mu batuayu bw' u Rwanda kuko bawukoreshaga muguhiga inyamanswa zo kurya mu mashyamba\nAmateka.\nUmuheto iyo umuntu yawujyanaga kurugamba ntago yabaga awufitte wonyine kuko byasabagako uba ufite n'ibindi bikoresho gakondo bitaga imyambi yakoreshwaga mukwica,Ingabo cyakoreshwaga nko kwirinda ibyagukomeretsa cyangwa bikakwica bakoherereza imyambi."}
{"id": "17380", "revid": "9488", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17380", "title": "Akayunguruzo", "text": "Akaunguruzo.\nAkayunguruzo ni igikoresho gakondo abanyarwanda bakoreshaga bayungurura ibyokurya cyangwa kunwya\nharimo nk'Ifu y'ubugari,amasaka,ifu y'ibigori nibindi"}
{"id": "17381", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17381", "title": "Amategura", "text": "Amategura.\namategura ni ibikoresho basakaza inzu mukimbo cy'amabati cyane cyane mubyaro\namategura aba akoze u ibumba ahanini riva mumazi\nUmwihariko.\nAmategura arangwa no kuba atagira urusaku iyo imvura iguye ndettse no gukonja cyane\nkunzu zubakishije amategura"}
{"id": "17382", "revid": "9488", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17382", "title": "Ikiraro cy'amatungo", "text": "Ikiraro.\nikiraro cy'amatungo ni inzu iba yubatse mubitii iraramo amatungo harimo nka\n- Inka\n- Ihene\n- Ingurube\n- Intama\n- Inkoko, nibindi"}
{"id": "17386", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17386", "title": "Imegeri", "text": "Imegeri.\nImegeri nibimwe mu bimera bibarizwa mubwoko bw'imboga ariko ntago wabibara mubihingwa kuko imegeri\nntago zihingwa ahubwo zirimeza.\nIbindi wamenya.\nIgitangaje iyo imegeri zameze bavugako zapfuye hanyuma bajya kuzisoroma bakavuga ko \nari ukwica Imegeri.mu Rwanda ni igihugu kimwe mubihugu byo muri Afurika biha agaciro Imegeri\nkuko ahantu zapfuye uhasanga uruvunganzoka rw'Abantu brimo kwica Imegeri kuko zivamo isosi iribwa\nkandi abazirie bavuga ko ziryoha ikindi zigira intungamubiri."}
{"id": "17387", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17387", "title": "Nyirarunonko", "text": "Nyirarunonko.\nNyirarunonko cyangwa se Runonko ni uburyo abanyarwanda bo hambere bakoraga bashaka ibyokurya batarinze \ngusubira murugo kuko babikoreraga aho bari mumirimo nko kuragira,Guhinga,Guhiga nibindi\nUburyo bwo kotsa Runonko.\nUburyo bwo kotsa Runonko, ni uburyo bwari bumenyerewe cyane mu Rwanda rwo ha mbere, na n\u2019ubu bugikorwa.mubice bimwe nabimwe byo mubyaro mu Rwanda. Kenshi na kenshi Runonko yotswaga n\u2019abashumba baragiye kure y\u2019ingo, abahinzi bagiye guhinga kure n\u2019abandi.\nIbyo bikabafasha kwica isari (Inzara) ngo itabatsemba bataragera mu rugo. Hari n\u2019ababikoraga mu rwego rwo gushaka amafunguro ya vuba na bwangu, kugira ngo bakomeze imirimo yabo batagombye gusubira mu rugo.\nImiterere n'imyubakire.\nKotsa Runonko byakorwaga muburyo bwo kubaka akazu gato k'ibinonko babaga barimye mumurima w'igisigati bateguriye imvura y'umuhindo bamara kukuzuza bagacanamo umuriro. ikimenyetso kigaragaza ko Runonko yahiye, ni uko byabinonko byose byabaga umutukutuku. \nUbwo bagakuramo rya vu ry'inkwe bacanye bagashyiramo Ibijumba, Amateke, cyangwa Imyumbati hanyuma bagahonda bya binonko byatukuye Bikaba itaka ariko riryamyye kuri byabindi bashizemo byo kotsa barangiza bakarenzaho akandi gataka gakeye kugirango wamuriro utaza kubacika ugasohoka bidahiye. Nyuma y'iminota runaka babaga bihayye bakaza kwarura bimwe bokejemo ubundi bagahunguraho itaa n'Ivu ubundi bakarya. \nImiziro ya Runonko.\nRunonko yagiraga imiziro itari mike bavugako cyaziraga gusura uyicaye iruhande, kuko ngo yahitaga ihirima idahiye cyaraziraga kandi kuyicanisha imyayyu n'ibishwagara kuko yatindaga gushya cyangwa se ibinonko ntibifatte umuriro wakottsa ibyo binyabijumba ikindi kandi Runonko yotswagamo ibinyabijumba gusa."}
{"id": "17388", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17388", "title": "John Dramani Mahama", "text": "John Dramani Mahama (yavutse ku ya 29 Ugushyingo 1958 i Damongo) ni umunyapolitiki wa Gana, Perezida w'icyo gihugu kuva muri Mutarama 2025, nyuma yo kuba yarakiyoboye kuva mu 2012 kugeza mu 2017. Umuyoboke w'ishyaka rya National Democratic Congress (NDC), yabaye umudepite, Minisitiri w'Itumanaho, hanyuma Visi-Perezida ku butegetsi bwa John Atta Mills. Yabaye Perezida ku ya 24 Nyakanga 2012, nyuma y'urupfu rwa Mills, aba visi-perezida wa mbere usimbuye perezida upfuye ndetse n'umukuru w'igihugu wa mbere wa Gana wavutse nyuma y'ubwigenge bwa 1957. Yatsinzwe amatora ya 2016 n'aya 2020 na Nana Akufo-Addo, ariko yongera gutorwa mu 2024, aba perezida wa mbere wa Gana utorewe manda ya kabiri itakurikiranye n'iya mbere.\nUbuzima bwe bwa mbere n'amashuri.\nMahama ni Umugonja ukomoka i Bole, mu ntara ya Savannah; yavukiye i Damongo, mu karere ka Gonja y'Iburengerazuba. Se, Emmanuel Adama Mahama, wari umuhinzi w'umuceri akaba n'umwarimu, yari umudepite wa mbere wa Gonja y'Iburengerazuba n'umuyobozi wa mbere w'Intara y'Amajyaruguru ku butegetsi bwa Kwame Nkrumah, hanyuma aba umujyanama wa Perezida Hilla Limann.\nYize amashuri abanza i Accra, mu ishuri rya Newtown n'irya Achimota, n'amashuri yisumbuye muri Ghana Secondary School i Tamale. Yize muri Kaminuza ya Gana i Legon, abona impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya mbere mu mateka mu 1981, n'impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya nyuma ya kaminuza mu itumanaho mu 1986. Yize kandi ubumenyi bw'imitekerereze y'imibereho mu ishuri rikuru ry'ubumenyi bw'imibereho rya Moscou, mu Bumwe bw'Abasoviyeti, ahabona impamyabumenyi mu 1988.\nUmwuga mbere ya politiki.\nNyuma ya kaminuza, Mahama yabaye umwarimu mu mashuri yisumbuye. Kuva mu 1991 kugeza mu 1995, yakoraga muri ambasade y'Ubuyapani i Accra, ashinzwe amakuru, umuco n'ubushakashatsi. Kuva mu 1995 kugeza mu 1996, yakoreye umuryango urwanya ubukene Plan International muri Gana.\nUmwuga wa politiki.\nMu matora ya 1996, Mahama yatorewe kuba umudepite uhagarariye Bole/Bamboi. Muri Mata 1997, yagizwe Minisitiri wungirije w'Itumanaho, hanyuma Minisitiri w'Itumanaho kuva mu Ugushyingo 1998 kugeza muri Mutarama 2001 ku butegetsi bwa Jerry Rawlings. Yongeye gutorwa mu 2000 no mu 2004. Mu 2003, yabaye umwe mu bagize Inteko Ishinga Amategeko Nyafurika.\nMu matora ya 2008, yatorewe kuba Visi-Perezida iruhande rwa John Atta Mills, arahira ku ya 7 Mutarama 2009. Yayoboye itsinda ry'igihugu rishinzwe imicungire y'ubukungu, n'inama zishinzwe ingabo na polisi.\nManda ya mbere (2012\u20132017).\nKu ya 24 Nyakanga 2012, nyuma y'urupfu rwa Perezida John Atta Mills, Mahama yarahiriye kuba Perezida wa Gana imbere ya Perezida w'Urukiko rw'Ikirenga, Georgina Wood. Mu matora yo ku ya 7 n'iya 8 Ukuboza 2012, yatsinze ku cyiciro cya mbere n'amajwi 50,70%, imbere ya Nana Akufo-Addo (47,74%), maze arahira ku ya 7 Mutarama 2013. Ishyaka rya Akufo-Addo ryareze ibyavuye mu matora, ariko ku ya 29 Kanama 2013 Urukiko rw'Ikirenga rutesha agaciro ikirego cyabo.\nKu ya 30 Werurwe 2014, Mahama yatorewe kuyobora Umuryango w'Ubukungu w'Ibihugu bya Afurika y'Iburengerazuba (CEDEAO). Mu 2015, Gana yahuye n'ikibazo gikomeye cy'ibura ry'amashanyarazi, kizwi ku izina rya \u00ab\"dumsor\"\u00bb, cyagize ingaruka ku bukungu kandi gitera imyigaragambyo. Mu 2016, umunyamakuru Manasseh Azure Awuni yagaragaje ko Mahama yahawe imodoka y'agaciro k'amadolari 100 000 n'umushoramari wo muri Burukina Faso; komisiyo ishinzwe uburenganzira bwa muntu (CHRAJ) yasanze yarishe amabwiriza ajyanye n'impano, ariko ko atari ruswa kuko yari yarashyikirije leta iyo modoka.\nMu matora yo mu Ukuboza 2016, yatsinzwe na Akufo-Addo, amubona n'amajwi 44,4% kuri 53,5%, maze yemera gutsindwa. Yabaye perezida wa mbere wa Gana utongeye gutorerwa manda ya kabiri ikurikiranye. Muri uko kwezi, yari mu itsinda rya CEDEAO ryahuzaga Perezida Yahya Jammeh na Adama Barrow muri Gambiya.\nHagati ya manda zombi.\nMuri Gashyantare 2019, NDC yamutanze nk'umukandida mu matora ya 2020 ; ku ya 4 Ukuboza 2020, we na Akufo-Addo basinye amasezerano y'amahoro, ariko Akufo-Addo yongera gutsinda n'amajwi 51,6%. Ku ya 14 Gicurasi 2023, Mahama yongeye gutorwa nk'umukandida wa NDC mu matora ya 2024, n'amajwi 98,9%.\nManda ya kabiri (kuva mu 2025).\nMu matora ya perezida yo ku ya 7 Ukuboza 2024, Mahama yatsinze Visi-Perezida Mahamudu Bawumia, wemeye gutsindwa bukeye ; komisiyo y'amatora yemeje itsinzi ye n'amajwi 56,55%. Yarahiye ku ya 7 Mutarama 2025. Itegeko Nshinga rya Gana ntirimwemerera kongera kwiyamamaza mu 2028.\nMu bikorwa bye bya mbere, yatangije iperereza ku mushinga wa Katederali y'igihugu wari wemejwe n'uwo yasimbuye, wanengwaga ikiguzi cyawo, kandi abuza abayobozi ba leta ingendo zitari ngombwa. Ku ya 22 Mata 2025, yahagaritse ku mirimo Perezida w'Urukiko rw'Ikirenga, Gertrude Torkornoo, maze ku ya 1 Nzeri 2025 aramwirukana nyuma y'inama ya komite yakoze iperereza. Mu 2025, yasabye inganda za peteroli kwihutisha ubucukuzi bwa peteroli muri Gana, mu gihe yiyemezaga no kongera ingufu zisukuye.\nUbuzima bwite.\nMahama yashakanye na Lordina Mahama, bafitanye abana batanu. Yavukiye mu Itorero ry'Abaperesibiteriyani, ariko mu 2001 yinjira mu Itorero rya Assemblies of God, iry'umugore we. Umuryango we urimo Abakristo n'Abayisilamu. Yanditse mu binyamakuru byinshi, harimo \"The New York Times\", kandi akunda umuziki wa Afrobeat, cyane cyane uwa Fela Kuti. Murumuna we ni umucuruzi Ibrahim Mahama."}
{"id": "17389", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17389", "title": "Kigali Bus Service", "text": "Kigali Bus Servise.\nKigali Bus Service cyangwa se KBS ni isosiyete ikorera mu Rwanda ishinzwe gutwara abantu nibintu \nKBS yatangiye kumugaragaro mu Rwanda mumujyi wa Kigali mu mwaka wa 2009 aho yatangiye\nifite ama Bus mato.\nKBS kugeza ubu.\nKigali Bus Servise kugeza ubu ni imwe muri sosiyete zifite bus nyinshi mu Rwanda kandi nini zitwara abanttu benshi \nicyarimwe "}
{"id": "17390", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17390", "title": "Ritco", "text": "Ritco LTD.\nRitco Lttd ni isosiyete itwara abantu ikorera mu Rwanda yatangiye ibikorwa byayo mu mwaka wa 2016 nubwo\nyamuritswe kumugaragaro muri Gashyantare mumwaka wa 2017 i Kigali\ningamba n'iterambere.\nRitco ni isosiyete itwara abantu mu Rwanda imaze gukemura ikibazo k'ingendo mu mujyi wa Kigali no mu turere\ntuwegereyye\nInzozi n'ingamba.\nRitco ivuga ko yaje ije gukemura ikibazo cy'abaturage baba mu bwinguge mu ntara kuko imodoka zigera mu nttara\nzari ikibazo ndetse no kuborohereza serivice z'ingendo"}
{"id": "17399", "revid": "18414", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17399", "title": "Akamaro k'ibidukikije", "text": "Umumaro w'amashyamba.\nAmashyamba afitiye akamaro kanini ibinyabuzima bituye ku isi: Mu mashyamba habonekamo amoko menshi anyuranye y`ibinyabuzima. Akamaro k'amashyamba ntikarondoreka; amashyamba ni indiri y'inyamaswa n'inyoni, amashyamba kandi atanga amadovize (amafaranga y'amahanga) bityo agakurura ba mukerarugendo mu gihugu. Amashyamba ayungurura umwuka duhumeka ndetse amababi y'ibimera yakira umwuka mubi dusohora akaduha umwuka mwiza duhumeka.\nAbantu bakenera amashyamba mu buzima bwa buri mutsi mu mirimo myinshi igiye itandukanye; benshi barara ku bitanda bikozwe mu biti, bamwe bagakoresha inkwi mu gutegura amafunguro ya buri munsi.., si ibyo gusa; usanga no mu bikoresho bifashisha mu kubaka inzu usanga higanjemo ibiti cyangwa ibikomoka ku biti. Uretse amagorofa ahambaye akenera ibisenge bikozwe mu byuma, andi mazu menshi usanga ibisenge byayo bikozwe mu biti cyangwa mu mbaho. Hari n'abavuga ko inzu yubakishijwe ibiti iramba kurusha iyubakishijwe amatafari ya rukarakara.\nMu Rwanda ibyafatwaga nk'ibyagiza ibidukikije n'amashyamba.\nIbikorwa bimwe na bimwe byangiza ibidukikije mu Rwanda; gutema ibiti cyangwa amashyamba adakuze, guhumanya ikirere hatwikwa ibiparasitike byo mu myanda, imyotsi ituruka ku binyabiziga, n'inganda zitubahiriza amabwiriza y'ubuzima. Ibindi kandi ni nko kwangiza ibishanga hamenwamo imyanda, cyangwa gufuriramo, gukora ubuhinzi butita ku bidukikije, no kudatera amaterasi y'indinganire ku buryo amazi yatwara ubutaka."}
{"id": "17405", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17405", "title": "Gusiramura igitsina gore", "text": "Gutema imyanya ndangagitsina y'abagore (FGM), bizwi kandi no gukata imyanya ndangagitsina y'abagore, gukata imyanya ndangagitsina y'abagore / gukata (FGM / C) no gukebwa kw'abagore, ni umuhango wo guca cyangwa gukuraho bimwe cyangwa byose. Imyitozo iboneka mu bihugu bimwe na bimwe bya Afurika, Aziya no mu Burasirazuba bwo Hagati, no muri diaspora zabo.Muri 2023, UNICEF ivuga ko \"byibuze miliyoni 200 z'abakobwa... mu bihugu 31\", harimo Indoneziya, Iraki, Yemeni, n'ibihugu 27 byo muri Afurika harimo na Misiri - bakorewe ubwoko bumwe cyangwa bwinshi bwo gutemagura imyanya ndangagitsina y'abagore. \nMubisanzwe bikorwa n'umusiramuzi gakondo akoresheje icyuma, FGM ishobora gukorwa kuva iminsi umukobwa avutse kugeza ubwangavu nahandi. Kimwe cya kabiri cy'ibihugu biboneka imibare y'igihugu, abakobwa benshi baracibwa mbere yimyaka itanu. Inzira ziratandukanye ukurikije igihugu cyangwa ubwoko. Harimo kuvanaho ingofero ya clitoral (ubwoko bwa 1-a) hamwe na clitoral glans (1-b); gukuraho labia y'imbere (2-a); no gukuraho labia y'imbere ninyuma no gufunga igituba (ubwoko 3). Muri ubu buryo bwa nyuma, buzwi nka infibulation, hasigaye umwobo muto kugirango unyure inkari n'amazi y'imihango; igituba cyafunguwe kugirango gikorwe kandi gifungurwe cyane kubyara. [8]\nImyitozo ishingiye ku busumbane bushingiye ku gitsina, kugerageza kugenzura imibonano mpuzabitsina y'abagore, n'ibitekerezo bijyanye n'isuku, kwiyoroshya, n'ubwiza. Ubusanzwe itangizwa kandi igakorwa nabagore, babibona nkisoko yicyubahiro, kandi batinya ko kunanirwa gukata abakobwa babo nabuzukuru babo bizashyira abakobwa mukumirwa. Ingaruka mbi zubuzima ziterwa nubwoko bwibikorwa; zirashobora kuba zirimo kwandura inshuro nyinshi, ingorane zo kwihagarika no gutembera kwimihango, ububabare budashira, iterambere rya cysts, kudashobora gusama, ingorane mugihe cyo kubyara, no kuva amaraso yica. [8] Nta nyungu zizwi zubuzima. "}
{"id": "17407", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17407", "title": "Arnhem", "text": "Arnhem n'umujyi hamwe na komine mu Buholandi n'umurwa mukuru w'intara ya Gelderland. Komine ifite abaturage 165.896, ikaba ari komine ya cumi nini mu Buholandi. \nUsibye umujyi wa Arnhem, komini ya Arnhem ikubiyemo imidugudu ya Elden na Schaarsbergen, imidugudu ya De Praets na 't Vlot, hamwe n'ibice by'imidugudu ya Terlet na Deelen. Arnhem ni mubufatanye bwa Arnhem Nijmegen Umujyi. \nUrukiko rw'akarere ka Gelderland hamwe n'urukiko rw'ubujurire rwa Arnhem-Leeuwarden biherereye muri uyu mujyi, kandi niwo shingiro ry'icyumba cya gisirikare cy'igihugu ndetse na brigade igendanwa. Byongeye kandi, uyu mujyi urimo ibintu byinshi bikurura igihugu ndetse n\u2019amahanga, harimo inzu ndangamurage y\u2019Ubuholandi ya Open Air Museum na Zoo ya Royal Burgers."}
{"id": "17415", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17415", "title": "Kazungu Denis", "text": "Kazungu Denis ni umwicanyi ruharwa w'umunyarwanda wishe abantu 14, abenshi muri bo bakaba ari abagore. Igihe yafatwaga, yarafite iduka ry\u2019ibicuruzwa bya moto.\nUbwicanyi.\nKazungu yatawe muri yombi muri Nyakanga 2023 akekwaho gufata ku ngufu, ubujura, no gukoresha iterabwoba. Icyakora, yahawe ntiyajyanwa mu rukiko kubera kubura ibimenyetso kugeza ku wa 5 Nzeri 202, kugera ubwo yongeye gutabwa muri yombi. Nyuma y'iminsi ibiri, hatangajwe ko imirambo cumi n'ine yabonetse mu mwobo uri mu gikoni cy'inzu ye yakodeshaga. Igihe Kazungu yafatwaga, yavuze ko yashutse abahohotewe mu kabari akajya iwe nyuma akaza kubafata ku ngufu, akabiba ndetse nyuma akabica. Ku ya 21 Nzeri 2023, mu rukiko Kazungu yemeye ibyaha muri ubwo bwicanyi. Ku ya 8 Werurwe 2024, Kazungu yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu."}
{"id": "17416", "revid": "12821", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17416", "title": "Abdullah Shah", "text": "Abdullah Shah (1965 - 20 Mata 2004) yari umwicanyi ruharwa wo ukomoka gihugu cya Afuganisitani wahamwe n'icyaha cyo kwica i Kabul abantu barenga 20, harimo n'umugore we. Iyicwa rye ryemewe ni irya mbere muri Afuganisitani kuva muri Abatalibani kugera mu mpera za 2001. \nShah ubundi yakoraga ku butegetsi bwa Zardad Khan, ndetse aza guhabwa izina ry'imbwa Zardad - wakoraga ku butegetsi bwa Gulbuddin Hekmatyar mu intambara y'abenegihugu muri Afuganisitani (1992\u20131996). Shah na Zardad bambuye umugenzi kumuhanda uva Kabul ugana Jalalabad.\nShah yahamijwe bwa mbere mu rukiko rwihariye mu Kwakira muri 2002. Mu rubanza abantu icyenda bamushinje, barimo undi mugore yagerageje kwica amutwitse. Imirambo ya benshi mu bahitanywe na Shah yabonetse mu iriba ryo mu Karere ka Paghman. \nIyicwa ryabereye muri gereza ya Pul-e-Charkhi. Perezida w'agateganyo yari Hamid Karzai yashyize umukono ku cyemezo cy'urupfu. Igihe yicwaga, Shah yarashwe mu mutwe. Mu batangabuhamya bari bahari harimo abahagarariye abapolisi ba Afuganisitani, Ubushinjacyaha Bukuru n\u2019abaganga.\nAmnesty International yamaganye iyicwa rivuga ko Afuganisitani yirinze amahame remezo y\u2019uburinganire. Uyu muryango wongeyeho ko bishoboka ko Shah yacecekeshejwe kugira ngo adashobora gutanga ubuhamya ku bayobozi bifatanije na guverinoma. Yavuze ko atahawe umwunganira m'umategeko w'abaregwa, urubanza rwabaye rwihishwa, ukwemera icyaha kwakorewe iyicarubozo kandi umucamanza wa mbere mu rubanza rwe yirukanwa kubera ruswa. Umucamanza wa kabiri yaje kotswa igitutu n'Urukiko rw'Ikirenga gutanga iki gihano."}
{"id": "17417", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17417", "title": "Jimmy Gasore", "text": "Gasore Jimmy yahoze ari umuyobozi wa Minisitiri w\u2019Ibikorwaremezo mu Rwanda.\nIbyo yakoze.\nGasore Jimmy yabaye kandi umwarimu muri Kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda aho yigishaga amasomo y'atmospheric sciences, n\u2019umushakashatsi mukuru mu rwego rw\u2019igihugu rushinzwe ubugenzuzi ku by\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe n'ikirere. Muri 2013 Jimmy yagize uruhare mu ishyirwaho rya Rwanda Climate Observatory Station, igenzura ibigize umwuka bifitanye isano n\u2019ihindagurika ry\u2019ibihe, kwandura k\u2019umwuka ndetse no kwangiriza kw\u2019akayunguruzo ka Ozone. Dr Gasore yayoboraga umushinga wo kugenzura ubuziranenge bw\u2019umwuka mu ikirere cyu Rwanda ugamije gushyiraho ibikoresho byifashishwa mu kugenzura ingano y\u2019ibyanduza umwuka mu gihugu hagamijwe gutanga inama ku cyakorwa.\nIbyo yize.\nDr Gasore Afite impamyabumenyi y\u2019icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu by\u2019Ubugenge yakuye mu yahoze ari Kaminuza y\u2019u Rwanda, mu 2008 n\u2019Impamyabushobozi y\u2019Ikirenga muri Siyansi mu by\u2019uruvange rw\u2019imyuka ku mubumbe w' isi (Atmospheric Sciences) yakuye muri Massachusetts Institute of Technology muri 2018."}
{"id": "17419", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17419", "title": "Charles Rudakubana", "text": "Rtd Maj Gen Dr Charles Rudakubana ni Amasaderi uhagarariye u Rwanda mu gihugu cya Angola akaba itezweho \ngutsura umubano wu Rwanda na Angola\nRtd. Maj. Gen. Charles Rudakubana.\nCharles Rudakubana ni umwe mu bagabo bayoboye umutwe wingabo z'Africa yiburasirazuba zishinzwe gutabara aho rukomeye\nImirimo.\nRtd,Gen, Dr Charles Rudakubana kuri ubu yagizwe Ambasaderi wu Rwanda mugihugu cy'Angola\nImirimo ye muri Angola.\nRtd Maj. Gen. Dr Charles Rudakubana azakomeza no gutsura umubano w'u Rwanda na Angola yifashishije uburyo bwa Diporomasi imikoranire mu bucuruzi, mu ishoramari no guteza imbere umutekano.\nAzakurikirana ishyirwamubikorwa ry'amasezerano y'ubufatanye hagati y'ibihugu byombi no kureba ibindi bishya ibihugu byombi byagiranamo imikoranire binyuzemumasezerano atandukanye`"}
{"id": "17420", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17420", "title": "Rwanda Peace Academy", "text": "Rwanda Peace Academy ni ishuri ryaGisirikare rigamije kugarura amahoro mu Rwanda no mu Karere\nni umushinga uterwa inkunga na Leta y'Ubuyapani hamwe na UNDP-Rwanda\nUmusaruro Wa Rwanda Peace Academy.\nRwanda Peace Academy ni ishuri rishinzwe kugarura amahoro mu Rwanda no mu Karere k'Afurika ni umushinga\nuzatanga amasomo ndetse nubushakashatsi mubibazo by' Afurika ndetse no gukemura amakimbirane\nIntego.\nMu bihe biri imbere, Guverinoma y'u Rwanda irateganya guhindura RPA ikagera ku rwego rw\u2019ikigo cy\u2019indashyikirwa mu karere\nmu bijyanye no kubaka amahoro no gukemura amakimbirane"}
{"id": "17424", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17424", "title": "Dushimimana Lambert", "text": "Dushimimana Lambert (yavutse 29 Kanama 1971) ni umugabo akaba ari umunyarwanda na guverineri w' Intara y\u2019Iburengerazuba kuva ku itariki ya 4 Nzeri 2023, akaba yari asanzwe akora mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko y\u2019u Rwanda, mu mutwe wa Sena.\nIbyo yize.\nDushimimana Lambert ni umugabo wavukiye i Rubavu, yarangije muri Kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda mu 2003 mu ishami ry\u2019amategeko, akaba afite icyiciro cya gatatu cya Kaminuza mu mategeko ari mpuza mahanga (Masters of LLM in International Law), akaba yarayikuye muri Kaminuza nkuru ya Pretoriya yo muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo muri 2007.\nIbyo Yakoze.\nDushimimana Lambert kuva 2004 ukagera muri 2005, yari umushinjacyaha, aho yaje gukomereje akazi muri Kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda mu ishami ry\u2019amategeko kugera 2010, yaje gukomereje akazi muri Minisiteri y\u2019Ubutabera kugera muri 2014, nyuma yaho ajya muri Komisiyo ishinzwe kuvugurura amategeko."}
{"id": "17430", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17430", "title": "Munyaneza Omar", "text": "Munyaneza omar ni umugabo w'umunyarwanda uyobora ikigo gitunganya amazi cyitwa Wasac. Munyaneza akaba yarigeze kuba Umudepite mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko yu Rwanda, yabaye umuyobozi wa Komisiyo mukuru ushinzwe Kugenzura Imikoreshereze y\u2019Imari bya Leta yitwa PAC, yabaye kandi umwarimu muri Kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda. Munyaneza akaba abarizwa mu ishyaka rya FPR inkotanyi. Munyaneza ubusazwe ni inzobere yaminuje mu bijyanye n\u2019amazi kuko yize ibijyanye n\u2019amazi ni ukuvuga PhD in Hydrology and Water Resources."}
{"id": "17431", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17431", "title": "Rugigana Evariste", "text": "\u00a0Rugigana Evariste (yavutse ku ya 17 Mata 1982) ni umunyarwanda, akaba impuguke mu bukungu akaba ari umunyapolitiki. \nKuva ku ya 3 Nzeri 2023, Evariste yabaye umuyobozi mukuru w'ikigo gishinzwe kugenzura ibikorwa rusange by'u Rwanda (RURA). ni Itegeko ry\u2019u Rwanda n \u00b0 09/2013 ryo ku wa 01/03/2013 kugenzura ibikorwa rusange birimo gushyiraho umurongo ngenderwaho wo gushyira mu bikorwa amategeko n'amabwiriza akurikizwa no kwemeza ko ibikorwa rusange byubahirizwa n'ibiteganywa n'amategeko n'amabwiriza agenga amategeko agenga mirenge muburyo bufite intego, buboneye kandi butavangura. Mbere yo gushyirwaho yabaye umuyobozi w\u2019inama y\u2019abaminisitiri mu Rwanda ku biro bya Minisitiri w\u2019intebe, Edouard Ngirente kuva muri Mata 2018 kugeza muri Nzeri 2023. \nUbuzima bwambere n'uburere.\nEvariste yavutse ku ya 17 Mata 1982 i Mbarara, mu burengerazuba bwa Uganda. Nyuma yo kwiga amashuri abanza aho Evariste yinjiye mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Makerere arangiza impamyabumenyi y'amashuri yisumbuye. Nyuma yinjiye muri kaminuza ya Makerere, muri Uganda aho yarangirije afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu by'ubukungu yakuye muri icyo kigo mu 2006. Mu mwaka wa 2011, Evariste yongeye kwiyandikisha mu mpamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu igenamigambi ry'imicungire n'imicungire y'ishuri rya Maastricht School of Management, mu Buholandi, arangiza muri uwo mwaka. Mu 2013, yabonye impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu by'ubukungu yakuye mu kigo cy'igihugu gishinzwe impamyabumenyi ya Politiki, Tokiyo, mu Buyapani. \nUmwuga.\nEvariste yatangiye umwuga we wungirije umwarimu muri kaminuza yu Rwanda muri 2007. Mu 2009 yimukiye kuba umuyobozi ushinzwe imisoro mu Rwanda Revenue Authority kugeza muri 2010. Mu mwaka wa 2010, Evariste yagizwe umusesenguzi wa politiki y\u2019ubukungu mu biro by\u2019u Rwanda bya Minisitiri w\u2019intebe Bernard Makuza kugeza mu Kwakira 2013, yazamuwe mu ntera n\u2019inama y\u2019abaminisitiri y\u2019u Rwanda muri 2014 kugira ngo abere umujyanama w\u2019ubukungu wa Minisitiri w\u2019intebe icyo gihe Pierre Damien Habumuremyi hanyuma nyuma Anastase Murekezi kugeza muri Kamena 2016. \nEvariste yakoze muri USAID umwaka umwe kuva muri Kamena 2016 kugeza Gicurasi 2017 nk'uhagarariye igihugu cy'u Rwanda muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba Ubucuruzi n'ishoramari Hub, umushinga w\u2019ibendera rya leta zunze ubumwe za Amerika (2014\u20132019) muri gahunda ya perezida w\u2019ubucuruzi muri Afurika, wagize uruhare mu kuzamura ubucuruzi bw\u2019Amerika na Afurika ndetse ishoramari, kwishyira hamwe kwakarere, no guhangana.\nMuri Kamena 2017, Evariste yagarutse ku biro bya minisitiri w\u2019intebe, akora nk'umujyanama mukuru mu by'ubukungu mbere yuko ashyirwaho na perezida Paul Kagame muri Mata 2018 nk'umuyobozi w\u2019ibikorwa by\u2019inama y\u2019abaminisitiri mu Rwanda mu biro bya Minisitiri w\u2019intebe Edouard Ngirente, akora kugeza muri Nzeri 2023. Ku ya 3 Nzeri 2023, Evariste yongeye kugenwa na perezida Paul Kagame nk'umuyobozi mukuru w'ikigo gishinzwe kugenzura ibikorwa rusange by\u2019u Rwanda (RURA), ikigo mpuzamahanga gishinzwe kugenzura ibikorwa bya guverinoma y'u Rwanda ku rwego mpuzamahanga mu bijyanye na ICT, serivisi z\u2019amaposita, ingufu, amazi, isuku, ubwikorezi, Kurinda Imirase. Ni umwe mu bagize Inama Nyobozi y\u2019ishyirahamwe rishinzwe kugenzura ingufu muri Afurika y\u2019iburasirazuba (EREA). "}
{"id": "17432", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17432", "title": "Habumuremyi Pierre Damien", "text": "Habumuremyi Pierre Damien (wavutse 20 Gashyantare 1961) ni umunyapolitiki w'umunyarwanda wabaye Minisitiri w\u2019intebe w\u2019u Rwanda kuva ku ya 7 Ukwakira 2011 kugeza ku ya 24 Nyakanga 2014. Yabanje kuba Minisitiri w\u2019uburezi kuva muri Gicurasi 2011 kugeza Ukwakira 2011.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nHabumuremyi Pierre-Damien yavutse 1961 i Ruhondo, mu Karere ka Musanze. Yize mu bihugu byinshi, birimo Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, Ubufaransa, na Burkina Faso. Yabonye impamyabumenyi ya B.Sc. muri sociologiya, mbere yo kurangiza icyiciro cye cya kaminuza muri kaminuza ya Lubumbashi muri 1993. Yarangije M. Sc muri siyanse ya politiki yakuye muri kaminuza ya Panth\u00e9on Assas muri 2003. Yabonye impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga. muri siyanse ya politiki yakuye muri kaminuza ya Ouagadougou muri 2011.\nUmwuga.\nHabumuremyi Pierre yatangiye umwuga we w\u2019amasomo, akora umwarimu wungirije muri kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda kuva muri 1993 kugeza 1999, anaba umwarimu muri kaminuza yigenga ya Kigali na kaminuza ya Adventiste ya balayiki ya Kigali muri 1997-1999 (UNILAK). Muri kiriya gihe, yanabaye umuhuzabikorwa wumushinga muri gahunda yo gufasha tekinike yubudage (GTZ Kigali) mu 1995-1997 n\u2019umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019umushinga ushinzwe ubutabazi gatolika muri 1997-2000. \nKuva mu 2000 kugeza 2003, yabaye umunyamabanga nshingwabikorwa wa komisiyo y'igihugu ishinzwe amatora mu Rwanda, nyuma aba umunyamabanga nshingwabikorwa kugeza muri 2008. Ku ya 11 Gicurasi 2008. Habumuremyi yatorewe kuba umwe mu bahagarariye u Rwanda mu Nteko ishinga amategeko ya Afurika y'Iburasirazuba. Yasimbuwe nk'umunyamabanga nshingwabikorwa wa komisiyo y'igihugu ishinzwe amatora na Charles Munyaneza muri Nyakanga 2008. \nHabumuremyi Pierre - Damien yaje muri guverinoma y'u Rwanda nka minisitiri w\u2019uburezi muri Gicurasi 2011, asimbuye Charles Murigande. \nYagizwe minisitiri w\u2019intebe ku ya 6 Ukwakira 2011. Ishyirwaho rye ryaratunguranye, urebye nkuko yagaragaraga cyane kuri politiki. Yasimbuwe na Anastase Murekezi ku ya 23 Nyakanga 2014. \nYanditse igitabo \"cyitwa\" Politiki kwishyira hamwe mu Rwanda nyuma ya jenoside yo mu 1994: Utopiya cyangwa Ukuri, cyasohowe n'Ikinyamakuru Palotti, Kigali, mu 2008."}
{"id": "17434", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17434", "title": "Murekezi Anastase", "text": "Murekezi Anastase (wavutse ku ya 15 Kamena 1952) ni umunyapolitiki w'umunyarwanda. Yize muri Groupe Scolaire Officiel de Butare (GSOB) akomeza muri kaminuza Gatolika ya Louvain mu Bubiligi kwiga ubuhinzi. Yabaye Minisitiri w\u2019abakozi ba Leta n\u2019umurimo kugeza ku ya 23 Nyakanga 2014 ubwo yabaga Minisitiri w\u2019intebe w\u2019u Rwanda, akora kugeza muri 2017. Kuva muri 2017-2020, yabaye Umuvunyi mukuru mu Rwanda.\nAmashyirahamwe mpuzamahanga.\nAnastase Murekezi kandi ni umwe mu bagize Inama y'Ubuyobozi ya Compact2025, ubufatanye buteza imbere kandi bukwirakwiza inama zishingiye ku bimenyetso ku banyapolitiki ndetse n'abandi bafata ibyemezo bigamije guca inzara n'imirire mibi mu myaka 10 iri imbere. "}
{"id": "17437", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17437", "title": "Ngirente \u00c9douard", "text": "Ngirente \u00c9douard (yavutse 22 Gashyantare 1973) ni impuguke mu by'ubukungu n'umunyapolitiki. yabaye Minisitiri w\u2019intebe w\u2019u Rwanda kuva ku ya 30 Kanama 2017, amaze kugenwa na Perezida w\u2019u Rwanda, Paul Kagame. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nNgirente \u00c9douard yavukiye mu Rwanda ku ya 22 Gashyantare 1973. Afite impamyabumenyi ya PhD mu by'ubukungu yakuye muri kaminuza ya Louvain, mu Bubiligi (UCLouvain), impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga (MSc) mu bukungu bw'ubuhinzi yakuye muri UCLouvain, mu Bubiligi, impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga (MA) mu micungire y\u2019ingaruka z\u2019amafaranga yakuye muri kaminuza ya Saint-Louis, Bruxelles mu Bubiligi Icyemezo cya kaminuza mu mibare yaturutse muri UCLouvain ; n'impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu by'ubukungu muri kaminuza nkuru y'u Rwanda.\nUmwuga.\nMbere yo gushyirwaho, yari afite imyanya itandukanye: umujyanama mukuru w\u2019umuyobozi mukuru wa Banki yisi (2017), umujyanama w'Umuyobozi Nshingwabikorwa wa Banki y'Isi (kuva 2011 kugeza 2017), umujyanama mukuru mu by'ubukungu muri Minisiteri y\u2019imari n\u2019igenamigambi mu Rwanda; umuyobozi mukuru wa gahunda y\u2019iterambere ry\u2019igihugu n\u2019ubushakashatsi muri Minisiteri y\u2019Imari n\u2019Igenamigambi ry\u2019Ubukungu ; umwarimu mukuru mu cyahoze ari kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda kugeza mu 2010, umuyobozi w'ishami ry'ubukungu mu buhinzi muri kaminuza imwe, umujyanama wigenga akaba n'umuyobozi ushinzwe imishinga. Ngirente yagize uruhare rukomeye mu bushakashatsi mu by'ubukungu mu gihe muri Banki y'Isi, yandika impapuro ku masoko yihariye yo mu karere ndetse n\u2019ibibazo by\u2019ubukungu yibanda ku masoko y\u2019ubuhinzi y\u2019u Rwanda. \nGahunda ya politiki.\nNgirente yagizwe umusimbura wa Anastase Murekezi ku ya 30 Kanama 2017. Yabaye Minisitiri w\u2019intebe wa 11 w\u2019u Rwanda n\u2019uwa 6 kuva Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Yari mu banyapolitiki benshi barahiye Paul Kagame nyuma y\u2019amatora ya Perezida w\u2019u Rwanda 2017. \nPolitiki.\nNgirente yagenzuye impinduka za politiki zigamije kuzamura ubukungu bw\u2019u Rwanda binyuze mu nkunga zagutse z\u2019ubushakashatsi, ibikorwa remezo byo gutwara abantu n\u2019uburezi mu zindi nzego. Ubukangurambaga bwo gushishikariza Abanyarwanda kwishyura imisoro no kubungabunga ibidukikije nabwo bwatangiye hagamijwe gushyiraho ejo hazaza heza haba mu bukungu ndetse no mu bidukikije. Mu nshingano ze nk'uhagarariye u Rwanda, Ngirente yazengurutse isi yose yiyamamariza kongera ishoramari mu mahanga mu gihugu. Ngirente kandi yazengurutse afurika y'unganira ingamba zo kuboneza urubyaro ku mugabane w'afurika. \nUbuzima bwite.\nNgirente arubatse kandi ni se w'abana babiri (Audrey na Pascale Ngirente). "}
{"id": "17439", "revid": "12821", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17439", "title": "Social Democratic Party", "text": "Izina Ishyaka Riharanira Demokarasi no Kurengera Imibereho Myiza y'Abaturage ryakoreshejwe n'amashyaka menshi ya politiki mu bihugu bitandukanye ku isi. Ishyaka nkiri rikunze guhuzwa na demokarasi mbonezamubano nkibitekerezo byabo bya politiki."}
