{"id": "17481", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17481", "title": "2021 Igikombe cya Afurika", "text": "Igikombe cya Afurika 2021 (nanone cyitwa AFCON 2021 cyangwa CAN 2021), kizwi ku rya TotalEnergies mu mwaka wa 2021 Igikombe cy\u2019Afurika cy\u2019ibihugu kubera impamvu z\u2019abaterankunga, shampiona ya Afurika yateguwe n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umupira wamaguru nyafurika (CAF). Iri rushanwa ryakiriwe na Kameruni, rikaba kuva ku ya 9 Mutarama kugeza ku ya 6 Gashyantare 2022. \nIri rushanwa ryari riteganijwe gukinwa muri Kamena na Nyakanga 2021. Icyakora, CAF yatangaje ku ya 15 Mutarama 2020 ko kubera ibihe by'ikirere bitameze neza muri kiriya gihe, amarushanwa yari yimuriwe ko azakinwa hagati ya 9 Mutarama na 6 Gashyantare 2021. Ku ya 30 Kamena 2020, CAF yimuye amatariki y\u2019irushanwa ku nshuro ya kabiri kugeza muri Mutarama 2022 nyuma y\u2019ingaruka z\u2019icyorezo cya COVID-19 ku mugabane wa Afurika, mu gihe yagumanye izina ry\u2019igikombe cy\u2019Afurika 2021 hagamijwe gutera inkunga. \nAlijeriya yari nyampinga urinda izamu, ariko isezererwa mu cyiciro cya mbere nyuma yo kurangiza hepfo yitsinda ryabo. Senegal yegukanye igikombe cya mbere cya AFCON nyuma yo gutsinda Misiri ku mukino wa nyuma 4-2 kuri penaliti, nyuma yo kunganya 0-0 nyuma yigihe cyinyongera. "}
{"id": "17484", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17484", "title": "Umurenge wa Kigabiro", "text": "Umurenge wa Kigabiro ni umwe mu mirenge 14 igize Akarere ka Rwamagana, mu Intara y'Iburasirazuba, mu Rwanda. Ugizwe n'utugari 5.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Kigabiro wari utuwe n'abaturage 47 358.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUtugari.\nUmurenge wa Kigabiro ni umwe mu mirenge 14 y'Akarere ka Rwamagana. Ugizwe n'utugari 5:\nUbuyobozi.\nMu 2023, Umunyamabanga Nshingwabikorwa w'Umurenge wa Kigabiro yari Marc Rushimisha.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Kigabiro wari utuwe n'abaturage 32 730. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 47 358. Muri bo, 34 360 babaga mu mujyi. Umurenge ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 37,74.\nIbikorwa remezo.\nGare ya Rwamagana iri hagati mu mujyi wa Rwamagana, mu Murenge wa Kigabiro. Yatashywe ku wa 11 Gashyantare 2019. Ibice byayo bibiri bya mbere byatwaye amafaranga y'u Rwanda arenga miliyoni 670."}
