{"id": "17486", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17486", "title": "Umurenge wa Gishari", "text": "Umurenge wa Gishari (cyangwa Gishali) ni umwe mu mirenge 14 igize Akarere ka Rwamagana, mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba y\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Gishari wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 36 692. Uri ku nkombe y\u2019Ikiyaga cya Muhazi. Muri uyu murenge hari ishuri ry\u2019amahugurwa rya Polisi y\u2019u Rwanda na IPRC Gishari.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbumenyi bw\u2019isi.\nUmurenge wa Gishari ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 45,1. Ugizwe n\u2019utugari turindwi: Binunga, Bwinsanga, Gati, Kavumu, Kinyana, Ruhimbi na Ruhunda.\nUhana imbibi n\u2019Ikiyaga cya Muhazi mu majyaruguru. Hakurya y\u2019ikiyaga hari Akarere ka Gatsibo. Uhana imbibi n\u2019Umurenge wa Muhazi mu burasirazuba. Uhana imbibi n\u2019Umurenge wa Munyiginya mu burengerazuba. Uhana imbibi n\u2019Umurenge wa Mwulire n\u2019Umurenge wa Kigabiro mu majyepfo.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Gishari wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 23 033. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 36 692. Abagabo bari 18 405. Abagore bari 18 287. Abaturage 14 759 bari batuye mu mujyi. Abaturage 21 933 bari batuye mu cyaro.\nIbigo by\u2019ingenzi.\nIshuri ry\u2019amahugurwa rya Polisi y\u2019u Rwanda rya Gishari (\"Police Training School Gishari\") riri mu Karere ka Rwamagana. Ritanga amasomo y\u2019ibanze ku bapolisi bashya. Mu Ukwakira 2024, abantu 2 200 barangirije muri iri shuri amasomo y\u2019ibanze ya polisi.\nIPRC Gishari yahoze yitwa \"Gishari Integrated Polytechnic\". Yafunguwe mu 2013. Yashinzwe na Polisi y\u2019u Rwanda n\u2019Ikigo gishinzwe guteza imbere ubumenyi bw\u2019abakozi (WDA).\nIkigo Bella Flowers gihinga indabo mu Murenge wa Gishari. Mu 2019, cyari gifite indabo kuri hegitari 32. Nibura 60 % by\u2019indabo zacyo zoherezwa mu Ubuholandi."}
