{"id": "17489", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17489", "title": "G S Gishari", "text": "Urwunge rw'amashuri Gishari.\nG.S Gishari ni ikigo gihererye mu ntara y'ibusirazuba mu karere ka Rwamagana mu murenge wa Gishari akagali ka Bwinsanga, umudugudu wa Shaburondo.\nG.S Gishari.\nIshuri rya G.S GISHARI riherereye mu karere ka Rwamagana mu umurenge wa Gishari. \nn' ikigo cya leta gifitwe mu nshingano na kiriziya gatolika, kigamo abahungu n'abakobwa. GS Gishari igizwe ni byiciro bi tanu aribyo ishuri ry'inshuke, ikiciro cya mbere cy'amashuri abanza, icyiciro cya kabiri cy' amashuri abanza, ikiciro cya mbere cy'amashuri yisumbuye, ndetse n'ikiciro cya kabiri cya mashuri yisumbuye ishami ry'imibare, ubukungu n'ubumenyi bw'isi. "}
{"id": "17490", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17490", "title": "Cleophas Barore", "text": "Cleophas Barore ni umuynyamakuru w'umunyarwanda akaba n'umuyobozi mukuru w'ikigo cy'igihugu cy'itangazamakuru. \nUbuzima Bwite.\nClephas Barore yakoze umuwuga w'iangazamakuru akorera ORINFOR ari yo yaje guhinduka ikigo cy'igihugu cy'itangazamakuru kizwi ku izina rya RBA ubu yamenyekanye cyane no mu kiganiro cyitwa \"makuru ki binyamakuru\".\nyavukiye mu karere ka Gicumbi yiga amashuri yisumbuye muri IFAK, aza no kuba umupasiteri mu itorero rya ADEPR. \nBarore ni umugabo wubatse ufite umugore."}
