{"id": "17493", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17493", "title": "Amenyo", "text": "AMENYO\nAmenyo yumuntu akora kugirango asenye muburyo bwibiryo ibiryo abikata kandi abijanjagura kugirango yitegure kumira no gusya. Nkibyo, bifatwa nkibice bigize sisitemu yumubiri\nImiterere yamenyo.\nNubwo amoko menshi atandukanye afite amenyo, iterambere ryayo ahanini ni kimwe nabantu.\nKugirango amenyo yabantu agire ibidukikije byiza byo munwa, enamel, dentin, sima, na parontontium bigomba gukura mugihe gikwiye cyo gukura. Amenyo y'ibanze atangira kwibumbira mu mikurire y'urusoro hagati y'icyumweru cya gatandatu n'icya munani, kandi amenyo ahoraho atangira kuboneka muri wee ya makumyabiri.\ngufata neza Amenyo.\nIsuku yo mu kanwa ni imyitozo yo kugira isuku mu kanwa kandi ni uburyo bwo kwirinda indwara z\u2019amenyo, gingivite, indwara zifata igihe, guhumeka nabi, n\u2019izindi ndwara z\u2019amenyo. Igizwe nubwitonzi bwumwuga nu muntu ku giti cye. Isuku isanzwe, mubisanzwe ikorwa nabashinzwe amenyo nabafite isuku y amenyo, ikureho tartar (plaque minerval) ishobora gutera imbere hamwe no gukaraba neza no gukaraba neza. Isuku yabigize umwuga ikubiyemo gupima amenyo, ukoresheje ibikoresho cyangwa ibikoresho bitandukanye kugirango uhoshe kandi ukure ibyabitswe mumenyo.\namashakiro"}
{"id": "17494", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17494", "title": "Gatabazi jean marie vianny", "text": "Jean Marie Vianney Gatabazi ni umwe mu bayobozi bo mu Rwanda wagize uruhare rukomeye mu miyoborere y\u2019Igihugu. Muri impinduka zakozwe mu buyobozi bwa Leta, yagizwe Minisitiri w\u2019Ubutegetsi bw\u2019Igihugu, aho yasimbuye Prof Shyaka Anastase. Mbere yo kugirwa Minisitiri, Gatabazi yari Guverineri w\u2019Intara y\u2019Amajyaruguru kuva mu 2017, aho yari ashinzwe guhuza ibikorwa by\u2019iterambere n\u2019imiyoborere myiza mu ntara. Mbere yaho kandi yari amaze imyaka igera kuri 14 ari Umudepite mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko y\u2019u Rwanda, ibintu byamuhaye ubunararibonye mu bijyanye n\u2019imiyoborere n\u2019amategeko.\nUbuzima bwite.\nJean Marie Vianney Gatabazi yavukiye ku wa 18 Kanama 1968 i Makarange mu Karere ka Gicumbi. Yize amashuri abanza muri Mulindi Primary School, akomereza ayisumbuye muri EAV Kabutare. Afite impamyabumenyi ya BBA mu micungire (Management) ndetse na MBA mu micungire y\u2019igenamigambi (Strategic Management) yakuye muri Mount Kenya University. \n\n==="}
{"id": "17495", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17495", "title": "RUTI JOEL", "text": "RUTI Joel ni umubyinnyi akaba n'umuririmbyi, ni umwe mubayoboye abaririmbyi b'imbyino gakondo mu Rwanda. Akaba afite indirimbo nyinshi zijyanye numuco nyarwanda harimo; Igikobwa,Amariza,Ibihame,Rusaro,Cunda,Rasana,Rwagasabo,Rasana,Cyane,Gaju na Nyambo n'izindi nyinshi.\nUbuzima bwe bwite.\nRUTI Joel ni umwana w'umunyarwanda avugako yakuriye mu maboko y'abahanzi gakondo. Indirimbo ze nyinshi zamenyekanye abifashijwemo na Kwanda Music bari bafatanije gusakaza ibihangano byiwe"}
