{"id": "17497", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17497", "title": "Dogiteri Nsabi", "text": "Dogiteri Nsabi ni umusore wavutse mumwaka 1998 uyu nsabi numusore w'umunyarwanda akaba yaravukiye muntara y'amajyaruguru mukarere ka musanze. amazina nyayo ya Nsabi ni Nsabimana Eric akaba azwiho gukina commedy nyarwanda ziri murizimwe zikunzwe cyane nabantu batari bake mu Rwanda. uyu nsabi amaze kugera kurwego rushimishije kuko asigaye akina flm zitandukanye harimo:my heart,killerman,ushobora no kumukurikirana ku irebero tv. ikindi azwiho nuko yize amashuri yisumbuye ibijyanye n' imibare ibinyabuzima n'ubutabire "}
