{"id": "17513", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17513", "title": "Muyombo Thomas", "text": "Muyombo Thomas (yavutse ku ya 28 Ukwakira 1984), uzwi kandi ku izina rya Tom Close, yavukiye muri Uganda, umucuranzi ukomoka mu Rwanda, akaba n'umuganga. Ikinyamakuru cya Chimp Reports cyo muri Uganda cyo muri 2013 yavuze ko ari umwami wa Afrobeat na Dancehall mu Rwanda. \nUbuzima bwa mbere n'uburere.\nMuyombo, uwa kabiri mu bana batatu, yavutse ku ya 28 Ukwakira 1984 kuri Edward Karangwa na Kwizera Grace Dukuze mu Karere ka Masindi muri Uganda. Nyuma yo gutangira amashuri abanza muri Uganda, Muyombo yimukiye mu Rwanda, ari naho yarangirije amashuri yisumbuye ku ishuri ryisumbuye rya Kiziguro na Lyc\u00e9e de Kigali y\u2019Igifaransa. Mu mwaka wa kane, yatangiye kuririmba muri korari y'itorero.\nYarangije impamyabumenyi ya kaminuza mu buvuzi bwa muntu muri kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda muri 2013. \nUmwuga.\nUmwuga wa muzika.\nNk'umucuranzi, Muyombo akunzwe kwitwa Tom Close. \nMuri 2005, Muyombo yashinze itsinda rye rya mbere hamwe n'inshuti enye ku izina rya Afro Saints, yandika indirimbo eshanu hagati ya 2006 na 2007 ariko ntabashe gutsinda. Indirimbo ye ya mbere nk'umuhanzi wenyine, Mbwira Yego, yanditswe mu Gushyingo 2007 hanyuma akurikirwa no kumurika alubumu ye ya mbere, \"Kuki\", muri Gicurasi 2008. Yanditse izindi alubumu enye hagati ya 2008 na 2013, yise \"Subiza\", \"Ntibanyurwa, Komeza Utsinde\" na \"Mbabarira Ugaruke\". \nYakoranye n\u2019abahanzi benshi bo mu Rwanda ndetse n\u2019amahanga, barimo Porofeseri Jay, Radio na Weasel, Jenerali Ozzey, Knowless, na Sean Kingston. Yazengurutse cyane mu Rwanda no mu bihugu bigize Umuryango w'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, anakorera muri Amerika mu 2011. Yakoreye muri concert yizihiza isabukuru y'imyaka icumi sosiyete y'itumanaho yo mu karere MTN ari kumwe n'umuhanzi mpuzamahanga Shaggy. \nMuyombo yatsindiye amarushanwa ya mbere ya buri mwaka ya Primus Guma Guma Super Star amarushanwa y'abahanzi bazwi, yabereye kuri Stade Amahoro muri 2011. Muri 2008, yatsindiye Umuhanzi mwiza mu marushanwa yakiriwe na kaminuza nkuru y'u Rwanda. Yatsindiye kandi Umuhanzi w'umwaka muri Salax Awards muri 2009, 2010 na 2011. \nUmwuga w'ubuvuzi.\nNyuma yo guhabwa impamyabumenyi, Muyombo yinjiye mu ishami ry'abana b'ibitaro bya Kacyiru mu 2014. Mu 2015, yinjiye muri serivisi yo gutanga amaraso mu 2015 agirwa umuyobozi w'ikigo cy'akarere gishinzwe gutanga amaraso i Kigali mu 2019. \nYakoze kandi nk'umuganga mu bitaro bya polisi y'igihugu biherereye i Kigali. \nUbuzima bwite.\nNyina wa Muyombo yapfuye mu 1996. Arubatse, afite abana babiri. "}
{"id": "17515", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17515", "title": "Gishali", "text": "\"GISHALI SECTOR\".\nGishali ni umurenge uherereye mu ntara y'Iburasirazuba, Akarere ka rwamwgana ukaba ubarizwamo ikigo gikuru cya police ukaba kandi arinaho habarizwamo ikigo gihinga indabyo kizwi nka bella flowers.https://www.mindat.org/feature-384528.htm\nUmurenge wa gishali ugizwe nutugari 7 aritwo kavumu,ruhunda,gati,binunga,ruhimbi bwinsangandetse na cyinyana umurenge wa Gishali muri 2012 wari utuwe n'abaturage bangana n'ibihumbi 23,033. ubwo ibarura rusange riheruka gukorwa muri 2022 basanze utuwe nabaturage bangana n'ibihumbi 36,692"}
