{"id": "17525", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17525", "title": "Jean daniel SINDAYIGAYA", "text": "Jean Daniel Sindayigaya ni umunyamakuru ukorera ikigo cyigihugu cyiyangaza makuru (RBA) wabigize umwuga uzwi mumagambo yimpine nka JDS nkuko akunze kubyiyita akaba Amaze imyaka myinshi mumwuga wubunyamakuru kubunyamakuru.\nNkuko bivugwa yamaze akazi kubunyamakuru nago ariko kazi yabanje gukora bivugwako yabanje kuba umumwarimu nyuma yuko asoje umwaka wanyuma wakaminuza muki 1993.\nAza gukomeza umwugawe ubwo yigishaga no muri kaminuza. Mubyukuri uyu SINDAYIGAYA avugako ubunyamakuru atigize abishyiraho umutima mu buto bwe kandi akongeraho ati arihejuru yi myaka 40 iyo bamubamubajije."}
{"id": "17526", "revid": "17908", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17526", "title": "NESA", "text": "NESA (National Examination and School Inspection Authority) ni ikigo cya Leta cyeguriwe ubuyobozi bwite mu Rwanda, gikorera munsi y'ikigo cya Ministeri y'Uburezi (MINEDUC). Yashinzwe mu mwaka wa 2020 ifite inshingano zo kugenzura ireme ry'uburezi no kuyobora ibizamini bya Leta.\nINSHINGANO ZA NESA\nNESA itegura, ikayobora, igakosora, ikatangaza n'ibisubizo by'ibizamini bya Leta kubanyeshuri basoje icyiciro cya Amashuri Abanza (P6), Ikiciro Rusange cy'Amashuri yisumbuye (S3/O-Level), n'Icyiciro Kisumbuye (S6/A-Level) harimo n'amashuri y'imyuga n'ubumenyi ngiro (TSS).\nNanone NESA Ishinzwe gutoranya no gushyira abanyeshuri basoje S3 mu cyiciro gisumbuye (General Education, TVET, cyangwa TTC) ndetse n'abasoje P6 mu mashuri yisumbuye hashingiwe ku manota na amahitamo yabo."}
